window.GEPT_JIEJIN_UNITS=[{"unit":1,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 1 (001.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Human Body, Physical Actions & Health | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"ankle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the joint between the foot and the lower leg","chinese":"腳踝","sentence":"Yesterday afternoon, Peter jumped off the garden wall, but he landed badly and hurt his right ______, so he could not walk home.","translation":"昨天下午彼得跳下花園圍牆，但他著地姿勢不佳並傷到了右腳踝，所以他無法走回家。"},{"word":"bone","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any of the hard pieces that make up the skeleton","chinese":"骨頭","sentence":"The stray dog looked very hungry and tired, so the kind lady gave him a beef ______ to chew on in the yard.","translation":"那隻流浪狗看起來非常飢餓且疲累，所以那位好心的女士給了牠一根牛骨頭在院子裡啃咬。"},{"word":"brain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the organ inside the head that controls thought and memory","chinese":"大腦；智力","sentence":"Regular physical exercise is good for your health, and reading books can help train your ______ to stay active and sharp.","translation":"規律的身體運動對健康有益，而閱讀書籍可以幫助訓練你的大腦保持活躍與敏銳。"},{"word":"chin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the bottom part of the face below the mouth","chinese":"下巴","sentence":"My little brother fell off his bicycle on the street, and he scraped his ______ on the ground, but he did not cry.","translation":"我的小弟弟在街上從腳踏車上摔了下來，他的下巴在地上擦傷，但他並沒有哭。"},{"word":"hip","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the area on either side of the body below the waist","chinese":"臀部；髖部","sentence":"My grandmother slipped on the wet kitchen floor this morning, so my father took her to the hospital to check her left ______.","translation":"我的祖母今天早上在濕滑的廚房地板上滑倒，所以我父親帶她去醫院檢查她的左側臀部（髖部）。"},{"word":"beard","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the hair that grows on a man's chin and cheeks","chinese":"鬍鬚","sentence":"Uncle David decided to grow a thick ______ during his winter vacation, but his wife asked him to shave it off yesterday.","translation":"大衛叔叔決定在寒假期間留濃密的鬍鬚，但他的妻子昨天要求他將它刮掉。"},{"word":"nail","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the hard surface covering the tip of fingers; a metal pin","chinese":"指甲；釘子","sentence":"Tom was very nervous before the English speech contest began, so he sat in the corner and kept biting his finger ______.","translation":"湯姆在英語演講比賽開始前非常緊張，所以他坐在角落裡一直咬自己的手指甲。"},{"word":"skin","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the natural outer layer that covers the body","chinese":"皮膚；擦破皮","sentence":"You should put on some sunscreen before going to the beach, or the hot summer sun will easily burn your ______.","translation":"你去海灘前應該擦點防曬乳，否則炎熱的夏日陽光很容易曬傷你的皮膚。"},{"word":"tear(tear / tore / torn)","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to pull paper or cloth into pieces; water from eyes","chinese":"撕裂；眼淚","sentence":"Please be very careful when you open the old envelope, and do not ______ the letter inside because it is very important.","translation":"當你打開那個舊信封時請非常小心，不要撕破裡面的信件，因為它非常重要。"},{"word":"throat","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the front passage inside the neck","chinese":"喉嚨","sentence":"I caught a bad cold on Monday morning, so I had a sore ______ and could not speak loudly in class all day.","translation":"我星期一早上得了重感冒，所以我喉嚨痛且一整天在課堂上都無法大聲說話。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the fast basketball match yesterday, Jason stepped on another player's foot and twisted his right ______, so he could not walk for three days.","options":["bone","ankle","beard","chin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ankle (腳踝)【全文中譯】昨天那場快節奏的籃球賽中，傑森踩到了另一名球員的腳並扭傷了他的右腳踝，所以他整整三天無法走路。【選項解析】(A) bone 骨頭  (B) ankle 腳踝  (C) beard 鬍鬚  (D) chin 下巴。由 stepped on... foot（踩到腳）與 could not walk（無法走路）可知應選 ankle。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The soup was served extremely hot, and Susan took a large mouthful without blowing on it, which burned her ______ badly.","options":["throat","nail","hip","bone"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: throat (喉嚨)【全文中譯】那碗湯上桌時非常燙，蘇珊沒吹涼就喝了一大口，結果嚴重燙傷了她的喉嚨。【選項解析】(A) throat 喉嚨  (B) nail 指甲  (C) hip 臀部  (D) bone 骨頭。由 took a large mouthful of hot soup（喝了一大口熱湯）可知會燙到喉嚨。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Grandfather likes to look neat, so he uses shaving cream and a sharp razor every morning to remove his white ______ completely.","options":["skin","brain","beard","ankle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beard (鬍鬚)【全文中譯】祖父喜歡看起來整潔，所以他每天早上都用刮鬍膏和鋒利的剃刀將他的白鬍鬚徹底刮乾淨。【選項解析】(A) skin 皮膚  (B) brain 大腦  (C) beard 鬍鬚  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 shaving cream（刮鬍膏）與 razor（剃刀）可知答案為 beard。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Scientists explain that doing crossword puzzles and reading new books can challenge your ______ and keep your memory sharp as you get older.","options":["hip","brain","nail","throat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: brain (大腦)【全文中譯】科學家解釋，做填字遊戲和閱讀新書可以挑戰你的大腦，並在年齡增長時保持記憶力敏銳。【選項解析】(A) hip 臀部  (B) brain 大腦  (C) nail 指甲  (D) throat 喉嚨。由 crossword puzzles（填字遊戲）與 keep memory sharp（保持記憶敏銳）可知指大腦。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the hammer slipped from my hand, it hit my left thumb and turned my finger ______ dark purple and very sore.","options":["beard","bone","chin","nail"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: nail (指甲)【全文中譯】當鐵鎚從我手中滑落時，它砸中了我的左拇指，把我的手指甲打成了深紫色且非常疼痛。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) chin 下巴  (D) nail 指甲。由 finger nail（手指甲）以及被鐵鎚砸到變紫色可知選 nail。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please be very gentle when opening this old historical document, or you might easily ______ the fragile paper into pieces.","options":["tear","cough","touch","ache"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tear (撕破)【全文中譯】打開這份古老的歷史文獻時請務必小心，否則你很容易把脆弱的紙張撕成碎片。【選項解析】(A) tear 撕裂  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) touch 接觸  (D) ache 疼痛。由 fragile paper into pieces（脆弱紙張成碎片）可知選動詞 tear。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The elderly gentleman fell down on the icy sidewalk, and the doctor said he cracked a small ______ in his left leg.","options":["beard","bone","brain","chin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bone (骨頭)【全文中譯】那位年長紳士在結冰的人行道上摔倒，醫生說他摔裂了左腿的一根小骨頭。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) brain 大腦  (D) chin 下巴。由 cracked a small bone in leg（腿部骨裂）可知答案為 bone。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The boxer kept his hands high to protect his face, but his opponent still landed a punch right on his ______.","options":["ankle","chin","nail","hip"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chin (下巴)【全文中譯】拳擊手雙手高舉以保護臉部，但他的對手仍然一拳正好擊中了他的下巴。【選項解析】(A) ankle 腳踝  (B) chin 下巴  (C) nail 指甲  (D) hip 臀部。由 protect his face（保護臉部）與 punched on可知是在臉部的 chin。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The doctor advised Mark to apply protective lotion before going swimming, because the strong sunlight could severely damage his sensitive ______.","options":["skin","throat","brain","beard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: skin (皮膚)【全文中譯】醫生建議馬克在去游泳前塗抹防護乳液，因為強烈的陽光會嚴重傷害他敏感的皮膚。【選項解析】(A) skin 皮膚  (B) throat 喉嚨  (C) brain 大腦  (D) beard 鬍鬚。由 apply lotion（塗乳液）與 strong sunlight（強烈陽光）可知受保護的是 skin。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Because Mrs. Baker wears an old belt that is too tight around her ______, she often feels uncomfortable when sitting down to work.","options":["chin","hip","brain","nail"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hip (臀部；髖部)【全文中譯】因為貝克太太繫在臀部周圍的舊皮帶太緊了，所以她坐下來工作時經常感到不舒服。【選項解析】(A) chin 下巴  (B) hip 臀部  (C) brain 大腦  (D) nail 指甲。由 belt around hip（繫在臀部/髖部的皮帶）可知答案為 hip。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After shouting loudly to cheer for our school soccer team in the rain, my ______ was very dry and I needed warm water.","options":["nail","beard","throat","ankle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: throat (喉嚨)【全文中譯】在雨中大聲為我們學校足球隊加油之後，我的喉嚨非常乾，而且我需要喝溫水。【選項解析】(A) nail 指甲  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) throat 喉嚨  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 shouting loudly（大聲吶喊）與 dry 可知喉嚨乾渴。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The puppy was thrilled when we gave him a large beef ______ from the butcher, and he happily chewed it in the yard all day.","options":["brain","chin","skin","bone"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bone (骨頭)【全文中譯】當我們從小肉舖拿了一根大牛骨頭給小狗時，牠興奮極了，整天開心地在院子裡啃著它。【選項解析】(A) brain 大腦  (B) chin 下巴  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) bone 骨頭。由 beef bone from butcher（肉舖的牛骨）與 chewed it 可知選 bone。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Henry decided to grow a thick brown ______ during the cold winter, but his mother said it made him look much older.","options":["ankle","beard","throat","nail"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: beard (鬍鬚)【全文中譯】亨利決定在寒冷的冬天留濃密的棕色鬍鬚，但他母親說這讓他看起來老很多。【選項解析】(A) ankle 腳踝  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) throat 喉嚨  (D) nail 指甲。由 grow a thick brown beard（留濃密鬍鬚）可知答案為 beard。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you pull the heavy box too quickly across the sharp metal shelf, the cardboard will ______ and everything will drop onto the floor.","options":["ache","cough","tear","burn"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tear (撕裂)【全文中譯】如果你把笨重的箱子在鋒利的金屬架上拉得太快，紙板會破裂，裡面的東西就會全掉到地上。【選項解析】(A) ache 疼痛  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) tear 撕裂  (D) burn 燃燒。由 pull across sharp metal... cardboard will tear 可知選 tear。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Little Tina was nervous about her final piano test, so she kept biting her finger ______ while waiting outside the music classroom.","options":["nail","hip","beard","brain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nail (指甲)【全文中譯】小蒂娜對鋼琴期末測驗感到非常緊張，所以在音樂教室外等待時，她一直咬著自己的手指甲。【選項解析】(A) nail 指甲  (B) hip 臀部  (C) beard 鬍鬚  (D) brain 大腦。由 biting finger nail（咬指甲）為緊張時常見動作。"},{"number":16,"stem":"While playing soccer on the school field, David fell and scraped his left ______ on the rough ground, causing it to bleed slightly.","options":["brain","throat","skin","beard"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: skin (皮膚)【全文中譯】大衛在學校操場踢足球時摔倒，在粗糙的地面上擦破了左側皮膚，導致微微流血。【選項解析】(A) brain 大腦  (B) throat 喉嚨  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) beard 鬍鬚。由 scraped his skin and bled（擦破皮流血）可知答案為 skin。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Resting properly after intense study sessions gives your ______ enough time to process new information and stay refreshed.","options":["brain","ankle","chin","nail"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: brain (大腦)【全文中譯】密集學習後適度休息，可以讓你的大腦有足夠的時間處理新資訊並保持精力充沛。【選項解析】(A) brain 大腦  (B) ankle 腳踝  (C) chin 下巴  (D) nail 指甲。由 process new information（處理新資訊）可知為主體大腦。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The little girl rested her small ______ on her hands while listening attentively to the wonderful bedtime story told by her grandfather.","options":["ankle","bone","chin","throat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: chin (下巴)【全文中譯】小女孩在聚精會神聆聽祖父講述美妙的床邊故事時，雙手托著她小巧的下巴。【選項解析】(A) ankle 腳踝  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) chin 下巴  (D) throat 喉嚨。由 rested her chin on hands（雙手托腮/托下巴）可知答案為 chin。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Wearing high-heeled shoes for many hours made Emily lose her balance, and she painfully twisted her left ______ on the stairs.","options":["throat","beard","skin","ankle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ankle (腳踝)【全文中譯】穿著高跟鞋好幾個小時讓艾蜜莉失去平衡，她在樓梯上痛苦地扭傷了左腳踝。【選項解析】(A) throat 喉嚨  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 high-heeled shoes（高跟鞋）與 twisted on the stairs 可知為 ankle。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The stray dog got into a fight with another animal, and the veterinarian had to take an X-ray to see if any ______ was broken.","options":["chin","bone","nail","brain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bone (骨頭)【全文中譯】那隻流浪狗與另一隻動物打架，獸醫必須照 X 光片來檢查是否有任何骨頭折斷了。【選項解析】(A) chin 下巴  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) nail 指甲  (D) brain 大腦。由 take an X-ray（照X光）與 broken 可知檢查的是 bone。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The heavy bag knocked against Amanda's left ______ as she squeezed through the narrow train door, leaving a visible blue bruise.","options":["beard","brain","hip","throat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hip (臀部；髖部)【全文中譯】當阿曼達擠過狹窄的火車門時，沉重的提袋撞到了她的左側臀部，留下了一塊明顯的瘀青。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) brain 大腦  (C) hip 臀部  (D) throat 喉嚨。由 knocked against hip as she squeezed through 可知為身體兩側的 hip。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Kevin spoke for over two hours during the company presentation, which left his ______ completely hoarse and tired.","options":["throat","nail","bone","ankle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: throat (喉嚨)【全文中譯】凱文在公司簡報中講了兩個多小時的話，這讓他的喉嚨完全沙啞且疲憊不堪。【選項解析】(A) throat 喉嚨  (B) nail 指甲  (C) bone 骨頭  (D) ankle 腳踝。由 spoke for over two hours（說話超過兩小時）與 hoarse（沙啞）可知為 throat。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The young artist accidently made a deep ______ in the expensive painting canvas while cutting open the package with a box cutter.","options":["beard","bone","chin","tear"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: tear (裂痕/破損)【全文中譯】那位年輕藝術家用美工刀割開包裝時，不小心在那幅昂貴的畫布上劃出了一道很深的裂痕。【選項解析】(A) beard 鬍鬚  (B) bone 骨頭  (C) chin 下巴  (D) tear 裂口/撕痕。名詞 tear 表示布料或紙張的撕裂口，與 canvas 相符。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The beautician carefully trimmed, shaped, and polished every single finger ______ before applying the elegant pink polish for the bride.","options":["nail","hip","throat","brain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nail (指甲)【全文中譯】美容師在為新娘塗上優雅的粉色指甲油之前，仔細修剪、塑形並拋光了每一根手指甲。【選項解析】(A) nail 指甲  (B) hip 臀部  (C) throat 喉嚨  (D) brain 大腦。由 trimmed, shaped and polished, pink polish 可知為 finger nail。"},{"number":25,"stem":"People with fair ______ need to be especially cautious on sunny beaches, because they are prone to painful sunburns within minutes.","options":["bone","beard","skin","chin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: skin (皮膚)【全文中譯】皮膚白皙的人在陽光明媚的海灘上需要格外小心，因為他們很容易在幾分鐘內就被曬傷。【選項解析】(A) bone 骨頭  (B) beard 鬍鬚  (C) skin 皮膚  (D) chin 下巴。由 fair skin（白皙皮膚）與 painful sunburns（曬傷）可知答案為 skin。"}]},{"unit":2,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 2 (002.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Body Parts, Physical Health & Medical Conditions | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"thumb","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the short, thick first finger on the human hand","chinese":"拇指","sentence":"When Emma opened the heavy glass door, her left ______ was caught in the frame, but luckily it was not broken.","translation":"當艾瑪推開厚重的玻璃門時，她的左手拇指被門框夾到了，但幸運的是沒有骨折。"},{"word":"toe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any of the five separate parts at the end of each foot","chinese":"腳趾","sentence":"Jason accidentally kicked the corner of the wooden table, and he hurt his big ______, so he sat on the sofa in pain.","translation":"傑森不小心踢到木桌的角落並傷到了他的大腳趾，所以他痛苦地坐在沙發上。"},{"word":"tongue","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the soft organ inside the mouth used for tasting and speaking","chinese":"舌頭","sentence":"The spicy noodle soup was still extremely hot, and Kevin burned his ______ badly, so he had to drink a glass of cold water.","translation":"那碗辣麵湯依然非常燙，凱文嚴重燙傷了舌頭，所以他不得不喝下一杯冰水。"},{"word":"tummy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the stomach or belly, especially used by or with children","chinese":"肚子；胃","sentence":"The little girl ate too many chocolate candies before lunch, so she had a sore ______ and could not finish her meal.","translation":"小女孩在午餐前吃了太多巧克力糖，所以她肚子痛且無法吃完正餐。"},{"word":"waist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the narrow middle part of the human body above the hips","chinese":"腰部","sentence":"My uncle has exercised every morning for six months, and his ______ has become much smaller, so he needs to buy a new belt.","translation":"我叔叔連續六個月每天早晨運動，他的腰圍縮小了許多，所以他需要買一條新皮帶。"},{"word":"wrist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the joint between the hand and the lower arm","chinese":"手腕","sentence":"David fell off his skateboard on the playground, and he sprained his right ______ when he tried to stop himself from hitting the floor.","translation":"大衛在操場上從滑板上摔了下來，當他試圖用手撐地防止摔倒時扭傷了右手腕。"},{"word":"AIDS","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a serious disease caused by a virus that harms the immune system","chinese":"愛滋病","sentence":"Modern doctors have developed new treatments for ______, and many international groups work together to prevent its spread worldwide.","translation":"現代醫生已經開發出治療愛滋病的新療法，許多國際組織也攜手合作以防止其在全球蔓延。"},{"word":"cancer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very serious disease in which abnormal cells grow uncontrollably","chinese":"癌症","sentence":"Smoking cigarettes significantly increases the risk of lung ______, so the government launched an educational campaign across the country.","translation":"吸菸會顯著增加罹患肺癌的風險，因此政府在全國展開了一項教育宣導宣傳。"},{"word":"cough","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to force air out of the throat with a sudden sound; the illness","chinese":"咳嗽","sentence":"The classroom was completely quiet during the exam, but Jerry had a dry ______ and tried his best not to disturb others.","translation":"考試期間教室裡非常安靜，但傑瑞患有乾咳並竭盡全力不去打擾他人。"},{"word":"death","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the end of life; the state of being dead","chinese":"死亡","sentence":"The sudden ______ of the beloved leader deeply shocked the entire nation, and thousands of citizens gathered to pay their respects.","translation":"這位敬愛領袖的突然去世深深震驚了全國，數千名市民聚集在一起表達敬意。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the heavy dictionary slipped from the desk, it landed directly on David's right foot and bruised his big ______.","options":["thumb","toe","wrist","waist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toe (腳趾) 【全文中譯】當厚重的字典從書桌上滑落時，它直接砸在戴維的右腳上並砸傷了他的大腳趾。 【選項解析】(A) thumb 拇指  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) wrist 手腕  (D) waist 腰部。由 right foot（右腳）可知砸到的是腳趾 toe。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The hot tea was poured straight from the boiling kettle, and Linda burned her ______ when she took a hasty sip.","options":["tongue","waist","tummy","wrist"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tongue (舌頭) 【全文中譯】熱茶直接從沸騰的水壺倒出，琳達匆忙喝了一小口時嚴重燙傷了她的舌頭。 【選項解析】(A) tongue 舌頭  (B) waist 腰部  (C) tummy 肚子  (D) wrist 手腕。由 boiling kettle（沸水壺）與 took a hasty sip（匆忙喝一小口）可知燙傷的是 tongue。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Because my grandfather lost ten kilograms during his illness, his trousers were too loose around his ______.","options":["tongue","cough","waist","thumb"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: waist (腰部) 【全文中譯】因為我的祖父在生病期間瘦了十公斤，所以他的長褲在腰圍處顯得太鬆了。 【選項解析】(A) tongue 舌頭  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) waist 腰部  (D) thumb 拇指。由 trousers were too loose（褲子太鬆）可知是指腰圍 waist。"},{"number":4,"stem":"While typing rapidly on the keyboard for hours, the programmer felt a sharp pain in her right ______ and decided to rest.","options":["tummy","toe","cancer","wrist"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wrist (手腕) 【全文中譯】在鍵盤上連續飛快打字數小時後，程式設計師感到右手腕陣陣劇痛並決定休息。 【選項解析】(A) tummy 肚子  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) cancer 癌症  (D) wrist 手腕。由 typing rapidly on the keyboard（在鍵盤打字）可知手腕 wrist 容易痠痛。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The doctor explained that regular medical checkups can help detect early signs of ______, which greatly improves recovery rates.","options":["cancer","thumb","waist","toe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cancer (癌症) 【全文中譯】醫生解釋定期健康檢查有助於發現癌症的早期徵兆，這能大幅提高康復率。 【選項解析】(A) cancer 癌症  (B) thumb 拇指  (C) waist 腰部  (D) toe 腳趾。由 early signs of... improves recovery rates 可知指重大疾病 cancer。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Little Tommy drank three bottles of cold soda in an hour, so he ran to his mother complaining about a painful ______.","options":["wrist","tummy","death","tongue"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tummy (肚子；胃) 【全文中譯】小湯米在一小時內喝了三瓶冰汽水，所以他跑去找媽媽抱怨肚子痛。 【選項解析】(A) wrist 手腕  (B) tummy 肚子  (C) death 死亡  (D) tongue 舌頭。由 drank three bottles of cold soda（喝了三瓶冰汽水）可知導致 tummy 痛。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The elderly gentleman wore a thick scarf to protect his chest against the cold wind, but his dry ______ still kept him awake at night.","options":["waist","thumb","cough","toe"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cough (咳嗽) 【全文中譯】那位年長紳士圍了條厚圍巾以抵禦寒風保護胸部，但他的乾咳依然讓他在夜裡難以入眠。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) thumb 拇指  (C) cough 咳嗽  (D) toe 腳趾。由 dry cough（乾咳）及 kept him awake at night 可知選 cough。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The hitchhiker stood beside the highway with his ______ raised high in the air to signal passing drivers for a ride.","options":["thumb","toe","tongue","tummy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: thumb (拇指) 【全文中譯】搭便車者站在公路旁，將拇指高高舉在空中以示意過往司機搭載。 【選項解析】(A) thumb 拇指  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) tongue 舌頭  (D) tummy 肚子。搭便車的國際手勢是舉起大拇指 thumb。"},{"number":9,"stem":"News of the brave firefighter's heroic ______ during the rescue mission brought tears to everyone in the town.","options":["waist","death","tummy","wrist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: death (死亡；殉職) 【全文中譯】這位英勇消防員在救援任務中英勇殉職的消息，讓鎮上的每個人都流下了眼淚。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) death 死亡  (C) tummy 肚子  (D) wrist 手腕。由 heroic death during rescue mission（救援任務中英勇殉職）可知選 death。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Public health organizations hold seminars every December to teach young adults about the prevention of ______.","options":["toe","AIDS","thumb","waist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: AIDS (愛滋病) 【全文中譯】公共衛生組織每年十二月都會舉辦研討會，向年輕人宣導預防愛滋病的知識。 【選項解析】(A) toe 腳趾  (B) AIDS 愛滋病  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) waist 腰部。每年12月1日為世界愛滋病日（World AIDS Day），防治疾病為 AIDS。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After hiking down the rocky mountain path in tight boots, Amanda noticed that her left ______ was badly swollen.","options":["toe","waist","tongue","cancer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toe (腳趾) 【全文中譯】穿著過緊的靴子走下多石的山徑後，阿曼達發現她的左腳趾嚴重腫脹。 【選項解析】(A) toe 腳趾  (B) waist 腰部  (C) tongue 舌頭  (D) cancer 癌症。由 tight boots（過緊的靴子）與 hiking down mountain path 可知受擠壓腫脹的是 toe。"},{"number":12,"stem":"When playing badminton yesterday, Samuel slipped on the wooden court and painfully twisted his right ______.","options":["tummy","cough","wrist","tongue"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wrist (手腕) 【全文中譯】昨天打羽毛球時，塞繆爾在木質球場上滑倒，痛苦地扭傷了右手腕。 【選項解析】(A) tummy 肚子  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) wrist 手腕  (D) tongue 舌頭。跌倒撐地或揮拍扭傷關節，此處指 wrist（手腕）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The little boy stuck out his ______ playfully at his sister behind his mother's back, but she caught him doing it.","options":["cancer","tongue","waist","toe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tongue (舌頭) 【全文中譯】小男孩趁媽媽不注意時，調皮地對他妹妹吐舌頭，但他被抓了個正著。 【選項解析】(A) cancer 癌症  (B) tongue 舌頭  (C) waist 腰部  (D) toe 腳趾。stick out one's tongue 為常見片語「吐舌頭」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mr. Harrison fastened a leather belt tightly around his ______ before lifting the heavy wooden crates onto the truck.","options":["waist","wrist","tongue","death"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: waist (腰部) 【全文中譯】哈里森先生在把沉重的木箱搬上卡車前，將皮帶緊緊繫在腰部以提供支撐。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) wrist 手腕  (C) tongue 舌頭  (D) death 死亡。皮帶繫在腰部，故選 waist。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Heavy air pollution in industrial areas often makes people ______ continuously whenever they walk outside without a face mask.","options":["taste","cough","touch","heal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cough (咳嗽) 【全文中譯】工業區嚴重的空氣污染經常使人們在沒戴口罩外出時不斷咳嗽。 【選項解析】(A) taste 品嚐  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) touch 接觸  (D) heal 治癒。空氣污染刺激呼吸道引發 cough（咳嗽）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The sudden tragic ______ of the talented young musician was reported on the front page of every morning newspaper.","options":["death","tummy","thumb","toe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: death (死亡；離世) 【全文中譯】這位才華洋溢的年輕音樂家突然英年早逝的噩耗，登上了每家早報的頭版。 【選項解析】(A) death 死亡  (B) tummy 肚子  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) toe 腳趾。由 tragic death（悲劇性去世）與 front page of morning newspaper 可知選 death。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The nurse gently placed an ice pack on the toddler's swollen ______ after he slammed it in the bedroom drawer.","options":["cancer","tongue","thumb","waist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thumb (拇指) 【全文中譯】小幼童的拇指被臥室抽屜夾到後，護士溫柔地在他的腫脹拇指上敷了冰塊。 【選項解析】(A) cancer 癌症  (B) tongue 舌頭  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) waist 腰部。由 slammed it in the drawer（被抽屜夾到）可知指手指/拇指 thumb。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Eating spoiled seafood from the night market caused severe cramps in my ______, so I visited the clinic immediately.","options":["tummy","wrist","toe","thumb"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tummy (肚子；胃) 【全文中譯】吃了夜市變質的海鮮導致我的肚子嚴重絞痛，所以我立刻去了診所就診。 【選項解析】(A) tummy 肚子  (B) wrist 手腕  (C) toe 腳趾  (D) thumb 拇指。吃了變質海鮮引起 tummy（肚子）痙攣絞痛。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Modern medical research has found effective antiviral drugs that allow people living with ______ to lead normal lives.","options":["AIDS","waist","wrist","tongue"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: AIDS (愛滋病) 【全文中譯】現代醫學研究發現了有效的抗病毒藥物，使愛滋病患者能夠過著正常生活。 【選項解析】(A) AIDS 愛滋病  (B) waist 腰部  (C) wrist 手腕  (D) tongue 舌頭。living with AIDS（與愛滋病共存）為固定醫療社會用語。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The doctor confirmed that the tumor in the patient's stomach was benign and not caused by ______, which relieved the whole family.","options":["death","cancer","tummy","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cancer (癌症) 【全文中譯】醫生證實病患胃部的腫瘤是良性的，並非由癌症所引起，這讓全家人鬆了一口氣。 【選項解析】(A) death 死亡  (B) cancer 癌症  (C) tummy 肚子  (D) cough 咳嗽。tumor is benign and not caused by cancer（腫瘤為良性且非癌症）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Be careful when running barefoot across the sandy beach, or a hidden piece of broken glass could cut your ______.","options":["tongue","waist","toe","cough"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: toe (腳趾) 【全文中譯】赤腳跑過沙灘時要小心，否則隱藏的碎玻璃可能會割傷你的腳趾。 【選項解析】(A) tongue 舌頭  (B) waist 腰部  (C) toe 腳趾  (D) cough 咳嗽。running barefoot（赤腳跑步）容易割傷腳趾 toe。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The tennis coach told the players to wrap protective tape around each ______ to avoid strain during competitive matches.","options":["wrist","tummy","cancer","death"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wrist (手腕) 【全文中譯】網球教練告訴球員們在手腕上纏繞防護膠帶，以避免在激烈比賽中受傷。 【選項解析】(A) wrist 手腕  (B) tummy 肚子  (C) cancer 癌症  (D) death 死亡。網球運動需大量手腕力量，需保護 wrist。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The doctor asked the patient to open his mouth wide and stick out his ______ so she could inspect his swollen throat.","options":["waist","tongue","toe","thumb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tongue (舌頭) 【全文中譯】醫生請病人張大嘴巴並伸出舌頭，以便檢查他腫脹的喉嚨。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) tongue 舌頭  (C) toe 腳趾  (D) thumb 拇指。stick out one's tongue to inspect swollen throat（伸出舌頭檢查喉嚨）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Whenever autumn arrives and temperatures drop quickly, grandfather begins to ______ and drink warm honey water.","options":["crawl","cough","bleed","climb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cough (咳嗽) 【全文中譯】每逢秋季來臨、氣溫驟降時，祖父就開始咳嗽並飲用溫蜂蜜水舒緩。 【選項解析】(A) crawl 爬行  (B) cough 咳嗽  (C) bleed 流血  (D) climb 攀爬。氣溫下降引發咳嗽，故選 cough。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When giving someone encouragement, raising your ______ upward is widely understood as a gesture of support and approval.","options":["waist","toe","thumb","tummy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thumb (拇指) 【全文中譯】在給予他人鼓勵時，大拇指朝上被廣泛理解為支持與讚許的手勢。 【選項解析】(A) waist 腰部  (B) toe 腳趾  (C) thumb 拇指  (D) tummy 肚子。raising thumb upward（豎起大拇指）是肯定讚許的肢體語言。"}]},{"unit":3,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 3 (003.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Illnesses, Symptoms & Physical Sensations | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"deaf","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"unable to hear anything or unable to hear well","chinese":"聾的；重聽的","sentence":"The elderly musician became completely ______ in his left ear, but he continued to compose touching songs by feeling the piano's vibrations.","translation":"這位年長的音樂家左耳完全聾了，但他透過感受鋼琴的振動繼續創作出感人的歌曲。"},{"word":"dizzy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"feeling as if everything is turning around and that you might fall","chinese":"頭暈的","sentence":"After riding the fast roller coaster three times in the amusement park, Laura felt very ______ and had to sit on the bench.","translation":"在遊樂園連續坐了三次快速雲霄飛車後，蘿拉感到非常頭暈，不得不坐在長椅上。"},{"word":"dumb","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"temporarily unable to speak, or permanently unable to speak; stupid","chinese":"啞的；說不出話的；愚蠢的","sentence":"When Mark heard the sudden news that he had won the grand prize, he was struck ______ with shock and could not say a single word.","translation":"當馬克聽到自己獲得大獎的突發消息時，他震驚得說不出話來，一個字也說不出來。"},{"word":"fever","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal","chinese":"發燒","sentence":"The little boy developed a high ______ of thirty-nine degrees late at night, so his worried parents took him straight to the emergency room.","translation":"小男孩在深夜發了三十九度的高燒，擔憂的父母立刻將他直接送往急診室。"},{"word":"flu","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an infectious illness like a very bad cold that causes fever and weakness","chinese":"流行性感冒；流感","sentence":"Several students in our class caught the ______ this week, so the teacher advised everyone to wash hands often and wear masks.","translation":"我們班這週有幾位同學得了流行性感冒，所以老師建議大家要勤洗手並戴口罩。"},{"word":"healthy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"strong and well; not sick; good for health","chinese":"健康的；健壯的","sentence":"My grandfather eats plenty of fresh vegetables every day and walks two miles, so he remains remarkably ______ at the age of eighty.","translation":"我的祖父每天吃大量新鮮蔬菜並步行兩英里，因此他在八十歲高齡依然非常健康。"},{"word":"ill","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"not feeling well; suffering from a disease or sickness","chinese":"生病的；不舒服的","sentence":"Because our English teacher suddenly fell ______ with a severe stomachache yesterday, another teacher had to take over our afternoon class.","translation":"因為我們的英文老師昨天突然因嚴重胃痛而生病，另一位老師不得不接替我們下午的課。"},{"word":"pain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the unpleasant physical feeling caused by injury or illness","chinese":"疼痛；痛苦","sentence":"After running the full marathon on Sunday morning, Jack experienced severe muscle ______ in both legs and could hardly climb the stairs.","translation":"週日早晨跑完完整的馬拉松後，傑克的雙腿經歷了嚴重的肌肉疼痛，幾乎無法爬樓梯。"},{"word":"painful","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"causing physical pain or mental suffering","chinese":"令人疼痛的；痛苦的","sentence":"The deep cut on Robert's right thumb was extremely ______, but the nurse treated it gently with antiseptic cream and a clean bandage.","translation":"羅伯特右手大拇指上的深傷口極為令人疼痛，但護士用消毒藥膏和乾淨繃帶溫柔地進行了處理。"},{"word":"pale","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having less color than usual, especially on the face because of illness","chinese":"蒼白的；灰白的","sentence":"When the nurse noticed how ______ the young patient looked after giving blood, she immediately brought him a cup of warm sweet tea.","translation":"當護士注意到那位年輕病人在捐血後臉色多麼蒼白時，她立刻給他端來一杯溫熱的甜茶。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"After spinning around in circles during the game, little Tommy felt so ______ that he fell onto the soft grass.","options":["healthy","dizzy","pale","deaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dizzy (頭暈的) 【全文中譯】在遊戲中原地旋轉幾圈後，小湯米感到非常頭暈，以致於跌倒在柔軟的草地上。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) deaf 聾的。由 spinning around in circles（旋轉圈圈）可知會感到 dizzy。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The doctor placed a thermometer under the baby's arm and confirmed that she had a dangerous ______ of 39.5 degrees.","options":["fever","pain","flu","tummy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: fever (發燒) 【全文中譯】醫生在嬰兒的手臂下放了體溫計，證實她發了高達 39.5 度的危險高燒。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) pain 疼痛  (C) flu 流感  (D) tummy 肚子。由 thermometer（體溫計）及 39.5 degrees 可知選 fever。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mr. Brown has been ______ since childhood, so he communicates smoothly with his family members using sign language.","options":["dizzy","healthy","deaf","painful"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: deaf (聾的) 【全文中譯】布朗先生自幼就耳聾，因此他使用手語與家人順暢地溝通。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) healthy 健康的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) painful 疼痛的。由 sign language（手語）可知其為 deaf。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Many factory workers caught the winter ______ at the same time, so the manager had to close the assembly line for three days.","options":["pain","flu","fever","death"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: flu (流行性感冒) 【全文中譯】許多工廠工人在同一時間感染了冬季流感，所以經理不得不將裝配線關閉三天。 【選項解析】(A) pain 疼痛  (B) flu 流感  (C) fever 發燒  (D) death 死亡。由 winter... close assembly line for three days 可知指傳染性疾病 flu。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When the student heard the terrifying thunder shake the classroom windows, his face turned completely ______ with fright.","options":["healthy","dizzy","pale","painful"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pale (蒼白的) 【全文中譯】當那位學生聽到可怕的雷聲震動教室窗戶時，他的臉嚇得完全發白。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) painful 疼痛的。turn pale with fright（嚇得臉色蒼白）為常見搭配。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Eating fresh organic fruit and exercising regularly are the best ways to keep your body strong and ______.","options":["ill","deaf","dizzy","healthy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: healthy (健康的) 【全文中譯】吃新鮮有機水果和規律運動，是保持身體強壯與健康的最有效方法。 【選項解析】(A) ill 生病的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) healthy 健康的。strong and healthy（強壯健康的）為同義補充。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The dentist gave Kevin an injection before pulling the rotten tooth, so the operation was not ______ at all.","options":["painful","deaf","dumb","pale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: painful (令人疼痛的) 【全文中譯】牙醫在拔除蛀牙前給凱文打了麻醉針，所以手術過程一點也不令人疼痛。 【選項解析】(A) painful 疼痛的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) dumb 啞的  (D) pale 蒼白的。打了麻藥（injection）使得拔牙過程 not painful。"},{"number":8,"stem":"When the injured player was carried off the soccer field on a stretcher, he was groaning with unbearable ______ in his ankle.","options":["fever","flu","pain","cancer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pain (疼痛) 【全文中譯】當受傷的球員被用擔架抬下足球場時，他因腳踝難以忍受的疼痛而呻吟著。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) flu 流感  (C) pain 疼痛  (D) cancer 癌症。groaning with unbearable pain（因難以忍受的劇痛而呻吟）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The little boy was struck ______ with astonishment when the magician pulled a live white rabbit out of the empty black hat.","options":["healthy","dumb","deaf","dizzy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dumb (說不出話的；驚呆的) 【全文中譯】當魔術師從空黑帽子裡拉出一隻活生生的白兔時，小男孩驚訝得目瞪口呆說不出話來。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dumb 啞的/說不出話的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。struck dumb with astonishment（驚訝得目瞪口呆/說不出話）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Because several employees became seriously ______ after eating contaminated food at the cafeteria, the health bureau launched an inspection.","options":["healthy","painful","ill","deaf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ill (生病的) 【全文中譯】由於幾位員工在餐廳吃了受污染的食物後嚴重生病，衛生局展開了全面檢查。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) painful 疼痛的  (C) ill 生病的  (D) deaf 聾的。fall ill（生病倒下）為標準用法。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After standing under the scorching summer sun for two hours without drinking water, Samuel felt extremely ______ and fainted.","options":["deaf","dizzy","healthy","dumb"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dizzy (頭暈的) 【全文中譯】在酷熱的夏日陽光下站了兩小時而沒喝水後，塞繆爾感到極度頭暈並昏了過去。 【選項解析】(A) deaf 聾的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) healthy 健康的  (D) dumb 啞的。酷暑脫水引發頭暈（dizzy）與昏厥。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The mother placed a cold wet towel on her son's forehead to help bring down his high ______ throughout the stormy night.","options":["flu","pain","fever","waist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fever (發燒) 【全文中譯】母親在兒子的額頭上放了一條冰冷濕毛巾，以幫助他在暴風雨之夜退去高燒。 【選項解析】(A) flu 流感  (B) pain 疼痛  (C) fever 發燒  (D) waist 腰部。bring down high fever（降低高燒）為常見搭配。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Even though my grandfather is slightly ______ in his right ear, he can still hear clearly if you speak directly toward him.","options":["deaf","pale","dizzy","healthy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: deaf (重聽的；聾的) 【全文中譯】儘管我的祖父右耳稍微有點重聽，但如果你直接朝著他講話，他依然能聽得很清楚。 【選項解析】(A) deaf 聾的/重聽的  (B) pale 蒼白的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) healthy 健康的。指耳朵功能受損，選 deaf。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Drinking warm lemon water and getting plenty of rest in bed will help your body recover faster from the seasonal ______.","options":["pain","flu","cancer","fever"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: flu (流感) 【全文中譯】喝溫檸檬水並在床上多休息，將有助於你的身體更快從季節性流感中康復。 【選項解析】(A) pain 疼痛  (B) flu 流感  (C) cancer 癌症  (D) fever 發燒。seasonal flu 指季節性流感。"},{"number":15,"stem":"When Mary stepped on a rusty iron nail in the garden, she cried out in sudden ______ and called her father for help.","options":["fever","pain","flu","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pain (疼痛) 【全文中譯】當瑪麗在花園裡踩到生鏽的鐵釘時，她痛苦地尖叫並大聲向父親求救。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) pain 疼痛  (C) flu 流感  (D) cough 咳嗽。踩到鐵釘引起的劇烈感官反應是 pain。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The nurse told the patient that the injection would feel like a tiny pinch and would not be very ______.","options":["painful","healthy","deaf","dizzy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: painful (令人疼痛的) 【全文中譯】護士告訴病人打針感覺就像被輕輕捏一下，並不會非常令人疼痛。 【選項解析】(A) painful 疼痛的  (B) healthy 健康的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。形容打針的感受，選 painful。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After being trapped inside the dark mine for twenty hours without food, the rescued workers looked remarkably weak and ______.","options":["healthy","pale","dumb","painful"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pale (蒼白的) 【全文中譯】在漆黑的礦井中被困二十小時且沒有食物後，獲救的工人們看起來異常虛弱且面色蒼白。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) pale 蒼白的  (C) dumb 啞的  (D) painful 疼痛的。weak and pale（虛弱且面色蒼白）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Maintaining a balanced daily diet and sleeping eight hours every night will ensure you remain energetic and ______.","options":["dizzy","ill","deaf","healthy"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: healthy (健康的) 【全文中譯】維持均衡的日常飲食並每晚睡滿八小時，將確保你保持活力與健康。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) ill 生病的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) healthy 健康的。energetic and healthy（充滿活力且健康）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the police officer asked the frightened witness what had happened, she was struck ______ and could only point at the broken door.","options":["deaf","dumb","pale","healthy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dumb (說不出話的) 【全文中譯】當警官詢問受驚的目擊者發生了什麼事時，她驚嚇得說不出話，只能指著破損的門。 【選項解析】(A) deaf 聾的  (B) dumb 說不出話的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) healthy 健康的。struck dumb 表示嚇得暫時失語。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The principal announced that school would be canceled tomorrow because our teacher suddenly fell ______ and had to stay in the hospital.","options":["healthy","dizzy","ill","pale"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ill (生病的) 【全文中譯】校長宣布明天停課，因為我們的老師突然生病且必須住院治療。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) ill 生病的  (D) pale 蒼白的。fell ill 表示罹病。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The cut on my finger was swollen and ______, so the doctor advised me to keep it clean and dry for a few days.","options":["painful","deaf","healthy","dumb"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: painful (令人疼痛的) 【全文中譯】我手指上的傷口紅腫且令人疼痛，所以醫生建議我保持幾天清潔乾燥。 【選項解析】(A) painful 疼痛的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) healthy 健康的  (D) dumb 啞的。swollen and painful（紅腫疼痛）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The patient took two painkiller pills before going to bed, and the sharp ______ in his injured shoulder gradually faded away.","options":["fever","flu","pain","death"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pain (疼痛) 【全文中譯】病人在睡前吃了兩顆止痛藥，他受傷肩膀上的劇烈疼痛逐漸消退。 【選項解析】(A) fever 發燒  (B) flu 流感  (C) pain 疼痛  (D) death 死亡。吃止痛藥（painkiller）是為了減緩 pain。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Looking down from the top of the hundred-story skyscraper made Oliver feel so ______ that he backed away from the window immediately.","options":["healthy","dizzy","deaf","pale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dizzy (頭暈的) 【全文中譯】從百層摩天大樓頂端向下看讓奧利佛感到非常頭暈，以致於他立刻從窗邊退開。 【選項解析】(A) healthy 健康的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) pale 蒼白的。在高處向下看引起的暈眩感即為 dizzy。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The child had a runny nose, a sore throat, and a high ______, which indicated that he had caught a serious viral infection.","options":["flu","fever","pain","tummy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fever (發燒) 【全文中譯】那孩子流鼻水、喉嚨痛且發高燒，這表明他感染了嚴重的病毒。 【選項解析】(A) flu 流感  (B) fever 發燒  (C) pain 疼痛  (D) tummy 肚子。have a high fever（發高燒）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When she saw the blood dripping from her sister's knee, Amanda's face turned as ______ as a white sheet of paper.","options":["pale","dizzy","deaf","healthy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pale (蒼白的) 【全文中譯】當看到血液從她妹妹的膝蓋滴下時，阿曼達的臉色變得像一張白紙一樣蒼白。 【選項解析】(A) pale 蒼白的  (B) dizzy 頭暈的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) healthy 健康的。as pale as a sheet 為固定比喻「面如白紙」。"}]},{"unit":4,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 4 (004.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Recovery, Medical Facilities & Spiritual Concepts | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"recover","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to become healthy or well again after an illness or injury","chinese":"康復；恢復","sentence":"After resting quietly at home for two weeks, Samuel began to ______ from his chest infection, and he returned to school yesterday.","translation":"在家安靜休養兩週後，塞繆爾開始從胸部感染中康復，並於昨天重返學校。"},{"word":"toothache","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sharp or dull pain in or near a tooth","chinese":"牙痛","sentence":"Linda suffered from a terrible ______ all night long, so she made an urgent appointment with her dentist early this morning.","translation":"琳達整晚飽受劇烈牙痛之苦，所以她今天清晨緊急向牙醫師預約看診。"},{"word":"weight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"how heavy someone or something is; heaviness","chinese":"重量；體重","sentence":"Because my father wanted to control his body ______, he stopped drinking sugary sodas and started jogging every evening.","translation":"因為我父親想要控制自己的體重，他不再喝含糖汽水並開始每天傍晚慢跑。"},{"word":"wound","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an injury to the body, especially a cut or tear in the skin","chinese":"傷口；傷害","sentence":"The soldier received a deep bullet ______ on his right arm during the battle, but field doctors bandaged it quickly.","translation":"那名士兵在戰鬥中右臂受了嚴重的子彈傷口，但戰地醫生迅速為他進行了包紮。"},{"word":"ambulance","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a special vehicle used for taking sick or injured people to hospital","chinese":"救護車","sentence":"When the serious highway crash occurred, the police arrived immediately and called an ______ to transport the injured driver.","translation":"當這起嚴重的公路車禍發生時，警方立即趕到現場並呼叫救護車運送受傷的司機。"},{"word":"patient","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person receiving medical care; able to wait calmly","chinese":"病人；有耐心的","sentence":"The elderly doctor was very gentle and ______ with every young child who visited the hospital clinic.","translation":"那位年邁的醫生對每一位來到醫院診所的小朋友都非常溫柔且有耐心。"},{"word":"homesick","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"sad because you are away from home and miss your family","chinese":"想家的；思鄉的","sentence":"During her first semester studying abroad in London, Emily felt deeply ______ whenever she looked at family photographs.","translation":"在倫敦留學的第一個學期裡，每當艾瑪看著家庭照片時，都感到深深的想家。"},{"word":"drugstore","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a shop where you can buy medicines, makeup, and daily items","chinese":"藥局；藥妝店","sentence":"Grandma asked me to walk over to the corner ______ to pick up her blood pressure pills and some cotton pads.","translation":"祖母叫我走到街角的藥局去幫她拿降血壓藥和一些化妝棉。"},{"word":"ghost","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the spirit of a dead person that some people believe can appear","chinese":"鬼魂；幽靈","sentence":"The children refused to enter the abandoned wooden mansion because an ancient legend claimed that a mysterious ______ lived inside.","translation":"孩子們拒絕進入那座廢棄的木製豪宅，因為一個古老的傳說聲稱裡面住著一個神秘的鬼魂。"},{"word":"god","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a superhuman being worshipped as having power over nature or human fortunes","chinese":"神；上帝","sentence":"The fishermen gathered at the coastal temple to pray to their ______ for safe voyages and calm seas ahead.","translation":"漁民們聚集在沿海的廟宇，向他們的神祈求航行平安與未來海面平靜。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the cyclist collided with the delivery van, bystanders immediately dialed 119 to request an ______.","options":["ambulance","drugstore","toothache","weight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ambulance (救護車) 【全文中譯】當自行車騎士與送貨廂型車相撞時，旁觀者立即撥打119請求救護車支援。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) drugstore 藥局  (C) toothache 牙痛  (D) weight 重量。由 dialed 119 可知是呼叫 ambulance。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The nurse cleaned the dusty gravel out of the open ______ before applying antiseptic ointment and a fresh bandage.","options":["god","wound","patient","ghost"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wound (傷口) 【全文中譯】護士在塗抹消毒藥膏和換上乾淨繃帶之前，先清理乾淨開放性傷口裡的砂石灰塵。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) wound 傷口  (C) patient 病人  (D) ghost 鬼魂。open wound 指「開放性傷口」。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Eating sweet sticky candies right before bed without brushing often leads to severe cavities and a terrible ______.","options":["weight","toothache","ambulance","wound"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toothache (牙痛) 【全文中譯】睡前吃甜黏的糖果而沒刷牙，常常導致嚴重的蛀牙和劇烈的牙痛。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) ambulance 救護車  (D) wound 傷口。蛀牙引發 toothache。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The doctor reassured the family that with proper medication and rest, the patient would soon ______ completely.","options":["recover","wound","pray","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recover (康復) 【全文中譯】醫生向家屬保證，只要給予適當的藥物和休息，病人很快就會完全康復。 【選項解析】(A) recover 康復  (B) wound 傷害  (C) pray 祈禱  (D) cough 咳嗽。recover completely 表示「完全康復」。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Living in a faraway foreign city for the first time often makes international college students feel quite ______.","options":["patient","homesick","healthy","deaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: homesick (想家的) 【全文中譯】初次獨自生活在遙遠的異國城市，常常讓國際大學生感到非常想家。 【選項解析】(A) patient 有耐心的  (B) homesick 思鄉的  (C) healthy 健康的  (D) deaf 聾的。身處異鄉感到 homesick。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please stop by the twenty-four-hour ______ on your way home to purchase cough syrup and band-aids for your brother.","options":["ghost","ambulance","drugstore","weight"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drugstore (藥局；藥妝店) 【全文中譯】請在回家的路上順道去那家24小時藥局，為你弟弟買止咳糖漿和OK繃。 【選項解析】(A) ghost 鬼魂  (B) ambulance 救護車  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) weight 體重。購買止咳糖漿的地方是 drugstore。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The heavy wooden box was loaded with metal tools, so its total ______ exceeded thirty kilograms.","options":["wound","toothache","patient","weight"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: weight (重量) 【全文中譯】那個厚重的木箱裝滿了金屬工具，所以其總重量超過了三十公斤。 【選項解析】(A) wound 傷口  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) patient 病人  (D) weight 重量。exceeded 30 kilograms 指重量（weight）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In ancient mythologies, people believed that the storm was sent by an angry ______ to punish wicked citizens.","options":["god","ghost","ambulance","patient"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: god (神) 【全文中譯】在古代神話中，人們相信這場暴風雨是一位憤怒的神派遣來懲罰邪惡市民的。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) ambulance 救護車  (D) patient 病人。古代神話中主宰自然的神為 god。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Old villagers whispered rumors that the dark tower on the cliff was haunted by the restless ______ of a forgotten sailor.","options":["weight","ghost","drugstore","toothache"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ghost (鬼魂) 【全文中譯】老村民們私下謠傳懸崖上的黑塔裡，遊蕩著一位被遺忘水手的焦躁鬼魂。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) toothache 牙痛。haunted by a ghost 表示鬧鬼。"},{"number":10,"stem":"A good elementary school teacher must remain extremely ______ when explaining complicated arithmetic to young beginners.","options":["homesick","patient","pale","dizzy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (有耐心的) 【全文中譯】優秀的小學老師在向初學者解釋複雜算術時，必須保持極大的耐心。 【選項解析】(A) homesick 想家的  (B) patient 有耐心的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。面對初學兒童需保持 patient。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After the surgeon finished the four-hour operation, the recovering ______ was moved into the intensive care room.","options":["ambulance","patient","drugstore","ghost"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (病人) 【全文中譯】在外科醫生結束長達四小時的手術後，康復中的病人被轉移至加護病房。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) patient 病人  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) ghost 鬼魂。接受手術住院的人為 patient。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The siren of the speeding ______ wailed loudly down the crowded avenue as drivers pulled over to let it pass.","options":["ambulance","drugstore","toothache","weight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ambulance (救護車) 【全文中譯】疾駛中的救護車鳴響警笛呼嘯穿過擁擠的大街，沿途司機紛紛靠邊讓行。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) drugstore 藥局  (C) toothache 牙痛  (D) weight 體重。鳴警笛且司機讓行的車輛為 ambulance。"},{"number":13,"stem":"It took Oliver almost six months of physical therapy to ______ full mobility in his fractured knee.","options":["recover","tear","skin","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recover (恢復；康復) 【全文中譯】奧利佛花了將近六個月的物理治療，才使骨折的膝蓋完全恢復活動能力。 【選項解析】(A) recover 恢復  (B) tear 撕裂  (C) skin 擦破皮  (D) cough 咳嗽。recover full mobility 指「恢復完整活動能力」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you have a throbbing ______ that keeps you awake, you should avoid drinking ice water and visit the dentist immediately.","options":["weight","toothache","wound","ghost"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toothache (牙痛) 【全文中譯】如果你有一陣陣令人難以入眠的跳痛牙痛，你應該避免喝冰水並立即去看牙醫。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) wound 傷口  (D) ghost 鬼魂。看牙醫處理的問題是 toothache。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The soldier's combat ______ healed cleanly over the summer, but a faint pale scar remained visible on his cheek.","options":["ghost","ambulance","wound","god"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wound (傷口) 【全文中譯】士兵的戰鬥傷口在夏天完全癒合了，但他臉頰上仍留下了一道淡淡的淺色疤痕。 【選項解析】(A) ghost 鬼魂  (B) ambulance 救護車  (C) wound 傷口  (D) god 神。combat wound 指「戰鬥傷口」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because Kevin gained too much ______ over the holidays, he decided to join a gym and reduce carbohydrate intake.","options":["weight","toothache","drugstore","patient"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: weight (體重) 【全文中譯】因為凱文在假期中體重增加太多，他決定加入健身房並減少碳水化合物攝取。 【選項解析】(A) weight 體重  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) patient 病人。gain weight 表示「體重增加」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The pharmacist working behind the counter at the local ______ carefully checked the doctor's prescription before handing out the pills.","options":["ambulance","drugstore","ghost","wound"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: drugstore (藥局) 【全文中譯】在當地藥局櫃檯工作的藥劑師，在發放藥丸前仔細檢查了醫生的處方籤。 【選項解析】(A) ambulance 救護車  (B) drugstore 藥局  (C) ghost 鬼魂  (D) wound 傷口。配藥的地點為 drugstore。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Spending Christmas alone in a snowy dormitory made the exchange student feel terribly sad and ______.","options":["homesick","patient","deaf","healthy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: homesick (想家的) 【全文中譯】獨自在積雪的宿舍裡度過聖誕節，讓這位交換學生感到非常悲傷與想家。 【選項解析】(A) homesick 想家的  (B) patient 有耐心的  (C) deaf 聾的  (D) healthy 健康的。節日獨處易感到 homesick。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before heading into the treacherous storm, the villagers knelt before their ancient ______ to ask for protection.","options":["god","ghost","patient","weight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: god (神) 【全文中譯】在進入危險的暴風雨前，村民們跪倒在古老的神明面前祈求保佑庇護。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) patient 病人  (D) weight 重量。向神明祈禱庇護，選 god。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Spooky tales about a white-robed ______ wandering the old cemetery at midnight kept children from walking near the gate.","options":["drugstore","toothache","ghost","wound"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ghost (幽靈；鬼魂) 【全文中譯】關於午夜時分白袍幽靈在舊墓園徘徊的恐怖故事，讓孩子們不敢走近大門。 【選項解析】(A) drugstore 藥局  (B) toothache 牙痛  (C) ghost 幽靈  (D) wound 傷口。白袍徘徊的神秘身影為 ghost。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Dealing with difficult customers requires cashiers to stay calm, courteous, and remarkably ______ at all times.","options":["homesick","patient","dizzy","pale"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (有耐心的) 【全文中譯】應對難纏的顧客要求收銀員始終保持冷靜、有禮貌且具備極佳的耐心。 【選項解析】(A) homesick 想家的  (B) patient 有耐心的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) pale 蒼白的。服務顧客需要 patient。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Paramedics rushed inside the wrecked building with a folding stretcher to carry the unconscious ______ outside.","options":["drugstore","patient","ghost","god"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: patient (傷患；病人) 【全文中譯】急救人員帶著折疊擔架衝進倒塌的建築物中，將昏迷不醒的傷患抬到室外。 【選項解析】(A) drugstore 藥局  (B) patient 病患  (C) ghost 鬼魂  (D) god 神。擔架抬出的對象為 patient。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The athlete was thrilled to hear from the surgeon that his torn muscle would ______ in time for the championship match.","options":["recover","wound","tear","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recover (康復) 【全文中譯】運動員高興地從外科醫生那裡得知，他撕裂的肌肉將及時康復以趕上冠軍賽。 【選項解析】(A) recover 康復  (B) wound 傷害  (C) tear 撕破  (D) cough 咳嗽。肌肉傷勢康復，選 recover。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sudden explosion sent shattered glass flying everywhere, causing a deep bleeding ______ across the mechanic's forehead.","options":["weight","wound","toothache","ambulance"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wound (傷口) 【全文中譯】突然的爆炸讓破碎玻璃四處飛濺，在技工的額頭上造成了一道深深流血的傷口。 【選項解析】(A) weight 重量  (B) wound 傷口  (C) toothache 牙痛  (D) ambulance 救護車。玻璃割傷為 bleeding wound。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Many ancient cultures built magnificent stone pyramids as sacred monuments dedicated to the sun ______.","options":["god","ghost","drugstore","patient"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: god (神) 【全文中譯】許多古代文明建造了壯麗的石造金字塔，作為獻給太陽神的神聖紀念碑。 【選項解析】(A) god 神  (B) ghost 鬼魂  (C) drugstore 藥局  (D) patient 病患。sun god 指「太陽神」。"}]},{"unit":5,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 5 (005.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: People, Manners & Human Spirit | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"praise","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to express strong approval or admiration for someone","chinese":"稱讚；讚美","sentence":"The principal gathered the whole school to ______ the brave students who rescued an elderly neighbor from the flooded house.","translation":"校長召集了全校師生，稱讚那些從淹水房屋中救出年邁鄰居的英勇學生。"},{"word":"pray","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to speak to God or a saint in order to give thanks or ask for help","chinese":"祈禱；祈求","sentence":"Every night before going to sleep, the little boy kneels beside his bed to ______ for his family's continued good health.","translation":"每晚就寢前，小男孩都會跪在床邊祈禱他的家人能夠持續保持身體健康。"},{"word":"spirit","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the non-physical part of a person; mood; courage and enthusiasm","chinese":"精神；靈魂；士氣","sentence":"Although our soccer team lost the final championship match, our coach admired the fighting ______ that every player showed.","translation":"雖然我們的足球隊在最後的冠軍爭奪賽中落敗，但教練十分讚賞每位球員所展現的戰鬥精神。"},{"word":"male","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"belonging to the sex that does not give birth to young","chinese":"男性的；雄性的","sentence":"In most bird species, the ______ bird displays brightly colored feathers to attract female partners during spring.","translation":"在大多數鳥類物種中，雄鳥在春季會展現出色彩斑斕的羽毛以吸引雌性伴侶。"},{"word":"adult","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person who is fully grown or legally mature","chinese":"成年人；成熟的","sentence":"Children under the age of twelve are not permitted to enter the swimming pool unless accompanied by an ______.","translation":"十二歲以下的兒童除非有成年人陪同，否則不允許進入該游泳池。"},{"word":"elder","pos":"(adj.) / (n.)","definition":"born earlier; senior; older person in a family or tribe","chinese":"年長的；長者","sentence":"Traditional Taiwanese culture teaches children to show high respect and courtesy toward their family ______.","translation":"台灣傳統文化教育孩子們要對家庭中的年長長輩表達崇高的尊敬與禮貌。"},{"word":"youth","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the period between childhood and adult age; young people","chinese":"青年時期；青春；年輕人","sentence":"In his ______, my grandfather worked on a merchant ship and traveled to more than twenty different countries.","translation":"在他年輕的時候，我的祖父曾在一艘商船上工作，並到過二十多個不同的國家旅行。"},{"word":"guy","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a man or boy; an informal word for an individual person","chinese":"傢伙；人；男士","sentence":"Mark is a really friendly and generous ______, and he always volunteers to help his classmates with difficult math homework.","translation":"馬克真是一個非常友善且慷慨的傢伙，他總是自願幫助同學解答困難的數學作業。"},{"word":"lady","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a polite or formal way of referring to a woman","chinese":"女士；淑女","sentence":"The polite young gentleman immediately stood up on the crowded subway train to offer his seat to an elderly ______.","translation":"那位有禮貌的年輕紳士立即在擁擠的捷運列車上站起身來，將座位讓給一位年長的女士。"},{"word":"ma'am","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a polite way of addressing a woman, especially in formal service","chinese":"女士；夫人（尊稱）","sentence":"The flight attendant smiled warmly and asked, 'May I bring you another cup of hot green tea, ______?'","translation":"空服員溫暖地微笑著問道：「女士，我能再為您拿一杯熱綠茶嗎？」"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The teacher did not hesitate to ______ Alice in front of the entire class for achieving the highest score on the exam.","options":["praise","pray","recover","wound"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: praise (稱讚) 【全文中譯】老師毫不猶豫地在全班同學面前稱讚愛麗絲，因為她在考試中獲得了最高分。 【選項解析】(A) praise 稱讚  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) recover 康復  (D) wound 傷害。考最高分值得在全班面前 praise。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Whenever our village faces severe droughts in summer, farmers gather at the chapel to ______ for rain.","options":["praise","pray","tear","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pray (祈禱) 【全文中譯】每當我們的村莊在夏季面臨嚴重的乾旱時，農民們就會聚集在小教堂祈求降雨。 【選項解析】(A) praise 讚美  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) tear 撕裂  (D) cough 咳嗽。pray for rain（祈雨）為固定用法。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The marathon runner was exhausted after thirty miles, but her indomitable ______ kept her pushing forward until the finish line.","options":["youth","spirit","guy","adult"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spirit (精神；意志) 【全文中譯】馬拉松跑者在跑了三十英里後精疲力竭，但她不屈不撓的精神讓她繼續向前推進直到終點線。 【選項解析】(A) youth 青春  (B) spirit 精神  (C) guy 傢伙  (D) adult 成年人。indomitable spirit 指「不屈不撓的精神」。"},{"number":4,"stem":"While female lions do most of the hunting for the pride, the strong ______ lion defends their vast territory from intruders.","options":["elder","male","homesick","patient"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: male (雄性的) 【全文中譯】雖然母獅負責獅群的大部分狩獵，但強壯的公獅則保衛著牠們龐大的領地免受入侵者侵擾。 【選項解析】(A) elder 年長的  (B) male 雄性的  (C) homesick 想家的  (D) patient 有耐心的。與 female 雌性相對應的是 male。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Movie tickets cost ten dollars for children, but every ______ must pay fifteen dollars at the ticket booth.","options":["guy","adult","youth","spirit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: adult (成年人) 【全文中譯】兒童電影票價為十美元，但在售票亭每位成年人必須支付十五美元。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) adult 成年人  (C) youth 青年  (D) spirit 精神。與 children 相對應的票價類別為 adult。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In many indigenous communities, young people listen attentively to the wisdom shared by the village ______.","options":["elders","spirits","guys","wounds"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: elders (長輩；長者) 【全文中譯】在許多原住民社區中，年輕人都專注傾聽村莊長輩們所分享的智慧。 【選項解析】(A) elders 長者  (B) spirits 靈魂  (C) guys 傢伙  (D) wounds 傷口。village elders 指「村莊長輩」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"During the energetic days of his ______, Uncle Frank spent entire summers backpacking across the rugged European mountains.","options":["spirit","youth","adult","lady"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: youth (青年時期) 【全文中譯】在活力充沛的青年時期，法蘭克叔叔花了一整個夏天背著背包徒步穿越崎嶇的歐洲山脈。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) youth 青年時期  (C) adult 成年人  (D) lady 女士。in the days of his youth 指青年歲月。"},{"number":8,"stem":"That tall ______ wearing the leather jacket is my older brother, and he plays lead guitar in a university rock band.","options":["adult","guy","spirit","ma'am"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guy (傢伙；男士) 【全文中譯】那個穿皮夾克的高個子傢伙是我哥哥，他在大學搖滾樂團裡擔任主奏吉他手。 【選項解析】(A) adult 成年人  (B) guy 傢伙  (C) spirit 精神  (D) ma'am 女士。that tall guy（那個高個子傢伙）為常見口語。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The courteous waiter bowed gently and pulled out the wooden chair for the elegant ______ wearing the black evening gown.","options":["guy","lady","spirit","youth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lady (女士；淑女) 【全文中譯】有禮貌的服務生溫柔地鞠躬，並為身穿黑色晚禮服的高雅女士拉開木椅。 【選項解析】(A) guy 男士  (B) lady 女士  (C) spirit 精神  (D) youth 青年。穿著晚禮服的高雅女性稱為 lady。"},{"number":10,"stem":"'Excuse me, ______, you dropped your leather purse on the pavement,' the honest schoolboy shouted across the street.","options":["guy","ma'am","spirit","youth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ma'am (女士；夫人) 【全文中譯】「不好意思，女士，您的皮夾掉在人行道上了，」誠實的男學童隔著街道大聲呼喊。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) ma'am 女士尊稱  (C) spirit 精神  (D) youth 青年。對陌生女性的有禮尊稱為 ma'am。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Parents should frequently ______ their children when they show kindness and helpfulness toward other people.","options":["praise","pray","skin","hurt"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: praise (稱讚) 【全文中譯】當孩子們對他人展現出善良與樂於助人時，父母應當經常給予稱讚。 【選項解析】(A) praise 稱讚  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) skin 擦傷  (D) hurt 傷害。肯定良好行為應給予 praise。"},{"number":12,"stem":"When the sailor was lost in the stormy ocean, he could only ______ for a rescue ship to appear before sunset.","options":["praise","pray","cough","tear"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pray (祈禱) 【全文中譯】當水手迷失在暴風雨的大海中時，他只能祈求搜救船能在日落前出現。 【選項解析】(A) praise 稱讚  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) cough 咳嗽  (D) tear 撕破。身陷絕境向天祈求，選 pray。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Even after losing their homes in the earthquake, the survivors showed remarkable community ______ by sharing food.","options":["spirit","youth","guy","adult"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: spirit (精神；士氣) 【全文中譯】即使在地震中失去了家園，倖存者們依然透過分享食物展現了非凡的社區團結精神。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) youth 青年  (C) guy 傢伙  (D) adult 成年人。community spirit 指「社區團隊凝聚精神」。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Scientists observed that only the ______ peacocks have magnificent fan-shaped tails with brilliant eye patterns.","options":["elder","male","patient","deaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: male (雄性的) 【全文中譯】科學家觀察到，只有雄孔雀才擁有絢麗眼狀斑紋的壯觀扇形尾羽。 【選項解析】(A) elder 年長的  (B) male 雄性的  (C) patient 有耐心的  (D) deaf 聾的。male peacocks 指「雄孔雀」。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The amusement park ride is too dangerous for toddlers, so an accompanying ______ must supervise each seat.","options":["youth","adult","spirit","guy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: adult (成年人) 【全文中譯】遊樂園的設施對幼童來說太危險了，因此每個座位都必須有一名陪同的成年人監護。 【選項解析】(A) youth 青年  (B) adult 成年人  (C) spirit 精神  (D) guy 男士。accompanying adult 指「陪同的成年人」。"},{"number":16,"stem":"It is an honorable custom in our family to consult our ______ sister whenever an important household decision arises.","options":["elder","male","pale","dizzy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: elder (年長的) 【全文中譯】每當家中有重大決定時，先向我們年長的姐姐請教是我們家族的一項光榮傳統。 【選項解析】(A) elder 年長的  (B) male 男性的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) dizzy 頭暈的。elder sister 指「年長的姐姐」。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Spending one's precious ______ playing video games all day without learning useful skills is something many regret later.","options":["adult","youth","spirit","lady"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: youth (青春時期) 【全文中譯】整天玩電子遊戲而沒有學習實用技能來耗費寶貴的青春，是許多人後來會後悔的事。 【選項解析】(A) adult 成年人  (B) youth 青春  (C) spirit 精神  (D) lady 女士。precious youth 指「寶貴的青春」。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Samuel is the kind of reliable ______ who will drop whatever he is doing to come and help fix your broken car.","options":["spirit","guy","ma'am","lady"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guy (傢伙；人) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾是那種值得信賴的人，他會放下手頭正在做的事來幫你修好故障的汽車。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) guy 傢伙/人  (C) ma'am 女士  (D) lady 女士。reliable guy 指「靠得住的人」。"},{"number":19,"stem":"The dignified old ______ donated millions of dollars to the children's hospital to build a modern cancer center.","options":["guy","lady","youth","spirit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lady (女士) 【全文中譯】那位尊貴的老婦人向兒童醫院捐贈了數百萬美元，以建立一座現代化的癌症中心。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) lady 女士  (C) youth 青年  (D) spirit 精神。dignified old lady 指「尊貴的高齡女士」。"},{"number":20,"stem":"'Here is your receipt and change, ______; thank you for shopping at our department store today,' the cashier said politely.","options":["guy","ma'am","spirit","youth"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: ma'am (女士；夫人) 【全文中譯】「這是您的收據和零錢，女士；謝謝您今天光臨我們的百貨公司，」收銀員有禮貌地說道。 【選項解析】(A) guy 男士  (B) ma'am 女士尊稱  (C) spirit 精神  (D) youth 青年。商業服務中禮貌稱呼顧客為 ma'am。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The sports coach offered warm words of ______ to the young goalkeeper after he blocked three decisive penalty kicks.","options":["spirit","praise","youth","adult"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: praise (讚美；讚許) 【全文中譯】在年輕守門員撲下了三個決定性的十二碼罰球後，體育教練對他表達了熱烈的讚美。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神  (B) praise 讚美  (C) youth 青春  (D) adult 成年人。words of praise 指「讚許的話語」。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Millions of peaceful citizens went to their local churches and mosques to ______ for an end to the brutal war.","options":["praise","pray","recover","wound"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pray (祈禱) 【全文中譯】數百萬和平的公民前往當地的教堂和清真寺，祈求殘酷的戰爭早日結束。 【選項解析】(A) praise 讚美  (B) pray 祈求  (C) recover 康復  (D) wound 傷害。pray for an end to war 指「祈求戰爭終結」。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The school festival was full of joyful laughter, and the festive ______ of the students spread throughout the neighborhood.","options":["spirit","youth","adult","guy"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: spirit (精神；氛圍) 【全文中譯】學校園遊會充滿了歡樂的笑聲，學生們節日的歡樂氛圍感染了整個社區街坊。 【選項解析】(A) spirit 精神/氣氛  (B) youth 青春  (C) adult 成年人  (D) guy 傢伙。festive spirit 指「節日慶祝氣氛」。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The university established a generous scholarship foundation to support motivated ______ from underprivileged rural backgrounds.","options":["adults","youth","ladies","spirits"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: youth (青年人) 【全文中譯】這所大學設立了慷慨的獎學金基金會，以資助來自弱勢農村背景且積極向上的青年人。 【選項解析】(A) adults 成年人  (B) youth 青年群體  (C) ladies 女士  (D) spirits 靈魂。motivated youth 指「有志青年」。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the polite young man offered his umbrella to the wet ______, she thanked him warmly and shared her cab.","options":["guy","lady","youth","spirit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lady (女士) 【全文中譯】當那位有禮貌的年輕人把雨傘讓給被雨淋濕的女士時，她熱情地感謝他並與他共乘計程車。 【選項解析】(A) guy 傢伙  (B) lady 女士  (C) youth 青春  (D) spirit 精神。wet lady 指被淋濕的女士。"}]},{"unit":6,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 6 (006.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Family Relations, Social Roles & Guests | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"granddaughter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a daughter of your son or daughter","chinese":"孫女；外孫女","sentence":"The elderly lady smiled happily as her little ______ ran into her arms and handed her a handmade birthday card.","translation":"當小孫女跑進那位年長女士的懷裡並遞給她一張手工生日卡片時，她幸福地微笑著。"},{"word":"grandson","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a son of your son or daughter","chinese":"孫子；外孫","sentence":"Mr. Watson took his energetic ten-year-old ______ to the baseball park, and they caught a foul ball in the third inning.","translation":"華生先生帶著他精力充沛的十歲孫子去棒球場，他們在第三局接到了一顆界外球。"},{"word":"nephew","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a son of your brother or sister","chinese":"姪子；外甥","sentence":"Aunt Catherine bought a remote-controlled helicopter for her favorite ______, and they flew it together in the garden.","translation":"凱薩琳姑姑為她最喜歡的姪子買了一架遙控直升機，他們一起在花園裡放飛它。"},{"word":"niece","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a daughter of your brother or sister","chinese":"姪女；外甥女","sentence":"Uncle David was extremely proud when his smart ______ graduated from medical school with top honors last month.","translation":"上個月，當大衛叔叔聰穎的姪女以優異的成績從醫學院畢業時，他感到無比自豪。"},{"word":"relative","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person connected by blood or marriage; comparative","chinese":"親戚；親屬","sentence":"During the Lunar New Year holidays, dozens of distant ______ gather at our ancestral home to share a festive reunion dinner.","translation":"在農曆新年假期期間，數十位遠房親戚聚集在我們祖厝，共同享用豐盛的團圓晚餐。"},{"word":"couple","pos":"(n.)","definition":"two people who are married or in a romantic relationship; a small number","chinese":"夫妻；情侶；一對","sentence":"The newly married young ______ rented a cozy apartment near the park, and they spent weekends decorating their living room.","translation":"這對新婚的年輕夫婦在公園附近租了一間溫馨的公寓，他們利用週末時間裝飾客廳。"},{"word":"guest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person invited to visit someone's home or attend an event","chinese":"客人；賓客","sentence":"The hotel staff prepared fresh flowers and fruit baskets to welcome every VIP ______ attending the international conference.","translation":"飯店員工準備了鮮花和水果籃，以歡迎出席這次國際會議的每一位貴賓。"},{"word":"host","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a person who receives or entertains guests; to organize an event","chinese":"主人；主辦；主持","sentence":"The gracious ______ welcomed each visitor at the front door with a warm smile and served hot tea in the parlor.","translation":"親切的主人在前門帶著溫暖的微笑迎接每位訪客，並在客廳裡為大家奉上熱茶。"},{"word":"member","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or animal belonging to a group, club, or society","chinese":"成員；會員","sentence":"Because Samuel has been an active ______ of the science club for three years, he was elected team leader for the competition.","translation":"因為塞繆爾連續三年擔任科學社團的活躍成員，他被推選為本次競賽的隊長。"},{"word":"visitor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who visits someone or somewhere for a short time","chinese":"參觀者；訪客","sentence":"Museum guides kindly reminded each foreign ______ not to take photos using flash inside the ancient Egyptian exhibition hall.","translation":"博物館導覽員親切地提醒每一位外國參觀者，在古埃及展覽廳內不得使用閃光燈拍照。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The proud grandmother baked sweet apple pies to celebrate her five-year-old ______'s first ballet performance.","options":["grandson","granddaughter","couple","host"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: granddaughter (孫女) 【全文中譯】自豪的祖母烤了香甜的蘋果派，以慶祝她五歲孫女的第一場芭蕾舞表演。 【選項解析】(A) grandson 孫子  (B) granddaughter 孫女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) host 主人。由 ballet performance（芭蕾舞表演）及 grandmother 可知選 granddaughter。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Grandpa taught his teenage ______ how to cast a fishing line and steer the wooden boat across the lake.","options":["granddaughter","niece","grandson","guest"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: grandson (孫子) 【全文中譯】祖父教他十幾歲的孫子如何拋投釣魚線並在湖面上掌舵木船。 【選項解析】(A) granddaughter 孫女  (B) niece 姪女  (C) grandson 孫子  (D) guest 客人。由 Grandpa... steer the wooden boat 可知帶孫子 grandson 釣魚。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Uncle Kevin sent a beautiful wooden toy castle to his six-year-old ______ on his birthday.","options":["nephew","niece","host","visitor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nephew (姪子；外甥) 【全文中譯】凱文叔叔在六歲姪子生日時，送了一座精美的木製玩具城堡給他。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) host 主人  (D) visitor 訪客。由 his birthday 可知姪子/外甥為男性 nephew。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Aunt Sarah helped her teenage ______ select an elegant white dress for her high school graduation ball.","options":["nephew","grandson","niece","member"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: niece (姪女；外甥女) 【全文中譯】莎拉姑姑幫助她十幾歲的姪女挑選了一件優雅的白禮服，以參加高中畢業舞會。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) grandson 孫子  (C) niece 姪女  (D) member 成員。選禮服參加畢業舞會的姪女為 niece。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When my parents celebrated their wedding anniversary, more than thirty close ______ traveled across the country to attend.","options":["relatives","couples","hosts","members"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: relatives (親戚；親屬) 【全文中譯】當我父母慶祝結婚紀念日時，超過三十位近親親屬橫跨全國趕來參加盛會。 【選項解析】(A) relatives 親屬  (B) couples 夫妻  (C) hosts 主人  (D) members 會員。close relatives 指「近親」。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The newlywed ______ held hands tightly as they walked down the sunlit beach during their honeymoon in Hawaii.","options":["guest","couple","relative","visitor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: couple (夫妻；情侶) 【全文中譯】這對新婚夫婦在夏威夷度蜜月期間，漫步在陽光明媚的沙灘上時緊緊牽著手。 【選項解析】(A) guest 客人  (B) couple 夫婦  (C) relative 親戚  (D) visitor 參觀者。newlywed couple 指「新婚夫妻」。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The polite waiter made sure that every invited dinner ______ had a glass of chilled sparkling water at the banquet.","options":["host","relative","guest","nephew"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guest (客人；賓客) 【全文中譯】有禮貌的服務生確保宴會上每位受邀的晚宴賓客，都能享有一杯冰鎮氣泡水。 【選項解析】(A) host 主人  (B) relative 親戚  (C) guest 賓客  (D) nephew 姪子。invited dinner guest 指「受邀晚宴賓客」。"},{"number":8,"stem":"As the generous party ______, Mr. Jenkins made sure all his neighbors had plenty of barbecue and cold drinks.","options":["guest","host","grandson","niece"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: host (主人；東道主) 【全文中譯】身為慷慨的派對主人，詹金斯先生確保所有的鄰居都有充足的烤肉和冷飲。 【選項解析】(A) guest 客人  (B) host 主人  (C) grandson 孫子  (D) niece 姪女。舉辦派對款待賓客者為 host。"},{"number":9,"stem":"To join the community swimming pool and use the fitness equipment, you must register as an annual ______.","options":["visitor","member","couple","host"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: member (會員；成員) 【全文中譯】若要加入社區游泳池並使用健身器材，你必須註冊成為年度會員。 【選項解析】(A) visitor 訪客  (B) member 會員  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) host 主人。register as an annual member 指註冊成為年度會員。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Thousands of international ______ travel to Taipei every autumn to admire the colorful fireworks and historic monuments.","options":["nieces","visitors","nephews","hosts"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: visitors (參觀者；遊客) 【全文中譯】數千名國際遊客每年秋天前往台北，欣賞絢麗的煙火並參觀歷史名勝。 【選項解析】(A) nieces 姪女  (B) visitors 遊客  (C) nephews 姪子  (D) hosts 主人。到訪台北觀光者為 visitors。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Old Mrs. Higgins knitted a soft pink wool sweater for her newborn ______ before the cold winter set in.","options":["grandson","granddaughter","couple","guest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: granddaughter (孫女) 【全文中譯】希金斯老太太在寒冬降臨前，為她剛出生的孫女織了一件柔軟的粉紅色羊毛毛衣。 【選項解析】(A) grandson 孫子  (B) granddaughter 孫女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) guest 客人。粉紅毛衣織給新生孫女 granddaughter。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The grandfather beamed with pride when his twenty-year-old ______ scored the winning goal in the university soccer tournament.","options":["granddaughter","grandson","niece","host"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grandson (孫子) 【全文中譯】當二十歲的孫子在大學足球錦標賽中踢進致勝球時，祖父滿臉自豪歡喜。 【選項解析】(A) granddaughter 孫女  (B) grandson 孫子  (C) niece 姪女  (D) host 主人。由 his twenty-year-old grandson 可知為孫子。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Because his father had no brothers, Jack was the only beloved ______ on his mother's side of the family.","options":["nephew","niece","couple","visitor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nephew (姪子；外甥) 【全文中譯】因為他父親沒有兄弟，傑克是母親那邊家族裡唯一備受疼愛的姪子/外甥。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) visitor 訪客。Jack 為男性，故為 nephew。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mary asked her talented ______ to play the violin at her wedding ceremony, and the performance moved everyone to tears.","options":["nephew","niece","host","member"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: niece (姪女；外甥女) 【全文中譯】瑪麗請她多才多藝的姪女在婚禮上演奏小提琴，這場演奏讓所有人感動落淚。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) host 主人  (D) member 成員。親戚晚輩中的女性演奏家為 niece。"},{"number":15,"stem":"We invited all our living ______ to the ancestral village reunion, but some could not travel due to old age.","options":["couples","relatives","visitors","guests"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: relatives (親戚) 【全文中譯】我們邀請了所有健在的親戚參加祖村宗親團聚，但有些人因年事已高無法遠行。 【選項解析】(A) couples 夫婦  (B) relatives 親屬  (C) visitors 訪客  (D) guests 賓客。ancestral village reunion 聚會對象為 relatives。"},{"number":16,"stem":"After dating for seven years through college, the romantic young ______ finally decided to announce their engagement.","options":["guest","host","couple","member"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: couple (情侶；一對) 【全文中譯】在大學相戀七年後，這對浪漫的年輕情侶終於決定宣布訂婚。 【選項解析】(A) guest 賓客  (B) host 主人  (C) couple 情侶  (D) member 成員。相戀宣布訂婚者為 couple。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The hotel manager personally greeted each important foreign ______ at the lobby entrance and arranged baggage delivery.","options":["host","guest","relative","nephew"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guest (賓客；貴賓) 【全文中譯】飯店經理在大廳門口親自迎接每一位重要的外國貴賓，並安排行李運送。 【選項解析】(A) host 主人  (B) guest 貴賓  (C) relative 親戚  (D) nephew 姪子。飯店接待的客人為 guest。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Taiwan will proudly ______ the international technology summit next year, welcoming thousands of foreign experts.","options":["guest","host","relative","niece"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: host (主辦；主持) 【全文中譯】台灣明年將榮幸地主辦國際科技峰會，熱烈歡迎數千名外國專家與會。 【選項解析】(A) guest 款待  (B) host 主辦  (C) relative 親屬  (D) niece 姪女。host the summit 指主辦高峰會。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Every committee ______ was invited to vote on the environmental protection policy during the annual meeting.","options":["visitor","member","couple","grandson"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: member (成員；委員) 【全文中譯】每位委員會成員都被邀請在年會上就環境保護政策進行投票表決。 【選項解析】(A) visitor 訪客  (B) member 成員  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) grandson 孫子。committee member 指委員會成員。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The national park guide warned every tourist and ______ to stay strictly on the marked walking trails for safety.","options":["nephew","niece","visitor","host"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: visitor (參觀者；遊客) 【全文中譯】國家公園導覽員告誡每位遊客和參觀者，為了自身安全必須嚴格走在標記步道上。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) visitor 參觀者  (D) host 主人。national park tourist and visitor 指國家公園遊客。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The little ______ sat happily on her grandfather's lap while he read bedtime stories from a large illustrated book.","options":["grandson","granddaughter","host","couple"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: granddaughter (孫女) 【全文中譯】小孫女高興地坐在祖父的膝蓋上，聽他朗讀大圖畫書裡的睡前故事。 【選項解析】(A) grandson 孫子  (B) granddaughter 孫女  (C) host 主人  (D) couple 夫婦。sit on grandfather's lap 聽故事的小女孩為 granddaughter。"},{"number":22,"stem":"When Mr. Davis retired, his eldest ______ took over management of the family hardware store in the downtown district.","options":["granddaughter","grandson","niece","guest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grandson (孫子) 【全文中譯】戴維斯先生退休後，他年紀最大的長孫接管了市中心家族五金店的經營。 【選項解析】(A) granddaughter 孫女  (B) grandson 孫子  (C) niece 姪女  (D) guest 賓客。eldest grandson 指長孫。"},{"number":23,"stem":"My sister asked me to babysit my energetic little ______ while she went to the dentist for a tooth extraction.","options":["nephew","niece","couple","host"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nephew (姪子；外甥) 【全文中譯】我姐姐請我在她去牙醫拔牙期間，幫忙照看我那活潑好動的小外甥。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 外甥  (B) niece 外甥女  (C) couple 夫婦  (D) host 主人。照顧姊姊的兒子即為 nephew。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The kind aunt taught her young ______ how to bake chocolate chip cookies and decorate frosted birthday cupcakes.","options":["nephew","niece","grandson","visitor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: niece (姪女；外甥女) 【全文中譯】親切的姑姑教她年幼的姪女如何烘焙巧克力脆片餅乾，並裝飾糖霜生日杯子蛋糕。 【選項解析】(A) nephew 姪子  (B) niece 姪女  (C) grandson 孫子  (D) visitor 訪客。教導女性晚輩烘焙，選 niece。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Although we do not see each other often, my distant ______ always sends handwritten greeting cards during the holidays.","options":["couple","relative","host","member"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: relative (親戚) 【全文中譯】儘管我們不常碰面，但我遠方的親戚總是在節日期間寄來手寫的問候賀卡。 【選項解析】(A) couple 夫婦  (B) relative 親戚  (C) host 主人  (D) member 成員。distant relative 指遠親。"}]},{"unit":7,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 7 (007.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Holidays, Cultural Festivals & Celebrations | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"Double Tenth Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"the national day of the Republic of China (Taiwan) celebrated on October 10","chinese":"雙十節；國慶日","sentence":"Thousands of citizens gathered in front of the Presidential Office Building on ______ ______ ______ to watch the military parade and air show.","translation":"數千名市民在雙十節聚集在總統府前，觀看盛大的閱兵典禮與飛行特技表演。"},{"word":"Dragon Boat Festival","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a traditional Chinese holiday when people race dragon boats and eat rice dumplings","chinese":"端午節","sentence":"Every summer during the ______ ______ ______, our family eats delicious sticky rice dumplings and watches exciting boat races on the river.","translation":"每年夏天的端午節期間，我們全家人都會吃美味的糯米粽子，並在河畔觀看精彩刺激的划龍舟比賽。"},{"word":"Easter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a Christian festival celebrating the resurrection of Jesus, marked by decorated eggs","chinese":"復活節","sentence":"Children ran excitedly around the church lawn on ______ Sunday morning searching for colorful chocolate eggs hidden in the bushes.","translation":"在復活節週日早晨，孩子們興奮地在教堂草坪四周奔跑，尋找藏在灌木叢中的彩色巧克力蛋。"},{"word":"Halloween","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the night of October 31 when children wear costumes and go trick-or-treating","chinese":"萬聖節前夕","sentence":"Young kids dressed up as friendly ghosts and superheroes on ______, walking from house to house shouting 'trick or treat' for candy.","translation":"年幼的孩子們在萬聖節前夕裝扮成友好的鬼魂和超級英雄，挨家挨戶走著並大喊「不給糖就搗蛋」以討取糖果。"},{"word":"Lantern Festival","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a Chinese festival celebrated on the 15th day of the first lunar month","chinese":"元宵節","sentence":"People across Taiwan solve tricky riddles and admire magnificent glowing light displays during the annual ______ ______ in February.","translation":"每年二月的元宵節期間，全台灣各地的人們都會猜有趣的燈謎，並欣賞壯麗璀璨的發光花燈展覽。"},{"word":"Mother's Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a day honoring mothers, celebrated on the second Sunday of May","chinese":"母親節","sentence":"Kevin and his sister prepared breakfast in bed and bought pink carnations to celebrate ______ ______ with their loving mom.","translation":"凱文和他的妹妹準備了床上早餐並買了粉紅康乃馨，與他們深愛的母親一同慶祝母親節。"},{"word":"Teacher's Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a day honoring teachers, celebrated in Taiwan on September 28","chinese":"教師節","sentence":"Students across Taiwan write heartfelt greeting cards and present flowers to thank their dedicated educators on ______ ______.","translation":"全台灣的學生都會在教師節這一天寫下由衷的感謝賀卡並奉上鮮花，向盡職盡責的教育工作者表達感謝。"},{"word":"Thanksgiving Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a North American holiday of giving thanks, celebrated with a roast turkey dinner","chinese":"感恩節","sentence":"American families reunite around the dining table on ______ ______ to enjoy roast turkey, cranberry sauce, and sweet pumpkin pie.","translation":"美國家庭會在感恩節這一天團聚在餐桌旁，一同享用烤火雞、蔓越莓醬和香甜南瓜派。"},{"word":"Valentine's Day","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"February 14, celebrated by sending cards and gifts to sweethearts","chinese":"情人節","sentence":"Florists and chocolate shops are packed with excited customers buying romantic red roses and gift boxes on ______ ______.","translation":"在情人節這一天，花店和巧克力店擠滿了興奮的顧客，爭相購買浪漫的紅玫瑰與精緻禮物盒。"},{"word":"wedding","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a marriage ceremony, especially considered as including the associated celebrations","chinese":"婚禮；結婚典禮","sentence":"The bride looked breathtaking in her lace gown, and more than two hundred guests attended the outdoor church ______.","translation":"新娘穿著蕾絲禮服顯得光彩照人，超過兩百位賓客出席了這場戶外教堂婚禮。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Spectators cheered wildly as colorful watercraft competed along the river during the annual ______ ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Double Tenth Day","Lantern Festival","Mother's Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Dragon Boat Festival (端午節) 【全文中譯】當色彩繽紛的船隻在一年一度的端午節沿河競渡時，觀眾們熱情地大聲歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。watercraft competing along river 為划龍舟。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Huge crowds gathered in the capital to witness the fighter jet flyover and fireworks marking ______ ______ ______.","options":["Lantern Festival","Double Tenth Day","Easter","Teacher's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Double Tenth Day (雙十節；國慶日) 【全文中譯】龐大人群聚集在首都，親眼見證慶祝雙十節的戰鬥機衝場與璀璨煙火表演。 【選項解析】(A) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十國慶  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Teacher's Day 教師節。戰機衝場為雙十國慶特色。"},{"number":3,"stem":"On the second Sunday of May, restaurants across the city are fully booked as families celebrate ______ ______.","options":["Mother's Day","Valentine's Day","Easter","Halloween"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Mother's Day (母親節) 【全文中譯】在五月的第二個星期日，全市的餐館全部被訂滿，因為各個家庭都在慶祝母親節。 【選項解析】(A) Mother's Day 母親節  (B) Valentine's Day 情人節  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Halloween 萬聖節。五月第二個星期日為 Mother's Day。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Children carry decorative battery-powered lights and eat sweet glutinous rice balls to celebrate the ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Easter","Lantern Festival","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Lantern Festival (元宵節) 【全文中譯】孩子們提著裝有電池的造型花燈並品嚐甜湯圓，以慶祝元宵節。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。提燈籠吃湯圓為元宵節習俗。"},{"number":5,"stem":"On October thirty-first, young kids dress up in spooky monster outfits to celebrate ______ with their classmates.","options":["Easter","Halloween","wedding","Mother's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Halloween (萬聖節前夕) 【全文中譯】十月三十一日這一天，年幼的小孩會穿上嚇人的怪物服裝，與同班同學一起慶祝萬聖節。 【選項解析】(A) Easter 復活節  (B) Halloween 萬聖節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。十月三十一日穿戲服為 Halloween。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In Christian communities, children enjoy hunting for painted pastel eggs hidden in gardens on ______ morning.","options":["Halloween","Easter","wedding","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Easter (復活節) 【全文中譯】在基督教社區裡，孩子們在復活節早晨開心地在花園裡尋找隱藏的彩繪粉彩蛋。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。尋找彩蛋為 Easter 代表活動。"},{"number":7,"stem":"On September twenty-eighth, school pupils present flower bouquets and thank-you notes to celebrate ______ ______.","options":["Mother's Day","Teacher's Day","Valentine's Day","Lantern Festival"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Teacher's Day (教師節) 【全文中譯】九月二十八日這一天，小學生們獻上花束和感謝卡片，慶祝教師節。 【選項解析】(A) Mother's Day 母親節  (B) Teacher's Day 教師節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Lantern Festival 元宵節。九月二十八日為台灣的教師節。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In the United States, eating roast turkey and giving thanks for family blessings are the core customs of ______ ______.","options":["Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day","Valentine's Day","Halloween"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Thanksgiving Day (感恩節) 【全文中譯】在美國，吃烤火雞並為家庭幸福獻上感恩，是感恩節的核心傳統習俗。 【選項解析】(A) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Halloween 萬聖節。吃火雞謝恩為 Thanksgiving Day。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Red roses and heart-shaped chocolate boxes are the most popular romantic gifts exchanged on ______ ______.","options":["Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Valentine's Day","Easter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Valentine's Day (情人節) 【全文中譯】紅玫瑰和心形巧克力禮盒，是在情人節互相贈送的最受歡迎浪漫禮物。 【選項解析】(A) Teacher's Day 教師節  (B) Mother's Day 母親節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Easter 復活節。心形巧克力和紅玫瑰代表 Valentine's Day。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The cathedral bells rang joyfully across the town square as the newlyweds stepped outside after their romantic ______.","options":["wedding","Halloween","Easter","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: wedding (婚禮；結婚典禮) 【全文中譯】當這對新人在浪漫的婚禮後步出大門時，大教堂的鐘聲在小鎮廣場上歡快響起。 【選項解析】(A) wedding 婚禮  (B) Halloween 萬聖節  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。新婚夫妻步出教堂為 wedding。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Eating sticky bamboo-wrapped rice dumplings while watching competitive river rowing is typical of the ______ ______ ______.","options":["Lantern Festival","Dragon Boat Festival","Double Tenth Day","Teacher's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Dragon Boat Festival (端午節) 【全文中譯】吃竹葉包的糯米粽子並同時觀賞精彩的河上划船競賽，是端午節的典型特色。 【選項解析】(A) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (B) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (C) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (D) Teacher's Day 教師節。包粽划船即為端午節。"},{"number":12,"stem":"High school marching bands and military guards delivered spectacular performances in front of the palace on ______ ______ ______.","options":["Double Tenth Day","Lantern Festival","Mother's Day","Valentine's Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Double Tenth Day (雙十國慶日) 【全文中譯】高中樂旗儀隊與三軍儀隊在雙十節這一天，於總統府前呈現了精彩絕倫的演出。 【選項解析】(A) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (B) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Valentine's Day 情人節。府前儀隊表演為雙十國慶活動。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Buying pink carnations and taking mom out for a gourmet dinner are traditional ways to honor ______ ______.","options":["Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Easter","Halloween"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Mother's Day (母親節) 【全文中譯】買粉紅色康乃馨並帶媽媽去享用精緻晚餐，是慶祝母親節的傳統方式。 【選項解析】(A) Teacher's Day 教師節  (B) Mother's Day 母親節  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Halloween 萬聖節。康乃馨贈與母親代表 Mother's Day。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Tourists from around the world flock to Pingxi to release thousands of sky lanterns into the night sky for the ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Lantern Festival","Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Lantern Festival (元宵天燈節) 【全文中譯】來自世界各地的遊客湧入平溪，在元宵節將數千盞天燈釋放到夜空之中。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Lantern Festival 元宵天燈節  (C) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (D) Double Tenth Day 雙十節。平溪放天燈在元宵節。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Little children carve grinning faces into orange pumpkins and place glowing candles inside to prepare for ______.","options":["Easter","Halloween","wedding","Mother's Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Halloween (萬聖節) 【全文中譯】小孩子們在橘色南瓜上雕刻出露齒笑臉並在裡面放發光蠟燭，以迎接萬聖節的到來。 【選項解析】(A) Easter 復活節  (B) Halloween 萬聖節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。雕刻南瓜燈為 Halloween 傳統。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Chocolate bunnies and colored hard-boiled eggs are traditional festive treats enjoyed by children during ______.","options":["Halloween","Easter","wedding","Double Tenth Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Easter (復活節) 【全文中譯】巧克力兔子和彩繪水煮蛋，是孩子們在復活節期間享用的傳統應景美味點心。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Double Tenth Day 雙十節。巧克力兔為 Easter 象徵。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Our former high school classmates met yesterday to organize a special alumni banquet honoring our instructors on ______ ______.","options":["Mother's Day","Valentine's Day","Teacher's Day","Lantern Festival"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: Teacher's Day (教師節) 【全文中譯】我們以前的高中同學昨天聚會，籌備在教師節舉辦特別的校友宴會向老師們致敬。 【選項解析】(A) Mother's Day 母親節  (B) Valentine's Day 情人節  (C) Teacher's Day 教師節  (D) Lantern Festival 元宵節。向老師致敬的節日為 Teacher's Day。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Airports and train stations in North America experience their busiest travel traffic of the entire year right before ______ ______.","options":["Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day","Valentine's Day","Dragon Boat Festival"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Thanksgiving Day (感恩節) 【全文中譯】北美各地的機場與火車站，在感恩節前夕都會迎來全年度最繁忙的返鄉交通人潮。 【選項解析】(A) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節。北美返鄉團聚最大節日為 Thanksgiving Day。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Couples book romantic rooftop dinners overlooking the city skyline months in advance to celebrate ______ ______ together.","options":["Teacher's Day","Valentine's Day","Mother's Day","Easter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: Valentine's Day (情人節) 【全文中譯】情侶們提前數月預訂俯瞰城市天際線的浪漫屋頂晚餐，共同慶祝情人節。 【選項解析】(A) Teacher's Day 教師節  (B) Valentine's Day 情人節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Easter 復活節。情侶共度浪漫晚餐為 Valentine's Day。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The groom felt nervous before walking down the aisle, but seeing his beautiful bride smiled warmly made the ______ unforgettable.","options":["Halloween","wedding","Easter","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wedding (婚禮) 【全文中譯】新郎在步上紅毯前感到很緊張，但看到美麗的新娘溫柔微笑，讓這場婚禮令人難忘。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) wedding 婚禮  (C) Easter 復活節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。新郎新娘步入禮堂為 wedding。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Smelling the aroma of steamed meat dumplings cooked in bamboo leaves always reminds grandfather of the ______ ______ ______.","options":["Dragon Boat Festival","Lantern Festival","Double Tenth Day","Easter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Dragon Boat Festival (端午節) 【全文中譯】聞到竹葉包裹蒸熟肉粽的香氣，總是讓祖父回想起端午節的熱鬧景象。 【選項解析】(A) Dragon Boat Festival 端午節  (B) Lantern Festival 元宵節  (C) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (D) Easter 復活節。竹葉肉粽為端午節應景食物。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Citizens waving red, blue, and white national flags gathered in Taipei City to commemorate the historical birth of the nation on ______ ______ ______.","options":["Double Tenth Day","Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Double Tenth Day (雙十國慶日) 【全文中譯】揮舞著紅、藍、白三色國旗的市民聚集在台北市，在雙十節慶祝國家的歷史誕生。 【選項解析】(A) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (B) Teacher's Day 教師節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。雙十國慶揮舞國旗。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The florist stayed up all night arranging hundreds of red rose bouquets for rushed young lovers on ______ ______.","options":["Valentine's Day","Teacher's Day","Mother's Day","Easter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Valentine's Day (情人節) 【全文中譯】花店老闆徹夜未眠包裝數百束紅玫瑰，以應對在情人節急匆匆前來選購的年輕情侶。 【選項解析】(A) Valentine's Day 情人節  (B) Teacher's Day 教師節  (C) Mother's Day 母親節  (D) Easter 復活節。情人節搶購紅玫瑰。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Neighborhood streets were flooded with costumed children holding plastic pumpkin buckets and asking for candy on ______ evening.","options":["Halloween","Easter","wedding","Thanksgiving Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Halloween (萬聖節) 【全文中譯】萬聖節當晚，街坊鄰里間擠滿了穿著各式戲服、手提塑膠南瓜桶討糖果的孩童。 【選項解析】(A) Halloween 萬聖節  (B) Easter 復活節  (C) wedding 婚禮  (D) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節。提南瓜桶討糖為 Halloween。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Delicious cranberry sauce, mashed potatoes, and roasted turkey were served to all invited relatives on ______ ______.","options":["Thanksgiving Day","Double Tenth Day","Valentine's Day","Mother's Day"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Thanksgiving Day (感恩節) 【全文中譯】美味的蔓越莓醬、馬鈴薯泥和烤火雞，在感恩節盛宴上端出來招待所有受邀的親戚。 【選項解析】(A) Thanksgiving Day 感恩節  (B) Double Tenth Day 雙十節  (C) Valentine's Day 情人節  (D) Mother's Day 母親節。火雞大餐配蔓越莓醬為 Thanksgiving Day。"}]},{"unit":8,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 8 (008.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Vegetables, Grains & Common Produce | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bean","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an edible seed or pod of certain plants, especially used for food","chinese":"豆莢；豆子","sentence":"Mom cooked a pot of hearty beef stew with green ______ and potatoes, so our whole family enjoyed a warm dinner.","translation":"媽媽用四季豆和馬鈴薯燉煮了一鍋熱氣騰騰的牛肉煲，所以我們全家人享受了一頓溫暖的晚餐。"},{"word":"cabbage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large round vegetable with thick green or purple leaves","chinese":"高麗菜；包心菜","sentence":"The chef chopped fresh green ______ finely to make crispy vegetable dumplings and spicy pickled side dishes.","translation":"主廚將新鮮翠綠的高麗菜切得碎碎的，以製作香脆蔬菜水餃與香辣醃漬小菜。"},{"word":"carrot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a long, thin, orange vegetable that grows underground","chinese":"胡蘿蔔","sentence":"The little girl fed a sweet, crunchy ______ to the hungry white rabbit in the kindergarten pet corner.","translation":"小女孩在幼兒園的寵物角落，將一根香甜酥脆的胡蘿蔔餵給飢餓的白兔。"},{"word":"cereal","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a grain used for food, such as wheat or oats, often eaten with milk","chinese":"穀類食品；麥片","sentence":"Every morning before heading to school, Jason pours cold milk over a bowl of crunchy whole-grain ______.","translation":"每天早晨上學前，傑森都會將冰牛奶倒進一碗香脆的全穀麥片中。"},{"word":"corn","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tall plant that produces yellow grains on large ears","chinese":"玉米","sentence":"Night market vendors grill sweet yellow ______ over charcoal and brush it with savory soy sauce for tourists.","translation":"夜市攤販在炭火上碳烤香甜的黃玉米，並為遊客刷上鹹香的醬油醬汁。"},{"word":"grape","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small round green or purple fruit that grows in bunches","chinese":"葡萄","sentence":"The French farmer harvested thousands of ripe purple ______ from the vineyard to produce award-winning wine.","translation":"法國農夫從葡萄園裡採收了數千顆成熟的紫葡萄，以釀造屢獲殊榮的葡萄酒。"},{"word":"guava","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tropical fruit with green skin, sweet pink or white flesh, and seeds","chinese":"芭樂；番石榴","sentence":"Taiwanese farmers grow delicious crisp ______ in Changhua, and locals love to sprinkle plum powder over sliced pieces.","translation":"台灣農民在彰化種植香脆可口的芭樂，當地人非常喜歡在切片上撒上甘梅粉食用。"},{"word":"lettuce","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a leafy green vegetable used especially in raw salads or burgers","chinese":"萵苣；生菜","sentence":"The waiter layered crisp green ______ and ripe red tomatoes between the toasted bread to make a club sandwich.","translation":"服務生在烘烤過的吐司之間夾入清脆綠萵苣與熟透紅番茄，製作了一份總匯三明治。"},{"word":"mango","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tropical fruit with smooth yellow-red skin and sweet juicy yellow flesh","chinese":"芒果","sentence":"During hot summer afternoons, tourists line up outside dessert shops in Tainan to order shaved ice topped with fresh ______.","translation":"在炎熱的夏日午後，遊客們在台南的甜品店外排隊，點選鋪滿新鮮芒果的芒果刨冰。"},{"word":"onion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a round vegetable with many layers that has a strong smell and taste","chinese":"洋蔥","sentence":"When Samuel chopped the pungent white ______ on the cutting board, his eyes watered so much that he had to wipe them.","translation":"當塞繆爾在砧板上切嗆辣的白洋蔥時，他的眼睛流淚不止，不得不頻頻擦拭。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The market vendor recommended buying fresh sweet ______ from Tainan to make refreshing fruit shaved ice.","options":["mango","onion","bean","cereal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mango (芒果) 【全文中譯】市場攤商推薦購買來自台南的新鮮香甜芒果，以製作令人暑氣全消的水果刨冰。 【選項解析】(A) mango 芒果  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) bean 豆子  (D) cereal 麥片。台南知名特產水果刨冰配料為 mango。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Whenever Linda chops a raw white ______ in the kitchen, its pungent sulfur scent makes her eyes water heavily.","options":["grape","onion","guava","corn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: onion (洋蔥) 【全文中譯】每當琳達在廚房切生白洋蔥時，其辛辣的氣味總是讓她眼淚流個不停。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) corn 玉米。切時讓人流淚的蔬菜為 onion。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The farmer showed the kindergarten children how to pull sweet orange ______ out of the loose black soil.","options":["cabbages","carrots","cereals","beans"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: carrots (胡蘿蔔) 【全文中譯】農夫向幼兒園的孩子們展示如何從鬆軟的黑土中拔出甜甜的橘色胡蘿蔔。 【選項解析】(A) cabbages 高麗菜  (B) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (C) cereals 穀物  (D) beans 豆類。橘色生長在泥土裡的為 carrots。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Slicing crisp green ______ and sprinkling sweet plum powder on top is a popular snack across night markets in Taiwan.","options":["guava","onion","cereal","carrot"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: guava (芭樂；番石榴) 【全文中譯】切片清脆的綠芭樂並撒上甘甜梅子粉，是台灣夜市廣受歡迎的休閒零嘴。 【選項解析】(A) guava 芭樂  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) cereal 麥片  (D) carrot 胡蘿蔔。搭配梅子粉食用的清脆水果為 guava。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The fast food worker placed grilled beef patties, melted cheese, and crisp green ______ inside the toasted burger bun.","options":["bean","lettuce","grape","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lettuce (萵苣；生菜) 【全文中譯】快餐店員工將烤牛肉餅、融化的起司與清脆綠生菜夾入烤過的漢堡麵包中。 【選項解析】(A) bean 豆子  (B) lettuce 生菜  (C) grape 葡萄  (D) cereal 麥片。漢堡內夾的清脆生菜為 lettuce。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In the vineyard, the owner showed visitors how bunches of ripe dark purple ______ are picked to make sweet juice.","options":["carrots","grapes","cabbages","onions"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: grapes (葡萄) 【全文中譯】在葡萄園裡，園主向遊客展示如何採摘成串成熟的深紫葡萄來製作甜果汁。 【選項解析】(A) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (B) grapes 葡萄  (C) cabbages 高麗菜  (D) onions 洋蔥。葡萄園（vineyard）生產的是 grapes。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Pouring warm milk over a bowl of honey-toasted ______ is Oliver's favorite quick breakfast before catching the morning train.","options":["cabbage","cereal","guava","lettuce"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cereal (穀物麥片) 【全文中譯】將熱牛奶倒進一碗蜂蜜烤麥片中，是奧利佛趕早班火車前最喜歡的快速早餐。 【選項解析】(A) cabbage 高麗菜  (B) cereal 麥片  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) lettuce 萵苣。配牛奶吃的早餐穀物為 cereal。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The soup smelled wonderful because grandmother simmered pork ribs with sweet yellow ______ for over two hours.","options":["corn","grape","lettuce","mango"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: corn (玉米) 【全文中譯】這鍋湯聞起來棒極了，因為祖母將排骨與香甜黃玉米一起慢火燉煮了兩個多小時。 【選項解析】(A) corn 玉米  (B) grape 葡萄  (C) lettuce 生菜  (D) mango 芒果。煲排骨湯常見的黃色蔬菜為 corn。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The restaurant chef stir-fried shredded ______ with garlic and dried shrimp to serve as an authentic Taiwanese side dish.","options":["grape","cabbage","mango","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cabbage (高麗菜) 【全文中譯】餐廳大廚用大蒜和蝦米熱炒切絲的高麗菜，作為一道道地的台灣家常菜。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) cabbage 高麗菜  (C) mango 芒果  (D) cereal 麥片。炒蒜泥蝦米蔬菜為 cabbage。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Vegetarians often eat soy ______ and tofu to ensure they consume sufficient dietary protein every day.","options":["beans","onions","guavas","lettuces"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beans (豆類) 【全文中譯】素食者常吃大豆和豆腐，以確保每天攝取足夠的膳食蛋白質。 【選項解析】(A) beans 豆類  (B) onions 洋蔥  (C) guavas 芭樂  (D) lettuces 萵苣。soy beans 指大豆/黃豆。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Juicy yellow slices of ripe ______ were served alongside vanilla ice cream as a special seasonal summer dessert.","options":["mango","cabbage","onion","carrot"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mango (芒果) 【全文中譯】香甜多汁的熟黃芒果切片與香草冰淇淋一同端上桌，作為特別的季節性夏季甜點。 【選項解析】(A) mango 芒果  (B) cabbage 高麗菜  (C) onion 洋蔥  (D) carrot 胡蘿蔔。夏季黃色多汁水果為 mango。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Caramelizing sliced brown ______ in melted butter gives French soup its distinctive rich aroma and deep golden color.","options":["grapes","onions","cereals","guavas"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: onions (洋蔥) 【全文中譯】用融化奶油慢炒焦化切片棕洋蔥，賦予了法式洋蔥湯獨特的濃郁香氣與金黃色澤。 【選項解析】(A) grapes 葡萄  (B) onions 洋蔥  (C) cereals 麥片  (D) guavas 芭樂。法式濃湯的主角為 onions。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Rabbits and horses enjoy chewing on fresh crunchy orange ______ picked straight from the vegetable garden.","options":["beans","carrots","guavas","lettuces"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: carrots (胡蘿蔔) 【全文中譯】兔子和馬喜歡咀嚼直接從蔬菜園現拔出來的新鮮酥脆橘色胡蘿蔔。 【選項解析】(A) beans 豆子  (B) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (C) guavas 芭樂  (D) lettuces 生菜。兔子馬匹愛吃的橘色蔬菜為 carrots。"},{"number":14,"stem":"We bought a large basket of crispy white ______ at the farmers' market and shared it with our relatives during the picnic.","options":["cereal","guava","onion","carrot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guava (芭樂) 【全文中譯】我們在農夫市集買了一大籃香脆白肉芭樂，並在野餐時與親戚們一同分享。 【選項解析】(A) cereal 麥片  (B) guava 芭樂  (C) onion 洋蔥  (D) carrot 胡蘿蔔。crispy white guava 指香脆白肉芭樂。"},{"number":15,"stem":"To make a healthy Mediterranean salad, toss chopped green ______ with olive oil, lemon juice, and feta cheese.","options":["grape","lettuce","corn","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lettuce (生菜；萵苣) 【全文中譯】製作健康的地中海沙拉時，將切碎的綠萵苣與橄欖油、檸檬汁及羊乳酪輕輕拌勻。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) lettuce 生菜  (C) corn 玉米  (D) cereal 麥片。沙拉底層綠葉為 lettuce。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Wine makers in central Italy harvest tons of red ______ every September to produce world-class dry wines.","options":["grapes","cabbages","beans","onions"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: grapes (葡萄) 【全文中譯】義大利中部的釀酒業者每年九月採收數噸紅葡萄，以釀造世界頂級的乾紅葡萄酒。 【選項解析】(A) grapes 葡萄  (B) cabbages 高麗菜  (C) beans 豆類  (D) onions 洋蔥。釀造葡萄酒原料為 grapes。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Eating a nutritious whole-wheat ______ with sliced bananas gives young athletes steady energy throughout morning practice.","options":["guava","cereal","cabbage","lettuce"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cereal (麥片食品) 【全文中譯】食用營養豐富的全麥麥片搭配香蕉切片，能為年輕運動員在晨練期間提供穩定的能量。 【選項解析】(A) guava 芭樂  (B) cereal 麥片  (C) cabbage 高麗菜  (D) lettuce 萵苣。全麥早點為 whole-wheat cereal。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Moviegoers love to buy large buckets of freshly popped ______ coated with melted butter and sugar before entering the theater.","options":["corn","carrot","guava","mango"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: corn (玉米；爆米花原料) 【全文中譯】進電影院前，影迷們最喜歡購買塗滿融化奶油和糖的大桶現爆爆米花。 【選項解析】(A) corn 玉米  (B) carrot 胡蘿蔔  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) mango 芒果。popped corn 即爆米花 popcorn。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Grandma chopped an entire head of green ______ to prepare traditional fermented kimchi for the upcoming winter season.","options":["grape","cabbage","cereal","mango"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cabbage (甘藍；大白菜/高麗菜) 【全文中譯】祖母切了一整顆綠高麗菜，為即將到來的寒冷冬季醃製傳統發酵泡菜。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) cabbage 高麗菜  (C) cereal 麥片  (D) mango 芒果。醃製泡菜常用 cabbage。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Green string ______ should be steamed gently with olive oil and seasoned with a pinch of sea salt.","options":["beans","guavas","onions","carrots"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beans (四季豆；豆子) 【全文中譯】綠四季豆應該用橄欖油輕輕清蒸，並撒上一小撮海鹽簡單調味即可。 【選項解析】(A) beans 豆類  (B) guavas 芭樂  (C) onions 洋蔥  (D) carrots 胡蘿蔔。green string beans 指四季豆。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Tropical fruit markets in southern Taiwan sell fresh ______ smoothies that attract long queues of thirsty tourists.","options":["mango","onion","cabbage","cereal"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mango (芒果) 【全文中譯】南台灣的水果熱門攤位販售現打新鮮芒果冰沙，吸引了口渴遊客排起長長隊伍。 【選項解析】(A) mango 芒果  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) cabbage 高麗菜  (D) cereal 麥片。現打冰沙特產為 mango smoothies。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Sautéing finely minced ______ and garlic is the essential first step in preparing delicious Italian tomato pasta sauce.","options":["grape","onion","guava","corn"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: onion (洋蔥) 【全文中譯】爆炒切碎的洋蔥末與蒜末，是烹調美味義大利番茄肉醬麵不可或缺的第一步。 【選項解析】(A) grape 葡萄  (B) onion 洋蔥  (C) guava 芭樂  (D) corn 玉米。義大利紅醬基底為 minced onion。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Drinking freshly squeezed juice made from sweet ______ and apples is known to provide high amounts of vitamin A.","options":["cabbages","carrots","onions","beans"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: carrots (胡蘿蔔) 【全文中譯】飲用香甜胡蘿蔔與蘋果現榨的新鮮蔬果汁，以富含極高的維生素A而聞名。 【選項解析】(A) cabbages 高麗菜  (B) carrots 胡蘿蔔  (C) onions 洋蔥  (D) beans 豆類。富含維生素A的橘色果汁原料為 carrots。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Rich in vitamin C and dietary fiber, crisp local ______ is one of the healthiest fruits you can eat on a daily basis.","options":["cereal","guava","onion","cabbage"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: guava (芭樂) 【全文中譯】富含維生素C和膳食纖維的本土脆芭樂，是你可以天天食用的最健康水果之一。 【選項解析】(A) cereal 麥片  (B) guava 芭樂  (C) onion 洋蔥  (D) cabbage 高麗菜。維生素C極高的脆水果為 guava。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Fresh organic romaine ______ should be washed thoroughly under running water before being added to chicken wraps.","options":["bean","lettuce","grape","cereal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: lettuce (生菜；萵苣) 【全文中譯】新鮮的有機蘿蔓生菜在包入雞肉捲之前，應該先放在流動清水下徹底清洗乾淨。 【選項解析】(A) bean 豆子  (B) lettuce 生菜  (C) grape 葡萄  (D) cereal 麥片。romaine lettuce 指蘿蔓生菜。"}]},{"unit":9,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 9 (009.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Fruits, Gourds & Dairy Condiments | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"papaya","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tropical fruit with orange flesh and small black seeds","chinese":"木瓜","sentence":"The juice shop blenders were running nonstop as customers ordered thick, sweet ______ milk throughout the warm afternoon.","translation":"果汁店的果汁機運轉不停，因為整個溫暖午後顧客們不斷點選濃郁香甜的木瓜牛奶。"},{"word":"peach","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft round fruit with pink-yellow fuzzy skin and a large stone","chinese":"桃子；水蜜桃","sentence":"Lala Mountain in Taoyuan is famous for growing sweet, juicy ______ that tourists love to buy during summer.","translation":"桃園拉拉山以種植香甜多汁的水蜜桃聞名，遊客們非常喜歡在夏天購買品嚐。"},{"word":"pear","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet fruit that is narrow near the stem and rounded at the bottom","chinese":"梨子","sentence":"Grandfather sliced a crisp, watery Asian ______ into pieces and shared it with the children after dinner.","translation":"晚飯後，祖父將一顆清脆多汁的亞洲水梨切成片，與孩子們一同分享。"},{"word":"pineapple","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large tropical fruit with stiff leaves and sweet, yellow flesh","chinese":"鳳梨","sentence":"Tourists visiting Taiwan always buy several boxes of traditional ______ cakes to take home as souvenirs for friends.","translation":"造訪台灣的遊客總會買好幾盒傳統鳳梨酥帶回家，作為送給親友的伴手禮。"},{"word":"potato","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a round root vegetable with brown or yellow skin that grows underground","chinese":"馬鈴薯；洋芋","sentence":"The chef mashed boiled ______ with fresh butter and warm milk to serve beside the roasted beef.","translation":"大廚將煮熟的馬鈴薯與新鮮奶油及溫牛奶壓成泥，搭配烤牛肉端上桌。"},{"word":"pumpkin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large round orange vegetable often used for pies or soups","chinese":"南瓜","sentence":"During autumn festivals, farmers display giant orange ______ and bake creamy pies flavored with cinnamon and nutmeg.","translation":"秋季節日期間，農夫們展示巨大的橘色南瓜，並烘烤帶有肉桂與肉荳蔻風味的香濃南瓜派。"},{"word":"strawberry","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small soft red fruit with tiny yellow seeds on its surface","chinese":"草莓","sentence":"Families enjoyed picking sweet red ______ in the scenic mountain farms of Dahu on a sunny winter morning.","translation":"在一個陽光明媚的冬日早晨，各個家庭在大湖風景秀麗的高山農場開心地採摘香甜紅草莓。"},{"word":"tangerine","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small sweet citrus fruit with loose, easily peeled skin","chinese":"柑橘；小柑橘","sentence":"During Lunar New Year, people place bright orange ______ on tables because their shape symbolizes good luck and wealth.","translation":"農曆新年期間，人們會在桌上擺放鮮豔的橘子，因為其形狀與名稱象徵著吉祥與財富。"},{"word":"watermelon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large heavy fruit with thick green skin and sweet red flesh with seeds","chinese":"西瓜","sentence":"Nothing cools you down on a sweltering July afternoon like a huge, chilled slice of sweet red ______.","translation":"在七月酷熱的午後，沒有什麼比一大片冰涼香甜的紅肉西瓜更能讓人消暑解渴了。"},{"word":"cream","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the thick white liquid containing fat taken from milk","chinese":"鮮奶油；奶油","sentence":"The pastry baker topped the freshly baked chocolate tart with a swirl of fluffy whipped ______ and berries.","translation":"糕點師傅在剛出爐的巧克力塔上擠上一圈蓬鬆細緻的打發鮮奶油和新鮮莓果。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Fresh sweet ______ milk is one of the most famous and beloved night market beverages in Taiwan.","options":["papaya","potato","pumpkin","pear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: papaya (木瓜) 【全文中譯】新鮮香甜的木瓜牛奶是台灣最著名且備受喜愛的夜市飲品之一。 【選項解析】(A) papaya 木瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) pear 梨子。papaya milk 為知名木瓜牛奶。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Slicing an enormous chilled ______ into thick wedges brought instant refreshment to all the players after soccer practice.","options":["watermelon","potato","cream","pear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: watermelon (西瓜) 【全文中譯】在足球訓練結束後，將一顆巨大的冰鎮西瓜切成厚片，給所有球員帶來了即時的消暑清涼。 【選項解析】(A) watermelon 西瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 奶油  (D) pear 水梨。消暑解渴的巨大水果為 watermelon。"},{"number":3,"stem":"During the winter picking season, thousands of travelers visit Dahu to gather sweet ripe red ______ in wicker baskets.","options":["pumpkins","potatoes","strawberries","creams"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: strawberries (草莓) 【全文中譯】在冬季採摘季節，數千名遊客造訪大湖，將成熟香甜的紅草莓裝入柳條籃中。 【選項解析】(A) pumpkins 南瓜  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) strawberries 草莓  (D) creams 鮮奶油。大湖冬季採摘代表水果為 strawberries。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Slicing sweet juicy ______ from high mountain orchards is a luxurious treat during hot summer months.","options":["peaches","potatoes","creams","pumpkins"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaches (水蜜桃；桃子) 【全文中譯】在高山果園採摘香甜多汁的水蜜桃切片，是炎熱夏季裡的奢華享受。 【選項解析】(A) peaches 水蜜桃  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) creams 奶油  (D) pumpkins 南瓜。high mountain orchards 出產甜美的 peaches。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Traditional bakeries in Taichung bake golden square cakes filled with sweet ______ paste that foreigners love.","options":["potato","pineapple","cream","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pineapple (鳳梨) 【全文中譯】台中傳統糕餅店烘焙填入香甜鳳梨餡的金黃方形酥餅，深受外國人喜愛。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) pineapple 鳳梨  (C) cream 鮮奶油  (D) watermelon 西瓜。pineapple cakes 指鳳梨酥。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The chef boiled several large brown ______ until soft and mashed them with butter, garlic, and fresh cream.","options":["potatoes","papayas","watermelons","strawberries"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: potatoes (馬鈴薯) 【全文中譯】大廚將幾顆大褐皮馬鈴薯煮至軟爛，並加入奶油、蒜頭與新鮮鮮奶油一起壓成馬鈴薯泥。 【選項解析】(A) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (B) papayas 木瓜  (C) watermelons 西瓜  (D) peaches 桃子。壓泥做成薯泥的蔬菜為 potatoes。"},{"number":7,"stem":"On Thanksgiving Day, families across America bake fragrant spiced pies filled with creamy orange ______ puree.","options":["pear","pumpkin","potato","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pumpkin (南瓜) 【全文中譯】在感恩節這一天，全美各個家庭都會烘烤填入綿密橘色南瓜泥的濃郁香料派。 【選項解析】(A) pear 水梨  (B) pumpkin 南瓜  (C) potato 馬鈴薯  (D) watermelon 西瓜。感恩節南瓜派使用 pumpkin puree。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The Asian variety of ______ has crisp, watery flesh and a delicate sweetness that tastes wonderful chilled.","options":["pear","potato","cream","watermelon"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pear (水梨；梨子) 【全文中譯】亞洲水梨肉質清脆多汁、甜度清雅，冰鎮後食用口感極佳。 【選項解析】(A) pear 水梨  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 鮮奶油  (D) watermelon 西瓜。Asian pear 指亞洲水梨。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Peeling the loose orange skin of a sweet juicy ______ is easy and does not require a knife.","options":["watermelon","tangerine","potato","cream"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tangerine (柑橘；橘子) 【全文中譯】剝去香甜多汁小柑橘鬆軟的橘色外皮非常容易，完全不需要用到刀子。 【選項解析】(A) watermelon 西瓜  (B) tangerine 柑橘  (C) potato 馬鈴薯  (D) cream 奶油。外皮易剝的柑橘類為 tangerine。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The barista floated a rich spoonful of fresh dairy ______ on top of the dark roasted coffee.","options":["potato","cream","pumpkin","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cream (鮮奶油) 【全文中譯】咖啡師在深焙黑咖啡頂端，輕輕浮上一大匙濃郁新鮮的乳脂鮮奶油。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) cream 鮮奶油  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) watermelon 西瓜。加在咖啡上的乳製品為 dairy cream。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Blending ripe orange ______ with ice and cold milk creates a thick, creamy smoothie favored by locals.","options":["papaya","potato","pumpkin","cream"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: papaya (木瓜) 【全文中譯】將成熟橘紅的木瓜與冰塊及冷牛奶一起攪打，能調製出深受當地人喜愛的濃郁奶昔冰沙。 【選項解析】(A) papaya 木瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) cream 奶油。打成橘色牛奶冰沙為 papaya。"},{"number":12,"stem":"In the heat of midsummer, beachgoers love cutting open a sweet green ______ and sharing the cold red slices.","options":["potato","watermelon","pear","pumpkin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: watermelon (西瓜) 【全文中譯】在盛夏酷暑中，去海灘的人們最喜歡切開香甜的綠皮西瓜，分享冰涼的紅果肉切片。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) watermelon 西瓜  (C) pear 水梨  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。綠皮紅肉的水果為 watermelon。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Topping a slice of rich chocolate cake with fresh red ______ and powdered sugar makes an irresistible dessert.","options":["strawberries","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strawberries (草莓) 【全文中譯】在一片濃郁巧克力蛋糕上點綴新鮮紅草莓並撒上糖粉，是令人難以抗拒的甜點。 【選項解析】(A) strawberries 草莓  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。搭配蛋糕的新鮮紅莓為 strawberries。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Farmers in Lala Mountain take extra care to protect tender white ______ from damaging wind and insects.","options":["peaches","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaches (水蜜桃) 【全文中譯】拉拉山的農民格外用心保護嬌嫩的白肉水蜜桃，使其免受強風與害蟲的傷害。 【選項解析】(A) peaches 水蜜桃  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。拉拉山嬌嫩特產為 white peaches。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Taiwan produces sweet golden ______ with spineless leaves that can be eaten fresh without burning the tongue.","options":["potato","pineapple","pear","pumpkin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pineapple (鳳梨) 【全文中譯】台灣生產無刺葉片的香甜金黃鳳梨，現切生食也不會刮傷舌頭。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) pineapple 鳳梨  (C) pear 水梨  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。台灣金鑽金黃水果為 pineapple。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Crispy French fries are made by cutting fresh ______ into thin strips and frying them in bubbling hot oil.","options":["potatoes","papayas","watermelons","peaches"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: potatoes (馬鈴薯) 【全文中譯】香脆的炸薯條是將新鮮馬鈴薯切成細條，再放入滾燙熱油中油炸而成。 【選項解析】(A) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (B) papayas 木瓜  (C) watermelons 西瓜  (D) peaches 桃子。炸薯條（French fries）原料為 potatoes。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Carving spooky faces into hollowed-out orange ______ is an ancient folk custom celebrated every October.","options":["pumpkins","potatoes","pears","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pumpkins (南瓜) 【全文中譯】在挖空的橘色大南瓜上雕刻搞怪的笑臉，是每年十月慶祝的古老民間習俗。 【選項解析】(A) pumpkins 南瓜  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pears 水梨  (D) creams 鮮奶油。萬聖節雕刻用的橘色瓜為 pumpkins。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Slicing a crisp green Asian ______ provides instant cool hydration during long afternoon hikes.","options":["pear","potato","cream","pumpkin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pear (水梨) 【全文中譯】在漫長的午後徒步健行中，切一片清脆的綠色亞洲水梨能提供即時的清涼與水分。 【選項解析】(A) pear 水梨  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 奶油  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。水分飽滿的清脆水果為 pear。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Placing bowls of bright orange ______ on the altar during spring festivals is believed to invite good fortune.","options":["tangerines","potatoes","watermelons","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tangerines (柑橘；橘子) 【全文中譯】在春節祭拜神案上擺放幾碗鮮豔的橘子，被認為能夠招來吉祥與好運氣。 【選項解析】(A) tangerines 柑橘  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) watermelons 西瓜  (D) creams 奶油。新年象徵吉利的水果為 tangerines。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The baker whisked heavy whipping ______ with vanilla extract and sugar until stiff peaks formed on the beaters.","options":["potato","cream","pumpkin","watermelon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cream (鮮奶油) 【全文中譯】烘焙師將濃鮮奶油與香草精和糖一起攪打，直到打蛋器上形成堅挺的鮮奶油花。 【選項解析】(A) potato 馬鈴薯  (B) cream 鮮奶油  (C) pumpkin 南瓜  (D) watermelon 西瓜。打發製作擠花的是 heavy whipping cream。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Tropical fruit stands display large green ______ on ice beside ripe yellow mangoes and fresh coconuts.","options":["papayas","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: papayas (木瓜) 【全文中譯】熱帶水果攤在冰塊上展示著大顆綠皮木瓜，旁邊擺著成熟的黃芒果與新鮮椰子。 【選項解析】(A) papayas 木瓜  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。大型熱帶水果為 papayas。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because this sweet red ______ contains more than ninety percent water, it is the best fruit for quenching summer thirst.","options":["watermelon","potato","cream","pear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: watermelon (西瓜) 【全文中譯】因為這種香甜的紅肉西瓜含水量超過百分之九十，所以是消解夏日乾渴的最佳水果。 【選項解析】(A) watermelon 西瓜  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) cream 鮮奶油  (D) pear 水梨。含水量逾90%的消暑水果為 watermelon。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Children dipped freshly picked ripe ______ into bowls of melted chocolate at the farm workshop.","options":["strawberries","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: strawberries (草莓) 【全文中譯】孩子們在農場工坊裡，將剛採摘下來的成熟紅草莓浸入一碗碗融化的巧克力中。 【選項解析】(A) strawberries 草莓  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。沾巧克力的經典水果為 strawberries。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Sweet high-altitude mountain ______ are packed carefully in padded foam nets to prevent bruising during shipment.","options":["peaches","potatoes","pumpkins","creams"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: peaches (水蜜桃) 【全文中譯】香甜的高山水蜜桃被小心翼翼地包裝在厚厚的發泡網中，以防在運送過程中碰撞瘀傷。 【選項解析】(A) peaches 水蜜桃  (B) potatoes 馬鈴薯  (C) pumpkins 南瓜  (D) creams 奶油。高山脆弱的水果為 mountain peaches。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Adding chunks of fresh sweet ______ to savory sweet-and-sour pork gives the traditional dish a delightful citrus twist.","options":["pineapple","potato","pear","pumpkin"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pineapple (鳳梨) 【全文中譯】在美味的糖醋排骨中加入香甜的新鮮鳳梨塊，為這道傳統佳餚帶來令人愉悅的果香風味。 【選項解析】(A) pineapple 鳳梨  (B) potato 馬鈴薯  (C) pear 水梨  (D) pumpkin 南瓜。糖醋料理常見配料為 pineapple。"}]},{"unit":10,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 10 (010.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Baking, Staples & Traditional Dishes | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bake","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to cook food such as bread, cakes, or pies in an oven","chinese":"烘烤；烘焙","sentence":"On Sunday mornings, grandma loves to ______ sweet cinnamon rolls in the oven until their aroma fills the entire house.","translation":"在星期天早晨，祖母喜歡在烤箱裡烘烤香甜肉桂捲，直到香氣瀰漫整座屋子。"},{"word":"bun","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small round sweet bread roll, or bread containing meat/vegetables","chinese":"小麵包；小圓包","sentence":"The hungry student bought a warm steamed pork ______ from the convenience store and ate it quickly on the train.","translation":"飢餓的學生從便利商店買了一個熱騰騰的蒸肉包，並在火車上快速吃完。"},{"word":"dessert","pos":"(n.)","definition":"sweet food eaten at the end of a meal","chinese":"甜點；甜食","sentence":"After finishing our savory Italian pasta dinner, we ordered tiramisu and chocolate cake for ______.","translation":"在享用完美味的義大利麵晚餐後，我們點了提拉米蘇和巧克力蛋糕作為餐後甜點。"},{"word":"donut","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small fried cake of sweetened dough, usually shaped like a ring","chinese":"甜甜圈","sentence":"Oliver bought a box of colorful glazed ______ with rainbow sprinkles to share with his colleagues at the office.","translation":"奧利佛買了一盒帶有彩虹糖碎的鮮豔糖霜甜甜圈，在辦公室與同事們一同分享。"},{"word":"dumpling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small piece of dough wrapped around minced meat or vegetables","chinese":"水餃；餃子","sentence":"During Chinese New Year celebrations, our entire family sits around the table wrapping hundreds of pork ______.","translation":"在農曆新年慶祝活動期間，我們全家人圍坐在桌旁包著數百顆香蔥豬肉水餃。"},{"word":"flour","pos":"(n.)","definition":"powder obtained by grinding grain, used to make bread, cakes, and pastry","chinese":"麵粉","sentence":"Before mixing the birthday cake batter, the baker sifted white wheat ______ through a fine metal sieve.","translation":"在攪拌生日蛋糕麵糊之前，烘焙師用細金屬篩網將白色小麥麵粉過篩。"},{"word":"loaf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"bread shaped and baked in one piece (plural: loaves)","chinese":"一條（麵包）","sentence":"Dad walked over to the neighborhood bakery and purchased a warm, freshly baked ______ of whole-wheat bread.","translation":"爸爸步行到附近的麵包店，購買了一條剛出爐溫熱的全麥土司麵包。"},{"word":"spaghetti","pos":"(n.)","definition":"pasta made in long, thin, solid strings, boiled and served with sauce","chinese":"義大利麵","sentence":"Mom cooked delicious homemade ______ topped with rich tomato beef sauce and sprinkled with parmesan cheese.","translation":"媽媽烹煮了美味的自製義大利細麵，淋上濃郁的番茄牛肉肉醬，並撒上帕瑪森起司粉。"},{"word":"toast","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"sliced bread made brown and crisp by heating; a drink to honor someone","chinese":"烤土司；吐司；祝酒","sentence":"For breakfast, Kevin usually spreads sweet strawberry jam over two slices of crunchy golden ______.","translation":"早餐時，凱文通常會在兩片香脆的金黃烤土司上抹上香甜的草莓果醬。"},{"word":"tofu","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft white food made from mashed soybeans, used in Asian cooking","chinese":"豆腐","sentence":"Taiwanese night markets are world-famous for serving deep-fried stinky ______ accompanied by sour pickled cabbage.","translation":"台灣夜市以供應油炸臭豆腐聞名全球，通常會搭配酸脆的醃漬泡菜一同享用。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Mom preheated the oven to two hundred degrees so she could ______ chocolate chip cookies for the party.","options":["bake","toast","recover","pray"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bake (烘烤；烘焙) 【全文中譯】媽媽將烤箱預熱到兩百度，以便能為派對烘烤巧克力脆片餅乾。 【選項解析】(A) bake 烘烤  (B) toast 烤土司/祝酒  (C) recover 康復  (D) pray 祈禱。preheated the oven to bake cookies 為典型烘焙搭配。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Night market stalls in Taipei draw brave foreign tourists eager to sample crispy deep-fried stinky ______.","options":["donut","tofu","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tofu (豆腐) 【全文中譯】台北的夜市攤位吸引了許多勇敢的外國遊客，爭相品嚐香脆油炸的臭豆腐。 【選項解析】(A) donut 甜甜圈  (B) tofu 豆腐  (C) loaf 一條  (D) bun 包子。stinky tofu 指臭豆腐。"},{"number":3,"stem":"For a hearty breakfast, grandfather popped two thick slices of white bread into the electric toaster to make ______.","options":["dumpling","toast","dessert","spaghetti"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toast (烤土司) 【全文中譯】為了享用豐盛的早餐，祖父把兩片厚白麵包放進電烤麵包機做成烤土司。 【選項解析】(A) dumpling 水餃  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) dessert 甜點  (D) spaghetti 義大利麵。放入烤麵包機烤出的為 toast。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Italian restaurants serve al dente ______ tossed with garlic, olive oil, fresh basil, and minced clams.","options":["flour","spaghetti","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spaghetti (義大利細麵) 【全文中譯】義大利餐廳供應拌入大蒜、橄欖油、新鮮羅勒和蛤蜊肉的彈牙義大利麵。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) spaghetti 義大利麵  (C) loaf 一條  (D) bun 小麵包。義大利餐廳長條麵食為 spaghetti。"},{"number":5,"stem":"On New Year's Eve, the grandmother gathered her children around the kitchen counter to wrap savory pork ______.","options":["dumplings","desserts","loaves","toasts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dumplings (水餃；餃子) 【全文中譯】除夕夜這一天，祖母將孩子們召集在廚房料理台旁，一起包美味的豬肉水餃。 【選項解析】(A) dumplings 水餃  (B) desserts 甜點  (C) loaves 麵包條  (D) toasts 烤土司。wrap pork dumplings 指包豬肉水餃。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The artisan bakery sells fresh sourdough by the whole ______, and customers line up before opening hours.","options":["bun","donut","loaf","dessert"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: loaf (一條麵包) 【全文中譯】這家手工麵包坊按整條出售新鮮酸種麵包，顧客在營業前就已排成長龍。 【選項解析】(A) bun 小圓麵包  (B) donut 甜甜圈  (C) loaf 一條麵包  (D) dessert 甜點。sell by the whole loaf 指按整條販售。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The children cheered excitedly when dad brought home a pink box containing six chocolate-frosted ring ______.","options":["loaves","donuts","flours","tofus"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: donuts (甜甜圈) 【全文中譯】當爸爸帶回一個裝著六個巧克力糖霜環形甜甜圈的粉紅盒子時，孩子們興奮歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) donuts 甜甜圈  (C) flours 麵粉  (D) tofus 豆腐。ring donuts 指圓環甜甜圈。"},{"number":8,"stem":"To make smooth pancake batter, whisk eggs and milk gradually into a large ceramic bowl of white wheat ______.","options":["flour","toast","spaghetti","dessert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: flour (麵粉) 【全文中譯】製作滑順的鬆餅麵糊時，將雞蛋和牛奶逐漸攪拌進裝滿白色小麥麵粉的大陶瓷碗中。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) toast 吐司  (C) spaghetti 義大利麵  (D) dessert 甜點。調製麵糊的主要乾原料為 wheat flour。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The street vendor sells piping-hot steamed vegetable ______ filled with crunchy cabbage and mushrooms every morning.","options":["loaves","buns","desserts","toasts"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: buns (包子；小麵包) 【全文中譯】街頭攤販每天早晨販售熱氣騰騰的蒸蔬菜包子，裡面包滿了清脆的高麗菜與香菇。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) buns 包子  (C) desserts 甜點  (D) toasts 吐司。steamed vegetable buns 指蒸蔬菜包子。"},{"number":10,"stem":"After the lavish wedding banquet, guests enjoyed matcha ice cream and seasonal fruits served for ______.","options":["dessert","flour","loaf","dumpling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dessert (餐後甜點) 【全文中譯】在奢華的婚宴結束後，賓客們享用了作為餐後甜點端上桌的抹茶冰淇淋與時令水果。 【選項解析】(A) dessert 甜點  (B) flour 麵粉  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) dumpling 水餃。餐後甜點為 dessert。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Every Christmas Eve, our mother loves to ______ festive gingerbread cookies shaped like stars and reindeer.","options":["bake","toast","wound","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bake (烘烤；烘焙) 【全文中譯】每年平安夜，我們的母親最喜歡烘烤形狀像星星和馴鹿的應景薑餅餅乾。 【選項解析】(A) bake 烘烤  (B) toast 祝酒/烤吐司  (C) wound 傷害  (D) cough 咳嗽。bake cookies 指烤餅乾。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Silken soft ______ simmered in spicy Sichuan chili oil is one of the most famous dishes in Chinese cuisine.","options":["donut","tofu","spaghetti","loaf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tofu (豆腐) 【全文中譯】在香辣四川辣油中慢煨的嫩豆腐，是中華料理中最著名的佳餚之一。 【選項解析】(A) donut 甜甜圈  (B) tofu 豆腐  (C) spaghetti 義大利麵  (D) loaf 麵包條。麻婆豆腐的主食材為 silken soft tofu。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Spreading creamy peanut butter over warm, crunchy slices of whole-wheat ______ is Samuel's favorite morning meal.","options":["dumpling","toast","dessert","flour"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toast (烤土司) 【全文中譯】在溫暖酥脆的全麥烤土司切片上塗抹香濃花生醬，是塞繆爾最喜歡的早晨餐點。 【選項解析】(A) dumpling 水餃  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) dessert 甜點  (D) flour 麵粉。塗花生醬食用的為 crunchy toast。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The chef simmered tomato meat sauce for three hours before pouring it over a steaming plate of fresh ______.","options":["flour","spaghetti","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spaghetti (義大利麵) 【全文中譯】大廚將番茄肉醬燉煮了三個小時，然後淋在熱氣騰騰的新鮮義大利細麵盤上。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) spaghetti 義大利麵  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) bun 包子。淋肉醬的主食為 spaghetti。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Steamed soup ______ filled with rich hot broth and minced pork are world-renowned delicacies from Taiwan.","options":["dumplings","desserts","loaves","toasts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dumplings (小籠包；水餃) 【全文中譯】充滿濃郁熱湯汁與豬肉餡的清蒸小籠包，是享譽國際的台灣道地美食。 【選項解析】(A) dumplings 湯包/水餃  (B) desserts 甜點  (C) loaves 麵包條  (D) toasts 吐司。steamed soup dumplings 指小籠湯包。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Dad sliced a freshly baked ______ of rye bread into even pieces and spread butter across each slice.","options":["bun","donut","loaf","dessert"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: loaf (一條麵包) 【全文中譯】爸爸將剛出爐的一整條裸麥麵包切成均勻薄片，並在每片上面塗抹奶油。 【選項解析】(A) bun 小麵包  (B) donut 甜甜圈  (C) loaf 一條  (D) dessert 甜點。a loaf of rye bread 指一條黑麥麵包。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Police officers in American movies are frequently shown enjoying sweet glazed ring ______ with hot black coffee.","options":["loaves","donuts","tofus","flours"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: donuts (甜甜圈) 【全文中譯】在美國電影中，經常可以看到警察一邊享用熱黑咖啡，一邊品嚐甜糖霜環形甜甜圈。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) donuts 甜甜圈  (C) tofus 豆腐  (D) flours 麵粉。美劇警察經典食物為 glazed ring donuts。"},{"number":18,"stem":"You will need two cups of all-purpose ______ and three eggs to prepare the dough for homemade noodles.","options":["flour","toast","spaghetti","dessert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: flour (麵粉) 【全文中譯】你需要兩杯中筋麵粉和三顆雞蛋，來為自製手工麵條揉製麵糰。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) toast 吐司  (C) spaghetti 義大利麵  (D) dessert 甜點。all-purpose flour 指中筋麵粉。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Walking past the traditional breakfast shop, the aroma of freshly steamed pork ______ made my mouth water.","options":["loaves","buns","desserts","toasts"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: buns (包子；肉包) 【全文中譯】走過傳統早餐店，剛出爐蒸熟豬肉包子的誘人香氣讓我垂涎欲滴。 【選項解析】(A) loaves 麵包條  (B) buns 包子  (C) desserts 甜點  (D) toasts 吐司。steamed pork buns 指蒸肉包。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The restaurant offers a mouthwatering array of sweet chocolate brownies and berry tarts on its afternoon ______ menu.","options":["dessert","flour","loaf","dumpling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dessert (甜點) 【全文中譯】這家餐廳在下午茶甜點菜單上，提供了令人垂涎欲滴的香濃巧克力布朗尼與莓果塔。 【選項解析】(A) dessert 甜點  (B) flour 麵粉  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) dumpling 水餃。afternoon dessert menu 指下午茶甜點菜單。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The kitchen smelled wonderful because aunt Catherine was learning how to ______ traditional French bread at home.","options":["bake","toast","tear","recover"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bake (烘焙) 【全文中譯】廚房裡飄著撲鼻香氣，因為凱薩琳姑姑正在家學習如何烘焙傳統法式長棍麵包。 【選項解析】(A) bake 烘烤  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) tear 撕開  (D) recover 恢復。bake French bread 指烤法式麵包。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Healthy organic miso soup is traditionally garnished with tiny cubes of soft white ______ and green scallions.","options":["donut","tofu","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: tofu (豆腐) 【全文中譯】健康的有機味噌湯傳統上會點綴切成微小方塊的柔軟白豆腐和翠綠蔥花。 【選項解析】(A) donut 甜甜圈  (B) tofu 豆腐  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) bun 包子。味噌湯內的白色小方塊為 tofu。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When you make a hot sandwich, grilling the bread until it turns into golden crispy ______ improves the texture.","options":["dumpling","toast","dessert","spaghetti"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: toast (烤土司) 【全文中譯】製作熱三明治時，將麵包烘烤至金黃酥脆的烤土司能顯著提升整體的口感層次。 【選項解析】(A) dumpling 水餃  (B) toast 烤土司  (C) dessert 甜點  (D) spaghetti 義大利麵。grilled into crispy toast 指烤成脆土司。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Twirling long strings of delicious boiled ______ with a fork and spoon requires a little practice for beginners.","options":["flour","spaghetti","loaf","bun"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: spaghetti (義大利麵) 【全文中譯】用叉子和湯匙捲起長條煮熟的美味義大利細麵，對初學者來說需要一點練習。 【選項解析】(A) flour 麵粉  (B) spaghetti 義大利麵  (C) loaf 麵包條  (D) bun 包子。twirling long strings of spaghetti 指用叉子捲義大利麵。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Boil the frozen beef ______ in a large pot of water for seven minutes until they float to the surface.","options":["dumplings","desserts","loaves","toasts"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dumplings (水餃) 【全文中譯】將冷凍牛肉水餃放入大鍋沸水中煮七分鐘，直到它們全部浮出水面即可撈起享用。 【選項解析】(A) dumplings 水餃  (B) desserts 甜點  (C) loaves 麵包條  (D) toasts 烤土司。boil frozen beef dumplings 指水煮冷凍牛肉水餃。"}]},{"unit":11,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 11 (011.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Beverages, Condiments & Seasonings | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"beer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an alcoholic drink made from grain and hops","chinese":"啤酒","sentence":"My father worked hard in the garden all Saturday afternoon, so he drank a cold glass of ______ with dinner.","translation":"我父親星期六整個下午都在花園裡辛勞工作，所以他晚餐時喝了一杯冰涼的啤酒。"},{"word":"soda","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet, cold carbonated soft drink","chinese":"汽水；碳酸飲料","sentence":"The children played soccer under the burning hot sun, and they bought two large cans of cold ______ at the convenience store.","translation":"孩子們在炎熱的烈日下踢足球，他們在便利商店買了兩大罐冰涼的汽水。"},{"word":"honey","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet, sticky yellow liquid made by bees","chinese":"蜂蜜","sentence":"Grandmother had a dry cough during the cold winter night, so my mother made her warm lemon tea with natural ______.","translation":"祖母在寒冷的冬夜裡乾咳，所以我母親用天然蜂蜜為她泡了一杯溫熱的檸檬茶。"},{"word":"ketchup","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick red sauce made from tomatoes, vinegar, and sugar","chinese":"番茄醬","sentence":"The French fries tasted a little plain without seasoning, so David squeezed some tomato ______ on his plate to dip them.","translation":"炸薯條沒有調味料時味道有點淡，所以戴維在盤子裡擠了一些番茄醬來沾薯條。"},{"word":"pepper","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sharp-tasting black or white powder made from dried berries","chinese":"胡椒粉","sentence":"The beef soup was very warm and rich, but my brother added a little black ______ to give it an extra spicy flavor.","translation":"牛肉湯非常溫暖濃郁，但我哥哥加了一點黑胡椒粉以增添額外的辛香風味。"},{"word":"soy sauce","pos":"(n.phr.)","definition":"a dark, salty liquid made from fermented soybeans","chinese":"醬油","sentence":"My aunt fried a large plate of pork dumplings for lunch, and we mixed some dark ______ with vinegar for dipping.","translation":"我姑姑午餐時煎了一大盤豬肉餃子，我們混合了一些深色醬油和醋當作沾醬。"},{"word":"sugar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sweet white substance obtained from plants","chinese":"糖","sentence":"The black coffee was too bitter for Mary to finish, so she added two small spoons of white ______ into the cup.","translation":"黑咖啡太苦了讓瑪麗喝不完，所以她在杯子裡加了兩小匙白糖。"},{"word":"vinegar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sour liquid made from fermented wine, cider, or rice","chinese":"醋","sentence":"The cook chopped some fresh cabbage and carrots finely, and he poured a spoonful of apple ______ over the salad.","translation":"廚師把新鮮的高麗菜和紅蘿蔔切得很細，並在沙拉上淋了一匙蘋果醋。"},{"word":"delicious","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"having a very pleasant and enjoyable taste or smell","chinese":"美味的；可口的","sentence":"Mrs. Lin baked an apple pie following her secret recipe, and everyone at the dinner table agreed that it was truly ______.","translation":"林太太依照她的私房食譜烤了一個蘋果派，餐桌上的每個人都一致認為它非常美味。"},{"word":"yummy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"tasting very good (often used informally)","chinese":"好吃的；美味的（口語）","sentence":"The bakery on the corner sells chocolate muffins every morning, and the little girl said they were the most ______ treats she ever had.","translation":"轉角的麵包店每天早上都賣巧克力馬芬蛋糕，小女孩說那是她吃過最好吃的點心。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"After finishing a heavy plate of beef dumplings, uncle David ordered a cold bottle of ______ to relax with his colleagues.","options":["beer","pepper","ketchup","vinegar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: beer (啤酒) 【全文中譯】吃完一大盤牛肉水餃後，戴維叔叔點了一瓶冰啤酒和同事一起放鬆。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) ketchup 番茄醬  (D) vinegar 醋。beer 為酒類飲品，符合語境。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The dentist warned Tommy that drinking too much sweet ______ would cause serious tooth decay over time.","options":["sugar","soda","beer","pepper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soda (汽水) 【全文中譯】牙醫警告湯米，長久下來喝太多含糖汽水會導致嚴重的蛀牙。 【選項解析】(A) sugar 糖  (B) soda 汽水  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) pepper 胡椒。drinking... sweet soda 指飲用汽水飲料。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Whenever grandfather suffers from a sore throat in winter, he drinks a cup of warm water mixed with pure ______.","options":["ketchup","vinegar","honey","soda"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: honey (蜂蜜) 【全文中譯】每當祖父在冬天喉嚨痛時，他都會喝一杯混有純蜂蜜的溫開水。 【選項解析】(A) ketchup 番茄醬  (B) vinegar 醋  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) soda 汽水。溫水加蜂蜜潤喉為常見生活常識。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The waiter brought out a hot basket of French fries, and the kids immediately asked for a bottle of tomato ______.","options":["beer","honey","pepper","ketchup"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ketchup (番茄醬) 【全文中譯】服務生端上一熱籃炸薯條，孩子們立刻要了一瓶番茄醬。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) honey 蜂蜜  (C) pepper 胡椒  (D) ketchup 番茄醬。沾薯條必備 ketchup。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The vegetable soup tasted somewhat bland, so the chef sprinkled some ground black ______ into the pot.","options":["pepper","soda","beer","honey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pepper (胡椒粉) 【全文中譯】蔬菜湯嚐起來有點清淡，所以主廚在鍋裡灑了一些黑胡椒粉。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) soda 汽水  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) honey 蜂蜜。sprinkled ground black pepper（撒上黑胡椒粉）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In traditional Taiwanese kitchens, cooks frequently use dark ______ to braise pork and marinate chicken.","options":["soda","soy sauce","ketchup","beer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soy sauce (醬油) 【全文中譯】在傳統台灣廚房裡，廚師經常使用純黑醬油來滷肉和醃雞肉。 【選項解析】(A) soda 汽水  (B) soy sauce 醬油  (C) ketchup 番茄醬  (D) beer 啤酒。滷肉常用 soy sauce。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Drinking milk tea without any added ______ is healthier because it helps you control your daily calorie intake.","options":["beer","pepper","sugar","vinegar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sugar (糖) 【全文中譯】喝鮮奶茶時不加任何額外的糖比較健康，因為能幫你控制每日熱量。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) sugar 糖  (D) vinegar 醋。without any added sugar 指無糖飲料。"},{"number":8,"stem":"To make the cabbage salad taste crisp and sour, mother poured two spoons of white ______ over the bowl.","options":["soda","ketchup","honey","vinegar"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vinegar (醋) 【全文中譯】為了讓高麗菜沙拉嚐起來酸脆爽口，媽媽在碗裡淋了兩匙白醋。 【選項解析】(A) soda 汽水  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) vinegar 醋。酸味來源為 vinegar。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The birthday cake was decorated with fresh strawberries, and all the guests praised how ______ it was.","options":["delicious","pale","dumb","deaf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: delicious (美味的) 【全文中譯】生日蛋糕以新鮮草莓裝飾，所有的賓客都盛讚它有多麼美味。 【選項解析】(A) delicious 美味的  (B) pale 蒼白的  (C) dumb 啞的  (D) deaf 聾的。修飾蛋糕美味選 delicious。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The young boy licked his fingers happily because the chocolate doughnut his mother baked was extremely ______.","options":["ill","yummy","dizzy","blind"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: yummy (好吃的) 【全文中譯】小男孩開心地舔著手指，因為媽媽烤的巧克力甜甜圈非常好吃。 【選項解析】(A) ill 生病的  (B) yummy 好吃的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) blind 盲的。兒童口語稱讚食物用 yummy。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Because father had to drive everyone home after the party, he drank fruit juice instead of alcoholic ______.","options":["vinegar","ketchup","beer","sugar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beer (啤酒) 【全文中譯】因為父親在派對結束後要開車載大家回家，所以他喝果汁而非含酒精的啤酒。 【選項解析】(A) vinegar 醋  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) sugar 糖。alcoholic beer（含酒精啤酒）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The summer afternoon was boiling hot, so the hikers stopped at a vending machine to buy a chilled can of ______.","options":["pepper","soda","soy sauce","honey"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soda (汽水) 【全文中譯】夏日午後酷熱難耐，登山客在自動販賣機停下腳步買了一罐冰涼的汽水。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) soda 汽水  (C) soy sauce 醬油  (D) honey 蜂蜜。chilled can of soda（罐裝冰汽水）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Bears in the wild often search hollow tree trunks because they love to eat sweet natural ______.","options":["honey","beer","ketchup","vinegar"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: honey (蜂蜜) 【全文中譯】野外的熊經常搜尋空心樹幹，因為牠們喜愛食用香甜的天然蜂蜜。 【選項解析】(A) honey 蜂蜜  (B) beer 啤酒  (C) ketchup 番茄醬  (D) vinegar 醋。熊愛吃 honey 符合自然事實。"},{"number":14,"stem":"If you dip your hot dog into red ______ and mustard, it will taste much more flavorful.","options":["sugar","beer","soda","ketchup"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ketchup (番茄醬) 【全文中譯】如果你把熱狗沾上紅色番茄醬和芥末醬，吃起來會更有風味。 【選項解析】(A) sugar 糖  (B) beer 啤酒  (C) soda 汽水  (D) ketchup 番茄醬。熱狗搭配 red ketchup。"},{"number":15,"stem":"When cooking scrambled eggs in the morning, a tiny pinch of salt and black ______ makes a big difference.","options":["beer","pepper","honey","soda"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pepper (胡椒粉) 【全文中譯】早晨煎炒蛋時，加入微量鹽巴與黑胡椒粉會帶來極大風味提升。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) soda 汽水。salt and black pepper（鹽與黑胡椒）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Steamed fish will taste fresh and savory if you pour a spoonful of seasoned ______ over it before serving.","options":["soy sauce","ketchup","beer","honey"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soy sauce (醬油) 【全文中譯】如果在端上桌前淋上一匙調味醬油，清蒸魚嚐起來會鮮甜可口。 【選項解析】(A) soy sauce 醬油  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) honey 蜂蜜。清蒸魚搭配 soy sauce。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Eating too many desserts that contain refined white ______ can lead to health problems like obesity.","options":["beer","vinegar","sugar","pepper"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sugar (糖) 【全文中譯】吃太多含有精緻白糖的甜點，可能會導致如肥胖等健康問題。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) vinegar 醋  (C) sugar 糖  (D) pepper 胡椒。refined white sugar（精製白糖）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Pickled cucumbers require a mixture of water, salt, and rice ______ to develop their characteristic sour taste.","options":["ketchup","honey","soda","vinegar"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vinegar (醋) 【全文中譯】醃黃瓜需要水、鹽巴和米醋的混合液，以產生其招牌的酸味。 【選項解析】(A) ketchup 番茄醬  (B) honey 蜂蜜  (C) soda 汽水  (D) vinegar 醋。醃製酸物必備 rice vinegar。"},{"number":19,"stem":"My grandmother cooked a pot of chicken soup with ginseng, and the whole family agreed that it was exceptionally ______.","options":["delicious","deaf","homesick","painful"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: delicious (美味的) 【全文中譯】我的祖母煮了一鍋人蔘雞湯，全家人都一致認為它格外美味。 【選項解析】(A) delicious 美味的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) homesick 想家的  (D) painful 疼痛的。形容雞湯鮮美用 delicious。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The children cheered excitedly when aunt May arrived with a box of ______ fruit tarts from the downtown bakery.","options":["dizzy","yummy","pale","ill"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: yummy (好吃的) 【全文中譯】當梅姑姑帶著一盒從市中心麵包店買來的好吃水果塔抵達時，孩子們興奮歡呼。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) yummy 好吃的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) ill 生病的。修飾 fruit tarts 選 yummy。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The restaurant refused to sell cold draft ______ to teenagers because the legal drinking age is strictly eighteen.","options":["pepper","honey","beer","vinegar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: beer (啤酒) 【全文中譯】這家餐廳拒絕向青少年販售冰生啤酒，因為法定飲酒年齡嚴格定為十八歲。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) honey 蜂蜜  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) vinegar 醋。draft beer（生啤酒）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Avoid leaving an open can of carbonated ______ on the desk, or it will lose all its bubbles and taste flat.","options":["beer","soda","sugar","pepper"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: soda (汽水) 【全文中譯】避免在書桌上放置開罐的碳酸汽水，否則它會流失氣泡且喝起來平淡無味。 【選項解析】(A) beer 啤酒  (B) soda 汽水  (C) sugar 糖  (D) pepper 胡椒。carbonated soda 指碳酸汽水。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Bees fly from flower to flower gathering nectar, which they carry back to their hive to produce golden ______.","options":["honey","ketchup","vinegar","soda"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: honey (蜂蜜) 【全文中譯】蜜蜂穿梭在花朵間採集花蜜，並將其帶回蜂巢製造金黃色蜂蜜。 【選項解析】(A) honey 蜂蜜  (B) ketchup 番茄醬  (C) vinegar 醋  (D) soda 汽水。蜜蜂產物為 golden honey。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The toddler accidentally dropped his burger on the floor, and bright red ______ stained his yellow shirt.","options":["soda","pepper","beer","ketchup"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ketchup (番茄醬) 【全文中譯】幼兒不小心把漢堡掉在地板上，鮮紅色的番茄醬沾污了他的黃色襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) soda 汽水  (B) pepper 胡椒  (C) beer 啤酒  (D) ketchup 番茄醬。漢堡內的醬料是 red ketchup。"},{"number":25,"stem":"People often place a salt shaker and a black ______ grinder on the dining table for guests to season their food.","options":["pepper","sugar","honey","beer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pepper (胡椒粉) 【全文中譯】人們常在餐桌上放置鹽罐和黑胡椒研磨罐，供賓客為食物調味。 【選項解析】(A) pepper 胡椒  (B) sugar 糖  (C) honey 蜂蜜  (D) beer 啤酒。black pepper grinder（黑胡椒研磨罐）。"}]},{"unit":12,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 12 (012.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Dining Out, Kitchen Utensils & Cooking | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"brunch","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a meal eaten late in the morning that combines breakfast and lunch","chinese":"早午餐","sentence":"On Sunday mornings, our family likes to sleep late and go to a cozy cafe for ______.","translation":"在星期天早晨，我們全家喜歡睡到自然醒，然後去一家溫馨的咖啡館享用早午餐。"},{"word":"cafeteria","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a restaurant where customers collect food on trays and pay at a register","chinese":"自助餐廳；學校/公司員工餐廳","sentence":"High school students lined up with their plastic trays in the school ______ to buy hot noodles.","translation":"高中生們端著塑膠托盤在學校員工餐廳（自助餐廳）排隊購買熱麵。"},{"word":"buffet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a meal where people serve themselves from a table of different dishes","chinese":"歐式自助餐；吃到飽餐飲","sentence":"The luxury hotel offered an amazing seafood ______ with fresh crabs, prawns, and grilled fish.","translation":"這家豪華飯店提供了令人驚嘆的海鮮自助餐，備有新鮮螃蟹、明蝦與烤魚。"},{"word":"pan","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wide, shallow metal container used for frying or cooking food","chinese":"平底鍋","sentence":"Mother heated some olive oil in the frying ______ before adding the diced garlic and onions.","translation":"母親在平底鍋裡加熱了一些橄欖油，然後加入切碎的大蒜與洋蔥。"},{"word":"plate","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat, usually round dish from which food is eaten","chinese":"盤子","sentence":"The waiter carried a large white ceramic ______ with grilled steak and roasted vegetables.","translation":"服務生端著一個裝有烤牛排和烤蔬菜的白色大陶瓷盤子。"},{"word":"pot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a deep round container used for cooking stews, soups, or boiling water","chinese":"深鍋；湯鍋","sentence":"Father placed a heavy metal ______ of vegetable soup on the kitchen counter to cool.","translation":"父親將一重金屬蔬菜湯鍋放在廚房流理台上使其冷卻。"},{"word":"saucer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small, shallow curved dish placed under a teacup","chinese":"茶碟；茶托","sentence":"The graceful lady picked up the delicate teacup and rested it gently on its matching ______.","translation":"那位優雅的女士端起精緻的茶杯，並將它輕輕放在配套的茶碟上。"},{"word":"teapot","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a container with a handle and spout used for making and serving tea","chinese":"茶壺","sentence":"Grandpa poured steaming oolong tea from the purple clay ______ into our tiny porcelain cups.","translation":"爺爺從紫砂茶壺中倒出熱氣騰騰的烏龍茶到我們的細瓷小杯子裡。"},{"word":"wok","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large, bowl-shaped pan used especially in Chinese cooking","chinese":"炒鍋；中華炒鍋","sentence":"The experienced chef stirred the sliced beef rapidly inside the hot iron ______ over high heat.","translation":"經驗豐富的主廚在大火上的熱鐵炒鍋內迅速翻炒牛肉片。"},{"word":"boil (boil / boiled / boiled)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to heat a liquid until bubbles rise to the surface","chinese":"煮沸；水滾","sentence":"You should let the clean water ______ completely before using it to prepare baby formula.","translation":"你在用乾淨的水沖泡嬰兒奶粉之前，應該讓水完全煮沸。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Sleeping late on weekends is pleasant, so Susan often meets her college friends at 11 a.m. for ______.","options":["brunch","plate","saucer","wok"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: brunch (早午餐) 【全文中譯】週末睡晚很享受，所以蘇珊常在上午11點和大學朋友相約吃早午餐。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) plate 盤子  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) wok 炒鍋。上午11點結合早餐與午餐為 brunch。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Every day at noon, hundreds of factory workers eat their lunch together in the company ______.","options":["pan","cafeteria","teapot","pot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cafeteria (員工/學生餐廳) 【全文中譯】每天中午，數百名工廠作業員在公司自助餐廳一起吃午餐。 【選項解析】(A) pan 平底鍋  (B) cafeteria 員工/學生餐廳  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pot 鍋子。員工集體用餐場所為 cafeteria。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Because this restaurant serves an all-you-can-eat ______, customers can choose whatever dishes they prefer.","options":["plate","saucer","buffet","wok"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: buffet (自助餐) 【全文中譯】因為這家餐廳提供吃到飽自助餐，顧客可以自由挑選喜歡的菜餚。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) buffet 自助餐  (D) wok 炒鍋。all-you-can-eat buffet（吃到飽自助餐）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Dad heated some butter in the flat frying ______ and cooked delicious sunny-side-up eggs for everyone.","options":["saucer","brunch","teapot","pan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pan (平底鍋) 【全文中譯】爸爸在平底煎鍋中加熱了一些奶油，為大家煎了美味的太陽蛋。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) brunch 早午餐  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pan 平底鍋。frying pan 為平底煎鍋。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The waiter accidentally dropped the porcelain ______ on the floor, and it broke into three sharp pieces.","options":["plate","cafeteria","brunch","buffet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: plate (盤子) 【全文中譯】服務生不小心把瓷盤掉在地板上，碎成了三塊鋒利的碎片。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) cafeteria 餐廳  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) buffet 自助餐。porcelain plate（瓷盤）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Grandmother cooked a fragrant beef stew inside a large stainless steel ______ for over three hours.","options":["saucer","pot","plate","buffet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pot (湯鍋；深鍋) 【全文中譯】祖母在大不鏽鋼湯鍋中燉煮香濃的燉牛肉超過三個小時。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) pot 湯鍋  (C) plate 盤子  (D) buffet 自助餐。燉湯用深鍋 pot。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The tea spilled slightly over the rim of the cup, but luckily it fell onto the ceramic ______ underneath.","options":["wok","cafeteria","saucer","pan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: saucer (茶碟) 【全文中譯】茶水從杯緣稍微溢出，但幸好落在了下方的陶瓷茶碟上。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) cafeteria 餐廳  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) pan 平底鍋。茶杯下方的托盤為 saucer。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Mother filled the ceramic ______ with dried green tea leaves and poured boiling spring water into it.","options":["teapot","plate","pan","buffet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: teapot (茶壺) 【全文中譯】媽媽將乾燥綠茶葉放進陶瓷茶壺中，並倒入沸騰的泉水。 【選項解析】(A) teapot 茶壺  (B) plate 盤子  (C) pan 平底鍋  (D) buffet 自助餐。泡茶容器為 teapot。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In traditional Chinese cuisine, fried rice tastes much better when tossed skillfully inside a round iron ______.","options":["saucer","cafeteria","brunch","wok"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wok (炒鍋) 【全文中譯】在傳統中式料理中，炒飯在圓形鐵炒鍋中熟練翻炒會更美味。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) cafeteria 餐廳  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) wok 中式炒鍋。中式熱鍋翻炒為 iron wok。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Before dropping the dry noodles into the soup, make sure the seasoned broth begins to ______.","options":["skin","boil","tear","cough"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: boil (煮沸) 【全文中譯】在將乾麵條放入湯裡之前，確保調味過的高湯已經開始沸騰。 【選項解析】(A) skin 擦破皮  (B) boil 煮沸  (C) tear 撕開  (D) cough 咳嗽。高湯沸騰用 boil。"},{"number":11,"stem":"We were not hungry at 8 a.m., so we decided to skip breakfast and enjoy a relaxing weekend ______.","options":["plate","saucer","brunch","pan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: brunch (早午餐) 【全文中譯】我們早上八點還不餓，所以決定省略早餐，享受放鬆的週末早午餐。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) pan 平底鍋。跳過早餐直接吃 brunch。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Students can buy sandwiches, fruit, and bottled milk at reasonable prices inside the university ______.","options":["wok","cafeteria","teapot","pot"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cafeteria (學校餐廳) 【全文中譯】學生可以在大學學生餐廳內以合理價格買到三明治、水果與瓶裝牛奶。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) cafeteria 學校餐廳  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pot 鍋子。大學校園餐廳用 university cafeteria。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The wedding reception featured an enormous international ______ with dishes from Japan, Italy, and France.","options":["buffet","plate","saucer","pan"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: buffet (自助餐) 【全文中譯】這場婚宴備有盛大的國際自助餐，供應來自日本、義大利與法國的菜餚。 【選項解析】(A) buffet 自助餐  (B) plate 盤子  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) pan 平底鍋。international buffet（國際自助餐）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Be careful not to touch the hot handle of the frying ______ with your bare hand while cooking.","options":["brunch","saucer","plate","pan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pan (平底鍋) 【全文中譯】烹飪時請小心不要用徒手去碰平底煎鍋發燙的手把。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) plate 盤子  (D) pan 平底鍋。frying pan handle（平底鍋手把）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Uncle George piled grilled chicken and sweet corn onto his ceramic ______ during the backyard party.","options":["plate","teapot","wok","saucer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: plate (盤子) 【全文中譯】後院派對期間，喬治叔叔在他的瓷盤上堆滿了烤雞與甜玉米。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) teapot 茶壺  (C) wok 炒鍋  (D) saucer 茶碟。盛裝食物於 plate 上。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Put the dirty soup ______ into the kitchen sink and soak it in warm soapy water for an hour.","options":["brunch","pot","buffet","saucer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pot (深鍋) 【全文中譯】把油膩的湯鍋放進廚房水槽，浸泡在溫肥皂水裡一小時。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) pot 湯鍋  (C) buffet 自助餐  (D) saucer 茶碟。soup pot（湯鍋）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A small decorative spoon was placed neatly beside the coffee cup on top of the small ______.","options":["wok","plate","saucer","pan"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: saucer (茶碟) 【全文中譯】一把小裝飾匙整齊地擺放在咖啡杯旁的小茶碟上。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) plate 盤子  (C) saucer 茶碟  (D) pan 平底鍋。杯子下方的碟子為 saucer。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The tourist bought a beautiful antique purple clay ______ as a souvenir during his trip to Yingge.","options":["plate","teapot","cafeteria","buffet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: teapot (茶壺) 【全文中譯】這位觀光客在鶯歌之旅中買了一件漂亮的仿古紫砂茶壺作為紀念品。 【選項解析】(A) plate 盤子  (B) teapot 茶壺  (C) cafeteria 餐廳  (D) buffet 自助餐。purple clay teapot（紫砂茶壺）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Street food vendors in the night market stir-fry fresh vegetables vigorously using a very hot ______.","options":["saucer","brunch","teapot","wok"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wok (炒鍋) 【全文中譯】夜市街頭攤販使用高溫的中華炒鍋奮力翻炒新鮮蔬菜。 【選項解析】(A) saucer 茶碟  (B) brunch 早午餐  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) wok 炒鍋。熱鍋熱炒用 hot wok。"},{"number":20,"stem":"You must ______ the fresh chicken eggs in hot water for six minutes to make soft-boiled yolks.","options":["boil","pray","praise","quit"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: boil (煮沸；水煮) 【全文中譯】你必須把新鮮雞蛋放在熱水中煮六分鐘，才能做出半熟蛋黃。 【選項解析】(A) boil 煮沸  (B) pray 祈禱  (C) praise 讚揚  (D) quit 放棄。水煮蛋用 boil。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Many trendy restaurants in Taipei are crowded on Sunday mornings because young people love meeting for ______.","options":["wok","plate","brunch","saucer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: brunch (早午餐) 【全文中譯】台北很多時髦餐廳在週日早晨客滿，因為年輕人喜歡相約吃早午餐。 【選項解析】(A) wok 炒鍋  (B) plate 盤子  (C) brunch 早午餐  (D) saucer 茶碟。Sunday morning brunch（週日早午餐）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"During the lunch break, hospital nurses and doctors usually gather to eat nutritious meals in the staff ______.","options":["pan","cafeteria","teapot","saucer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cafeteria (員工餐廳) 【全文中譯】午休時間，醫院的護理師和醫師通常聚集在員工餐廳享用營養餐點。 【選項解析】(A) pan 平底鍋  (B) cafeteria 員工餐廳  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) saucer 茶碟。staff cafeteria（員工餐廳）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Eating at a hotel dinner ______ allows guests to sample twenty different desserts in one evening.","options":["buffet","pot","wok","plate"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: buffet (自助餐) 【全文中譯】在飯店享用自助晚餐讓賓客能在一個晚上品嚐二十種不同甜點。 【選項解析】(A) buffet 自助餐  (B) pot 鍋子  (C) wok 炒鍋  (D) plate 盤子。hotel dinner buffet（飯店自助晚餐）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Use a wooden spatula when cooking fish in a non-stick ______ so that you do not scratch the surface.","options":["brunch","saucer","teapot","pan"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pan (平底鍋) 【全文中譯】在不沾平底鍋裡煎魚時請使用木鏟，這樣才不會刮傷鍋面。 【選項解析】(A) brunch 早午餐  (B) saucer 茶碟  (C) teapot 茶壺  (D) pan 平底鍋。non-stick pan（不沾平底鍋）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the kettle whistle sounds, it indicates that the clean water inside has reached a vigorous ______.","options":["boil","hire","serve","cough"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: boil (煮沸；沸騰狀態) 【全文中譯】當水壺鳴笛聲響起時，代表裡面的水已經達到劇烈沸騰狀態。 【選項解析】(A) boil 沸騰  (B) hire 僱用  (C) serve 服務  (D) cough 咳嗽。reached a vigorous boil（達到劇烈沸騰）。"}]},{"unit":13,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 13 (013.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Clothing, Formal Attire & Accessories | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"blouse","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a woman's shirt or upper garment","chinese":"女性襯衫；罩衫","sentence":"Helen wore a lightweight silk ______ with dark blue trousers to her job interview yesterday morning.","translation":"海倫昨天早上穿著一件輕盈的絲質女性襯衫搭配深藍色長褲去參加求職面試。"},{"word":"pajamas","pos":"(n.)","definition":"soft loose clothing worn in bed","chinese":"睡衣褲","sentence":"The little boy brushed his teeth, put on his warm cotton ______, and climbed into bed with a storybook.","translation":"小男孩刷了牙，穿上他溫暖的純棉睡衣褲，拿著故事書爬上了床。"},{"word":"suit","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a jacket and matching trousers or skirt; to fit well","chinese":"套裝；西裝；適合","sentence":"Mr. Anderson bought an elegant black ______ for the annual corporate dinner, and it fit him perfectly.","translation":"安德森先生為年度公司晚宴買了一套優雅的黑色西裝，而且穿在他身上非常合身。"},{"word":"trousers","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of clothing covering the body from waist to ankle on each leg","chinese":"長褲","sentence":"My brother spilled tomato soup on his khaki ______, so he had to wash them before going to class.","translation":"我哥哥把番茄湯灑在他的卡其長褲上，所以他去上課前必須先把褲子洗乾淨。"},{"word":"T-shirt","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a simple short-sleeved cotton casual shirt with no collar","chinese":"短袖圓領汗衫；T恤","sentence":"During the humid summer months, teenagers prefer wearing a loose white ______ with casual shorts.","translation":"在潮濕的夏季月份裡，青少年更喜歡穿著寬鬆的白色T恤搭配休閒短褲。"},{"word":"underwear","pos":"(n.)","definition":"clothes worn under other clothes next to the skin","chinese":"內衣褲","sentence":"Packing clean socks and ______ is essential whenever you plan a three-day hiking trip in the mountains.","translation":"每當你計畫去山裡進行為期三天的健行旅行時，打包乾淨的襪子和內衣褲是必不可少的。"},{"word":"vest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sleeveless upper garment worn over a shirt","chinese":"背心","sentence":"The police officer wore a bulletproof ______ under his uniform to protect himself while on night patrol.","translation":"警官在制服底下穿了一件防彈背心，以便在夜間巡邏時保護自己。"},{"word":"scarf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a length of fabric worn around the neck for warmth or style","chinese":"圍巾","sentence":"Cold northern winds blew across the city streets, so Jessica wrapped a wool ______ securely around her neck.","translation":"冰冷的北風吹過城市街道，所以潔西卡把一條羊毛圍巾緊緊圍在脖子上。"},{"word":"tie (tie / tied / tied)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a narrow strip of material worn around the neck; to bind","chinese":"領帶；繫；綁","sentence":"The young salesman learned how to fasten his silk ______ neatly before meeting important clients.","translation":"這位年輕業務員在拜訪重要客戶之前，學會了如何把他的絲質領帶繫得整整齊齊。"},{"word":"necklace","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an ornamental chain or string of beads worn around the neck","chinese":"項鍊","sentence":"On their twentieth wedding anniversary, my father surprised my mother with an expensive pearl ______.","translation":"在他們結婚二十週年紀念日，我父親送給我母親一條昂貴的珍珠項鍊作為驚喜。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"For the formal business presentation, Emily wore a professional white silk ______ paired with a dark pencil skirt.","options":["blouse","pajamas","trousers","underwear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blouse (女性襯衫) 【全文中譯】為了正式的商務簡報，艾蜜莉穿著專業的白色絲質女襯衫搭配深色窄裙。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) trousers 長褲  (D) underwear 內衣。女性正式上衣用 blouse。"},{"number":2,"stem":"After taking a warm shower before bed, little Leo put on his striped cotton ______ and fell asleep quickly.","options":["blouse","pajamas","necklace","tie"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pajamas (睡衣褲) 【全文中譯】睡前沖完溫水澡後，小里歐穿上條紋純棉睡衣褲並很快進入夢鄉。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) tie 領帶。睡前穿著 pajamas。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The bank manager arrived at the international conference dressed in a well-tailored navy blue ______.","options":["blouse","pajamas","suit","scarf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: suit (西裝；套裝) 【全文中譯】銀行經理穿著一套剪裁得體的海軍藍西裝抵達國際研討會現場。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) suit 西裝  (D) scarf 圍巾。商務正式西裝用 suit。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Jason accidentally ripped a hole in his school ______ when climbing over the rusty iron playground fence.","options":["blouse","suit","tie","trousers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: trousers (長褲) 【全文中譯】傑森在翻越操場生鏽的鐵圍欄時，不小心把學校長褲勾破了一個洞。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) suit 套裝  (C) tie 領帶  (D) trousers 長褲。爬圍欄易撕破 trousers。"},{"number":5,"stem":"On hot July afternoons, college students enjoy wearing a light cotton ______ while walking around campus.","options":["T-shirt","necklace","suit","tie"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: T-shirt (T恤) 【全文中譯】在炎熱的七月午後，大學生們在校園漫步時喜歡穿著輕便的棉質T恤。 【選項解析】(A) T-shirt T恤  (B) necklace 項鍊  (C) suit 西裝  (D) tie 領帶。夏季休閒短袖為 T-shirt。"},{"number":6,"stem":"For reasons of personal hygiene, doctors recommend changing your daily ______ every single morning.","options":["scarf","underwear","necklace","suit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underwear (內衣褲) 【全文中譯】基於個人衛生考量，醫生建議每天早晨更換乾淨的貼身內衣褲。 【選項解析】(A) scarf 圍巾  (B) underwear 內衣褲  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) suit 西裝。個人衛生更換 underwear。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The construction worker wore a bright yellow safety ______ so that passing drivers could easily see him.","options":["necklace","pajamas","vest","blouse"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: vest (背心) 【全文中譯】建築工人穿著一件亮黃色的安全背心，讓過往車輛司機能輕易看見他。 【選項解析】(A) necklace 項鍊  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) vest 背心  (D) blouse 女襯衫。safety vest 為安全背心。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Because the winter wind was freezing, grandma knitted a thick wool ______ to keep her neck warm.","options":["blouse","suit","trousers","scarf"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: scarf (圍巾) 【全文中譯】因為冬天的風冷冽刺骨，祖母織了一條厚羊毛圍巾來為脖子保暖。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) suit 西裝  (C) trousers 長褲  (D) scarf 圍巾。脖子保暖必備 wool scarf。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Men are usually required to wear a dark jacket and a matching silk ______ at formal diplomacy banquets.","options":["tie","pajamas","underwear","blouse"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tie (領帶) 【全文中譯】在正式的外交宴會上，男士通常被要求穿著深色外套並繫上相襯的絲質領帶。 【選項解析】(A) tie 領帶  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) underwear 內衣  (D) blouse 女襯衫。搭配西裝外套繫 tie。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The museum exhibition featured an ancient gold ______ decorated with emeralds and shiny diamonds.","options":["trousers","necklace","T-shirt","vest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: necklace (項鍊) 【全文中譯】博物館展覽展出了一條以祖母綠和閃亮鑽石點綴的古老金項鍊。 【選項解析】(A) trousers 長褲  (B) necklace 項鍊  (C) T-shirt T恤  (D) vest 背心。頸部首飾為 necklace。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Mother bought a lovely pink floral ______ to wear to my sister's graduation ceremony next weekend.","options":["pajamas","trousers","blouse","underwear"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: blouse (女襯衫) 【全文中譯】媽媽買了一件優雅的粉紅碎花女性襯衫，準備下週末參加我姊姊的畢業典禮時穿。 【選項解析】(A) pajamas 睡衣  (B) trousers 長褲  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) underwear 內衣。粉紅碎花女襯衫為 blouse。"},{"number":12,"stem":"It is inappropriate to walk into a luxury hotel lobby wearing your bedroom slippers and ______.","options":["blouse","suit","necklace","pajamas"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pajamas (睡衣) 【全文中譯】穿著臥室拖鞋和睡衣走進豪華飯店大廳是相當不合適的舉動。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) suit 西裝  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) pajamas 睡衣。居家睡衣用 pajamas。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The groom looked very handsome in his custom-made wedding ______ as he waited for his bride.","options":["suit","pajamas","blouse","scarf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: suit (西裝) 【全文中譯】新郎穿著他的量身訂製結婚西裝，在等待新娘時看起來非常英挺帥氣。 【選項解析】(A) suit 西裝  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) scarf 圍巾。新郎穿著 wedding suit。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Mr. White sent his wrinkled wool ______ to the dry cleaner so they would look neat for the interview.","options":["blouse","trousers","tie","necklace"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trousers (長褲) 【全文中譯】懷特先生將起皺的羊毛長褲送到乾洗店，以便在面試時看起來端莊筆挺。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) trousers 長褲  (C) tie 領帶  (D) necklace 項鍊。長褲為 trousers。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Peter bought a black rock band ______ at the concert and wore it proudly to school the following Monday.","options":["necklace","scarf","T-shirt","suit"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: T-shirt (T恤) 【全文中譯】彼得在演唱會上買了一件黑色搖滾樂團T恤，並在下週一驕傲地穿去學校。 【選項解析】(A) necklace 項鍊  (B) scarf 圍巾  (C) T-shirt T恤  (D) suit 西裝。樂團紀念衫通常為 band T-shirt。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Travelers should always pack three extra sets of clean ______ when embarking on an overseas flight.","options":["blouse","necklace","tie","underwear"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: underwear (內衣褲) 【全文中譯】搭機前往海外旅行時，旅客應隨時額外打包三套乾淨的換洗貼身內衣褲。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) necklace 項鍊  (C) tie 領帶  (D) underwear 內衣褲。出國備用內衣褲為 underwear。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In autumn, grandfather likes to wear a knitted wool ______ over his shirt to keep his chest comfortable.","options":["vest","pajamas","blouse","necklace"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: vest (背心) 【全文中譯】在秋天，祖父喜歡在襯衫外穿一件針織羊毛背心以保持胸部溫暖舒適。 【選項解析】(A) vest 背心  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) necklace 項鍊。套在襯衫外的無袖衣物為 vest。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the snowy evening walk, Sophia pulled her red cashmere ______ higher over her mouth and nose.","options":["blouse","scarf","suit","trousers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: scarf (圍巾) 【全文中譯】在下雪的夜晚散步時，索菲亞將紅色羊絨圍巾拉高遮住口鼻以避寒。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) scarf 圍巾  (C) suit 西裝  (D) trousers 長褲。圍在頸部防寒為 cashmere scarf。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Can you teach me how to ______ a proper knot on this school necktie before the morning assembly starts?","options":["boil","skin","tie","tear"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tie (繫；打結) 【全文中譯】在朝會開始之前，你能教我如何在這條學校領帶上打出漂亮的結嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) boil 煮沸  (B) skin 擦破皮  (C) tie 繫/打結  (D) tear 撕破。tie a knot（打結）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The thief snatched the diamond ______ from the lady's neck and disappeared quickly into the crowded alley.","options":["trousers","pajamas","blouse","necklace"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: necklace (項鍊) 【全文中譯】小偷從那位女士的脖子上扯下鑽石項鍊，迅速消失在擁擠的巷弄中。 【選項解析】(A) trousers 長褲  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) blouse 女襯衫  (D) necklace 項鍊。戴在脖子上的珠寶是 necklace。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The saleslady showed Mrs. Davis an elegant silk ______ with delicate lace around the round collar.","options":["blouse","trousers","pajamas","underwear"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blouse (女襯衫) 【全文中譯】女店員向戴維斯太太展示了一件圓領帶有精美蕾絲的優雅絲質女襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) trousers 長褲  (C) pajamas 睡衣  (D) underwear 內衣。圓領女襯衫用 blouse。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Cozy flannel ______ are especially popular among children during freezing December nights.","options":["suits","pajamas","scarves","necklaces"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pajamas (睡衣) 【全文中譯】舒適的法蘭絨睡衣在寒冷的十二月夜晚特別受到孩子們的歡迎。 【選項解析】(A) suits 西裝  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) scarves 圍巾  (D) necklaces 項鍊。flannel pajamas（法蘭絨睡衣）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Lawyers usually wear a sharp formal ______ in court to present a respectable and serious appearance.","options":["blouse","pajamas","suit","necklace"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: suit (西裝) 【全文中譯】律師通常在法庭穿著筆挺的正式西裝，以展現莊重嚴肅的專業形象。 【選項解析】(A) blouse 女襯衫  (B) pajamas 睡衣  (C) suit 西裝  (D) necklace 項鍊。法庭正式西裝為 sharp formal suit。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Because these blue denim ______ are too long, mother offered to shorten the cuffs on her sewing machine.","options":["blouses","ties","scarves","trousers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: trousers (長褲) 【全文中譯】因為這條藍色牛仔長褲太長了，母親主動提出要用裁縫機幫忙改短褲管。 【選項解析】(A) blouses 女襯衫  (B) ties 領帶  (C) scarves 圍巾  (D) trousers 長褲。牛仔長褲為 denim trousers。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Tom bought a simple white ______ and used fabric markers to draw his own cartoon design on the front.","options":["T-shirt","suit","necklace","tie"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: T-shirt (T恤) 【全文中譯】湯姆買了一件純白T恤，並用布料彩繪筆在正面畫上了他自己的卡通設計。 【選項解析】(A) T-shirt T恤  (B) suit 西裝  (C) necklace 項鍊  (D) tie 領帶。白色素T為 white T-shirt。"}]},{"unit":14,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 14 (014.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Footwear, Personal Accessories & Precious Metals | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"slippers","pos":"(n.)","definition":"comfortable loose soft shoes worn indoors","chinese":"室內拖鞋","sentence":"When guests enter our home, mother kindly offers them a clean pair of cotton ______ to wear.","translation":"當客人走進我們家時，母親會親切地提供他們一雙乾淨的室內純棉拖鞋穿著。"},{"word":"sneakers","pos":"(n.)","definition":"soft sports shoes suitable for casual wear and athletics","chinese":"運動鞋；球鞋","sentence":"Mark laced up his lightweight running ______ before heading down to the school athletic track.","translation":"馬克在前往學校田徑場之前，繫緊了他輕便慢跑運動鞋的鞋帶。"},{"word":"socks","pos":"(n.)","definition":"soft knitted coverings for the feet worn inside shoes","chinese":"短襪","sentence":"You should wear thick cotton ______ when hiking in the mountains to prevent blisters on your feet.","translation":"在山區健行時，你應該穿著厚棉短襪以防止腳上起水泡。"},{"word":"handkerchief","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small square piece of cloth used for wiping the nose or face","chinese":"手帕","sentence":"The gentle old man took a clean white ______ from his pocket and wiped the tears from his eyes.","translation":"那位溫和的老先生從口袋裡拿出一條乾淨的白色手帕，擦乾了他眼中的淚水。"},{"word":"purse","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small bag used especially by women for holding coins, money, and makeup","chinese":"女用手提包；小錢包","sentence":"While riding the crowded subway train, Brenda kept a firm grip on her leather ______.","translation":"在搭乘擁擠的地鐵列車時，布蘭達緊緊抓著她的皮質女用手提包。"},{"word":"wallet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat folding pocketbook used especially by men for holding paper money and cards","chinese":"皮夾；短夾","sentence":"After paying for the groceries at the counter, dad put his credit card back into his brown leather ______.","translation":"在櫃檯付完雜貨費用後，爸爸把信用卡放回他棕色的皮革短夾裡。"},{"word":"diamond","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an extremely hard, precious clear gemstone made of pure carbon","chinese":"鑽石","sentence":"The romantic gentleman knelt down in the restaurant and offered his girlfriend a sparkling ______ ring.","translation":"那位浪漫的紳士在餐廳裡單膝跪地，向他的女友獻上一枚閃閃發光的鑽石戒指。"},{"word":"gold","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a valuable soft yellow metallic element used for coins and jewelry","chinese":"黃金","sentence":"During periods of financial crisis, many investors prefer buying physical ______ to protect their wealth.","translation":"在金融危機時期，許多投資人更喜歡購買實體黃金來保護他們的財富。"},{"word":"golden","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"made of gold or having a bright yellow, shining color","chinese":"金黃色的；金色的","sentence":"The autumn afternoon sun cast a warm ______ glow over the ripening wheat fields across the valley.","translation":"秋日午後的陽光在整個山谷成熟的麥田上灑下了溫暖的金黃色光芒。"},{"word":"silver","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a shiny white metallic element used for coins, ornaments, and utensils","chinese":"銀；白銀；銀製的","sentence":"The royal banquet table was laid out with delicate porcelain dishes and polished antique ______ spoons.","translation":"皇家宴會桌上擺滿了精緻的瓷器餐具與擦得發亮的仿古銀製湯匙。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Japanese tradition requires visitors to take off their outdoor shoes and slip into indoor ______ at the entryway.","options":["slippers","handkerchief","purse","wallet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slippers (室內拖鞋) 【全文中譯】日本傳統要求訪客在玄關脫下室外鞋，並換上室內拖鞋。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) purse 女用包  (D) wallet 短夾。玄關換穿 indoor slippers。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Because we plan to play basketball on the outdoor asphalt court, you must wear good athletic ______.","options":["purse","sneakers","wallet","diamond"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sneakers (運動鞋) 【全文中譯】因為我們打算在戶外柏油球場打籃球，你必須穿著優質的運動鞋。 【選項解析】(A) purse 女用包  (B) sneakers 運動鞋  (C) wallet 短夾  (D) diamond 鑽石。打籃球穿 athletic sneakers。"},{"number":3,"stem":"On freezing winter mornings, little Jenny wears two pairs of warm woolen ______ inside her heavy boots.","options":["slippers","purse","socks","wallet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: socks (短襪) 【全文中譯】在寒冬早晨，小珍妮在厚重的靴子裡穿了兩雙保暖的羊毛襪。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) purse 女用包  (C) socks 襪子  (D) wallet 短夾。靴子內穿 woolen socks。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Grandfather sneezed loudly during the church sermon, but he quickly covered his nose with a linen ______.","options":["diamond","wallet","purse","handkerchief"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: handkerchief (手帕) 【全文中譯】祖父在教堂講道時大聲打了噴嚏，但他很快用亞麻手帕遮住了鼻子。 【選項解析】(A) diamond 鑽石  (B) wallet 短夾  (C) purse 女用包  (D) handkerchief 手帕。打噴嚏遮掩用 handkerchief。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The lady realized with horror that she had accidentally left her designer leather ______ on the bus seat.","options":["purse","sneakers","socks","slippers"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: purse (手提包) 【全文中譯】這位女士驚恐地發現，她不小心把名牌皮革手提包遺留在公車座位上了。 【選項解析】(A) purse 女用手提包  (B) sneakers 運動鞋  (C) socks 襪子  (D) slippers 拖鞋。遺忘在公車上的隨身包為 purse。"},{"number":6,"stem":"When the young man opened his leather ______ to pay the taxi driver, he found only two coins left inside.","options":["handkerchief","wallet","sneakers","socks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: wallet (皮夾) 【全文中譯】當年經人打開皮革短夾要付計程車司機車資時，發現裡面只剩兩枚硬幣。 【選項解析】(A) handkerchief 手帕  (B) wallet 皮夾  (C) sneakers 運動鞋  (D) socks 襪子。裝鈔票與卡片的為 wallet。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Because a ______ is the hardest natural substance known on earth, it is used for heavy industrial cutting.","options":["wallet","purse","diamond","handkerchief"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: diamond (鑽石) 【全文中譯】因為鑽石是地球上已知最堅硬的天然物質，所以被用於重工業切割。 【選項解析】(A) wallet 皮夾  (B) purse 手提包  (C) diamond 鑽石  (D) handkerchief 手帕。最堅硬物質為 diamond。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The winning athlete proudly stepped onto the victory podium and received a medal crafted from pure ______.","options":["slippers","purse","wallet","gold"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: gold (黃金) 【全文中譯】獲勝的運動員驕傲地站上頒獎台，接過一面由純金打造的獎牌。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) purse 手提包  (C) wallet 皮夾  (D) gold 黃金。第一名金牌為 pure gold。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In fairytale stories, the brave prince had bright ______ hair and rode across the kingdom on a white horse.","options":["golden","deaf","dizzy","pale"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: golden (金黃色的) 【全文中譯】在童話故事裡，英勇的王子擁有一頭金黃色秀髮，騎著白馬巡視王國。 【選項解析】(A) golden 金色的  (B) deaf 聾的  (C) dizzy 頭暈的  (D) pale 蒼白的。形容金髮用 golden hair。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Grandmother keeps her grandmother's antique ______ teapot locked securely inside the glass cabinet.","options":["ill","silver","painful","blind"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: silver (銀製的) 【全文中譯】祖母把她祖母留下來的仿古純銀茶壺安全地鎖在玻璃櫃中。 【選項解析】(A) ill 生病的  (B) silver 銀製的  (C) painful 疼痛的  (D) blind 盲的。貴重茶具為 silver teapot。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Take off those muddy soccer shoes immediately and put on these clean rubber ______ by the door.","options":["handkerchief","purse","slippers","wallet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: slippers (室內拖鞋) 【全文中譯】立刻脫下那雙沾滿泥巴的足球鞋，換上門邊這些乾淨的橡膠拖鞋。 【選項解析】(A) handkerchief 手帕  (B) purse 手提包  (C) slippers 拖鞋  (D) wallet 皮夾。室內換穿 rubber slippers。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Modern marathon runners invest in high-tech running ______ designed with thick carbon-fiber cushions.","options":["wallets","purses","handkerchiefs","sneakers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sneakers (運動鞋) 【全文中譯】現代馬拉松跑者投資於設計有厚碳纖維緩震墊的高科技慢跑運動鞋。 【選項解析】(A) wallets 皮夾  (B) purses 手提包  (C) handkerchiefs 手帕  (D) sneakers 運動鞋。馬拉松穿 running sneakers。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Always remember to pack several pairs of clean cotton ______ before embarking on a week-long hiking expedition.","options":["socks","wallets","purses","diamonds"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: socks (短襪) 【全文中譯】在展開為期一週的健行探險前，務必記得打包數雙乾淨的純棉短襪。 【選項解析】(A) socks 短襪  (B) wallets 皮夾  (C) purses 手提包  (D) diamonds 鑽石。健行必備換洗 cotton socks。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The kind schoolteacher gently handed her cotton ______ to the crying child to wipe away his tears.","options":["sneakers","handkerchief","wallet","purse"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: handkerchief (手帕) 【全文中譯】親切的學校老師溫柔地將她的純棉手帕遞給哭泣的孩子擦眼淚。 【選項解析】(A) sneakers 運動鞋  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) wallet 皮夾  (D) purse 手提包。擦眼淚用 cotton handkerchief。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Aunt Clara keeps her smartphone, car keys, and house keys organized neatly inside her floral ______.","options":["socks","wallet","purse","sneakers"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: purse (手提包) 【全文中譯】克拉拉姑姑把智慧型手機、車鑰匙和家門鑰匙整齊收納在碎花手提包裡。 【選項解析】(A) socks 短襪  (B) wallet 皮夾  (C) purse 女用提包  (D) sneakers 運動鞋。女用隨身提包為 purse。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The police arrested a pickpocket who was caught stealing an expensive leather ______ from an elderly tourist.","options":["handkerchief","sneakers","slippers","wallet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wallet (皮夾) 【全文中譯】警方逮捕了一名扒手，他被當場抓到偷竊一名年長觀光客昂貴的真皮皮夾。 【選項解析】(A) handkerchief 手帕  (B) sneakers 運動鞋  (C) slippers 拖鞋  (D) wallet 皮夾。扒手常竊取 leather wallet。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Many couples choose a solitaire ______ engagement ring as a traditional symbol of everlasting love.","options":["diamond","handkerchief","purse","wallet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: diamond (鑽石) 【全文中譯】許多伴侶選擇單顆美鑽求婚戒指，作為永恆愛情的傳統象徵。 【選項解析】(A) diamond 鑽石  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) purse 手提包  (D) wallet 皮夾。求婚戒為 diamond engagement ring。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In ancient times, wealthy merchants conducted international trade using heavy coins minted from solid ______.","options":["wallet","gold","purse","sneakers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: gold (黃金) 【全文中譯】在古代，富裕的商人使用以純金鑄造的沉重硬幣進行國際貿易。 【選項解析】(A) wallet 皮夾  (B) gold 黃金  (C) purse 手提包  (D) sneakers 運動鞋。古錢幣以 solid gold 鑄造。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Looking down from the mountain peak at dawn, we watched the morning sunlight paint the horizon a brilliant ______ yellow.","options":["dumb","homesick","golden","deaf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: golden (金黃色的) 【全文中譯】黎明時分從山頂俯瞰，我們看著晨曦將地平線染成一片絢麗的金黃色。 【選項解析】(A) dumb 啞的  (B) homesick 想家的  (C) golden 金黃色的  (D) deaf 聾的。形容金色晨光用 golden yellow。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The talented musician was awarded a polished ______ trophy for winning second place in the piano contest.","options":["dizzy","blind","pale","silver"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: silver (銀製的) 【全文中譯】這位有才華的音樂家因獲得鋼琴大賽第二名而獲頒一座精緻的銀製獎盃。 【選項解析】(A) dizzy 頭暈的  (B) blind 盲的  (C) pale 蒼白的  (D) silver 銀製的。第二名獲頒 silver trophy。"},{"number":21,"stem":"In traditional Asian households, guests never walk across polished wooden floors without wearing indoor ______.","options":["slippers","handkerchief","purse","wallet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: slippers (拖鞋) 【全文中譯】在傳統亞洲家庭中，客人在磨光木地板上走動時絕不會不穿室內拖鞋。 【選項解析】(A) slippers 拖鞋  (B) handkerchief 手帕  (C) purse 手提包  (D) wallet 皮夾。室內防滑保潔穿 slippers。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Kevin bought a pair of black canvas ______ to wear with his casual denim jeans during weekend outings.","options":["wallets","sneakers","purses","handkerchiefs"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sneakers (球鞋；運動鞋) 【全文中譯】凱文買了一雙黑色帆布球鞋，以便在週末外出時搭配休閒牛仔褲穿著。 【選項解析】(A) wallets 皮夾  (B) sneakers 球鞋  (C) purses 手提包  (D) handkerchiefs 手帕。休閒帆布鞋為 canvas sneakers。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The washing machine ate one of my striped ______, so now I have an odd pair that does not match.","options":["purses","wallets","socks","diamonds"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: socks (短襪) 【全文中譯】洗衣機吃掉了我的一隻條紋襪，所以現在我有一雙湊不成套的襪子。 【選項解析】(A) purses 手提包  (B) wallets 皮夾  (C) socks 短襪  (D) diamonds 鑽石。一隻落單的襪子為 sock。"},{"number":24,"stem":"A gentleman in the 19th century always kept an ironed silk ______ in the breast pocket of his coat.","options":["wallet","purse","sneakers","handkerchief"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: handkerchief (手帕) 【全文中譯】19世紀的紳士總會在外套胸前口袋裡放一條熨燙整齊的絲質手帕。 【選項解析】(A) wallet 皮夾  (B) purse 手提包  (C) sneakers 運動鞋  (D) handkerchief 手帕。紳士口袋巾為 silk handkerchief。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Don't leave your open ______ unattended on the restaurant table while getting food from the buffet counter.","options":["purse","slippers","sneakers","socks"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: purse (手提包) 【全文中譯】在自助餐檯取餐時，切勿將打開的手提包無人看管地放在餐桌上。 【選項解析】(A) purse 手提包  (B) slippers 拖鞋  (C) sneakers 運動鞋  (D) socks 短襪。隨身女用手提包為 purse。"}]},{"unit":15,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 15 (015.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Stationery, Office Supplies & Materials | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"cotton","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft white fibrous substance used for making clothes and thread","chinese":"棉花；純棉","sentence":"People living in tropical climates prefer wearing light clothes made of pure ______ because it absorbs sweat well.","translation":"生活在熱帶氣候的人們更喜歡穿著純棉製成的輕便衣服，因為它吸汗效果好。"},{"word":"pipe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tube through which liquids or gases flow; a smoking device","chinese":"管子；煙斗","sentence":"The plumber had to replace a leaking copper ______ under the kitchen sink to prevent further water damage.","translation":"水電工必須更換廚房水槽下一根漏水的銅管，以防止水災進一步擴大。"},{"word":"tape (tape / taped / taped)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a narrow strip of sticky material; to record audio/video","chinese":"膠帶；磁帶；用膠帶黏貼；錄製","sentence":"Before moving to the new apartment, father used strong packaging ______ to seal all the cardboard boxes.","translation":"在搬到新公寓之前，父親用強韌的封箱膠帶把所有的紙箱都密封好。"},{"word":"CD","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a compact disc used for storing digital audio, video, or data","chinese":"光碟；雷射唱片","sentence":"My uncle has an impressive music collection with over five hundred jazz albums stored on original ______.","translation":"我叔叔擁有令人印象深刻的音樂收藏，有超過五百張爵士專輯保存在原版光碟上。"},{"word":"envelope","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat paper container used especially for enclosing a letter","chinese":"信封","sentence":"After writing a heartfelt thank-you letter to her teacher, Maria slipped it into a clean white ______.","translation":"在給她的老師寫了一封由衷的感謝信之後，瑪麗亞將信滑入一個乾淨的白色信封中。"},{"word":"glue (glue / glued / glued)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a sticky substance used for joining things together","chinese":"膠水；黏貼","sentence":"The little girl made a colorful paper lantern for the festival, and she used liquid ______ to stick the parts.","translation":"小女孩為節日做了一個色彩繽紛的紙燈籠，她用液態膠水將各個部分黏合在一起。"},{"word":"ink","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a colored liquid used for writing, drawing, or printing","chinese":"墨水；油墨","sentence":"The office printer stopped working suddenly because the black ______ cartridge ran completely dry.","translation":"辦公室印表機突然停止運作，因為黑色墨水匣裡面的墨水已經徹底用乾了。"},{"word":"marker","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a felt-tipped pen used for writing bold lines or highlighting","chinese":"麥克筆；彩色筆","sentence":"The English teacher picked up a red dry-erase ______ and wrote three important grammar rules on the whiteboard.","translation":"英文老師拿起一支給白板用的紅色乾擦麥克筆，在白板上寫了三條重要的文法規則。"},{"word":"paste (paste / pasted / pasted)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a thick wet mixture used for sticking paper; to glue","chinese":"糊狀物；漿糊；張貼","sentence":"The students spread homemade wheat ______ evenly over the wall to hang their artistic campaign posters.","translation":"學生們將自製的麵粉漿糊均勻塗抹在牆上，以張貼他們的藝術宣傳海報。"},{"word":"textbook","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a comprehensive book used for the formal study of a subject","chinese":"教科書；課本","sentence":"Every student must bring their science ______ to class every morning so that we can read chapter four together.","translation":"每位學生每天早上都必須帶他們的自然教科書來上課，這樣我們才能一起閱讀第四章。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Because the summer heat in southern Taiwan is intense, I only buy casual shirts tailored from breathable natural ______.","options":["cotton","CD","envelope","pipe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cotton (純棉) 【全文中譯】因為南台灣夏季炎熱難耐，我只購買透氣天然純棉剪裁的休閒襯衫。 【選項解析】(A) cotton 棉花/純棉  (B) CD 光碟  (C) envelope 信封  (D) pipe 管子。透氣布料為 natural cotton。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The heavy freeze caused a burst water ______ in the garden, and cold water flooded the lawn.","options":["envelope","pipe","marker","paste"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pipe (管子；水管) 【全文中譯】嚴重的冰凍導致花園裡的一根水管爆裂，冰水淹沒了整個草坪。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 水管  (C) marker 麥克筆  (D) paste 漿糊。burst water pipe（爆裂水管）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mother securely fastened the edges of the parcel using three layers of brown packing ______.","options":["textbook","ink","tape","CD"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tape (膠帶) 【全文中譯】母親用三層棕色封箱膠帶將包裹的邊緣牢固地封合起來。 【選項解析】(A) textbook 教科書  (B) ink 墨水  (C) tape 膠帶  (D) CD 光碟。封箱使用 packing tape。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Before digital streaming became popular worldwide, people bought music tracks on shiny round ______.","options":["pipes","cottons","envelopes","CDs"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: CD (光碟) 【全文中譯】在數位串流風靡全球之前，人們都在閃亮圓形光碟上購買音樂曲目。 【選項解析】(A) pipes 管子  (B) cottons 棉花  (C) envelopes 信封  (D) CDs 光碟。音樂載體為 shiny round CDs。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Please remember to moisten the flap of the ______ and press it firmly before putting it in the mailbox.","options":["envelope","pipe","CD","textbook"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: envelope (信封) 【全文中譯】在把信投入郵筒前，請記得將信封封口沾濕並用力按緊。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) textbook 教科書。信件封口為 flap of the envelope。"},{"number":6,"stem":"When Billy dropped his toy airplane, its plastic wing snapped off, but he fixed it with model ______.","options":["pipe","glue","cotton","CD"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: glue (膠水) 【全文中譯】當比利把玩具飛機掉在地上時，塑膠機翼斷了，但他用模型膠水修好了它。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) glue 膠水  (C) cotton 棉花  (D) CD 光碟。修復塑膠模型使用 model glue。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Be careful when refilling the calligraphy pen, or dark blue ______ will splash across your desk.","options":["pipe","envelope","ink","textbook"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ink (墨水) 【全文中譯】在補充鋼筆墨水時要小心，否則深藍色墨水會濺得整個書桌都是。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) envelope 信封  (C) ink 墨水  (D) textbook 教科書。鋼筆內部液體為 dark blue ink。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The lecturer used a bold black ______ to draw a clear diagram on the whiteboard during the seminar.","options":["envelope","pipe","CD","marker"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: marker (麥克筆) 【全文中譯】演講者在研討會期間用一支粗黑色麥克筆在白板上畫了一個清晰的圖表。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) marker 麥克筆。白板書寫工具為 dry-erase marker。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In art class, the children used sticky wallpaper ______ to assemble papier-mâché sculptures.","options":["paste","pipe","CD","envelope"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: paste (漿糊) 【全文中譯】在美術課上，孩子們使用具黏性的壁紙漿糊來組裝紙黏土雕塑。 【選項解析】(A) paste 漿糊  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) envelope 信封。黏合紙雕使用 wallpaper paste。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Turn to page ninety in your biology ______ and answer the three questions printed at the bottom.","options":["pipe","textbook","envelope","tape"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: textbook (教科書) 【全文中譯】翻開自然教科書第九十頁，並回答印在最底部的三個問題。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) textbook 教科書  (C) envelope 信封  (D) tape 膠帶。課堂教材翻到某頁用 textbook。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Hospital bandages are made of sterilized ______ gauze to protect sensitive wounds from external infection.","options":["pipe","CD","cotton","envelope"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: cotton (棉質) 【全文中譯】醫院繃帶由滅菌棉紗布製成，以保護敏感傷口免受外部感染。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 光碟  (C) cotton 棉花/純棉  (D) envelope 信封。醫用棉紗為 cotton gauze。"},{"number":12,"stem":"An experienced plumber climbed into the crawlspace to inspect the main drainage ______ of the apartment.","options":["marker","envelope","CD","pipe"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pipe (管線) 【全文中譯】經驗豐富的水電工爬進管道夾層，檢查公寓的主要排水管。 【選項解析】(A) marker 麥克筆  (B) envelope 信封  (C) CD 光碟  (D) pipe 管線。主排水管為 main drainage pipe。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The detective carefully wrapped a piece of transparent adhesive ______ around the suspect's drinking glass.","options":["tape","pipe","CD","textbook"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tape (膠帶) 【全文中譯】刑警小心翼翼地在嫌疑犯喝水的水杯周圍纏上一條透明膠帶以採集指紋。 【選項解析】(A) tape 膠帶  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) textbook 教科書。透明膠帶為 transparent adhesive tape。"},{"number":14,"stem":"My older sister still enjoys collecting physical albums, so she bought a classic rock ______ at the music store.","options":["pipe","CD","cotton","envelope"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: CD (唱片光碟) 【全文中譯】我姊姊仍然喜歡收藏實體專輯，所以她在唱片行買了一張經典搖滾CD。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 唱片光碟  (C) cotton 棉花  (D) envelope 信封。實體音樂專輯為 classic rock CD。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Don't forget to affix a valid postage stamp to the top right corner of the paper ______ before mailing.","options":["pipe","CD","envelope","marker"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: envelope (信封) 【全文中譯】寄出信件前，不要忘記在紙信封的右上角貼上一張有效的郵票。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 光碟  (C) envelope 信封  (D) marker 麥克筆。信封右上角貼郵票為 paper envelope。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The wooden chair leg became loose after years of use, so grandpa repaired it with strong wood ______.","options":["pipe","envelope","CD","glue"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: glue (膠水；木工膠) 【全文中譯】木椅腳經過多年使用變鬆了，所以祖父用強效木工膠將其修復好。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) envelope 信封  (C) CD 光碟  (D) glue 膠水。修補木椅用 strong wood glue。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Medieval scribes dipped pointed bird feathers into dark squid ______ to write historical manuscripts.","options":["ink","pipe","CD","envelope"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ink (墨水) 【全文中譯】中世紀的抄寫員將削尖的鳥羽毛浸入深色墨水之中來書寫歷史手稿。 【選項解析】(A) ink 墨水  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) envelope 信封。沾水筆書寫用 dark squid ink。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Make sure to put the cap back on the highlighter ______ tightly, or the tip will dry out completely overnight.","options":["CD","marker","envelope","pipe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: marker (麥克筆；螢光筆) 【全文中譯】務必把螢光麥克筆的筆蓋蓋緊，否則筆尖隔夜就會徹底乾掉。 【選項解析】(A) CD 光碟  (B) marker 麥克筆  (C) envelope 信封  (D) pipe 管子。螢光筆為 highlighter marker。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before computers existed, editors used scissors and starch ______ to lay out newspaper columns by hand.","options":["pipe","CD","paste","envelope"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: paste (漿糊) 【全文中譯】在電腦出現之前，編輯們用剪刀和澱粉漿糊手工排版報紙專欄版面。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) CD 光碟  (C) paste 漿糊  (D) envelope 信封。黏貼排版使用 starch paste。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The high school principal announced that all students would receive their new history ______ next Monday morning.","options":["envelopes","pipes","CDs","textbooks"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: textbook (教科書) 【全文中譯】高中校長宣布，全體學生將在下星期一早晨領取他們的新歷史教科書。 【選項解析】(A) envelopes 信封  (B) pipes 管子  (C) CDs 光碟  (D) textbooks 教科書。學期發放教材為 history textbooks。"},{"number":21,"stem":"High-quality bedding sheets made from organic Egyptian ______ provide a remarkably comfortable night of rest.","options":["cotton","pipe","envelope","CD"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cotton (純棉) 【全文中譯】由有機埃及棉製成的高品質床單，能提供格外舒適的夜間睡眠休憩。 【選項解析】(A) cotton 純棉  (B) pipe 管子  (C) envelope 信封  (D) CD 光碟。埃及純棉為 Egyptian cotton。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Factory emissions travel through a tall exhaust ______ high into the sky above the industrial park.","options":["CD","pipe","envelope","textbook"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pipe (排氣管) 【全文中譯】工廠廢氣穿過工業區上方高聳的排氣管排放到遙遠的高空之中。 【選項解析】(A) CD 光碟  (B) pipe 排氣管  (C) envelope 信封  (D) textbook 教科書。廢氣排放管道為 tall exhaust pipe。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The athlete wrapped athletic ______ around his sprained ankle to give it extra stability during the race.","options":["CD","pipe","tape","textbook"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tape (貼紮膠帶) 【全文中譯】運動員在他扭傷的腳踝上纏繞運動白貼膠帶，以在比賽中增加穩定度。 【選項解析】(A) CD 光碟  (B) pipe 管子  (C) tape 膠帶  (D) textbook 教科書。運動防護貼紮為 athletic tape。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Put the installation ______ into your computer's optical drive and follow the instructions on the screen.","options":["pipe","envelope","textbook","CD"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: CD (安裝光碟) 【全文中譯】將安裝光碟放入電腦的光碟機中，並依照螢幕上的操作指示進行。 【選項解析】(A) pipe 管子  (B) envelope 信封  (C) textbook 教科書  (D) CD 安裝光碟。電腦光碟機放入 installation CD。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the confidential document arrived, the red wax seal on the back of the parchment ______ was unbroken.","options":["envelope","pipe","CD","tape"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: envelope (信封) 【全文中譯】當機密文件送達時，羊皮紙信封背面的紅色火漆印章完好無損。 【選項解析】(A) envelope 信封  (B) pipe 管子  (C) CD 光碟  (D) tape 膠帶。附有火漆印章的信件容器為 parchment envelope。"}]},{"unit":16,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 16 (016.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Home Architecture, Rooms & Interior Storage | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"balcony","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a platform projecting from the wall of a building","chinese":"陽台","sentence":"On cool summer evenings, my grandparents enjoy sitting on the second-floor ______ to watch the street below.","translation":"在涼爽的夏日傍晚，我的祖父母喜歡坐在二樓陽台上觀看下方街景。"},{"word":"basement","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the lowest floor of a building located entirely or partly underground","chinese":"地下室","sentence":"During heavy summer rainstorms, father went down to the dark ______ to check if water had entered.","translation":"在夏季強烈暴風雨期間，父親走到黑暗的地下室檢查是否有水滲入。"},{"word":"garage","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a building or indoor space used for housing motor vehicles","chinese":"車庫","sentence":"Uncle Robert parked his new electric car inside the spacious ______ and plugged it into the charger.","translation":"羅伯特叔叔將他的新電動車停進寬敞的車庫裡，並插上充電器。"},{"word":"fence","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wooden or metal barrier enclosing an area of land","chinese":"籬笆；柵欄","sentence":"Our neighbor built a tall wooden ______ around his backyard to prevent his energetic dog from running out.","translation":"我們的鄰居在後院周圍建了一道高高的木籬笆，以防止他精力充沛的狗跑出去。"},{"word":"yard","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of ground adjoining a house, often with grass or gardens","chinese":"庭院；院子","sentence":"The cheerful children chased colourful butterflies around the grassy front ______ until dinner was ready.","translation":"活潑開朗的孩子們在綠草如茵的前院追逐色彩繽紛的蝴蝶，直到晚餐準備就緒。"},{"word":"bookcase","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of furniture with shelves used for storing books","chinese":"書櫃；書架","sentence":"Professor Miller ordered a custom-made mahogany ______ to display his vast collection of antique literature.","translation":"米勒教授訂製了一個紅木書架，以展示他收藏的大量古代文學典籍。"},{"word":"shelf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a flat horizontal board fixed to a wall or frame for displaying objects","chinese":"層架；架子","sentence":"Mother asked Kevin to reach up and fetch the large porcelain bowl from the highest wooden ______.","translation":"母親請凱文把手伸高，從最高處的木製層架上取下那個大瓷碗。"},{"word":"closet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tall cupboard or small recess used for storing clothes and coats","chinese":"壁櫥；衣櫥","sentence":"Before leaving for work, Mr. Davis opened the bedroom ______ and selected a crisp navy blue suit.","translation":"出門上班前，戴維斯先生打開臥室衣櫥，挑選了一套筆挺的海軍藍西裝。"},{"word":"drawer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sliding box-like container fitted into a desk or chest of drawers","chinese":"抽屜","sentence":"Grandmother kept her golden scissors, sewing needles, and thread safely stored in the top desk ______.","translation":"祖母把她的金剪刀、縫紉針和線安全地收納在書桌最上方的抽屜裡。"},{"word":"dresser","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of bedroom furniture with drawers and usually a mirror","chinese":"梳妝台；矮衣櫃","sentence":"My older sister sat in front of the bedroom ______ every morning to comb her hair and apply light makeup.","translation":"我姊姊每天早上坐在臥室梳妝台前梳理頭髮並化上淡淡的妝容。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"From our fourth-floor apartment ______, we can observe the annual New Year fireworks display across the river.","options":["balcony","basement","garage","fence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: balcony (陽台) 【全文中譯】從我們四樓公寓的陽台，我們可以觀看對岸一年一度的跨年煙火秀。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) garage 車庫  (D) fence 籬笆。高樓層觀景位置為 balcony。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The old laundry washing machines and heating boilers are installed down in the concrete ______.","options":["balcony","basement","drawer","dresser"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: basement (地下室) 【全文中譯】老舊的洗衣機和供暖鍋爐都安裝在下方的混凝土地下室裡。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) dresser 梳妝台。鍋爐設備常置於 basement。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Mr. Brown drove into the two-car ______ and closed the automatic metal roller door behind his vehicle.","options":["balcony","basement","garage","shelf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: garage (車庫) 【全文中譯】布朗先生開進雙車位車庫，並關閉了車輛後方的自動金屬鐵捲門。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) garage 車庫  (D) shelf 架子。停車空間為 two-car garage。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The farmer repaired the wooden boundary ______ to stop wild deer from entering and eating his cabbage crop.","options":["balcony","drawer","dresser","fence"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: fence (籬笆) 【全文中譯】農夫修補了木製邊界籬笆，以防止野生鹿跑進來啃食他的高麗菜作物。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) drawer 抽屜  (C) dresser 梳妝台  (D) fence 籬笆。防野生動物入侵建 wooden boundary fence。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The neighborhood kids love playing badminton and pitching tents in our large grassy back ______.","options":["yard","bookcase","closet","drawer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: yard (庭院) 【全文中譯】鄰居的孩子們喜歡在我們寬敞、綠草如茵的後院打羽毛球和搭帳篷。 【選項解析】(A) yard 庭院  (B) bookcase 書櫃  (C) closet 衣櫥  (D) drawer 抽屜。戶外活動場所為 grassy back yard。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Dad organized all his encyclopedia volumes in alphabetical order on the large living room ______.","options":["yard","bookcase","drawer","dresser"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bookcase (書櫃) 【全文中譯】爸爸按照字母順序將他所有的百科全書整齊收納在客廳大書櫃上。 【選項解析】(A) yard 庭院  (B) bookcase 書櫃  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) dresser 梳妝台。存放百科全書為 bookcase。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The store clerk placed several glass perfume bottles carefully on the illuminated display ______.","options":["garage","fence","shelf","basement"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shelf (層架) 【全文中譯】店員小心翼翼地將數個玻璃香水瓶擺放在有照明的展示層架上。 【選項解析】(A) garage 車庫  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) shelf 層架  (D) basement 地下室。商品陳列板為 display shelf。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Hang your winter overcoat on a wooden hanger and place it inside the hallway ______.","options":["fence","yard","balcony","closet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: closet (衣櫥) 【全文中譯】把你的冬季大衣掛在木衣架上，並放進走廊的衣櫥裡面。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) yard 庭院  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) closet 衣櫥。懸掛大衣放置於 hallway closet。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Tom opened the wooden desk ______ to look for a pair of scissors and a fresh ballpoint pen.","options":["drawer","fence","garage","yard"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drawer (抽屜) 【全文中譯】湯姆拉開木製書桌抽屜，尋找一把剪刀和一支新的原子筆。 【選項解析】(A) drawer 抽屜  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) garage 車庫  (D) yard 庭院。書桌可抽拉收納為 desk drawer。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Mother keeps perfume bottles, cosmetics, and jewelry boxes neatly arranged on top of her bedroom ______.","options":["fence","dresser","yard","basement"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dresser (梳妝台) 【全文中譯】母親將香水瓶、化妝品和首飾盒整齊排列在她的臥室梳妝台上。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) dresser 梳妝台  (C) yard 庭院  (D) basement 地下室。擺放化妝品之矮櫃為 bedroom dresser。"},{"number":11,"stem":"We set up a small table and two folding chairs on the flower-filled ______ to drink afternoon coffee.","options":["basement","fence","balcony","drawer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: balcony (陽台) 【全文中譯】我們在繁花盛開的陽台上擺放了一張小桌子和兩張折疊椅來喝下午茶咖啡。 【選項解析】(A) basement 地下室  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) drawer 抽屜。戶外喝咖啡於 flower-filled balcony。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During the tornado warning, families in the Midwestern United States quickly retreated to the storm ______.","options":["fence","balcony","dresser","basement"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: basement (地下室) 【全文中譯】在龍捲風警報期間，美國中西部的家庭迅速撤離到防風暴地下室避難。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) balcony 陽台  (C) dresser 梳妝台  (D) basement 地下室。避龍捲風進 storm basement。"},{"number":13,"stem":"You should clear those old boxes out of the private ______ so there is enough room to park the family minivan.","options":["garage","balcony","drawer","fence"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: garage (車庫) 【全文中譯】你應該把那些舊箱子從私人車庫清走，這樣才有足夠空間停放休旅車。 【選項解析】(A) garage 車庫  (B) balcony 陽台  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) fence 籬笆。停放廂型車需清理 private garage。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A white picket ______ borders the charming country cottage and separates the front lawn from the lane.","options":["yard","fence","drawer","dresser"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fence (籬笆) 【全文中譯】一道白色尖頭木籬笆環繞著迷人的鄉村農舍，並將前草坪與小徑隔開。 【選項解析】(A) yard 庭院  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) dresser 梳妝台。經典美式白色籬笆為 white picket fence。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The children planted sunflowers and sweet cherry tomatoes along the perimeter of the sunny ______.","options":["bookcase","drawer","yard","closet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: yard (院子) 【全文中譯】孩子們在陽光充沛的院子周圍種下了向日葵和甜櫻桃番茄。 【選項解析】(A) bookcase 書櫃  (B) drawer 抽屜  (C) yard 院子  (D) closet 衣櫥。戶外種植花卉蔬菜在 sunny yard。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Hundreds of leather-bound classical novels fill every single row of the professor's oak ______.","options":["drawer","yard","fence","bookcase"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bookcase (書櫃) 【全文中譯】數百本皮質封面的古典小說填滿了教授橡木書架上的每一格。 【選項解析】(A) drawer 抽屜  (B) yard 院子  (C) fence 籬笆  (D) bookcase 書櫃。藏書傢俱為 oak bookcase。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Can you reach up to that high kitchen ______ and hand me down the jar of dried oregano seasoning?","options":["shelf","fence","yard","basement"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shelf (架子) 【全文中譯】你能伸手夠到廚房上方的高架子，把那罐牛至香料遞給我嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) shelf 架子  (B) fence 籬笆  (C) yard 院子  (D) basement 地下室。廚房置物板為 kitchen shelf。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In winter, mother stores heavy down blankets in vacuum-sealed plastic bags inside the master bedroom ______.","options":["fence","closet","yard","balcony"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: closet (衣櫥) 【全文中譯】在冬天，母親把厚羽絨被收納在真空袋裡，放在主臥室的衣櫥裡。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) closet 衣櫥  (C) yard 院子  (D) balcony 陽台。存放棉被於 master bedroom closet。"},{"number":19,"stem":"I can never find clean socks because my brother constantly mixes up his clothes in the shared dresser ______.","options":["fence","yard","drawer","balcony"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drawer (抽屜) 【全文中譯】我總是找不到乾淨的襪子，因為我弟弟總是在共用的矮櫃抽屜裡把衣服混在一起。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) yard 院子  (C) drawer 抽屜  (D) balcony 陽台。存放衣物的滑動盒為 dresser drawer。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The mirror attached to the vintage wooden ______ had to be cleaned because it was covered in dust.","options":["fence","yard","balcony","dresser"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dresser (梳妝台) 【全文中譯】附在那座復古木製梳妝台上的鏡子必須擦拭，因為上面沾滿了灰塵。 【選項解析】(A) fence 籬笆  (B) yard 院子  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) dresser 梳妝台。附帶鏡子的梳妝矮櫃為 vintage wooden dresser。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Potted geraniums and fresh basil plants flourish under the warm morning sun on our open ______.","options":["balcony","drawer","dresser","closet"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: balcony (陽台) 【全文中譯】盆栽天竺葵與新鮮羅勒植物在我們開放式陽台上的溫暖晨光下茂盛生長。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) drawer 抽屜  (C) dresser 梳妝台  (D) closet 衣櫥。植栽盆栽放於 open balcony。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Because there are no windows down in the underground ______, we installed bright overhead LED tube lights.","options":["balcony","basement","fence","yard"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: basement (地下室) 【全文中譯】因為地下室沒有窗戶，所以我們安裝了明亮的頂置LED燈管。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) basement 地下室  (C) fence 籬笆  (D) yard 庭院。地底無窗空間為 underground basement。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The mechanic's home ______ is equipped with heavy-duty diagnostic computers and hydraulic lifting jacks.","options":["balcony","shelf","garage","drawer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: garage (車庫) 【全文中譯】這位技師的自家車庫配備了重型診斷電腦和油壓千斤頂起重機。 【選項解析】(A) balcony 陽台  (B) shelf 架子  (C) garage 車庫  (D) drawer 抽屜。修車場兼車庫為 home garage。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The barbed-wire security ______ surrounding the military installation is monitored by electronic cameras 24 hours a day.","options":["drawer","yard","balcony","fence"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: fence (鐵絲網籬笆) 【全文中譯】圍繞軍事基地的鐵絲網安全籬笆全天候24小時由電子監控攝影機監看。 【選項解析】(A) drawer 抽屜  (B) yard 院子  (C) balcony 陽台  (D) fence 鐵絲網籬笆。防護圍牆為 security fence。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Father spent all Saturday afternoon mowing the overgrown green grass in our spacious front ______.","options":["yard","closet","bookcase","dresser"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: yard (前院) 【全文中譯】父親星期六整個下午都在為我們寬敞前院雜草叢生的綠草修剪草皮。 【選項解析】(A) yard 前院  (B) closet 衣櫥  (C) bookcase 書架  (D) dresser 梳妝台。割草修剪在 spacious front yard。"}]},{"unit":17,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 17 (017.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Home Fixtures, Domestic Appliances & Floor Coverings | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"ceiling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the overhead upper surface of a room","chinese":"天花板","sentence":"The historic cathedral features a magnificent dome with biblical scenes painted across the high ______.","translation":"這座歷史悠久的大教堂擁有壯麗的穹頂，高聳的天花板上繪製著聖經場景。"},{"word":"roof","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the structure forming the upper covering of a building","chinese":"屋頂","sentence":"A violent typhoon damaged the terracotta tiles, so two workers climbed up to repair the house ______.","translation":"強烈颱風破壞了紅陶瓦片，所以兩名工人爬上去修復房子的屋頂。"},{"word":"curtain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a piece of hanging cloth used to screen a window","chinese":"窗簾；簾子","sentence":"Because the afternoon sunlight was shining directly into the study, Linda pulled the thick velvet ______ closed.","translation":"因為午後的陽光直接照進書房，琳達把厚重的天鵝絨窗簾拉上了。"},{"word":"dryer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an appliance that removes moisture, especially for clothes or hair","chinese":"烘乾機；吹風機","sentence":"After washing his muddy soccer kit, Tom placed the clean uniforms into the electric clothes ______.","translation":"在洗好沾滿泥巴的足球裝備後，湯姆把乾淨的球衣放進了電動乾衣機中。"},{"word":"heater","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an apparatus used for warming the air in a room or building","chinese":"暖氣機；電暖爐","sentence":"When mountain temperatures dropped below zero degrees in January, we gathered around the portable electric ______.","translation":"當一月份山區氣溫降至零度以下時，我們聚集在便攜式電暖爐周圍取暖。"},{"word":"microwave","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an oven that cooks or warms food using high-frequency electromagnetic waves","chinese":"微波爐","sentence":"If you arrive home late and find the dinner cold, you can reheat the chicken soup in the kitchen ______.","translation":"如果你很晚才到家發現晚餐涼了，你可以把雞湯放進廚房微波爐裡重新加熱。"},{"word":"oven","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an enclosed compartment used for baking or roasting food","chinese":"烤箱","sentence":"Mother preheated the electric baking ______ to 180 degrees before putting the apple pie inside.","translation":"母親在把蘋果派放進去之前，先把電烤箱預熱到攝氏一百八十度。"},{"word":"stove","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an apparatus for cooking or heating that operates by burning fuel or electricity","chinese":"瓦斯爐；火爐","sentence":"Always remember to turn off the gas knobs on the kitchen ______ before leaving the house.","translation":"出門前請務必記得關閉廚房瓦斯爐上的旋鈕開關。"},{"word":"carpet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick heavy woven floor covering covering an entire room","chinese":"地毯","sentence":"The luxury presidential suite was decorated with Persian rugs and a thick, soft woolen ______ on the floor.","translation":"豪華總統套房鋪設著波斯地毯，地板上鋪著一層厚實柔軟的羊毛地毯。"},{"word":"mat","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small piece of coarse material placed on a floor for wiping shoes","chinese":"地墊；門墊；墊子","sentence":"Before stepping into the Japanese-style living room, visitors wipe the mud off their shoes on the door ______.","translation":"在走進日式客廳之前，訪客會在門墊上擦掉鞋子上的泥土。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"We hired an electrician to install a modern crystal chandelier directly onto the high living room ______.","options":["ceiling","carpet","stove","mat"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ceiling (天花板) 【全文中譯】我們僱用了一名電工，把一盞現代水晶吊燈直接安裝在客廳挑高的天花板上。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) stove 瓦斯爐  (D) mat 地墊。吊燈安裝於 ceiling 上。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Heavy snow accumulated on the slanted wooden ______ of the alpine cottage during the winter storm.","options":["curtain","roof","microwave","dryer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: roof (屋頂) 【全文中譯】在冬季暴風雪期間，大量積雪堆積在高山小屋傾斜的木屋頂上。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) microwave 微波爐  (D) dryer 乾衣機。積雪堆積在 slanted wooden roof。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Sunlight woke the baby early, so mother bought a blackout ______ to keep the nursery dim and quiet.","options":["heater","stove","curtain","oven"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curtain (窗簾) 【全文中譯】陽光很早就把嬰兒吵醒了，所以媽媽買了一副遮光窗簾以保持嬰兒房昏暗寧靜。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖氣  (B) stove 爐子  (C) curtain 窗簾  (D) oven 烤箱。遮光使用 blackout curtain。"},{"number":4,"stem":"If you leave wet towels sitting inside the laundry ______ after the cycle ends, they will develop an unpleasant smell.","options":["ceiling","mat","roof","dryer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dryer (烘衣機) 【全文中譯】如果烘衣循環結束後把濕毛巾留在洗衣烘衣機裡，毛巾會產生難聞的氣味。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) mat 墊子  (C) roof 屋頂  (D) dryer 乾衣機。洗衣烘乾設備為 laundry dryer。"},{"number":5,"stem":"In the cold mountain cabin, our family sat around the kerosene ______ to warm our freezing hands.","options":["heater","carpet","curtain","roof"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: heater (暖氣機；暖爐) 【全文中譯】在寒冷的高山木屋中，我們全家圍坐在煤油暖爐旁溫暖凍僵的雙手。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖爐  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) curtain 窗簾  (D) roof 屋頂。取暖設備為 kerosene heater。"},{"number":6,"stem":"You can defrost that frozen beef steak in three minutes if you use the automatic setting on the ______.","options":["curtain","microwave","mat","ceiling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: microwave (微波爐) 【全文中譯】如果你使用微波爐上的自動設定，可以在三分鐘內解凍那塊冷凍牛排。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) microwave 微波爐  (C) mat 墊子  (D) ceiling 天花板。快速解凍用 microwave。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The pastry chef placed twenty chocolate chip cookies on a baking sheet and slid them into the hot ______.","options":["ceiling","curtain","oven","carpet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: oven (烤箱) 【全文中譯】西點廚師把二十塊巧克力脆片餅乾放在烤盤上，並滑進滾燙的烤箱中。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) curtain 窗簾  (C) oven 烤箱  (D) carpet 地毯。烘烤餅乾使用 hot oven。"},{"number":8,"stem":"A pot of vegetable broth was bubbling gently over the medium flame on the four-burner kitchen ______.","options":["roof","carpet","ceiling","stove"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: stove (瓦斯爐) 【全文中譯】一鍋蔬菜高湯在四口瓦斯爐的中火上微滾冒泡。 【選項解析】(A) roof 屋頂  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) stove 瓦斯爐。瓦斯爐火上煮湯為 kitchen stove。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Walking barefoot across the plush living room ______ feels wonderfully soft during chilly winter mornings.","options":["carpet","roof","ceiling","stove"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: carpet (地毯) 【全文中譯】在寒冷的冬日早晨，赤腳走在客廳厚實柔軟的地毯上感覺無比舒服。 【選項解析】(A) carpet 地毯  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) stove 爐子。赤腳踩在 plush carpet 上。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Please wipe your wet shoes thoroughly on the rubber welcome ______ before entering the classroom.","options":["ceiling","mat","heater","oven"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mat (地墊；門墊) 【全文中譯】在進入教室之前，請在橡膠歡迎門墊上徹底擦乾淨你濕漉漉的鞋子。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) mat 地墊  (C) heater 暖爐  (D) oven 烤箱。擦鞋門墊為 welcome mat。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Water stains began to appear on the white plaster ______ because the bathroom pipe on the floor above was leaking.","options":["carpet","stove","ceiling","mat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ceiling (天花板) 【全文中譯】因為樓上浴室水管漏水，白色灰泥天花板上開始出現水漬。 【選項解析】(A) carpet 地毯  (B) stove 爐子  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) mat 地墊。天花板漏水為 water stains on plaster ceiling。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Solar panels were installed across the south-facing ______ of the school library to generate clean electricity.","options":["curtain","microwave","dryer","roof"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: roof (屋頂) 【全文中譯】學校圖書館朝南的屋頂上安裝了太陽能電池板以產生乾淨的電力。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) microwave 微波爐  (C) dryer 乾衣機  (D) roof 屋頂。屋頂裝太陽能板為 south-facing roof。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The stage actor waited nervously behind the heavy red velvet ______ before walking out to face the crowd.","options":["curtain","stove","oven","heater"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: curtain (舞台布幔；幕布) 【全文中譯】舞台劇演員在厚重紅色天鵝絨布幔後緊張等待，然後才步出舞台面對觀眾。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 舞台布幔  (B) stove 爐子  (C) oven 烤箱  (D) heater 暖爐。舞台簾幕為 velvet curtain。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Hang your delicate silk blouses on a clothesline instead of tossing them into the hot tumbling ______.","options":["ceiling","dryer","roof","mat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dryer (烘乾機) 【全文中譯】把你嬌貴的絲質襯衫掛在曬衣繩上，不要扔進滾燙滾動的烘衣機裡。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) dryer 烘乾機  (C) roof 屋頂  (D) mat 地墊。高溫烘乾設備為 tumbling dryer。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Turn on the bathroom space ______ ten minutes before taking a shower so that the room becomes comfortably warm.","options":["carpet","curtain","heater","roof"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: heater (暖風機) 【全文中譯】在沖澡前十分鐘開啟浴室暖風機，這樣整個房間就會變得溫暖舒適。 【選項解析】(A) carpet 地毯  (B) curtain 窗簾  (C) heater 暖風機  (D) roof 屋頂。浴室加溫器為 bathroom space heater。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Reheating pizza in a ______ makes the cheese melt, but baking it in an oven keeps the crust crispy.","options":["ceiling","roof","mat","microwave"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: microwave (微波爐) 【全文中譯】用微波爐重新加熱披薩能讓起司融化，但在烤箱裡烤能讓餅皮保持酥脆。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) mat 墊子  (D) microwave 微波爐。快速熱融起司使用 microwave。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Don't touch the interior metal racks of the baking ______ without wearing thick heat-resistant mitts.","options":["oven","curtain","carpet","roof"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: oven (烤箱) 【全文中譯】未戴上厚耐熱手套之前，切勿徒手觸碰烘烤烤箱內部的金屬架。 【選項解析】(A) oven 烤箱  (B) curtain 窗簾  (C) carpet 地毯  (D) roof 屋頂。高溫烘焙設備為 baking oven。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Mother placed a large iron tea kettle directly over the gas burner on the stainless steel ______.","options":["roof","stove","ceiling","mat"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stove (瓦斯爐) 【全文中譯】母親將大鐵水壺直接放在不鏽鋼瓦斯爐的燃氣爐頭上。 【選項解析】(A) roof 屋頂  (B) stove 瓦斯爐  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) mat 墊子。爐火加熱水壺在 stainless steel stove。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Red wine spilled across the cream-colored bedroom ______, and it took professional cleaners two hours to remove the stain.","options":["ceiling","stove","carpet","roof"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: carpet (地毯) 【全文中譯】紅酒灑在米色的臥室地毯上，專業清潔工花了兩小時才徹底清除污漬。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) stove 爐子  (C) carpet 地毯  (D) roof 屋頂。地面紡織鋪層為 bedroom carpet。"},{"number":20,"stem":"After getting out of the hot bathtub, step onto the absorbent cotton bath ______ to avoid slipping.","options":["ceiling","roof","heater","mat"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: mat (腳踏墊) 【全文中譯】走出熱水浴缸後，踏在吸水的純棉浴室踏墊上以防滑倒。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) heater 暖氣  (D) mat 腳踏墊。浴室吸水墊為 bath mat。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The tall office building was designed with suspended acoustic panels attached to the high concrete ______.","options":["ceiling","carpet","stove","oven"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: ceiling (天花板) 【全文中譯】這棟高層辦公大樓設計有安裝在挑高混凝土天花板上的吸音隔音板。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) carpet 地毯  (C) stove 爐子  (D) oven 烤箱。挑高混凝土上方為 concrete ceiling。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Firefighters climbed up tall hydraulic ladders to extinguish the flames blazing across the factory ______.","options":["curtain","roof","microwave","dryer"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: roof (屋頂) 【全文中譯】消防隊員爬上高大的雲梯以撲滅在工廠屋頂上熊熊燃燒的烈火。 【選項解析】(A) curtain 窗簾  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) microwave 微波爐  (D) dryer 乾衣機。火勢蔓延於 factory roof。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Pulling back the bedroom ______ revealed a magnificent panorama of the sun rising over the distant mountains.","options":["heater","stove","curtain","mat"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: curtain (窗簾) 【全文中譯】拉開臥室窗簾，遠處群山頂上朝陽升起的壯麗全景展露無遺。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖風機  (B) stove 爐子  (C) curtain 窗簾  (D) mat 墊子。拉開窗簾用 pulling back bedroom curtain。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Clean out the lint filter in your laundry ______ after every single load to prevent a potential fire hazard.","options":["ceiling","roof","carpet","dryer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: dryer (乾衣機) 【全文中譯】每次烘乾後請清除乾衣機內的棉絮濾網，以防止潛在的火災危險。 【選項解析】(A) ceiling 天花板  (B) roof 屋頂  (C) carpet 地毯  (D) dryer 乾衣機。清除濾網為 laundry dryer。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When winter storms knock out municipal power, our neighbors rely on a wood-burning ______ for warmth.","options":["heater","mat","ceiling","curtain"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: heater (火爐；暖氣機) 【全文中譯】當冬日暴風雨切斷市政電力時，我們的鄰居仰賴燃木火爐來獲取溫暖。 【選項解析】(A) heater 暖氣/火爐  (B) mat 墊子  (C) ceiling 天花板  (D) curtain 窗簾。供暖設備為 wood-burning heater。"}]},{"unit":18,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 18 (018.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Furniture, Bedding & Bathroom Hardware | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"bench","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a long seat for several people, typically made of wood or stone","chinese":"長凳；長椅","sentence":"The elderly couple sat quietly on a wooden park ______ to rest and feed the pigeons under the oak tree.","translation":"那對老夫婦靜靜地坐在公園木長椅上休息，並在橡樹下餵食鴿子。"},{"word":"armchair","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a comfortable chair with supports for the arms","chinese":"單人扶手沙發椅","sentence":"Grandfather settled into his leather ______ with a cup of hot tea to read the evening newspaper.","translation":"祖父坐在他的皮質單人扶手椅裡，喝著熱茶閱讀晚報。"},{"word":"pillow","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a soft cushion used to support the head during sleep","chinese":"枕頭","sentence":"I was so exhausted after hiking up the mountain that my eyes closed the moment my head touched the ______.","translation":"登山健行後我筋疲力竭，以至於我的頭一碰到枕頭眼睛就閉上了。"},{"word":"sheet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a large piece of cotton or linen used on a bed; a broad thin piece","chinese":"床單；一張薄紙/板","sentence":"Mother laundered the bed linen every Saturday morning and spread a clean white cotton ______ across the mattress.","translation":"母親每週六早晨洗滌寢具，並在床墊上鋪上一張乾淨的白色純棉床單。"},{"word":"blanket","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick piece of woolen or warm material used as a bed covering","chinese":"毛毯；厚毯子","sentence":"The mountain night was bitterly cold, so the camp counselor handed each student an extra wool ______.","translation":"山裡的夜晚寒冷徹骨，所以營隊輔導員給每位學生分發了一條額外的羊毛毯。"},{"word":"sink (sink / sank / sunk)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a fixed basin with a water supply; to go down below surface","chinese":"水槽；下沉；沉沒","sentence":"Before preparing dinner, the chef washed his hands with soap and cleaned the fresh vegetables in the kitchen ______.","translation":"在準備晚餐前，廚師用肥皂洗手並在廚房水槽清洗新鮮蔬菜。"},{"word":"tub","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a wide, open container used especially for taking a bath","chinese":"浴缸；桶","sentence":"After running a twenty-kilometer race in the rain, Samuel soaked his sore muscles in a warm bath ______.","translation":"在雨中跑完二十公里賽跑後，塞繆爾在溫暖的浴缸中浸泡舒緩痠痛的肌肉。"},{"word":"mirror","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a reflective glass surface used for viewing one's appearance","chinese":"鏡子","sentence":"The actor stood backstage in front of the illuminated dressing ______ to make sure his costume was perfect.","translation":"演員站在後台有照明的更衣梳妝鏡前，確保他的戲服完美無瑕。"},{"word":"faucet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a device by which a flow of liquid from a pipe is controlled","chinese":"水龍頭","sentence":"To conserve water during the dry season, always remember to turn off the bathroom ______ while brushing teeth.","translation":"為了在乾季節約用水，刷牙時請務必記得關緊浴室水龍頭。"},{"word":"bucket","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cylindrical vessel used for carrying liquids or materials","chinese":"提桶；水桶","sentence":"The janitor filled a yellow plastic ______ with soapy water to mop the classroom hallway floor.","translation":"工友在黃色塑膠水桶裡裝滿肥皂水，以拖洗教室走廊的地板。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"We rested our tired legs on a shaded stone ______ overlooking the botanical lotus pond.","options":["bench","pillow","faucet","sink"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bench (長凳；長椅) 【全文中譯】我們在俯瞰植物園蓮花池的石長椅上休息疲憊的雙腿。 【選項解析】(A) bench 長凳  (B) pillow 枕頭  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) sink 水槽。戶外休息處為 stone bench。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The tired businessman collapsed into the soft velvet ______ by the fireplace and fell asleep.","options":["bucket","armchair","tub","sheet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: armchair (單人扶手椅) 【全文中譯】疲累的商人倒在壁爐旁柔軟的天鵝絨單人扶手椅裡睡著了。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) tub 浴缸  (D) sheet 床單。壁爐旁個人座椅為 velvet armchair。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Sleeping on an ergonomic feather ______ helps support your neck and prevents morning stiffness.","options":["faucet","bucket","pillow","bench"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pillow (枕頭) 【全文中譯】睡在人體工學羽絨枕上有助於支撐頸部，防止晨起頸部僵硬。 【選項解析】(A) faucet 水龍頭  (B) bucket 水桶  (C) pillow 枕頭  (D) bench 長椅。頸部支撐寢具為 feather pillow。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Mother ironed the freshly washed linen ______ before tucking it neatly under the hotel mattress.","options":["sink","armchair","faucet","sheet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sheet (床單) 【全文中譯】母親熨燙了剛洗好的亞麻床單，然後整齊地塞入飯店床墊下。 【選項解析】(A) sink 水槽  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) sheet 床單。鋪在床墊上的為 linen sheet。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When freezing blizzards hit the cabin, we wrapped ourselves in a thick knitted ______ on the couch.","options":["blanket","sink","bucket","bench"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blanket (毛毯) 【全文中譯】當刺骨的暴風雪襲擊木屋時，我們在沙發上將自己裹在厚針織毯裡。 【選項解析】(A) blanket 毛毯  (B) sink 水槽  (C) bucket 水桶  (D) bench 長椅。禦寒裹身用 thick knitted blanket。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Please place all dirty plates and coffee mugs into the stainless steel kitchen ______ to be washed.","options":["armchair","sink","blanket","pillow"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sink (水槽) 【全文中譯】請把所有髒盤子和咖啡杯放進廚房不鏽鋼水槽裡等待清洗。 【選項解析】(A) armchair 扶手椅  (B) sink 水槽  (C) blanket 毛毯  (D) pillow 枕頭。洗碗槽為 kitchen sink。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The mother filled the ceramic ______ with warm water and bubbles so her toddler could take a fun bath.","options":["bench","sheet","tub","faucet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tub (浴缸) 【全文中譯】母親在陶瓷浴缸裡放滿溫水和泡泡，讓幼兒能洗個好玩的澡。 【選項解析】(A) bench 長椅  (B) sheet 床單  (C) tub 浴缸  (D) faucet 水龍頭。泡澡容器為 ceramic bath tub。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The girl looked at her reflection in the full-length bedroom ______ while trying on her prom dress.","options":["bucket","blanket","sink","mirror"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: mirror (鏡子) 【全文中譯】女孩試穿畢業舞會禮服時，看著臥室全身鏡中的自己倒影。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) blanket 毛毯  (C) sink 水槽  (D) mirror 鏡子。全身穿衣鏡為 full-length mirror。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Call a plumber right away because the leaky chrome ______ in the guest bathroom has been dripping all night.","options":["faucet","blanket","sheet","bench"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: faucet (水龍頭) 【全文中譯】立刻打電話叫水電工，因為客用浴室裡漏水的鉻合金水龍頭滴了一整晚。 【選項解析】(A) faucet 水龍頭  (B) blanket 毛毯  (C) sheet 床單  (D) bench 長椅。滴水的管件為 leaky faucet。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The firefighter carried a heavy metal ______ of sand to extinguish the small chemical flame.","options":["pillow","bucket","sheet","armchair"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: bucket (水桶；提桶) 【全文中譯】消防隊員提著一金屬桶沙子，以撲滅微小的化學火焰。 【選項解析】(A) pillow 枕頭  (B) bucket 提桶  (C) sheet 床單  (D) armchair 扶手椅。提裝沙子用 metal bucket。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After hiking five miles through the forest, the couple sat down on a rustic wooden ______ to drink water.","options":["sheet","sink","bench","faucet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bench (長凳) 【全文中譯】在穿越森林健行五英里後，這對伴侶在一張質樸的木長椅上坐下喝水。 【選項解析】(A) sheet 床單  (B) sink 水槽  (C) bench 長凳  (D) faucet 水龍頭。健行休憩坐在 rustic wooden bench。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Grandmother enjoys knitting sweaters while sitting comfortably in her favorite reclining ______.","options":["bucket","tub","pillow","armchair"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: armchair (單人扶手椅) 【全文中譯】祖母喜歡舒適地坐在她最喜歡的躺椅式單人扶手椅裡織毛衣。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) tub 浴缸  (C) pillow 枕頭  (D) armchair 扶手椅。單人斜躺椅為 reclining armchair。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The little boy had a playful fight with his sister using a fluffy feather ______ on the bed.","options":["pillow","faucet","sink","bench"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pillow (枕頭) 【全文中譯】小男孩在床上用蓬鬆的羽毛枕頭和他的妹妹展開了嬉戲打鬧。 【選項解析】(A) pillow 枕頭  (B) faucet 水龍頭  (C) sink 水槽  (D) bench 長椅。枕頭戰為 fluffy feather pillow fight。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The teacher handed each student a clean ______ of blank paper to write their creative poetry assignment.","options":["tub","sheet","armchair","bucket"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sheet (一張) 【全文中譯】老師分發給每位學生一張乾淨的空白紙，供他們書寫創意詩歌作業。 【選項解析】(A) tub 桶  (B) sheet 一張紙  (C) armchair 扶手椅  (D) bucket 水桶。a clean sheet of blank paper（一張白紙）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The homeless shelter collected hundreds of thermal ______ to distribute to people during the cold wave.","options":["faucets","sinks","blankets","benches"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: blanket (保暖毯) 【全文中譯】遊民收容所募集了數百條保暖毯，準備在寒流期間分發給民眾。 【選項解析】(A) faucets 水龍頭  (B) sinks 水槽  (C) blankets 保暖毯  (D) benches 長椅。寒流發送物資為 thermal blankets。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Soap scum accumulated around the porcelain bathroom ______ because no one had cleaned it for weeks.","options":["armchair","pillow","sheet","sink"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sink (洗手槽) 【全文中譯】陶瓷浴室水槽周圍積滿了肥皂垢，因為已經好幾週沒人清理了。 【選項解析】(A) armchair 扶手椅  (B) pillow 枕頭  (C) sheet 床單  (D) sink 洗手槽。浴室洗臉槽為 porcelain bathroom sink。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After a stressful day at the office, relaxing in a hot scented ______ helps relieve physical tension.","options":["tub","bench","faucet","mirror"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tub (浴缸) 【全文中譯】在辦公室度過充滿壓力的一天後，在熱香氛浴缸裡放鬆能舒緩身體緊繃。 【選項解析】(A) tub 浴缸  (B) bench 長凳  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) mirror 鏡子。泡香氛熱水澡在 hot scented tub。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The driver adjusted his rear-view ______ carefully before backing the minivan out of the tight driveway.","options":["bucket","mirror","blanket","sheet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mirror (後視鏡) 【全文中譯】在將休旅車倒出狹窄車道前，駕駛仔細調整了他的車內後視鏡。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) mirror 鏡子  (C) blanket 毛毯  (D) sheet 床單。後照鏡為 rear-view mirror。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Don't leave the garden ______ running while you answer the phone, or you will waste gallons of water.","options":["pillow","armchair","faucet","sheet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: faucet (水龍頭) 【全文中譯】接聽電話時不要讓花園水龍頭一直開著流水，否則會浪費數加侖水資源。 【選項解析】(A) pillow 枕頭  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) sheet 床單。戶外龍頭為 garden faucet。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The little boy took his colorful plastic shovel and ______ to build sandcastles along the seaside beach.","options":["sheet","mirror","bench","bucket"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: bucket (小水桶) 【全文中譯】小男孩拿著他色彩繽紛的塑膠小鏟子和水桶，在海邊沙灘上建造沙堡。 【選項解析】(A) sheet 床單  (B) mirror 鏡子  (C) bench 長椅  (D) bucket 水桶。沙灘玩沙玩具為 shovel and bucket。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Tourists sat on the green park ______ to eat takeout sandwiches and enjoy the afternoon sunshine.","options":["bench","faucet","sink","pillow"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bench (長椅) 【全文中譯】觀光客坐在綠色公園長椅上吃外帶三明治，享受午後陽光照拂。 【選項解析】(A) bench 長椅  (B) faucet 水龍頭  (C) sink 水槽  (D) pillow 枕頭。公園長椅為 green park bench。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Father rested his weary head against the cushioned back of the antique ______ and watched television.","options":["tub","armchair","bucket","sheet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: armchair (單人沙發椅) 【全文中譯】父親把疲憊的頭靠在古董單人沙發椅的軟墊靠背上看電視。 【選項解析】(A) tub 浴缸  (B) armchair 單人椅  (C) bucket 水桶  (D) sheet 床單。古董單人扶手沙發為 antique armchair。"},{"number":23,"stem":"If you wake up with neck pain every day, you probably need a firmer orthopedic ______.","options":["bucket","faucet","pillow","sink"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pillow (枕頭) 【全文中譯】如果你每天醒來都脖子痛，你可能需要一個更堅挺的人體工學枕頭。 【選項解析】(A) bucket 水桶  (B) faucet 水龍頭  (C) pillow 枕頭  (D) sink 水槽。支撐頸椎的枕頭為 firmer orthopedic pillow。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Housekeeping staff at the resort replace the cotton bed ______ after each guest checks out of the room.","options":["faucet","armchair","tub","sheet"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sheet (床單) 【全文中譯】度假村的房務人員在每位房客退房之後都會更換棉質床單。 【選項解析】(A) faucet 水龍頭  (B) armchair 扶手椅  (C) tub 浴缸  (D) sheet 床單。換洗床單為 cotton bed sheet。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Even during chilly autumn evenings, wrapping a warm fleece ______ over your legs keeps you cozy outdoors.","options":["blanket","sink","faucet","mirror"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: blanket (刷毛毯) 【全文中譯】即使在涼颼颼的秋日傍晚，在雙腿上披一條溫暖的刷毛毯能讓你在戶外保持舒適。 【選項解析】(A) blanket 毛毯  (B) sink 水槽  (C) faucet 水龍頭  (D) mirror 鏡子。蓋在腿上的保暖被為 warm fleece blanket。"}]},{"unit":19,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 19 (019.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Household Hardware, Lighting & Everyday Gadgets | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"toilet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a fixed bowl with a seat and water flush system used for urination and defecation","chinese":"抽水馬桶；洗手間","sentence":"When traveling on a long-distance express train, you can find a clean public ______ at either end of the carriage.","translation":"在長途特快車上旅行時，你可以在車廂的任一端找到一間乾淨的公用洗手間（抽水馬桶）。"},{"word":"candle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cylinder of wax with a central wick burned to provide light or fragrance","chinese":"蠟燭","sentence":"When the sudden thunderstorm caused a blackout across the neighborhood, grandmother lit a scented ______ on the dining table.","translation":"當突如其來的雷雨導致整個社區停電時，祖母在餐桌上點燃了一支香氛蠟燭。"},{"word":"flashlight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a portable handheld battery-powered electric lamp","chinese":"手電筒","sentence":"The security guard carried a heavy-duty LED ______ while patrolling the dark warehouse grounds at midnight.","translation":"警衛在半夜巡邏黑暗的倉庫廠區時，手裡拿著一支高功率的LED手電筒。"},{"word":"needle","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very thin pointed steel tool with an eye for thread used in sewing","chinese":"縫紉針；指針","sentence":"Aunt Mary threaded a sharp steel ______ carefully before mending the torn sleeve on her husband's wool jacket.","translation":"瑪麗姑姑在修補丈夫羊毛夾克上破損的袖子之前，小心翼翼地穿好了一根鋒利的鋼縫紉針。"},{"word":"pin (pin / pinned / pinned)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a tiny thin piece of metal used for fastening clothes or paper","chinese":"大頭針；別針；別住","sentence":"The tailor used a sharp silver ______ to hold the pant cuff in place before he began sewing the hem.","translation":"裁縫師在開始縫製褲管邊緣之前，用一枚鋒利的銀色別針把褲腳固定在原位。"},{"word":"hanger","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a curved piece of wood, metal, or plastic on which clothes are hung","chinese":"衣架","sentence":"Please hang your damp winter raincoat neatly on a sturdy wooden ______ instead of throwing it over the couch.","translation":"請把你潮濕的冬季雨衣整齊掛在堅固的木衣架上，不要隨手扔在沙發上。"},{"word":"lock (lock / locked / locked)","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a mechanism for keeping a door secure; to fasten with a key","chinese":"門鎖；上鎖","sentence":"Before our family leaves the house for a long vacation, father always checks that the front door ______ is secure.","translation":"在我們全家出門度長假之前，父親總是會檢查前門門鎖是否已經鎖好牢固。"},{"word":"freezer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a refrigerated cabinet or room preserved at below freezing temperatures","chinese":"冷凍庫；冷凍櫃","sentence":"Mother bought two large tubs of vanilla ice cream and placed them immediately inside the kitchen ______ to keep firm.","translation":"母親買了兩大桶香草冰淇淋，並立刻放進廚房冷凍庫以保持硬度。"},{"word":"recorder","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an apparatus for recording sound or visual signals digitally or on tape","chinese":"錄音機；記錄器；直笛","sentence":"The university journalist placed a digital audio ______ on the interview table to capture every word accurately.","translation":"大學校刊記者在訪談桌上放了一台數位錄音機，以便準確記錄下每一個字。"},{"word":"video","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the recording, reproducing, or broadcasting of moving visual images","chinese":"影片；錄影；錄製影片","sentence":"During my sister's high school graduation ceremony, my proud father recorded the entire event on digital ______.","translation":"在我姊姊的高中畢業典禮上，我引以為傲的父親用數位影片記錄下了整場活動。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Excuse me, could you tell me where the nearest public ______ is located in this department store?","options":["toilet","candle","needle","lock"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toilet (洗手間；馬桶) 【全文中譯】不好意思，你能告訴我這家百貨公司最近的公用洗手間在哪裡嗎？ 【選項解析】(A) toilet 洗手間  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) needle 針  (D) lock 門鎖。百貨公司公廁為 public toilet。"},{"number":2,"stem":"On her ninth birthday, the birthday girl made a silent wish and blew out all nine ______ on the cake.","options":["toilets","candles","needles","freezers"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: candle (蠟燭) 【全文中譯】在她九歲生日那天，壽星默默許了願，吹熄了蛋糕上全部的九支蠟燭。 【選項解析】(A) toilets 馬桶  (B) candles 蠟燭  (C) needles 針  (D) freezers 冷凍櫃。蛋糕上吹熄 candles。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The campers walked through the dense woods at midnight using a battery-powered ______ to illuminate the trail.","options":["hanger","needle","flashlight","lock"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flashlight (手電筒) 【全文中譯】露營者在半夜穿越茂密森林，使用電池供電的手電筒照亮山徑。 【選項解析】(A) hanger 衣架  (B) needle 針  (C) flashlight 手電筒  (D) lock 門鎖。夜晚照亮路徑使用 flashlight。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Grandma put on her reading glasses so that she could thread the tiny eye of the sewing ______.","options":["candle","toilet","freezer","needle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: needle (縫紉針) 【全文中譯】祖母戴上老花眼鏡，這樣她才能把線穿過縫紉針細小的針眼。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) freezer 冷凍庫  (D) needle 縫紉針。針眼穿線為 eye of the sewing needle。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The doctor fastened the paper name tag to the lapel of her white coat using a small gold safety ______.","options":["pin","toilet","freezer","candle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pin (別針) 【全文中譯】女醫生用一枚小金安全別針，把紙質名牌別在她白袍的翻領上。 【選項解析】(A) pin 別針  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) freezer 冷凍櫃  (D) candle 蠟燭。別名牌使用 safety pin。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Don't leave your tailored suit crumpled on the desk; suspend it neatly upon a plastic coat ______.","options":["candle","hanger","needle","toilet"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hanger (衣架) 【全文中譯】不要把你的合身西裝皺巴巴地丟在桌上，整齊地吊掛在塑膠衣架上吧。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) hanger 衣架  (C) needle 針  (D) toilet 馬桶。掛衣服用 coat hanger。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Make sure to turn the brass key twice to secure the deadbolt ______ on the main entrance door.","options":["candle","needle","lock","freezer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: lock (門鎖) 【全文中譯】請務必轉動黃銅鑰匙兩圈，以確保大門上的固定鎖栓鎖牢固。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) needle 針  (C) lock 門鎖  (D) freezer 冷凍櫃。鑰匙上鎖為 deadbolt lock。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Keep raw salmon and meat dumplings frozen at minus twenty degrees inside the deep ______.","options":["toilet","candle","needle","freezer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: freezer (冷凍庫) 【全文中譯】將生鮭魚和生肉水餃放在深度冷凍櫃中，保持在零下二十度冰凍。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) needle 針  (D) freezer 冷凍庫。維持零下20度低溫為 deep freezer。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The detective pressed the record button on his pocket voice ______ to save the witness statement.","options":["recorder","candle","toilet","needle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: recorder (錄音機) 【全文中譯】刑警按下口袋錄音機上的錄音鍵，以完整保存目擊者的證詞。 【選項解析】(A) recorder 錄音機  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) needle 針。存證錄音使用 voice recorder。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Millions of students watch educational science ______ on YouTube to help them review difficult exam concepts.","options":["candles","videos","needles","toilets"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: video (影片) 【全文中譯】數百萬名學生在YouTube上觀看自然科學教育影片，協助複習難懂的考試觀念。 【選項解析】(A) candles 蠟燭  (B) videos 影片  (C) needles 針  (D) toilets 馬桶。網路觀看教學影片為 educational science videos。"},{"number":11,"stem":"After using the private restroom, remember to push the handle downward to flush the porcelain ______.","options":["candle","needle","toilet","lock"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: toilet (抽水馬桶) 【全文中譯】使用完私人洗手間後，記得將把手往下壓以沖洗陶瓷馬桶。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) needle 針  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) lock 門鎖。沖水馬桶為 flush the porcelain toilet。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The romantic restaurant set a flickering wax ______ in a glass holder on every single dining table.","options":["toilet","needle","freezer","candle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: candle (蠟燭) 【全文中譯】這家浪漫餐廳在每張餐桌的玻璃燭台裡都擺了一支閃爍的蠟燭。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) needle 針  (C) freezer 冷凍櫃  (D) candle 蠟燭。餐桌氣氛點燃 wax candle。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Always keep a spare ______ and extra alkaline batteries in your car's emergency glove compartment.","options":["flashlight","toilet","needle","hanger"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: flashlight (手電筒) 【全文中譯】請隨時在車子的緊急手套箱中備有一支備用手電筒和多餘的鹼性電池。 【選項解析】(A) flashlight 手電筒  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) needle 針  (D) hanger 衣架。緊急照明必備 spare flashlight。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A nurse cleaned the sharp hypodermic ______ with rubbing alcohol before administering the annual flu vaccine.","options":["toilet","needle","candle","lock"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: needle (注射針頭) 【全文中譯】護理師在施打年度流感疫苗之前，先用消毒酒精擦拭鋒利的皮下注射針頭。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) needle 注射針頭  (C) candle 蠟燭  (D) lock 門鎖。醫用針頭為 hypodermic needle。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The teacher used a colorful thumb ______ to attach the class field trip schedule to the cork noticeboard.","options":["toilet","candle","pin","freezer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pin (圖釘) 【全文中譯】老師用一枚彩色圖釘把班級校外教學日程表固定在軟木公告欄上。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) pin 圖釘  (D) freezer 冷凍櫃。固定紙張於軟木板用 thumb pin。"},{"number":16,"stem":"There were no empty coat ______ left in the restaurant cloakroom, so the waiter folded my jacket over a chair.","options":["toilets","needles","candles","hangers"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hanger (衣架) 【全文中譯】餐廳寄物處沒有多餘的衣架了，所以服務生把我的夾克折疊放在椅子上。 【選項解析】(A) toilets 馬桶  (B) needles 針  (C) candles 蠟燭  (D) hangers 衣架。寄物懸掛使用 coat hangers。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A thief tried to pick the heavy iron pad ______ with a bent metal wire, but the security alarm sounded.","options":["lock","candle","toilet","needle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lock (鎖頭；掛鎖) 【全文中譯】小偷試圖用彎曲金屬線撬開笨重的鐵掛鎖，但安全警報器響了。 【選項解析】(A) lock 掛鎖  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) needle 針。被撬開的五金為 pad lock。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Ice cream and frozen popsicles will melt into sticky liquid if you fail to store them in the ______.","options":["candle","freezer","toilet","needle"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: freezer (冷凍庫) 【全文中譯】如果你沒把冰淇淋和冰棒放進冷凍庫裡保存，它們會融化成黏稠的液體。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) freezer 冷凍庫  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) needle 針。防融化置於 freezer。"},{"number":19,"stem":"In elementary school music class, all fourth-grade children learn how to play simple songs on a plastic ______.","options":["toilet","candle","recorder","needle"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: recorder (直笛) 【全文中譯】在國小音樂課上，所有四年級的孩子都會學習如何在塑膠直笛上吹奏簡單歌曲。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) recorder 直笛  (D) needle 針。學校吹奏樂器為 plastic recorder。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The police reviewed the security camera surveillance ______ to identify the vehicle involved in the hit-and-run.","options":["candle","needle","toilet","video"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: video (錄影片段) 【全文中譯】警方調閱監視攝影機的監控錄影畫面，以辨識涉及肇事逃逸的車輛。 【選項解析】(A) candle 蠟燭  (B) needle 針  (C) toilet 馬桶  (D) video 錄影畫面。監視器影像為 surveillance video。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The airline flight attendant reminded passengers that smoking inside the aircraft ______ is strictly prohibited by law.","options":["toilet","needle","candle","lock"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: toilet (洗手間) 【全文中譯】飛機空服員提醒旅客，法律嚴格禁止在飛機洗手間內吸菸。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 洗手間  (B) needle 針  (C) candle 蠟燭  (D) lock 門鎖。飛機上洗手間為 aircraft toilet。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Scented lavender ______ emit a calming aroma that helps soothe insomnia before going to sleep at night.","options":["toilets","candles","needles","locks"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: candle (香氛蠟燭) 【全文中譯】薰衣草香氛蠟燭能散發舒緩香氣，有助於在夜晚入睡前撫平失眠。 【選項解析】(A) toilets 馬桶  (B) candles 蠟燭  (C) needles 針  (D) locks 門鎖。放鬆薰香點燃 scented lavender candles。"},{"number":23,"stem":"When our fuse box tripped during the thunderstorm, dad reached into the drawer for a reliable ______.","options":["needle","toilet","flashlight","hanger"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flashlight (手電筒) 【全文中譯】暴風雨中保險絲跳電時，爸爸伸手到抽屜裡拿出一支可靠的手電筒。 【選項解析】(A) needle 針  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) flashlight 手電筒  (D) hanger 衣架。停電備用照明為 reliable flashlight。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Searching for a missing sewing ______ on a shaggy carpet is very difficult and dangerous for bare feet.","options":["toilet","candle","lock","needle"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: needle (縫紉針) 【全文中譯】在長毛地毯上尋找掉落的縫紉針非常困難，而且對赤腳來說非常危險。 【選項解析】(A) toilet 馬桶  (B) candle 蠟燭  (C) lock 門鎖  (D) needle 縫紉針。掉落的尖銳金屬是 sewing needle。"},{"number":25,"stem":"When the customer bought a dress, the cashier attached the paper price tag with a small metal ______.","options":["pin","toilet","freezer","candle"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: pin (別針) 【全文中譯】當顧客買下洋裝時，收銀員用一枚小金屬別針將紙質價格標籤固定好。 【選項解析】(A) pin 別針  (B) toilet 馬桶  (C) freezer 冷凍庫  (D) candle 蠟燭。固定標籤使用 small metal pin。"}]},{"unit":20,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 20 (020.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Sports, Leisure Activities & Camping Recreation | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"activity","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thing that a person or group does or has done","chinese":"活動","sentence":"The summer camp offered many exciting outdoor ______ such as kayaking, rock climbing, and forest hiking.","translation":"夏令營提供了許多令人興奮的戶外活動，例如划皮艇、攀岩以及森林健行。"},{"word":"badminton","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a court game played with lightweight rackets and a shuttlecock","chinese":"羽毛球運動","sentence":"After finishing classes on Friday afternoon, Kevin and his classmate played three intense games of ______.","translation":"星期五下午放學後，凱文和他的同學在體育館打了三場激烈的羽毛球比賽。"},{"word":"bowling","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a game in which players roll a heavy ball down a wooden lane to knock down pins","chinese":"保齡球運動","sentence":"For my brother's sixteenth birthday celebration, we booked two lanes at the downtown ______ alley.","translation":"為了慶祝我弟弟的十六歲生日，我們在市中心的保齡球館預訂了兩個球道。"},{"word":"football","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a game played with an oval ball on an outdoor field; American football or soccer","chinese":"美式足球；橄欖球；足球","sentence":"High school students gathered at the outdoor stadium on Friday night to cheer for their varsity ______ team.","translation":"高中生們週五晚上聚集在戶外體育場，為他們的學校美式足球代表隊加油吶喊。"},{"word":"frisbee","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a plastic flying disc thrown for recreation or in competitive team sports","chinese":"飛盤","sentence":"On sunny Saturday afternoons, dog owners gather in the riverside park and toss a bright plastic ______ to their pets.","translation":"在陽光明媚的週六午後，養狗人士聚集在河濱公園，向他們的寵物拋擲鮮豔的塑膠飛盤。"},{"word":"golf","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a club-and-ball sport played across an outdoor course of 9 or 18 holes","chinese":"高爾夫球","sentence":"My retired grandfather plays eighteen holes of ______ every Wednesday morning with his former business partners.","translation":"我退休的祖父每週三早上都會與他以前的商業夥伴打十八洞高爾夫球。"},{"word":"soccer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a football game played between two teams of eleven players with a round ball","chinese":"足球（英式足球）","sentence":"During the FIFA World Cup tournament, millions of passionate fans watch their national ______ team on television.","translation":"在國際足協世界盃錦標賽期間，數以百萬計的熱情球迷在電視機前觀看他們的國家足球隊比賽。"},{"word":"volleyball","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a team game played by hitting an inflated ball back and forth over a high net","chinese":"排球","sentence":"During their summer vacation at Kenting, the teenagers enjoyed playing beach ______ under the blue sky.","translation":"在墾丁放暑假期間，青少年們在藍天下的沙灘上盡情享受打沙灘排球的樂趣。"},{"word":"tent","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a portable shelter made of fabric supported by poles and ropes","chinese":"帳篷","sentence":"Before the mountain rainstorm arrived, the hikers pitched their waterproof canvas ______ on high ground.","translation":"在山區暴風雨來臨之前，登山者們在高地上搭起了他們的防水帆布帳篷。"},{"word":"chess","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a strategic board game for two players played on a checkered board with sixteen pieces each","chinese":"西洋棋；國際象棋","sentence":"Grandmaster players must think three or four moves ahead when competing in a national ______ championship.","translation":"國際特級大師在參加全國西洋棋錦標賽時，必須提前深思熟慮三到四步棋。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Regular physical ______ such as jogging and swimming helps keep your heart healthy and reduces stress.","options":["activity","tent","frisbee","chess"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: activity (活動) 【全文中譯】慢跑和游泳等規律的身體活動有助於保持心臟健康並減輕壓力。 【選項解析】(A) activity 活動  (B) tent 帳篷  (C) frisbee 飛盤  (D) chess 西洋棋。身體活動為 physical activity。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Samuel bought a professional carbon-fiber racket and a tube of goose feather shuttlecocks for ______.","options":["football","badminton","bowling","golf"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: badminton (羽毛球) 【全文中譯】塞繆爾買了一支專業碳纖維球拍和一筒鵝毛羽毛球來打羽球。 【選項解析】(A) football 美式足球  (B) badminton 羽毛球  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。羽球器材為 shuttlecock for badminton。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When you roll the heavy ball down the polished lane and knock down all ten pins in ______, you score a strike.","options":["soccer","chess","bowling","golf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bowling (保齡球) 【全文中譯】當你在保齡球運動中將重球滾下磨光球道並擊倒所有十個球瓶時，就是全倒。 【選項解析】(A) soccer 足球  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。擊倒十瓶為 bowling strike。"},{"number":4,"stem":"In American high schools, playing on the varsity ______ team is considered a great athletic achievement.","options":["chess","tent","activity","football"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: football (美式足球) 【全文中譯】在美國高中，加入學校美式足球代表隊被視為一項重大的體育成就。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) tent 帳篷  (C) activity 活動  (D) football 美式足球。學校校隊為 varsity football team。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The border collie jumped two feet into the air to catch the spinning yellow plastic ______ with its teeth.","options":["frisbee","golf","bowling","chess"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: frisbee (飛盤) 【全文中譯】這隻邊境牧羊犬躍入空中兩英尺高，用牙齒接住了旋轉的黃色塑膠飛盤。 【選項解析】(A) frisbee 飛盤  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) chess 西洋棋。空中旋轉拋接玩具為 plastic frisbee。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Wealthy executives often conduct informal business negotiations while walking across a green ______ course.","options":["chess","golf","badminton","volleyball"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: golf (高爾夫球) 【全文中譯】富裕的企業主管經常在漫步走過翠綠的高爾夫球場時進行非正式商業談判。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) badminton 羽毛球  (D) volleyball 排球。綠草球場為 golf course。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The Brazilian athlete kicked the black-and-white ball into the top corner of the goal net during the ______ match.","options":["bowling","golf","soccer","chess"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: soccer (足球) 【全文中譯】巴西運動員在足球比賽中將黑白相間的皮球踢進球門網的上角得分。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) soccer 足球  (D) chess 西洋棋。黑白皮球踢進球門為 soccer match。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Two teams of six players dive across the indoor court to prevent the leather ball from hitting the floor in ______.","options":["chess","golf","tent","volleyball"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: volleyball (排球) 【全文中譯】在排球運動中，兩支各六人的隊伍在室內球場奮力撲救，防止皮球落水。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) tent 帳篷  (D) volleyball 排球。隔網擊球為 volleyball。"},{"number":9,"stem":"We hammered four steel pegs firmly into the soil to prevent our camping ______ from blowing away in the wind.","options":["tent","chess","activity","bowling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tent (帳篷) 【全文中譯】我們將四根鋼營釘牢固敲進泥土中，以防止露營帳篷在狂風中被吹走。 【選項解析】(A) tent 帳篷  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) activity 活動  (D) bowling 保齡球。防風固定為 camping tent。"},{"number":10,"stem":"In the ancient strategic board game of ______, the ultimate objective is to trap and checkmate the opponent's king.","options":["golf","chess","soccer","football"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: chess (西洋棋) 【全文中譯】在古老的策略棋盤遊戲西洋棋中，最終目標是困住並將死對手的國王。 【選項解析】(A) golf 高爾夫  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) soccer 足球  (D) football 美式足球。圍困將死國王為 game of chess。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Physical education teachers organize a variety of group sports ______ to keep elementary students active.","options":["tents","frisbees","activities","golfs"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: activity (活動) 【全文中譯】體育老師組織各種團體體育活動，讓小學生保持活躍好動。 【選項解析】(A) tents 帳篷  (B) frisbees 飛盤  (C) activities 活動  (D) golfs 高爾夫。運動項目為 group sports activities。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Hit the shuttlecock firmly over the high net with your racket so that your ______ opponent cannot return it.","options":["bowling","chess","golf","badminton"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: badminton (羽毛球) 【全文中譯】用球拍用力將羽毛球擊過高網，讓你的羽毛球對手無法回擊。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) badminton 羽毛球。羽毛球運動對手為 badminton opponent。"},{"number":13,"stem":"You must put on special leather-soled shoes before stepping onto the polished wooden floor of the ______ alley.","options":["bowling","football","chess","tent"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: bowling (保齡球) 【全文中譯】在踩上磨光木地板的保齡球球道之前，你必須先換上專用皮底鞋。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) football 美式足球  (C) chess 西洋棋  (D) tent 帳篷。保齡球場館為 bowling alley。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The quarterback threw a fifty-yard touchdown pass in the final seconds of the championship ______ game.","options":["golf","football","chess","bowling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: football (美式足球) 【全文中譯】四分衛在冠軍美式足球賽的最後幾秒投擲了一記五十碼的達陣傳球。 【選項解析】(A) golf 高爾夫  (B) football 美式足球  (C) chess 西洋棋  (D) bowling 保齡球。四分衛傳球達陣為 football game。"},{"number":15,"stem":"College students relaxing on the campus lawn enjoyed throwing a neon orange ______ back and forth in the breeze.","options":["bowling","golf","frisbee","tent"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: frisbee (飛盤) 【全文中譯】在校園草坪上放鬆的大學生們享受在微風中來回拋擲螢光橘色飛盤。 【選項解析】(A) bowling 保齡球  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) frisbee 飛盤  (D) tent 帳篷。草地上拋接玩具為 neon orange frisbee。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Players carry a set of fourteen metal and wooden clubs inside a heavy leather bag across the ______ course.","options":["chess","soccer","volleyball","golf"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: golf (高爾夫球) 【全文中譯】球員們在高爾夫球場上背著裝有一套十四支金屬與木質球桿的重皮袋。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) soccer 足球  (C) volleyball 排球  (D) golf 高爾夫。十四支球桿為 golf course 規則。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Referees blow their whistles and show yellow caution cards whenever a ______ player commits a dangerous sliding tackle.","options":["soccer","chess","bowling","golf"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: soccer (足球) 【全文中譯】每當足球員做出危險的鏟球動作時，裁判會吹哨並亮出黃牌警告。 【選項解析】(A) soccer 足球  (B) chess 西洋棋  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。鏟球亮黃牌為 soccer player。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Playing beach ______ in the soft sand provides an intense cardiovascular workout for your legs and shoulders.","options":["chess","volleyball","golf","bowling"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: volleyball (排球) 【全文中譯】在鬆軟沙灘上打沙灘排球為雙腿和肩膀提供了高強度的有氧鍛鍊。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) volleyball 排球  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) bowling 保齡球。沙灘運動為 beach volleyball。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Because the heavy rain began to leak through the fabric, we covered our nylon camping ______ with a plastic tarp.","options":["chess","golf","tent","activity"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: tent (帳篷) 【全文中譯】因為大雨開始滲過布料，我們在尼龍露營帳篷上覆蓋了一張塑膠防水布。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) golf 高爾夫  (C) tent 帳篷  (D) activity 活動。露營遮蔽所為 nylon camping tent。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The Russian grandmaster spent forty minutes analyzing the board position before moving his wooden queen in ______.","options":["football","bowling","golf","chess"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: chess (西洋棋) 【全文中譯】俄羅斯特級大師在西洋棋中移動木製皇后棋子之前，花了四十分鐘分析局面。 【選項解析】(A) football 美式足球  (B) bowling 保齡球  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) chess 西洋棋。棋局棋子移動為 game of chess。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Swimming, cycling, and mountain hiking are our family's favorite recreational weekend ______.","options":["activities","tents","golfs","frisbees"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: activity (活動) 【全文中譯】游泳、騎自行車以及登山健行是我們全家最喜愛的週末休閒活動。 【選項解析】(A) activities 活動  (B) tents 帳篷  (C) golfs 高爾夫  (D) frisbees 飛盤。休閒活動為 recreational weekend activities。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Fast reflexes and agile footwork are essential for anyone who aspires to play competitive singles ______.","options":["golf","badminton","bowling","chess"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: badminton (羽毛球) 【全文中譯】靈敏的反應速度和敏捷的步法對於渴望打好競技單打羽球的人至關重要。 【選項解析】(A) golf 高爾夫  (B) badminton 羽毛球  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) chess 西洋棋。競賽單打為 competitive singles badminton。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Knocking down all remaining pins on your second ball roll in a ______ frame is known as picking up a spare.","options":["chess","football","bowling","golf"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: bowling (保齡球) 【全文中譯】在保齡球局中用第二球擊倒所有剩下的球瓶，在術語中被稱為補中（解球）。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) football 美式足球  (C) bowling 保齡球  (D) golf 高爾夫。補中為 picking up a spare in bowling。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Thousands of screaming spectators packed the stadium bleachers to witness the traditional college ______ rivalry.","options":["chess","bowling","golf","football"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: football (美式足球) 【全文中譯】數千名尖叫吶喊的觀眾擠滿了體育場看台，見證傳統的大學美式足球對決宿敵戰。 【選項解析】(A) chess 西洋棋  (B) bowling 保齡球  (C) golf 高爾夫  (D) football 美式足球。大學體育宿敵賽為 college football rivalry。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Throwing a lightweight aerodynamic ______ requires a smooth flick of the wrist and good wind control.","options":["frisbee","tent","chess","bowling"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: frisbee (飛盤) 【全文中譯】拋擲輕巧且符合空氣動力學的飛盤需要流暢的手腕抖動和良好的風向掌控。 【選項解析】(A) frisbee 飛盤  (B) tent 帳篷  (C) chess 西洋棋  (D) bowling 保齡球。空氣動力飛行盤為 aerodynamic frisbee。"}]},{"unit":21,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 21 (021.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Entertainment, Performing Arts & Musical Instruments | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"drama","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a play for theater, radio, or television; exciting events","chinese":"戲劇","sentence":"The high school English club staged a famous Shakespeare ______ in the school hall, and parents gave them a standing ovation.","translation":"高中英語社團在學校禮堂上演了一齣著名的莎士比亞戲劇，家長們起立給予他們熱烈鼓掌。"},{"word":"film","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a motion picture; thin layer; to record moving pictures","chinese":"電影；膠卷；拍攝","sentence":"We stayed home on Friday night to watch an award-winning documentary ______, but my younger sister fell asleep on the couch.","translation":"我們週五晚上留在家裡看一部獲獎的紀錄片電影，但我妹妹卻在沙發上睡著了。"},{"word":"cartoon","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an animated film or a humorous drawing in a newspaper","chinese":"卡通；漫畫","sentence":"Children usually wake up very early on Saturday mornings to watch their favorite ______ on television while eating cereal.","translation":"孩子們通常在週六早晨很早就起床，一邊吃麥片一邊看電視上他們最喜歡的卡通。"},{"word":"KTV","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a commercial entertainment venue where people sing karaoke","chinese":"KTV；卡拉OK包廂","sentence":"After completing our final semester examinations, our classmates booked a private room at a nearby ______ to sing pop songs.","translation":"完成期末考試後，我們同班同學在附近的一家 KTV 預訂了一間包廂唱流行歌曲。"},{"word":"MTV","pos":"(n.)","definition":"Music Television; music videos broadcast on screen","chinese":"音樂電視；音樂錄影帶頻道","sentence":"During the summer holidays, teenagers spent hours watching trendy pop songs and artist interviews on ______, which was very popular.","translation":"在暑假期間，青少年花好幾個小時在 MTV 上觀看熱門流行歌曲和藝人訪談，這在當時非常流行。"},{"word":"jazz","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a type of modern music with strong rhythms and improvisation","chinese":"爵士樂","sentence":"The cozy downtown cafe invited a talented saxophone player to perform live ______ every Friday evening, so many customers arrived early.","translation":"市中心那家溫馨的咖啡館邀請了一位才華洋溢的薩克斯風樂手在每週五傍晚現場演奏爵士樂，所以許多顧客很早就抵達了。"},{"word":"drum","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a musical percussion instrument; to beat repeatedly","chinese":"鼓；打鼓","sentence":"Kevin joined the marching band as the main rhythm player, so he practiced beating the bass ______ for two hours every afternoon.","translation":"凱文加入行進樂隊擔任主要節奏手，所以他每天下午花兩個小時練習敲擊大鼓。"},{"word":"flute","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a high-pitched wind instrument made of wood or metal","chinese":"長笛","sentence":"Sarah stood under the spotlight on stage and played a sweet melody on her silver ______, which touched everyone in the auditorium.","translation":"莎拉站在舞台的聚光燈下，用她的銀色長笛吹奏出甜美的旋律，感動了禮堂裡的每個人。"},{"word":"guitar","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a musical instrument usually with six strings played by plucking","chinese":"吉他","sentence":"Jason sat beside the warm campfire on the beach and strummed his acoustic ______ while his friends sang classic folk songs together.","translation":"傑森坐在海灘溫暖的營火旁撥弄著他的民謠吉他，而他的朋友們則一起哼唱著經典民謠。"},{"word":"trumpet","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a brass musical instrument with a flared bell and valves","chinese":"小號；喇叭","sentence":"The brass band leader raised his hand to start the march, and the loud sound of the golden ______ echoed across the athletic field.","translation":"銅管樂隊指揮舉手示意開始進行曲，金黃色小號響亮的聲音隨即在運動場上迴盪。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The school music department formed a brass ensemble, and Mark was chosen to play the shiny golden ______.","options":["flute","drum","trumpet","guitar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: trumpet (小號；喇叭) 【全文中譯】學校音樂系組建了一個銅管樂隊，馬克被選中演奏閃亮的金色小號。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) drum 鼓 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) guitar 吉他。由 brass ensemble（銅管樂團）與 shiny golden 可知選 trumpet。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Every Sunday morning, little kids sit in front of the screen laughing happily at an entertaining animal ______.","options":["cartoon","drama","film","KTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: cartoon (卡通；動畫) 【全文中譯】每逢週日早晨，小孩子們坐在螢幕前開心地看著逗趣的動物卡通大笑。 【選項解析】(A) cartoon 卡通 (B) drama 戲劇 (C) film 電影 (D) KTV 卡拉OK包廂。由 little kids 與 laughing at entertaining animal 可知選 cartoon。"},{"number":3,"stem":"When we camped on the mountain top last weekend, our music teacher brought his wooden ______ and taught us folk tunes.","options":["trumpet","flute","guitar","drum"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guitar (吉他) 【全文中譯】上週末我們在山頂露營時，音樂老師帶了他的木吉他教我們民謠曲調。 【選項解析】(A) trumpet 小號 (B) flute 長笛 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) drum 鼓。露營彈唱民謠最常使用 wooden acoustic guitar。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The director spent over three years in the rainforest to shoot a breathtaking nature ______ about endangered animals.","options":["film","KTV","MTV","jazz"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: film (電影；紀錄片) 【全文中譯】導演在雨林中花了三年多時間拍攝了一部關於瀕危動物的令人驚嘆的自然電影。 【選項解析】(A) film 電影 (B) KTV (C) MTV (D) jazz 爵士樂。由 shoot a breathtaking nature... 可知此處指電影/紀錄片 film。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The rock concert was so energetic that the sound of the loud bass ______ could be felt vibrating through the arena floor.","options":["flute","drum","trumpet","guitar"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: drum (鼓) 【全文中譯】搖滾音樂會活力十足，以至於大低音鼓的響亮聲音在體育場地板上震動。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) drum 鼓 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) guitar 吉他。由 bass drum（低音大鼓）與 vibrating the floor 可知選 drum。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Linda took deep breaths and placed her lips on the mouth hole of the silver ______ to play a calm classical tune.","options":["drum","trumpet","flute","guitar"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flute (長笛) 【全文中譯】琳達深吸一口氣，將嘴唇貼在銀色長笛的吹孔上吹出平靜的古典曲調。 【選項解析】(A) drum 鼓 (B) trumpet 小號 (C) flute 長笛 (D) guitar 吉他。由 mouth hole（吹孔）與 silver 可知為長笛 flute。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The theatrical troupe performed an intense historical ______ about ancient emperors that received rave reviews from critics.","options":["drama","cartoon","MTV","KTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drama (戲劇) 【全文中譯】該劇團演出了一齣關於古代帝王的緊張歷史劇，獲得評論家的一致好評。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) cartoon 卡通 (C) MTV (D) KTV。劇團（theatrical troupe）演出歷史戲劇 drama。"},{"number":8,"stem":"In the 1990s, almost every teenager tuned their home television to ______ to discover the latest international music hits.","options":["film","MTV","drama","cartoon"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: MTV (音樂電視) 【全文中譯】在 1990 年代，幾乎所有青少年都將家裡的電視轉到 MTV 來發現最新的國際流行歌曲。 【選項解析】(A) film 電影 (B) MTV 音樂電視 (C) drama 戲劇 (D) cartoon 卡通。電視音樂頻道指 MTV。"},{"number":9,"stem":"For Amy's eighteenth birthday celebration, her best friends rented a soundproof room at a popular ______ downtown.","options":["cartoon","KTV","jazz","film"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: KTV (卡拉OK) 【全文中譯】為了慶祝艾米的十八歲生日，她最好的朋友們在市中心一家熱門的 KTV 租了一間隔音包廂。 【選項解析】(A) cartoon 卡通 (B) KTV (C) jazz 爵士樂 (D) film 電影。包廂唱歌娛樂場所為 KTV。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The cozy lounge near the river is famous for playing relaxing smooth ______ while guests chat softly over coffee.","options":["jazz","drama","cartoon","film"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jazz (爵士樂) 【全文中譯】河畔這家溫馨的休閒酒吧以播放令人放鬆的輕爵士樂聞名，客人們在喝咖啡時輕聲交談。 【選項解析】(A) jazz 爵士樂 (B) drama 戲劇 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) film 電影。smooth jazz（流暢爵士樂）為經典音樂類型。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You need to replace the third nylon string on your acoustic ______ because it broke during yesterday's rehearsal.","options":["flute","drum","guitar","trumpet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guitar (吉他) 【全文中譯】你需要更換原聲吉他上的第三根尼龍弦，因為它在昨天的排練中斷了。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) drum 鼓 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) trumpet 小號。弦樂器有 strings（琴弦），此處為 guitar。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The royal herald blew a clear signal on his brass ______ to announce the arrival of the queen at the ceremony.","options":["trumpet","guitar","flute","drum"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trumpet (小號；號角) 【全文中譯】皇家傳令官吹響了他的銅號角發出清晰信號，在儀式上宣布女王的到來。 【選項解析】(A) trumpet 小號 (B) guitar 吉他 (C) flute 長笛 (D) drum 鼓。傳令官吹號（blew a signal on brass trumpet）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The animated short ______ won an Oscar award because its hand-drawn pictures and humorous storyline were magnificent.","options":["drama","KTV","MTV","cartoon"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: cartoon (卡通；動畫短片) 【全文中譯】這部動畫短片獲得了奧斯卡獎，因為其手繪畫面和幽默故事情節非常壯麗。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) KTV (C) MTV (D) cartoon 卡通。animated short cartoon（動畫短片）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Peter wanted to learn percussion, so his parents bought him a pair of wooden sticks and a snare ______.","options":["guitar","trumpet","drum","flute"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: drum (鼓) 【全文中譯】彼得想學打擊樂，所以他的父母給他買了一對鼓棒和小軍鼓。 【選項解析】(A) guitar 吉他 (B) trumpet 小號 (C) drum 鼓 (D) flute 長笛。percussion（打擊樂）與 sticks、snare drum 相對應。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many local actors auditioned for the leading role in the new television ______ produced by the public network.","options":["drama","MTV","KTV","jazz"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drama (戲劇；電視劇) 【全文中譯】許多當地演員參加了公共電視網製作的新電視劇主角的試鏡。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) MTV (C) KTV (D) jazz 爵士樂。television drama（電視劇）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because the movie tickets were completely sold out, we decided to stream a classic detective ______ on our laptop instead.","options":["KTV","film","cartoon","jazz"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: film (電影) 【全文中譯】因為電影票完全賣光了，我們決定改在筆記型電腦上看一部經典偵探電影。 【選項解析】(A) KTV (B) film 電影 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) jazz 爵士樂。movie tickets 售罄改看 classic detective film。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Her fingers moved gracefully over the silver keys of the wind ______, producing high and airy notes in the quiet hall.","options":["drum","guitar","trumpet","flute"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: flute (長笛) 【全文中譯】她的手指優雅地在管樂長笛的銀鍵上移動，在安靜的禮堂吹出高亢空靈的音符。 【選項解析】(A) drum 鼓 (B) guitar 吉他 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) flute 長笛。wind instrument 與 silver keys 表長笛 flute。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The international youth hostel organized a Friday night session where guests sang karaoke just like in a private ______.","options":["KTV","drama","cartoon","film"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: KTV (卡拉OK) 【全文中譯】國際青年旅舍舉辦了週五晚會，讓房客像在私人 KTV 一樣引吭高歌。 【選項解析】(A) KTV (B) drama 戲劇 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) film 電影。sang karaoke just like in a private KTV。"},{"number":19,"stem":"New Orleans is globally recognized as the historic birthplace of ______, attracting millions of music lovers each year.","options":["cartoon","jazz","drama","film"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: jazz (爵士樂) 【全文中譯】紐奧良被公認為爵士樂的歷史發源地，每年吸引數百萬音樂愛好者。 【選項解析】(A) cartoon 卡通 (B) jazz 爵士樂 (C) drama 戲劇 (D) film 電影。New Orleans is the birthplace of jazz。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Before music streaming websites were created, music video clips broadcast on ______ were the primary way to promote albums.","options":["MTV","drama","cartoon","KTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: MTV (音樂電視) 【全文中譯】在音樂串流網站出現之前，MTV 播放的音樂錄影帶是宣傳專輯的主要方式。 【選項解析】(A) MTV (B) drama 戲劇 (C) cartoon 卡通 (D) KTV。music video clips broadcast on MTV。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The street performer tapped his foot to the rhythm while plucking the steel strings of his six-string ______.","options":["drum","flute","guitar","trumpet"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: guitar (吉他) 【全文中譯】街頭藝人一邊隨著節奏踏腳，一邊撥動他的六弦吉他的鋼弦。 【選項解析】(A) drum 鼓 (B) flute 長笛 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) trumpet 小號。plucking the steel strings of a six-string guitar。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The military ceremony began with a solemn salute accompanied by a single soldier playing the ______ in the distance.","options":["flute","trumpet","guitar","drum"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trumpet (小號；號角) 【全文中譯】軍事儀式在莊嚴的敬禮中開始，遠處傳來一名士兵吹奏號角的小號聲。 【選項解析】(A) flute 長笛 (B) trumpet 小號 (C) guitar 吉他 (D) drum 鼓。軍事號角演奏通常為 trumpet。"},{"number":23,"stem":"On Sunday afternoons, newspapers often include a colorful comic section filled with short strips and funny ______.","options":["films","cartoons","dramas","MTVs"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: cartoon (漫畫；卡通連環畫) 【全文中譯】在週日下午，報紙通常會附帶一個彩色的漫畫版面，上面有短篇連環畫和有趣的漫畫。 【選項解析】(A) films (B) cartoons (C) dramas (D) MTVs。comic section of newspapers filled with cartoons。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The theater company specializes in staging classical Greek ______ that explore human struggles and moral choices.","options":["drama","KTV","jazz","MTV"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: drama (戲劇) 【全文中譯】該劇團專門上演探索人類奮鬥與道德抉擇的古典希臘戲劇。 【選項解析】(A) drama 戲劇 (B) KTV (C) jazz 爵士樂 (D) MTV。classical Greek drama（古希臘戲劇）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The energetic marching band marched onto the football field, led by the rhythmic beats of the big tenor ______.","options":["guitar","flute","trumpet","drum"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: drum (鼓) 【全文中譯】充滿活力的行進樂隊走進美式足球場，由中音大鼓有節奏的敲擊聲引領著前進。 【選項解析】(A) guitar 吉他 (B) flute 長笛 (C) trumpet 小號 (D) drum 鼓。rhythmic beats of the tenor drum。"}]},{"unit":22,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 22 (022.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Professions, Roles & Career Paths | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"violin","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a four-stringed wooden musical instrument played with a bow","chinese":"小提琴","sentence":"The orchestra concert master tucked the wooden ______ under her chin and played a beautiful solo that silenced the audience.","translation":"管弦樂團首席將木製小提琴夾在下巴下，演奏了一段優美的獨奏，令全場觀眾屏息聆聽。"},{"word":"career","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a profession or occupation chosen as one's life's work","chinese":"職業；事業","sentence":"After graduating from college with honors, Kevin decided to pursue a professional ______ in computer software development.","translation":"在大學以優異成績畢業後，凱文決定在電腦軟體開發領域追求專業的事業生涯。"},{"word":"actor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person whose profession is acting on stage, in movies, or on television","chinese":"男演員；演員","sentence":"The famous Hollywood ______ practiced his lines repeatedly in the dressing room before stepping out in front of the cameras.","translation":"這位著名好萊塢演員在走進鏡頭前，在更衣室裡反覆練習他的台詞。"},{"word":"actress","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a woman whose profession is acting on stage, in movies, or on television","chinese":"女演員","sentence":"The young ______ received an international award for her brilliant performance as a brave doctor in the wartime film.","translation":"這位年輕女演員因在戰爭電影中精彩詮釋一位勇敢的醫生而榮獲國際大獎。"},{"word":"artist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who produces paintings or drawings as a profession or hobby","chinese":"藝術家；畫家","sentence":"The talented local ______ displayed thirty colorful oil paintings in the gallery, and visitors admired her creative imagination.","translation":"這位才華洋溢的在地藝術家在畫廊展出了三十幅色彩繽紛的油畫，參觀者對她的創意思維讚歎不已。"},{"word":"assistant","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who helps someone in a higher position with their work","chinese":"助理；助手","sentence":"The general manager hired a bilingual ______ to organize business meetings, reply to client emails, and book flight tickets.","translation":"總經理僱用了一位雙語助手來安排商務會議、回覆客戶電子郵件以及訂購機票。"},{"word":"banker","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an officer or manager of a bank or financial institution","chinese":"銀行家；銀行主管","sentence":"My uncle works as a senior ______ in Taipei, and he helps local business owners obtain loans to expand their factories.","translation":"我叔叔在台北擔任資深銀行主管，他協助當地企業主獲得貸款以擴大他們的工廠。"},{"word":"barber","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person whose business is cutting men's hair and shaving beards","chinese":"理髮師（男士）","sentence":"Grandfather always visits the same traditional ______ on the corner to have his hair trimmed and his beard neatly shaved.","translation":"祖父總是去街角那家傳統理髮店剪頭髮，並請理髮師把他的鬍鬚刮得整整齊齊。"},{"word":"captain","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the person in command of a ship or aircraft; team leader","chinese":"船長；機長；隊長","sentence":"The experienced ship ______ steered the large cargo vessel safely through the stormy sea into the deep harbor.","translation":"這位經驗豐富的船長駕駛著大型貨輪安全穿過暴風雨肆虐的海洋，駛入深水港灣。"},{"word":"clerk","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person employed in an office or bank to keep records; shop assistant","chinese":"辦事員；店員","sentence":"When the customer brought the winter jacket to the counter, the polite store ______ scanned the price tag and accepted payment.","translation":"當顧客將冬季夾克拿到櫃檯時，有禮貌的店員掃描了價格標籤並收取了款項。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"During the symphony performance, the musician played a sad melody on her classical four-string ______.","options":["violin","career","captain","clerk"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: violin (小提琴) 【全文中譯】在交響樂演出中，這位音樂家在她那把古典四弦小提琴上演奏了悲傷的旋律。 【選項解析】(A) violin 小提琴 (B) career 事業 (C) captain 船長 (D) clerk 職員。four-string instrument 指小提琴 violin。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Choosing a suitable lifelong ______ requires careful thought about personal interests, strengths, and market opportunities.","options":["barber","career","assistant","actress"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: career (職業；事業) 【全文中譯】選擇合適的終身職業需要仔細思考個人興趣、優勢與市場機會。 【選項解析】(A) barber 理髮師 (B) career 事業 (C) assistant 助手 (D) actress 女演員。lifelong career（終身職業生涯）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The handsome Hollywood ______ appeared on the red carpet to sign autographs for hundreds of cheering movie fans.","options":["clerk","banker","actor","violin"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: actor (演員；男演員) 【全文中譯】這位英俊的好萊塢演員出現在紅地毯上，為數百名歡呼的影迷簽名。 【選項解析】(A) clerk 店員 (B) banker 銀行家 (C) actor 男演員 (D) violin 小提琴。Hollywood actor 在紅毯簽名。"},{"number":4,"stem":"She worked hard in theatrical plays for a decade before becoming a world-renowned ______ in dramatic feature films.","options":["career","actress","barber","captain"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: actress (女演員) 【全文中譯】她在舞台劇中努力了十年，才成為劇情長片中舉世聞名的女演員。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) actress 女演員 (C) barber 理髮師 (D) captain 機長。由 female role / renowned 可知指女演員 actress。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The creative ______ spent months in his studio mixing oil colors on canvas to complete a magnificent landscape portrait.","options":["artist","clerk","banker","assistant"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: artist (藝術家；畫家) 【全文中譯】這位富有創意的藝術家在工作室花了數月在畫布上調配油畫顏料，完成了一幅壯麗的風景肖像畫。 【選項解析】(A) artist 藝術家 (B) clerk 職員 (C) banker 銀行家 (D) assistant 助理。油畫顏料與畫布對應 artist。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The professor asked his laboratory ______ to prepare test tubes and chemical solutions before the morning chemistry lecture.","options":["captain","career","violin","assistant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: assistant (助手；助理) 【全文中譯】教授請他的實驗室助手在早晨化學課之前準備好試管和化學溶液。 【選項解析】(A) captain 隊長 (B) career 事業 (C) violin (D) assistant 助理。laboratory assistant（實驗室助理）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"If you plan to borrow money to buy a new house, you should consult an experienced ______ at the local financial branch.","options":["actor","banker","artist","barber"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: banker (銀行家；銀行經理) 【全文中譯】如果你打算借錢買新房子，你應該諮詢當地金融分行一位經驗豐富的銀行主管。 【選項解析】(A) actor 演員 (B) banker 銀行家 (C) artist 藝術家 (D) barber 理髮師。辦理房屋貸款洽詢 banker。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Every two months, my father visits his neighborhood ______ for a quick haircut and a relaxing warm towel shave.","options":["barber","captain","actress","career"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: barber (理髮師) 【全文中譯】每隔兩個月，我父親都會去住家附近的理髮師那裡快速剪個頭髮並享受放鬆的熱毛巾刮鬍服務。 【選項解析】(A) barber 理髮師 (B) captain 船長 (C) actress 女演員 (D) career 事業。剪髮刮鬍為 barber 專業工作。"},{"number":9,"stem":"In the middle of the heavy thunderstorm, the airplane ______ calmly announced that landing would be delayed for safety.","options":["clerk","artist","captain","assistant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: captain (機長；船長) 【全文中譯】在狂風暴雨中，飛機機長沉著地廣播通知為了安全起見將延後降落。 【選項解析】(A) clerk 職員 (B) artist 藝術家 (C) captain 機長 (D) assistant 助理。airplane captain（飛機機長）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"The hotel front desk ______ greeted incoming guests with a warm smile and handed them their room electronic key cards.","options":["violin","clerk","career","actor"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: clerk (辦事員；櫃檯店員) 【全文中譯】飯店櫃檯接待員帶著溫暖的微笑迎接抵達的客人，並遞給他們房間感應鑰匙卡。 【選項解析】(A) violin (B) clerk 櫃檯接待員 (C) career (D) actor。front desk clerk 指櫃檯接待員。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Practicing the ______ requires great hand coordination because you hold the instrument with the left hand and the bow with the right.","options":["career","violin","captain","banker"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: violin (小提琴) 【全文中譯】練習小提琴需要極佳的雙手協調，因為你用左手拿琴、右手握弓。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) violin 小提琴 (C) captain (D) banker。手持弓拉奏之樂器為 violin。"},{"number":12,"stem":"After ten successful years in journalism, Maria changed her ______ and started teaching media studies at a university.","options":["assistant","barber","career","artist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: career (事業；職涯) 【全文中譯】在新聞界成功工作十年後，瑪麗亞轉換了跑道，開始在大學教授媒體研究。 【選項解析】(A) assistant (B) barber (C) career 事業 (D) artist。changed her career 指轉換事業生涯。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The stage ______ forgot his line for a few seconds, but he improvised cleverly so the audience noticed nothing.","options":["actor","clerk","violin","banker"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: actor (男演員；演員) 【全文中譯】這位舞台劇演員忘詞了幾秒鐘，但他巧妙地即興發揮，使觀眾完全沒有察覺。 【選項解析】(A) actor 演員 (B) clerk (C) violin (D) banker。stage actor（舞台劇演員）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The talented ______ received praise from critics for her role as Queen Victoria in the historical television series.","options":["captain","career","actress","barber"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: actress (女演員) 【全文中譯】這位才華橫溢的女演員因在歷史電視劇中飾演維多利亞女王而獲得評論家的讚賞。 【選項解析】(A) captain (B) career (C) actress 女演員 (D) barber。飾演女角色的演員為 actress。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An exhibition of modern sculptures created by an Italian ______ opened at the city museum yesterday afternoon.","options":["artist","clerk","assistant","banker"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: artist (藝術家) 【全文中譯】一位義大利藝術家創作的現代雕塑展昨天下午在市立博物館開幕。 【選項解析】(A) artist 藝術家 (B) clerk (C) assistant (D) banker。創作現代雕塑者為 artist。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Because the corporate executive had an extremely busy travel schedule, his personal ______ booked all hotel reservations.","options":["violin","career","actor","assistant"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: assistant (助理；特助) 【全文中譯】由於這位企業高層的差旅日程極為緊湊，他的個人特助預訂了所有的飯店住宿。 【選項解析】(A) violin (B) career (C) actor (D) assistant 助理。personal assistant 指個人特助。"},{"number":17,"stem":"As an investment ______, Mr. Davis analyzes international stock markets and advises wealthy clients on financial decisions.","options":["banker","barber","captain","artist"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: banker (銀行家) 【全文中譯】作為一名投資銀行家，戴維斯先生分析國際股票市場並為富有客戶提供財務決策建議。 【選項解析】(A) banker 銀行家 (B) barber (C) captain (D) artist。investment banker（投資銀行家）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The vintage ______ shop on Baker Street still uses antique leather chairs and metal straight razors to trim beards.","options":["career","barber","actress","violin"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: barber (理髮店；理髮師) 【全文中譯】貝克街上的那家老式理髮店仍在使用復古皮椅和金屬直剃刀來修整鬍鬚。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) barber 理髮師 (C) actress (D) violin。vintage barber shop（老式理髮店）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Before departing from the harbor, the ferry ______ checked the weather forecast and made sure all life vests were ready.","options":["clerk","assistant","captain","actor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: captain (船長) 【全文中譯】在從港口出發之前，渡輪船長檢查了天氣預報並確保所有救生衣均已就緒。 【選項解析】(A) clerk (B) assistant (C) captain 船長 (D) actor。ferry captain 指渡輪船長。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The supermarket checkout ______ scanned twenty groceries in just two minutes and kindly gave the shopper a paper receipt.","options":["career","clerk","violin","artist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: clerk (店員) 【全文中譯】超市結帳店員僅用兩分鐘就掃描了二十件雜貨，並親切地遞給購物者一張紙本收據。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) clerk 店員 (C) violin (D) artist。checkout clerk（結帳店員）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"She was recognized as a child musical prodigy who could play complex concertos on the ______ at the age of seven.","options":["captain","violin","banker","barber"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: violin (小提琴) 【全文中譯】她被公認為音樂神童，在七歲時就能在小提琴上演奏複雜的協奏曲。 【選項解析】(A) captain (B) violin 小提琴 (C) banker (D) barber。play complex concertos on the violin。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Dedicated students who wish to build a rewarding professional ______ in medicine must study hard for many years.","options":["career","assistant","clerk","actress"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: career (事業；專業生涯) 【全文中譯】立志在醫學領域建立有成就感專業事業的有志學生，必須苦讀多年。 【選項解析】(A) career 事業 (B) assistant (C) clerk (D) actress。build a rewarding professional career。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The film director gave clear instructions to the young ______ on how to express sadness during the final farewell scene.","options":["violin","barber","actor","career"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: actor (演員) 【全文中譯】電影導演向這位年輕演員給予明確指示，教導如何在最後的告別場景中表達悲傷。 【選項解析】(A) violin (B) barber (C) actor 演員 (D) career。film director 給予 actor 指導。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The theater award for Best Leading ______ was presented to an inspiring performer who portrayed a courageous schoolteacher.","options":["actress","captain","banker","clerk"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: actress (女演員) 【全文中譯】最佳女主角劇院大獎頒發給了一位飾演勇敢女教師的激勵人心表演者。 【選項解析】(A) actress 女演員 (B) captain (C) banker (D) clerk。Best Leading Actress（最佳女主角獎）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A gallery owner agreed to represent the aspiring ______ after seeing her stunning watercolor portraits of elderly villagers.","options":["career","assistant","violin","artist"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: artist (藝術家) 【全文中譯】畫廊主人在看到這位有抱負的藝術家畫出老年村民令人驚艷的水彩肖像畫後，同意代理她的作品。 【選項解析】(A) career (B) assistant (C) violin (D) artist 藝術家。aspiring artist 指新進藝術家。"}]},{"unit":23,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 23 (023.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Specialized Occupations, Legal & Technical Experts | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"coach","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an athletic trainer; long-distance bus; to train someone","chinese":"教練；長途巴士；指導","sentence":"The high school basketball ______ blew his whistle loudly to stop the practice and explained how to set a better defense.","translation":"高中籃球教練大聲吹響哨子暫停練習，並解釋如何建立更好的防守陣型。"},{"word":"dentist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a doctor who specializes in treating teeth and gums","chinese":"牙醫","sentence":"Because my younger brother ate too many candies without brushing his teeth, mother took him to the ______ to check a cavity.","translation":"因為我弟弟吃太多糖果且沒刷牙，母親帶他去看牙醫以檢查蛀牙。"},{"word":"engineer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person trained in designing or building machines, structures, or software","chinese":"工程師","sentence":"The senior mechanical ______ inspected the blueprint carefully before the construction crew began assembling the new bridge.","translation":"資深機械工程師在施工團隊開始組裝新橋樑之前，仔細檢查了設計藍圖。"},{"word":"expert","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"a person with comprehensive and authoritative knowledge in a particular area","chinese":"專家；熟練的","sentence":"The financial news station invited a stock market ______ to analyze global inflation trends and advise viewers on investments.","translation":"財經新聞台邀請了一位股票市場專家來分析全球通貨膨脹趨勢，並為觀眾提供投資建議。"},{"word":"hunter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or animal that pursues and kills wild animals for food or sport","chinese":"獵人","sentence":"In ancient times, the skilled forest ______ tracked footprints in the snow for hours to find food for the hungry tribe.","translation":"在古代，熟練的森林獵人在雪地中追蹤腳印數小時，為飢餓的部落尋找食物。"},{"word":"journalist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who writes news stories for newspapers, magazines, or broadcasts","chinese":"新聞記者","sentence":"The courageous investigative ______ traveled into remote areas to interview villagers and report on local water pollution.","translation":"這位勇敢的調查新聞記者深入偏遠地區採訪村民，報導當地的水質污染問題。"},{"word":"judge","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a public officer appointed to decide cases in court; to form an opinion","chinese":"法官；裁判；評斷","sentence":"After listening carefully to both lawyers in the courtroom, the impartial ______ delivered a fair sentence to the defendant.","translation":"在法庭上仔細聆聽兩位律師的陳述後，公正的法官對被告宣判了公平的判決。"},{"word":"lawyer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who practices or studies law; an attorney or legal counselor","chinese":"律師","sentence":"Before signing the business partnership agreement, Mr. Lin consulted a corporate ______ to ensure all contractual terms were legal.","translation":"在簽署商業合夥協議之前，林先生諮詢了一位公司律師以確保所有合約條款皆合法。"},{"word":"manager","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person responsible for controlling or administering an organization or staff","chinese":"經理；主管","sentence":"The customer service ______ resolved the client's complaint politely and offered a full refund for the defective product.","translation":"客服部經理客氣地解決了顧客的投訴，並為該瑕疵產品提供了全額退款。"},{"word":"model","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a person employed to display clothes; a representation of an object","chinese":"模特兒；模型；模範","sentence":"The international fashion ______ walked gracefully down the catwalk in Paris, showcasing the designer's latest winter collection.","translation":"這位國際時尚模特兒優雅地走在巴黎伸展台上，展示設計師最新的冬季時裝系列。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"If you experience severe tooth pain when drinking cold water, you should book an appointment with a certified ______.","options":["engineer","dentist","journalist","hunter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dentist (牙醫) 【全文中譯】如果你喝冰水時感到嚴重的牙齒疼痛，你應該預約一名合格的牙醫看診。 【選項解析】(A) engineer 工程師 (B) dentist 牙醫 (C) journalist 記者 (D) hunter 獵人。tooth pain 由牙醫看診。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The football team was losing at halftime, but their enthusiastic ______ inspired them with an energetic motivational speech.","options":["coach","judge","lawyer","model"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: coach (教練) 【全文中譯】足球隊在中場休息時處於落後，但他們熱情的教練用激勵人心的演說鼓舞了他們。 【選項解析】(A) coach 教練 (B) judge 法官 (C) lawyer 律師 (D) model 模特兒。球隊指導者為 coach。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The tech startup hired a talented software ______ to build an interactive mobile app for online grocery shopping.","options":["dentist","hunter","engineer","coach"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: engineer (工程師) 【全文中譯】這家科技新創公司聘請了一位才華洋溢的軟體工程師，為線上雜貨購物建立互動式手機應用程式。 【選項解析】(A) dentist (B) hunter (C) engineer 工程師 (D) coach。software engineer（軟體工程師）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The university invited an environmental ______ to deliver a lecture on the global effects of melting glaciers.","options":["expert","model","coach","dentist"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: expert (專家) 【全文中譯】大學邀請了一位環境專家，就冰川融化對全球造成的影響發表演講。 【選項解析】(A) expert 專家 (B) model (C) coach (D) dentist。environmental expert（環境專家）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The ancient tribe relied on an experienced ______ to track deer through the thick forest during harsh winter months.","options":["lawyer","hunter","judge","manager"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hunter (獵人) 【全文中譯】在嚴寒的冬季月份裡，古老的部落依靠經驗豐富的獵人穿越茂密的森林追蹤鹿群。 【選項解析】(A) lawyer (B) hunter 獵人 (C) judge (D) manager。track deer 表追蹤獵物，此為 hunter。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The brave ______ won a prestigious press award after exposing corrupt activities inside the regional government.","options":["dentist","coach","journalist","engineer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: journalist (新聞記者) 【全文中譯】這位勇敢的記者在揭露地方政府內部的腐敗活動後，榮獲了聲譽卓著的新聞大獎。 【選項解析】(A) dentist (B) coach (C) journalist 記者 (D) engineer。investigative journalist（調查記者）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The courtroom was completely silent as the supreme ______ banged his wooden gavel and read the official verdict.","options":["judge","model","hunter","expert"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: judge (法官) 【全文中譯】當最高法官敲響他的木槌並宣讀官方判決時，整個法庭一片肅靜。 【選項解析】(A) judge 法官 (B) model (C) hunter (D) expert。敲木槌宣判者為 judge。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The accused company hired a top defense ______ to present solid evidence and protect their intellectual property rights.","options":["coach","dentist","lawyer","engineer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: lawyer (律師) 【全文中譯】被指控的公司聘請了頂尖的辯護律師提供確鑿證據，以保護他們的智慧財產權。 【選項解析】(A) coach (B) dentist (C) lawyer 律師 (D) engineer。defense lawyer（辯護律師）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The restaurant ______ walked from table to table asking guests whether they enjoyed their special holiday meals.","options":["hunter","manager","judge","expert"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: manager (經理；主管) 【全文中譯】餐廳經理在桌子間穿梭巡視，詢問客人是否喜歡特別的節日餐點。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) manager 經理 (C) judge (D) expert。restaurant manager（餐廳經理）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Tall and elegant, the runway ______ wore an exquisite evening gown created by a prominent French fashion designer.","options":["journalist","engineer","dentist","model"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: model (模特兒) 【全文中譯】身材高挑優雅的伸展台模特兒穿著由法國知名服裝設計師創作的精美晚禮服。 【選項解析】(A) journalist (B) engineer (C) dentist (D) model 模特兒。runway model 指走伸展台之模特兒。"},{"number":11,"stem":"You must brush and floss your teeth every night, or your ______ will have to drill your cavities on your next visit.","options":["dentist","coach","lawyer","judge"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: dentist (牙醫) 【全文中譯】你每晚必須刷牙並使用牙線，否則牙醫在下次看診時就得幫你鑽牙補蛀牙了。 【選項解析】(A) dentist 牙醫 (B) coach (C) lawyer (D) judge。drill cavities（鑽補蛀牙）為牙醫之工作。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The track and field ______ instructed the sprinters to practice starting blocks repeatedly to shave off split seconds.","options":["hunter","coach","journalist","model"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: coach (教練) 【全文中譯】田徑教練指示短跑運動員反覆練習起跑架，以縮短微秒時間。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) coach 教練 (C) journalist (D) model。track and field coach（田徑教練）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Civil ______ from the national transport ministry conducted safety inspections on all suspension bridges after the earthquake.","options":["engineers","dentists","judges","hunters"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: engineers (工程師) 【全文中譯】國家交通部的土木工程師在地震後對所有懸索橋進行了安全檢查。 【選項解析】(A) engineers 工程師 (B) dentists (C) judges (D) hunters。civil engineers（土木工程師）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"A medical ______ appeared on the breakfast television show to explain how daily aerobic exercise strengthens the heart.","options":["lawyer","model","expert","manager"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: expert (專家) 【全文中譯】一位醫學專家出現在早安電視節目中，向觀眾解釋每日有氧運動如何增強心臟功能。 【選項解析】(A) lawyer (B) model (C) expert 專家 (D) manager。medical expert（醫學專家）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Armed with a hunting rifle, the seasoned ______ walked quietly across the misty hills before sunrise.","options":["journalist","hunter","engineer","dentist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: hunter (獵人) 【全文中譯】帶著獵槍的老練獵人在日出前悄悄走過多霧的山丘。 【選項解析】(A) journalist (B) hunter 獵人 (C) engineer (D) dentist。armed with hunting rifle 指獵人 hunter。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The young newspaper ______ interviewed eyewitnesses at the traffic accident site and filed her story before deadline.","options":["coach","judge","journalist","model"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: journalist (新聞記者) 【全文中譯】這位年輕的報社記者在車禍現場採訪了目擊者，並在截稿時間前發送了報導。 【選項解析】(A) coach (B) judge (C) journalist 記者 (D) model。interviewed eyewitnesses 表採訪目擊者。"},{"number":17,"stem":"In a criminal trial, the presiding ______ must remain neutral and guarantee that court rules are strictly followed.","options":["judge","dentist","engineer","hunter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: judge (法官) 【全文中譯】在刑事審判中，主審法官必須保持中立並確保法院規則得到嚴格執行。 【選項解析】(A) judge 法官 (B) dentist (C) engineer (D) hunter。presiding judge（主審法官）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"You should never sign any contract without having your trusted family ______ review the legal clauses carefully.","options":["coach","model","lawyer","expert"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: lawyer (律師) 【全文中譯】在簽署任何合約之前，切勿未讓您信任的家庭律師仔細審閱法律條款。 【選項解析】(A) coach (B) model (C) lawyer 律師 (D) expert。review legal clauses 指律師審閱條款。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When sales dropped by fifteen percent, the branch ______ organized an emergency strategy meeting with all staff members.","options":["hunter","journalist","dentist","manager"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: manager (經理；分行長) 【全文中譯】當銷售額下滑百分之十五時，分公司經理與所有員工組織了一次緊急策略會議。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) journalist (C) dentist (D) manager 經理。branch manager（分公司經理）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The miniature wooden ______ of the ancient cathedral took the architecture student six months of meticulous work.","options":["model","judge","coach","lawyer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: model (模型) 【全文中譯】這座古老大教堂的微型木製模型耗費了這位建築系學生六個月的精細心血。 【選項解析】(A) model 模型 (B) judge (C) coach (D) lawyer。miniature wooden model（微型木製模型）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The pediatric ______ gave the crying toddler a cute sticker after painlessly cleaning his baby teeth.","options":["engineer","dentist","hunter","journalist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: dentist (牙醫) 【全文中譯】小兒牙醫在無痛清理完幼兒的乳牙後，給了嚎啕大哭的小童一張可愛的貼紙。 【選項解析】(A) engineer (B) dentist 牙醫 (C) hunter (D) journalist。pediatric dentist（小兒牙醫）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The swim team ______ timed each lap carefully and corrected the swimmers' arm strokes from the edge of the pool.","options":["lawyer","judge","coach","model"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: coach (教練) 【全文中譯】游泳隊教練在池畔仔細為每一趟計時，並修正游泳選手的划水動作。 【選項解析】(A) lawyer (B) judge (C) coach 教練 (D) model。swim team coach（游泳隊教練）。"},{"number":23,"stem":"An electrical ______ was called to the manufacturing plant when the primary power generator suddenly overheated.","options":["engineer","expert","hunter","manager"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: engineer (工程師) 【全文中譯】當主發電機突然過熱時，一位電機工程師被緊急召集到製造廠處置。 【選項解析】(A) engineer 工程師 (B) expert (C) hunter (D) manager。electrical engineer（電機工程師）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The television host introduced a culinary ______ who demonstrated traditional pastry techniques to the studio audience.","options":["dentist","judge","coach","expert"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: expert (專家) 【全文中譯】電視主持人介紹了一位烹飪專家，向攝影棚觀眾示範傳統糕點技藝。 【選項解析】(A) dentist (B) judge (C) coach (D) expert 專家。culinary expert（烹飪專家）。"},{"number":25,"stem":"The department store ______ supervised fifty employees and handled daily scheduling to maintain smooth operations.","options":["hunter","manager","model","journalist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: manager (經理) 【全文中譯】百貨公司經理監督五十名員工並處理日常排班，以維護業務順暢運作。 【選項解析】(A) hunter (B) manager 經理 (C) model (D) journalist。department store manager（百貨公司經理）。"}]},{"unit":24,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 24 (024.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Public Service, Academia & Cultural Professions | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"musician","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who plays a musical instrument or writes music","chinese":"音樂家","sentence":"The talented classical ______ composed an original piano sonata, and she performed it with great passion at the national theater.","translation":"這位才華洋溢的古典音樂家創作了一首原創鋼琴奏鳴曲，她在國家劇院充滿激情地演奏了這首曲子。"},{"word":"priest","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an ordained minister of the Christian Church having religious authority","chinese":"神父；牧師","sentence":"Every Sunday morning, the elderly Catholic ______ gave an inspiring sermon about compassion to all believers in the church.","translation":"每逢週日早晨，這位年邁的天主教神父都會在教堂向全體信徒發表關於慈悲的激勵人心講道。"},{"word":"painter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an artist who paints pictures; a person who paints buildings","chinese":"畫家；油漆匠","sentence":"The French Impressionist ______ set up his easel in the flower garden to capture the morning sunlight on his canvas.","translation":"這位法國印象派畫家在花園中架起畫架，試圖在畫布上捕捉晨曦的光影變化。"},{"word":"photographer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who takes photographs, either as a job or hobby","chinese":"攝影師","sentence":"The wildlife ______ waited patiently behind camouflage netting for six hours to take pictures of rare mountain eagles.","translation":"這位野生動物攝影師在偽裝網後耐心等待了六個小時，只為拍攝稀有山雕的照片。"},{"word":"policeman","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a male member of a police force","chinese":"警察；警員","sentence":"The brave traffic ______ stood at the busy downtown intersection directing vehicles after the traffic lights broke down.","translation":"在紅綠燈故障後，英勇的交通警察站在繁忙的市中心十字路口指揮車輛行進。"},{"word":"president","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the elected head of a republican state; leader of an organization","chinese":"總統；總裁；理事長","sentence":"The newly elected national ______ delivered a hopeful inaugural address promising to improve education and reduce unemployment.","translation":"新當選的國家總統發表了充滿希望的就職演說，承諾改善教育並降低失業率。"},{"word":"principal","pos":"(n.) / (adj.)","definition":"the head of a school; first in order of importance","chinese":"校長；主要的","sentence":"During the morning assembly, the school ______ awarded medals to outstanding students who won the regional science contest.","translation":"在晨會期間，學校校長向贏得區域科學競賽的優秀學生頒發了獎牌。"},{"word":"professor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a university teacher of the highest academic rank","chinese":"教授","sentence":"The history ______ delivered an engaging lecture on ancient Egyptian pyramids and answered questions from curious students.","translation":"歷史系教授發表了一場關於古埃及金字塔的生動演講，並回答了好奇學生的提問。"},{"word":"reporter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who reports news or conducts interviews for television or press","chinese":"記者；通訊員","sentence":"The television news ______ held a microphone in the pouring rain, broadcasting live updates about the approaching typhoon.","translation":"電視新聞記者在傾盆大雨中手持麥克風，現場直播關於颱風逼近的最新動態。"},{"word":"sailor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who works as a member of the crew of a ship or boat","chinese":"水手；海員","sentence":"The young naval ______ tightened the thick ropes on deck and looked out across the boundless ocean toward the horizon.","translation":"年輕的海軍水手緊緊拉繫甲板上的粗繩，放眼望向地平線對面的無垠大洋。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The orchestra invited a renowned guest ______ to perform a stunning violin solo during their anniversary concert.","options":["sailor","musician","policeman","priest"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: musician (音樂家) 【全文中譯】管弦樂團邀請了一位著名客座音樂家，在他們的週年音樂會上演奏了精彩的小提琴獨奏。 【選項解析】(A) sailor 水手 (B) musician 音樂家 (C) policeman 警察 (D) priest 神父。演奏小提琴者為 musician。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The village gathered inside the historic stone chapel where the local ______ offered comforting prayers for the sick.","options":["priest","photographer","president","painter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: priest (神父；牧師) 【全文中譯】村民聚集在歷史悠久的石造小教堂內，當地的神父為病患獻上撫慰人心的祈禱。 【選項解析】(A) priest 神父 (B) photographer 攝影師 (C) president 總統 (D) painter 畫家。在教堂帶領祈禱者為 priest。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The renowned landscape ______ dipped his fine brush into watercolor and painted green hills overlooking the river.","options":["principal","policeman","painter","professor"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: painter (畫家) 【全文中譯】著名的風景畫家將細毛畫筆浸入水彩中，畫出了俯瞰河流的青山綠水。 【選項解析】(A) principal 校長 (B) policeman (C) painter 畫家 (D) professor。以水彩揮毫畫畫者為 painter。"},{"number":4,"stem":"A professional fashion ______ adjusted the studio lighting to capture high-resolution portraits for the magazine cover.","options":["sailor","reporter","priest","photographer"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: photographer (攝影師) 【全文中譯】專業時尚攝影師調整了攝影棚燈光，為雜誌封面拍攝高解析度的肖像照。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) reporter (C) priest (D) photographer 攝影師。調整燈光拍攝雜誌封面照者為 photographer。"},{"number":5,"stem":"When a pedestrian lost her purse on the street, an alert ______ helped her track down the suspect immediately.","options":["musician","policeman","professor","painter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: policeman (警察) 【全文中譯】當一名行人在街上遺失錢包時，一名警覺的警員立即幫助她追查嫌疑人。 【選項解析】(A) musician (B) policeman 警察 (C) professor (D) painter。維持治安、追查嫌犯者為 policeman。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Citizens crowded around their television sets to watch the state ______ announce the signing of the peace treaty.","options":["president","sailor","photographer","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: president (總統) 【全文中譯】民眾擠在電視機前，觀看國家總統宣布簽署和平條約。 【選項解析】(A) president 總統 (B) sailor (C) photographer (D) priest。簽署國家和約者為 state president。"},{"number":7,"stem":"At the beginning of the new academic year, the elementary school ______ welcomed new first graders at the school gate.","options":["painter","musician","principal","reporter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: principal (校長) 【全文中譯】在新學年開始時，小學校長在校門口迎接新入學的一年級新生。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) musician (C) principal 校長 (D) reporter。迎接入學校園之長官為 school principal。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The university ______ published a groundbreaking academic paper on renewable solar energy in a prestigious scientific journal.","options":["professor","sailor","policeman","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: professor (教授) 【全文中譯】這位大學教授在頂尖科學期刊上發表了一篇關於可再生太陽能的開創性學術論文。 【選項解析】(A) professor 教授 (B) sailor (C) policeman (D) priest。發表科學論文的大學教員為 professor。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The sports news ______ interviewed the marathon champion immediately after he crossed the finish line in record time.","options":["painter","reporter","principal","president"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: reporter (記者) 【全文中譯】體育新聞記者在馬拉松冠軍以破紀錄時間衝過終點線後立即對他進行了採訪。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) reporter 記者 (C) principal (D) president。新聞採訪者為 reporter。"},{"number":10,"stem":"During the fierce ocean storm, every experienced ______ wore a safety harness while securing loose cargo on deck.","options":["musician","photographer","professor","sailor"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: sailor (水手) 【全文中譯】在猛烈的海洋風暴中，每位經驗豐富的水手在甲板上固定鬆動貨物時都繫著安全帶。 【選項解析】(A) musician (B) photographer (C) professor (D) sailor 水手。船艦甲板工作人員為 sailor。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Jazz and classical ______ spend years mastering their instruments and practicing complex musical scales every day.","options":["musicians","policemen","priests","sailors"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: musicians (音樂家) 【全文中譯】爵士與古典音樂家耗費數年時間精通樂器，每天練習複雜的音樂音階。 【選項解析】(A) musicians 音樂家 (B) policemen (C) priests (D) sailors。精通樂器音階者為 musicians。"},{"number":12,"stem":"The parish ______ conducted wedding vows for the young couple in front of their tearful relatives and close friends.","options":["painter","priest","photographer","president"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: priest (神父；牧師) 【全文中譯】教區神父在新人熱淚盈眶的親戚和摯友面前主持了他們的結婚誓詞。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) priest 神父 (C) photographer (D) president。主持教會婚禮者為 parish priest。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Before remodeling the living room, we hired an interior ______ to paint all the walls with warm pastel tones.","options":["professor","sailor","painter","principal"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: painter (油漆匠) 【全文中譯】在改造客廳之前，我們僱用了一位室內油漆工用溫暖的粉彩色調粉刷所有牆壁。 【選項解析】(A) professor (B) sailor (C) painter 油漆工 (D) principal。粉刷牆壁者為 painter。"},{"number":14,"stem":"An aerial ______ flew in a small helicopter above the grand canyon to capture panoramic sunrise photographs.","options":["photographer","policeman","musician","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photographer (攝影師) 【全文中譯】一位空拍攝影師乘坐小型直升機飛越大峽谷，捕捉日出的全景照片。 【選項解析】(A) photographer 攝影師 (B) policeman (C) musician (D) priest。拍攝日出照片者為 photographer。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An undercover ______ arrested two car thieves who had broken into vehicles parked outside the shopping mall.","options":["reporter","professor","policeman","painter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: policeman (便衣警察) 【全文中譯】一名便衣警察逮捕了兩名闖入商場外停放車輛行竊的汽車竊賊。 【選項解析】(A) reporter (B) professor (C) policeman 警察 (D) painter。undercover policeman（便衣警察）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The company ______ delivered a strategic speech to shareholders, explaining plans to expand operations into Southeast Asia.","options":["sailor","president","principal","musician"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: president (總裁；董事長) 【全文中譯】公司總裁向股東發表了戰略演講，解釋進軍東南亞市場的業務拓展計畫。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) president 總裁 (C) principal (D) musician。company president（公司總裁/董事長）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Parents scheduled an appointment with the high school ______ to discuss the school's new anti-bullying policy.","options":["painter","photographer","priest","principal"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: principal (校長) 【全文中譯】家長與高中校長約定面談時間，以討論學校最新的反霸凌政策。 【選項解析】(A) painter (B) photographer (C) priest (D) principal 校長。掌管學校政策之代表為 principal。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The chemistry ______ spent office hours guiding graduate students through their laboratory experiments and thesis research.","options":["professor","policeman","sailor","reporter"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: professor (教授) 【全文中譯】化學教授利用課餘諮詢時間指導研究生的實驗室實驗和學位論文研究。 【選項解析】(A) professor 教授 (B) policeman (C) sailor (D) reporter。指導研究生論文者為 professor。"},{"number":19,"stem":"An investigative ______ uncovered secret financial records showing that factory owners had hidden environmental damages.","options":["musician","reporter","priest","painter"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: reporter (記者) 【全文中譯】一位調查記者揭露了秘密財務記錄，顯示工廠負責人隱瞞了環境損害真相。 【選項解析】(A) musician (B) reporter 記者 (C) priest (D) painter。investigative reporter（調查記者）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The merchant vessel employed thirty crew members, and each seasoned ______ took turns keeping watch on the bridge.","options":["photographer","principal","sailor","president"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sailor (水手；船員) 【全文中譯】這艘商船僱用了三十名船員，每位經驗豐富的水手輪流在艦橋上值勤望遠。 【選項解析】(A) photographer (B) principal (C) sailor 水手 (D) president。商船船員為 sailor。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Street ______ played lively acoustic tunes in the public square, and passing tourists dropped coins into their guitar cases.","options":["musicians","professors","priests","policemen"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: musicians (街頭音樂家) 【全文中譯】街頭音樂家在公共廣場演奏輕快的民謠曲調，路過的遊客紛紛將硬幣投進他們的吉他琴盒中。 【選項解析】(A) musicians 音樂家 (B) professors (C) priests (D) policemen。street musicians 指街頭街頭藝人/音樂家。"},{"number":22,"stem":"The kind ______ visited elderly residents in the nursing home every Friday, offering blessings and cheerful company.","options":["sailor","painter","reporter","priest"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: priest (神父) 【全文中譯】慈祥的神父每週五探訪安養院的年長居民，為他們獻上祝福與歡樂的陪伴。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) painter (C) reporter (D) priest 神父。給予宗教祝福者為 priest。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The famous oil ______ spent forty years creating realistic portraits of common working people in rural villages.","options":["photographer","painter","policeman","principal"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: painter (畫家) 【全文中譯】這位著名的油畫家花了四十年時間創作鄉村普通勞動人民的寫實肖像畫。 【選項解析】(A) photographer (B) painter 畫家 (C) policeman (D) principal。oil painter（油畫家）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sports ______ stood near the sidelines taking rapid burst shots of the gymnasts performing aerial flips.","options":["photographer","president","professor","priest"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: photographer (攝影師) 【全文中譯】體育攝影師站在場邊連續高速快門連拍體操運動員做空中翻滾的畫面。 【選項解析】(A) photographer 攝影師 (B) president (C) professor (D) priest。高速快門拍攝運動員者為 photographer。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A bicycle ______ patrolled the park paths each afternoon to ensure visitors obeyed safety regulations.","options":["sailor","musician","policeman","reporter"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: policeman (警察) 【全文中譯】一名騎單車的巡警每天下午在公園小徑上巡邏，以確保遊客遵守安全規定。 【選項解析】(A) sailor (B) musician (C) policeman 警察 (D) reporter。bicycle policeman（自行車巡警）。"}]},{"unit":25,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 25 (025.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Service Roles, Royalty & Specialized Trades | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"salesman","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a man whose job involves selling goods or services","chinese":"業務員；推銷員","sentence":"The friendly car ______ explained all the safety features of the hybrid sedan and offered us a free test drive.","translation":"這位親切的汽車業務員解釋了這輛油電混合轎車的所有安全功能，並為我們提供了免費試駕。"},{"word":"scientist","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who studies or has expert knowledge in one or more sciences","chinese":"科學家","sentence":"The environmental ______ analyzed water samples collected from the river and discovered dangerous levels of chemical waste.","translation":"這位環境科學家分析了從該河流採集的水樣，並發現了危險含量的化學廢料。"},{"word":"mechanic","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who repairs and maintains machinery, especially car engines","chinese":"技工；修車工","sentence":"When my old car suddenly broke down on the highway, a skillful ______ replaced the damaged alternator in two hours.","translation":"當我的老爺車在公路上突然拋錨時，一位技術精湛的技工在兩小時內更換了損壞的發電機。"},{"word":"secretary","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person employed to assist with correspondence, keep records, and make appointments","chinese":"秘書","sentence":"The executive ______ answered incoming telephone calls politely and scheduled important meetings on the company digital calendar.","translation":"這位主管秘書客氣地接聽打進來的電話，並在公司的數位行事曆上安排了重要會議。"},{"word":"servant","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who performs duties for others, especially in a domestic setting","chinese":"僕人；傭人","sentence":"In ancient European castles, numerous ______ cleaned grand dining halls, prepared elaborate meals, and looked after the nobility.","translation":"在古代歐洲城堡中，眾多僕人負責打掃宏偉的宴會廳、準備豐盛的餐點，並伺候貴族階層。"},{"word":"vendor","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or company offering something for sale, especially street traders","chinese":"小販；攤販；廠商","sentence":"Every Saturday night, the street food ______ sets up his mobile stall in the night market to grill fragrant sausages for customers.","translation":"每逢週六晚上，街頭小販都會在夜市擺出移動攤位，為顧客現烤香氣四溢的香腸。"},{"word":"thief","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who steals another person's property, especially secretly (pl. thieves)","chinese":"小偷；竊賊","sentence":"An alert store security officer caught the sneaky ______ trying to sneak out the back exit with stolen electronic watches.","translation":"一名警覺的店內保全人員抓住了這個鬼鬼祟祟的小偷，他當時正試圖帶著偷來的電子手錶從後門溜出去。"},{"word":"speaker","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person who speaks, especially at a formal event; audio device","chinese":"演講者；講者；揚聲器","sentence":"The keynote ______ delivered an inspiring talk on artificial intelligence, and the auditorium erupted in loud applause.","translation":"主講人在會上發表了關於人工智慧的激勵人心演講，整個禮堂爆發出熱烈的掌聲。"},{"word":"prince","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the son of a monarch; a close male member of a royal family","chinese":"王子；親王","sentence":"The handsome young ______ rode his white horse through the palace gates to greet thousands of cheering royal subjects.","translation":"這位英俊的年輕王子騎著白馬穿過宮殿大門，向數千名歡呼的王室子民揮手致意。"},{"word":"princess","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the daughter of a monarch; the wife of a prince","chinese":"公主；王妃","sentence":"The royal ______ wore a sparkling diamond tiara to the banquet and smiled warmly at international diplomatic guests.","translation":"這位王室公主戴著閃亮的鑽石皇冠出席宴會，並對國際外交嘉賓報以溫暖的微笑。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"When the family car began making a strange rattling sound, my father took it to a reliable auto ______.","options":["scientist","mechanic","vendor","prince"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mechanic (技工；修車工) 【全文中譯】當家裡的汽車開始發出奇怪的咔嗒聲時，父親把它送到了可靠的汽車技工那裡檢修。 【選項解析】(A) scientist 科學家 (B) mechanic 技工 (C) vendor 小販 (D) prince 王子。auto mechanic（汽車修理工）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The pharmaceutical ______ conducted complex laboratory trials to test the safety of a new influenza vaccine.","options":["thief","salesman","scientist","servant"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: scientist (科學家) 【全文中譯】製藥科學家進行了複雜的實驗室試驗，以測試新型流感疫苗的安全性。 【選項解析】(A) thief (B) salesman (C) scientist 科學家 (D) servant。進行疫苗實驗室試驗者為 pharmaceutical scientist。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The energetic computer ______ demonstrated the latest tablet features to shoppers gathered at the electronics expo.","options":["salesman","princess","mechanic","thief"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: salesman (業務員；銷售員) 【全文中譯】充滿活力的電腦銷售員向聚集在電子展覽會上的購物者示範最新平板電腦的功能。 【選項解析】(A) salesman 業務員 (B) princess (C) mechanic (D) thief。推銷電子展品者為 computer salesman。"},{"number":4,"stem":"The director asked his confidential ______ to draft a formal reply to the foreign government's invitation letter.","options":["vendor","secretary","prince","scientist"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: secretary (秘書) 【全文中譯】主管請他的機要秘書起草一份給外國政府邀請函的正式回信。 【選項解析】(A) vendor (B) secretary 秘書 (C) prince (D) scientist。起草正式信函、掌管文書者為 confidential secretary。"},{"number":5,"stem":"In the 18th century, wealthy aristocratic families employed a faithful household ______ to maintain their country manor.","options":["servant","salesman","speaker","mechanic"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: servant (僕人；傭人) 【全文中譯】在 18 世紀，富有的貴族家庭僱用忠誠的家僕來維護他們的鄉村莊園。 【選項解析】(A) servant 僕人 (B) salesman (C) speaker (D) mechanic。照顧鄉村莊園的傭工為 household servant。"},{"number":6,"stem":"A night market ______ pushed his wooden cart into the crowded alley and began frying delicious scallion pancakes.","options":["prince","scientist","vendor","secretary"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: vendor (攤販；小販) 【全文中譯】夜市小販把木推車推進擁擠的小巷，開始現煎美味的蔥油餅。 【選項解析】(A) prince (B) scientist (C) vendor 小販 (D) secretary。night market vendor 指夜市小販。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The house was broken into while the family was on vacation, and the ______ stole valuable jewelry from the safe.","options":["salesman","thief","mechanic","servant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: thief (小偷；竊賊) 【全文中譯】這家人度假時房子遭人破門而入，竊賊從保險箱裡偷走了昂貴的珠寶。 【選項解析】(A) salesman (B) thief 竊賊 (C) mechanic (D) servant。破門偷走珠寶者為 thief。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The guest ______ at the graduation ceremony encouraged students to be resilient when confronting future challenges.","options":["speaker","princess","thief","vendor"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: speaker (演講者；講者) 【全文中譯】畢業典禮上的特邀演講嘉賓鼓勵學生在面對未來的挑戰時要保持堅韌不拔。 【選項解析】(A) speaker 演講者 (B) princess (C) thief (D) vendor。guest speaker（特邀演講嘉賓）。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The young crown ______ was next in line for the throne and was trained strictly in international politics from childhood.","options":["mechanic","prince","salesman","secretary"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: prince (王子) 【全文中譯】年輕的王儲是王位的第一順位繼承人，從小就接受嚴格的國際政治訓練。 【選項解析】(A) mechanic (B) prince 王子 (C) salesman (D) secretary。crown prince 指皇太子/王儲。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Little girls around the world love fairy tales where a beautiful ______ lives happily ever after in a grand palace.","options":["scientist","vendor","thief","princess"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: princess (公主) 【全文中譯】全世界的小女孩都喜歡童話故事，在故事中美麗的公主在宏偉的城堡裡從此過著幸福快樂的生活。 【選項解析】(A) scientist (B) vendor (C) thief (D) princess 公主。童話故事中的王室女主角為 princess。"},{"number":11,"stem":"An aircraft ______ inspected the jet engine blades thoroughly before granting final takeoff clearance.","options":["mechanic","prince","salesman","speaker"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: mechanic (技工；機械維修師) 【全文中譯】飛機機械技工在給予最終起飛許可前，徹底檢查了噴射發動機葉片。 【選項解析】(A) mechanic 技工 (B) prince (C) salesman (D) speaker。aircraft mechanic（飛機維修工程師/技工）。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Nobel Prize-winning ______ from around the world gathered in Stockholm to discuss global climate challenges.","options":["servants","thieves","scientists","vendors"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: scientists (科學家) 【全文中譯】來自世界各地的諾貝爾獎得主科學家聚集在斯德哥爾摩，討論全球氣候挑戰。 【選項解析】(A) servants (B) thieves (C) scientists 科學家 (D) vendors。Nobel Prize-winning scientists。"},{"number":13,"stem":"A door-to-door vacuum ______ knocked on our front door yesterday, but mother politely declined his demonstration.","options":["secretary","salesman","prince","princess"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: salesman (推銷員) 【全文中譯】一名挨家挨戶推銷吸塵器的業務員昨天敲了我們的前門，但母親客氣地拒絕了他的示範。 【選項解析】(A) secretary (B) salesman 推銷員 (C) prince (D) princess。door-to-door vacuum salesman。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The school board appointed a competent ______ to take minutes during executive meetings and maintain archived records.","options":["mechanic","thief","vendor","secretary"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: secretary (秘書；書記) 【全文中譯】學校董事會任命了一位稱職的秘書在執行會議期間記錄會議紀錄並維護存檔記錄。 【選項解析】(A) mechanic (B) thief (C) vendor (D) secretary 秘書。負責會議記錄（take minutes）者為 secretary。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The cruel master ordered his overworked ______ to chop firewood all night without offering him any warm food.","options":["scientist","servant","speaker","salesman"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: servant (僕人) 【全文中譯】殘忍的主人命令他那過勞的僕人整夜砍柴，卻沒有給他任何溫暖的食物。 【選項解析】(A) scientist (B) servant 僕人 (C) speaker (D) salesman。服侍主人（master）的人為 servant。"},{"number":16,"stem":"A souvenir ______ set up a stall near the famous landmark selling handmade wooden postcards to foreign tourists.","options":["vendor","prince","thief","secretary"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: vendor (紀念品攤販) 【全文中譯】紀念品小販在著名地標附近擺了一個攤位，向外國遊客出售手工木製明信片。 【選項解析】(A) vendor 攤販 (B) prince (C) thief (D) secretary。souvenir vendor（紀念品攤販）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Police detectives matched fingerprints found on the broken window frame to a notorious jewel ______.","options":["salesman","mechanic","thief","scientist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thief (竊賊) 【全文中譯】警察偵探將破碎窗框上發現的指紋與一名臭名昭著的珠寶大盜進行了比對匹配。 【選項解析】(A) salesman (B) mechanic (C) thief 竊賊 (D) scientist。jewel thief（珠寶竊賊）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"During the debate competition, each student ______ had exactly three minutes to present an opening argument.","options":["prince","speaker","vendor","servant"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: speaker (演講者；辯手) 【全文中譯】在辯論比賽中，每位學生發言者正好有三分鐘時間陳述開場論點。 【選項解析】(A) prince (B) speaker 發言者 (C) vendor (D) servant。debate speaker 指辯論發言選手。"},{"number":19,"stem":"In the royal fairy tale, the handsome ______ rode through enchanted forests to rescue his beloved companion.","options":["prince","secretary","mechanic","salesman"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: prince (王子) 【全文中譯】在王室童話中，英俊的王子騎馬穿越魔法森林去拯救他心愛的伴侶。 【選項解析】(A) prince 王子 (B) secretary (C) mechanic (D) salesman。handsome prince 為童話典型形象。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The charity gala was hosted by an elegant ______, who donated millions of dollars to build children's hospitals.","options":["thief","vendor","princess","scientist"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: princess (王妃；公主) 【全文中譯】這場慈善晚會由一位優雅的公主主持，她捐贈了數百萬美元建造兒童醫院。 【選項解析】(A) thief (B) vendor (C) princess 公主 (D) scientist。royal princess 出席主持慈善晚會。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Because my bicycle chain snapped in half, the neighborhood bike ______ repaired it with a replacement link.","options":["salesman","mechanic","speaker","prince"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: mechanic (技工) 【全文中譯】因為我的自行車鏈條斷成了兩截，鄰里自行車技工用替換鏈節把它修好了。 【選項解析】(A) salesman (B) mechanic 技工 (C) speaker (D) prince。bike mechanic 指自行車修護技工。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Dedicated marine ______ spent three months studying coral reef restoration off the southern coast of Taiwan.","options":["servants","scientists","vendors","thieves"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: scientists (海洋科學家) 【全文中譯】敬業的海洋科學家花了三個月時間研究台灣南部海岸附近的珊瑚礁修復工作。 【選項解析】(A) servants (B) scientists 科學家 (C) vendors (D) thieves。marine scientists 指海洋科學家。"},{"number":23,"stem":"An enthusiastic insurance ______ called Mr. Wang to explain the financial advantages of long-term retirement policies.","options":["princess","secretary","salesman","mechanic"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: salesman (保險業務員) 【全文中譯】一位熱心的保險業務員打電話給王先生，解釋長期退休保單的財務優勢。 【選項解析】(A) princess (B) secretary (C) salesman 業務員 (D) mechanic。insurance salesman 指保險業務員。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The personal ______ managed the celebrity's daily schedule, answered fan mail, and organized press conferences.","options":["thief","secretary","vendor","speaker"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: secretary (私人秘書) 【全文中譯】私人秘書管理名人的日常行程安排、回覆粉絲信件並組織記者會。 【選項解析】(A) thief (B) secretary 秘書 (C) vendor (D) speaker。personal secretary 指私人秘書。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Street food ______ outside the sports arena did booming business selling hot dogs and cold soda during the game.","options":["princes","mechanics","scientists","vendors"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: vendors (街頭小販) 【全文中譯】體育場外的街頭食品小販在比賽期間賣熱狗和冷冰汽水，生意興隆。 【選項解析】(A) princes (B) mechanics (C) scientists (D) vendors 攤販。street food vendors 指路邊飲食攤商。"}]},{"unit":26,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 26 (026.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Business, Employment & Commerce | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"serve","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to perform duties or services for an organization, customer, or country","chinese":"服務；供應；服役","sentence":"The friendly family restaurant continues to ______ traditional Taiwanese beef noodles, and long queues form outside every weekend.","translation":"這家溫馨的家庭餐館繼續供應道地的台灣牛肉麵，每個週末外面都會排起長長的人龍。"},{"word":"service","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action of helping or doing work for someone; customer care","chinese":"服務；協助","sentence":"The hotel staff was praised by overseas travelers because the room ______ was prompt, courteous, and exceptionally helpful.","translation":"飯店員工受到海外旅客的讚賞，因為客房服務迅速、謙恭有禮且非常有幫助。"},{"word":"customer","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person or organization that buys goods or services from a store or business","chinese":"顧客；客戶","sentence":"The supermarket manager politely greeted every loyal ______ who walked through the front doors on Saturday morning.","translation":"超市經理在週六早晨客氣地向走進大門的每一位忠實顧客打招呼。"},{"word":"trade","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"the buying and selling of goods and services between people or countries","chinese":"貿易；交易；商業","sentence":"International ______ between Asian and European nations has expanded rapidly because shipping routes have become more efficient.","translation":"亞洲和歐洲國家之間的國際貿易迅速擴張，因為航運路線變得更加高效。"},{"word":"company","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a commercial business; the condition of being with someone","chinese":"公司；同行；陪伴","sentence":"After working for ten years in finance, Jason and his college friends established an innovative tech ______ in Taipei.","translation":"在金融領域工作了十年之後，傑森和他的大學好友在台北成立了一家創新科技公司。"},{"word":"employee","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a person employed for wages or salary, especially at non-executive level","chinese":"員工；受僱者","sentence":"The generous manufacturing firm offered every hardworking ______ a generous year-end bonus and three weeks of paid leave.","translation":"這家慷慨的製造業公司為每位辛勤工作的員工提供了優厚的年終獎金和三週的有薪假。"},{"word":"interview","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a formal meeting at which someone is questioned to assess suitability","chinese":"面試；訪談；採訪","sentence":"David felt slightly nervous before his morning job ______, so he reviewed common questions while waiting in the reception hall.","translation":"大衛在早晨的求職面試前感到有些緊張，所以他在接待大廳等待時複習了常見問題。"},{"word":"hire","pos":"(v.) / (n.)","definition":"to employ someone for wages; to rent equipment for temporary use","chinese":"僱用；聘請；租用","sentence":"Because the software department had several big projects, the board decided to ______ ten experienced programmers immediately.","translation":"因為軟體部門有幾個大專案，董事會決定立即聘請十位有經驗的程式設計師。"},{"word":"contract","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a written or spoken agreement intended to be enforceable by law","chinese":"合約；契約；縮小","sentence":"Both corporate leaders read every clause in the legal ______ carefully before signing their names at the bottom.","translation":"兩位企業領導人在底部簽名之前，仔細閱讀了這份法律合約中的每一個條款。"},{"word":"quit (quit / quit)","pos":"(v.)","definition":"to leave a place usually permanently; to stop an action or employment","chinese":"辭職；放棄；停止","sentence":"After working long overnight hours for three years, Sarah decided to ______ her stressful job to pursue her passion for painting.","translation":"在連續三年上夜班長時間工作之後，莎拉決定辭掉這份壓力很大的工作，去追求她對畫畫的熱情。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The cafeteria staff works hard from eleven to two every weekday to ______ fresh hot meals to hungry high school students.","options":["quit","serve","trade","hire"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: serve (供應；服務) 【全文中譯】自助餐廳員工每個工作日的十一點到兩點辛勤工作，為飢腸轆轆的高中生供應新鮮熱食。 【選項解析】(A) quit 辭職 (B) serve 供應 (C) trade 貿易 (D) hire 僱用。供應餐點用 serve meals。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The airline won an international award because their flight attendants offered outstanding customer ______ to passengers.","options":["service","contract","company","interview"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: service (服務) 【全文中譯】該航空公司榮獲國際大獎，因為其空服人員向乘客提供了卓越的顧客服務。 【選項解析】(A) service 服務 (B) contract 合約 (C) company 公司 (D) interview 面試。customer service 指客戶服務。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The store manager offered a ten percent discount voucher to any satisfied ______ who completed an online feedback survey.","options":["employee","trade","customer","company"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: customer (顧客；客戶) 【全文中譯】超市經理向任何完成線上反饋調查的滿意顧客提供九折優惠券。 【選項解析】(A) employee 員工 (B) trade 貿易 (C) customer 顧客 (D) company 公司。給予完成問卷的顧客優惠。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Maritime ______ agreements signed between the two neighboring countries lowered tariffs on agricultural exports.","options":["interview","trade","service","contract"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: trade (貿易) 【全文中譯】兩個鄰國之間簽署的海上貿易協定降低了農產品出口關稅。 【選項解析】(A) interview 面試 (B) trade 貿易 (C) service 服務 (D) contract 合約。maritime trade agreements（海上貿易協定）。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The multinational pharmaceutical ______ invested millions of dollars in developing affordable medicine for developing nations.","options":["employee","customer","trade","company"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: company (公司) 【全文中譯】這家跨國製藥公司斥資數百萬美元，為開發中國家開發價格合理的藥品。 【選項解析】(A) employee (B) customer (C) trade (D) company 公司。multinational pharmaceutical company（跨國製藥公司）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Every full-time ______ in the factory receives comprehensive health insurance coverage and two weeks of paid vacation.","options":["employee","service","contract","interview"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: employee (員工) 【全文中譯】工廠裡的每一位全職員工都享有全面的醫療保險保障和兩週的有薪假。 【選項解析】(A) employee 員工 (B) service (C) contract (D) interview。受僱享福利者為 full-time employee。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Maria practiced her self-introduction several times before attending the final round of her job ______ at the bank.","options":["trade","interview","company","service"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: interview (面試) 【全文中譯】瑪麗亞在參加銀行最後一輪求職面試之前，多次練習了自己的自我介紹。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) interview 面試 (C) company (D) service。job interview 指求職面試。"},{"number":8,"stem":"Because peak tourist season was approaching, the beachfront resort planned to ______ twenty temporary kitchen assistants.","options":["serve","quit","hire","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: hire (僱用；聘請) 【全文中譯】由於旅遊旺季即將到來，這家海濱度假村計劃立即聘請二十名臨時廚房助手。 【選項解析】(A) serve (B) quit (C) hire 聘請 (D) trade。招募臨時工為 hire assistants。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Before buying the apartment, Mr. Lin asked his lawyer to inspect the property purchase ______ for hidden liabilities.","options":["contract","employee","service","customer"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: contract (合約) 【全文中譯】在購買該公寓之前，林先生請他的律師仔細檢查房產購買合約以防暗藏債務。 【選項解析】(A) contract 合約 (B) employee (C) service (D) customer。property purchase contract（購屋合約）。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Mark was extremely exhausted from working eighty hours a week, so he finally gathered his courage to ______ his position.","options":["serve","hire","quit","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: quit (辭職；放棄) 【全文中譯】馬克因每週工作八十小時而極度精疲力竭，因此他終於鼓起勇氣辭去了職位。 【選項解析】(A) serve (B) hire (C) quit 辭職 (D) trade。辭去職務用 quit his position。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Flight attendants smiled warmly as they began to ______ beverages and warm snacks to passengers on the long flight.","options":["trade","quit","hire","serve"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: serve (供應；端送) 【全文中譯】空服人員面帶溫暖的微笑，開始在長途飛行中為乘客供應飲料和溫熱小吃。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) quit (C) hire (D) serve 供應。客艙供應餐飲用 serve beverages。"},{"number":12,"stem":"After ten years of dependable ______, the senior technician was rewarded with a gold watch at the annual company party.","options":["service","interview","customer","contract"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: service (服務；貢獻) 【全文中譯】在長達十年的可靠服務奉獻之後，資深技術員在公司年度聚會上獲贈一只金錶。 【選項解析】(A) service 服務年資 (B) interview (C) customer (D) contract。ten years of dependable service。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The clothing boutique welcomed a wealthy ______ who purchased five silk dresses and three matching winter coats.","options":["trade","customer","company","employee"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: customer (顧客) 【全文中譯】這家服飾精品店迎來了一位富有的顧客，她買了五件絲綢洋裝和三件配套的冬衣。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) customer 顧客 (C) company (D) employee。購買服飾者為 boutique customer。"},{"number":14,"stem":"Ancient merchants traveled along the Silk Road to ______ Chinese silk and porcelain for European glass and wine.","options":["quit","serve","trade","hire"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: trade (交易；交換) 【全文中譯】古代商人沿著絲綢之路跋涉，用中國的絲綢和瓷器換取歐洲的玻璃和葡萄酒。 【選項解析】(A) quit (B) serve (C) trade 交換/以物易物 (D) hire。trade silk for wine（以絲綢交換葡萄酒）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The logistics ______ purchased fifty new electric delivery vans to reduce carbon emissions across the metropolitan area.","options":["company","service","customer","contract"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: company (公司) 【全文中譯】這家物流公司採購了五十輛全新電動貨車，以減少大都會區的碳排放量。 【選項解析】(A) company 公司 (B) service (C) customer (D) contract。logistics company（物流公司）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"An outstanding ______ who exceeded monthly sales targets by fifty percent was promoted to regional marketing director.","options":["service","interview","employee","trade"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: employee (員工) 【全文中譯】一位月銷售額超出目標百分之五十的傑出員工，被拔擢為區域行銷總監。 【選項解析】(A) service (B) interview (C) employee 員工 (D) trade。工作表現優異受拔擢者為 employee。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The magazine reporter conducted an in-depth ______ with the famous film director regarding his cinematic inspirations.","options":["company","contract","interview","customer"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: interview (專訪；訪談) 【全文中譯】雜誌記者就其電影創作靈感對這位著名電影導演進行了深度訪談。 【選項解析】(A) company (B) contract (C) interview 專訪 (D) customer。conducted an in-depth interview。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The tech corporation announced plans to ______ two hundred skilled data analysts for their newly opened research center.","options":["quit","trade","serve","hire"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: hire (招聘；僱用) 【全文中譯】這家科技巨頭宣佈計劃為其新落成的研發中心招聘兩百名熟練的數據分析師。 【選項解析】(A) quit (B) trade (C) serve (D) hire 招聘。企業召募人才用 hire analysts。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Players who sign a professional athletic ______ must maintain rigorous physical fitness throughout the competitive season.","options":["customer","contract","employee","service"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: contract (合約；契約) 【全文中譯】簽署職業運動合約的選手必須在整個賽季期間維持嚴格的身材體能狀態。 【選項解析】(A) customer (B) contract 契約 (C) employee (D) service。athletic contract（運動員合約）。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The doctor warned the patient that he must ______ smoking cigarettes immediately to avoid permanent heart damage.","options":["quit","serve","trade","hire"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: quit (戒除；戒掉) 【全文中譯】醫生警告該病患必須立即戒菸，以免造成永久性心臟損傷。 【選項解析】(A) quit 戒除 (B) serve (C) trade (D) hire。quit smoking 指戒菸。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The elegant restaurant strives to ______ authentic Italian cuisine using fresh imported olive oil and homemade cheese.","options":["hire","serve","trade","quit"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: serve (供應；端出) 【全文中譯】這家優雅的餐館力求使用新鮮進口橄欖油和自製乳酪，供應正宗義大利美食。 【選項解析】(A) hire (B) serve 供應 (C) trade (D) quit。餐館供應美食用 serve cuisine。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Fast and polite customer ______ is the primary reason why online shoppers remain loyal to this e-commerce platform.","options":["contract","service","employee","company"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: service (服務) 【全文中譯】迅速且有禮貌的客戶服務，是線上購物者對該電子商務平台保持忠誠的主要原因。 【選項解析】(A) contract (B) service 服務 (C) employee (D) company。customer service 指售後與客戶服務。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The banking clerk assisted an elderly ______ who needed help filling out an international wire transfer document.","options":["trade","interview","customer","service"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: customer (顧客；客戶) 【全文中譯】銀行行員協助了一位需要填寫國際電匯文件表格的老年客戶。 【選項解析】(A) trade (B) interview (C) customer 客戶 (D) service。至銀行臨櫃辦理業務者為 bank customer。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The export-oriented nation relies heavily on foreign ______ to import crude oil and export advanced semiconductors.","options":["trade","contract","company","employee"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: trade (貿易) 【全文中譯】這個以出口為導向的國家高度依賴對外貿易來進口原油並出口先進半導體。 【選項解析】(A) trade 貿易 (B) contract (C) company (D) employee。foreign trade 指對外貿易。"},{"number":25,"stem":"During the panel ______, candidates were evaluated on problem-solving abilities, communication skills, and team spirit.","options":["company","service","customer","interview"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: interview (面試) 【全文中譯】在小組面試期間，評審依據問題解決能力、溝通技巧和團隊合作精神來評估應試者。 【選項解析】(A) company (B) service (C) customer (D) interview 面試。panel interview 指小組集體面試。"}]},{"unit":27,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 27 (027.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Aviation, Public Transit & Highway Infrastructure | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"aircraft","pos":"(n.)","definition":"any airplane, helicopter, or flying machine (pl. aircraft)","chinese":"航空器；飛機","sentence":"The international airport ordered fifteen modern commercial ______ to meet the rising demand for overseas travel.","translation":"該國際機場訂購了十五架現代商用航空器，以滿足日益增長的出境旅遊需求。"},{"word":"airline","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a company that provides regular flights for passengers or cargo","chinese":"航空公司","sentence":"Our family booked discounted round-trip tickets through a reputable budget ______, and the customer service was surprisingly good.","translation":"我們全家透過一家聲譽良好的廉價航空公司訂購了折扣來回機票，其客戶服務出乎意料地好。"},{"word":"flight","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a journey made through the air, especially in an airplane","chinese":"航班；飛行","sentence":"Because severe stormy weather hit Tokyo, our direct afternoon ______ was delayed on the airport runway for two hours.","translation":"因為嚴重暴風雨襲擊東京，我們下午的直飛航班在機場跑道上延誤了兩個小時。"},{"word":"plane","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an airplane; a powered flying vehicle with fixed wings","chinese":"飛機","sentence":"The passengers fastened their seatbelts tightly as the heavy passenger ______ accelerated rapidly down the runway.","translation":"當這架沉重的大型客運飛機在跑道上快速加速時，機上乘客緊緊繫上了安全帶。"},{"word":"helicopter","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an aircraft that derives lift from rotating overhead blades","chinese":"直升機","sentence":"A rescue ______ hovered steadily above the raging river to lift stranded mountain hikers into the cabin safely.","translation":"一架救援直升機在洶湧的河流上方平穩盤旋，將受困的山區登山客安全吊起進入機艙。"},{"word":"MRT","pos":"(n.)","definition":"Mass Rapid Transit; the metropolitan subway and elevated train system","chinese":"捷運；大眾捷運系統","sentence":"Commuters in Taipei prefer taking the punctual ______ during rush hours because city street traffic is often gridlocked.","translation":"台北的通勤族在尖峰時段更喜歡搭乘準時的捷運，因為市區街道交通經常嚴重堵塞。"},{"word":"subway","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an underground railway system in a city","chinese":"地下鐵；地鐵","sentence":"During our winter holiday in New York, we bought a weekly pass to ride the underground ______ across Manhattan easily.","translation":"在紐約度寒假期間，我們買了一張週票，方便搭乘地下地鐵暢行曼哈頓。"},{"word":"highway","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a main public road, especially connecting major cities","chinese":"公路；高速公路","sentence":"Long-distance truck drivers usually travel along the national ______ late at night when the roadway is clear of traffic.","translation":"長途卡車司機通常在深夜路面車流稀少時，沿著國道高速公路行駛。"},{"word":"overpass","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a bridge that carries one road or path above another road","chinese":"天橋；陸橋；高架道","sentence":"Pedestrians are encouraged to walk across the elevated ______ to cross the dangerous ten-lane avenue safely.","translation":"政府鼓勵行人走上高架天橋，以安全穿越這條危險的十線道大馬路。"},{"word":"underpass","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a tunnel or sunken roadway allowing vehicles or pedestrians to pass beneath","chinese":"地下道；地下車道","sentence":"Because the heavy monsoon storm flooded the low-lying ______, city traffic police closed the road to prevent accidents.","translation":"因為強烈的季風暴雨淹沒了低窪的地下道，市區交通警察封閉了道路以防止意外發生。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Technicians at the air base conducted thorough maintenance on each military ______ before morning training drills began.","options":["overpass","aircraft","subway","underpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: aircraft (航空器；軍機) 【全文中譯】空軍基地的技術人員在晨間訓練演習開始前，對每架軍用航空器進行了徹底維修。 【選項解析】(A) overpass 天橋 (B) aircraft 航空器 (C) subway 地鐵 (D) underpass 地下道。military aircraft（軍用飛機/航空器）。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The national ______ expanded its flight network by opening five new direct routes to major European capitals.","options":["airline","underpass","overpass","highway"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: airline (航空公司) 【全文中譯】這家國家航空公司透過開通五條直飛歐洲主要首都的新航線，擴大了其航線網絡。 【選項解析】(A) airline 航空公司 (B) underpass (C) overpass (D) highway。開通直飛航線的企業為 airline。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The captain announced that our transatlantic ______ would land thirty minutes ahead of schedule due to strong tailwinds.","options":["underpass","highway","flight","overpass"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flight (航班；飛行航程) 【全文中譯】機長廣播宣布由於強勁順風，我們的跨大西洋航班將提前三十分鐘降落。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) highway (C) flight 航班 (D) overpass。transatlantic flight（跨大西洋航班）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"As the cargo ______ touched down smoothly on the concrete runway, the cabin crew breathed a sigh of relief.","options":["subway","plane","MRT","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plane (飛機；貨機) 【全文中譯】當貨運飛機平穩降落在混凝土跑道上時，機組人員鬆了一口氣。 【選項解析】(A) subway (B) plane 飛機 (C) MRT (D) overpass。cargo plane 指貨運飛機。"},{"number":5,"stem":"The emergency medical service dispatched a rescue ______ to evacuate the critically injured hiker from the canyon.","options":["underpass","airline","helicopter","highway"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: helicopter (直升機) 【全文中譯】緊急醫療服務派遣了一架救援直升機，從峽谷中疏散受重傷的登山客。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) airline (C) helicopter 直升機 (D) highway。rescue helicopter（搜救直升機）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"In urban Taiwan, riding the air-conditioned ______ is widely considered the most convenient way to travel around town.","options":["MRT","highway","plane","overpass"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: MRT (捷運) 【全文中譯】在台灣市區，搭乘配備冷氣的大眾捷運被普遍認為是周遊城市最方便的方式。 【選項解析】(A) MRT 捷運 (B) highway (C) plane (D) overpass。都會區冷氣大眾運輸工具指 MRT。"},{"number":7,"stem":"Travelers navigating through London can easily reach any district by following colorful maps inside the ______ system.","options":["airline","subway","helicopter","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: subway (地鐵系統) 【全文中譯】遊覽倫敦的旅客只要跟隨地鐵系統內色彩豐富的地圖，就能輕鬆到達任何區域。 【選項解析】(A) airline (B) subway 地鐵 (C) helicopter (D) overpass。London subway / underground 指地鐵。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The government widened the coastal ______ from two lanes to four lanes to accommodate heavy weekend tourist traffic.","options":["flight","underpass","aircraft","highway"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: highway (公路；高速公路) 【全文中譯】政府將沿海公路從雙向兩線拓寬為四線道，以容納週末繁忙的觀光車流。 【選項解析】(A) flight (B) underpass (C) aircraft (D) highway 公路。拓寬車道容納車流指 coastal highway。"},{"number":9,"stem":"To avoid crossing the speeding expressway on foot, workers climbed the concrete ______ to reach the factory opposite.","options":["overpass","airline","plane","flight"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: overpass (天橋；陸橋) 【全文中譯】為了避免徒步穿越車速飛快的快速道路，工人們登上混凝土天橋以前往對面的工廠。 【選項解析】(A) overpass 天橋 (B) airline (C) plane (D) flight。跨越道路之陸橋為 pedestrian overpass。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Drainage pumps were installed at the entrance of the pedestrian ______ to prevent rainwater from accumulating during typhoons.","options":["helicopter","underpass","aircraft","airline"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underpass (地下道) 【全文中譯】行人地下道入口處安裝了排水抽水機，以防颱風期間雨水積聚成災。 【選項解析】(A) helicopter (B) underpass 地下道 (C) aircraft (D) airline。pedestrian underpass 指行人地下道。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Aerospace engineers designed an experimental ______ powered entirely by solar batteries and ultra-light materials.","options":["underpass","subway","aircraft","highway"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: aircraft (航空器) 【全文中譯】航太工程師設計了一架完全由太陽能電池和超輕材料驅動的實驗性航空器。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) subway (C) aircraft 航空器 (D) highway。experimental aircraft 指實驗飛行器。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Because the budget ______ charges extra fees for checked baggage, many backpackers travel with just one carry-on bag.","options":["airline","overpass","MRT","underpass"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: airline (航空公司) 【全文中譯】因為廉價航空公司對托運行李收取額外費用，許多背包客只攜帶一件隨身行李出行。 【選項解析】(A) airline 航空公司 (B) overpass (C) MRT (D) underpass。budget airline（廉價航空公司）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Passengers were advised to confirm their international ______ status online before traveling to the airport terminal.","options":["highway","overpass","flight","underpass"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: flight (航班) 【全文中譯】旅客被建議在前往機場航廈之前，先上網確認他們的國際航班狀態。 【選項解析】(A) highway (B) overpass (C) flight 航班 (D) underpass。international flight status（國際航班動態）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The twin-engine passenger ______ climbed above the gray rain clouds into bright and steady sunshine.","options":["underpass","plane","subway","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plane (飛機) 【全文中譯】這架雙引擎客機爬升穿過灰色雨雲，進入陽光明媚平穩的雲層上方。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) plane 飛機 (C) subway (D) overpass。twin-engine passenger plane（雙引擎客機）。"},{"number":15,"stem":"The traffic surveillance ______ broadcast live video of the highway collision to the police command center.","options":["airline","subway","underpass","helicopter"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: helicopter (直升機) 【全文中譯】交通監控直升機將公路相撞事故的現場畫面即時傳輸到警方指揮中心。 【選項解析】(A) airline (B) subway (C) underpass (D) helicopter 直升機。surveillance helicopter（監控直升機）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Students tapped their contactless smartcards at the automatic ticket gate to enter the crowded ______ platform.","options":["MRT","highway","aircraft","overpass"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: MRT (捷運月台) 【全文中譯】學生在自動驗票閘門感應非接觸式晶片智慧卡，走進擁擠的捷運月台。 【選項解析】(A) MRT 捷運 (B) highway (C) aircraft (D) overpass。crowded MRT platform（擁擠的捷運月台）。"},{"number":17,"stem":"Street performers often play guitars and harmonicas near the bustling exits of the underground ______ station.","options":["highway","helicopter","subway","airline"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: subway (地鐵站) 【全文中譯】街頭藝人經常在繁忙的地下地鐵站出口附近彈吉他吹口琴。 【選項解析】(A) highway (B) helicopter (C) subway 地鐵 (D) airline。underground subway station（地下地鐵站）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Long lines of automobiles crept forward slowly along the interstate ______ during the holiday weekend rush.","options":["underpass","flight","aircraft","highway"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: highway (高速公路) 【全文中譯】在假日週末的高峰期，長長的汽車隊伍在州際高速公路上緩慢向前蠕動。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) flight (C) aircraft (D) highway 高速公路。interstate highway（州際公路）。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Urban planners built an illuminated pedestrian ______ across the boulevard so students could reach the library safely.","options":["overpass","airline","helicopter","plane"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: overpass (人行天橋) 【全文中譯】都市規劃人員在大道上方建造了一座有照明設施的行人天橋，以便學生能安全前往圖書館。 【選項解析】(A) overpass 天橋 (B) airline (C) helicopter (D) plane。illuminated pedestrian overpass。"},{"number":20,"stem":"City maintenance workers cleared leaves and trash from the storm drains inside the vehicle ______ after midnight.","options":["aircraft","underpass","flight","airline"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: underpass (車行地下道) 【全文中譯】市政維護人員在午夜過後清理了車行地下道內雨水落水管中的樹葉和垃圾。 【選項解析】(A) aircraft (B) underpass 地下道 (C) flight (D) airline。vehicle underpass（車行地下道）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The carrier transports perishable seafood worldwide using refrigerated containers loaded onto heavy cargo ______.","options":["subways","highways","aircraft","underpasses"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: aircraft (貨運航空器) 【全文中譯】該承運商利用裝載到大型貨運航空器上的冷藏貨櫃，向全球運送易腐海鮮。 【選項解析】(A) subways (B) highways (C) aircraft 航空器 (D) underpasses。heavy cargo aircraft（大型貨機）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Customer loyalty programs run by this global ______ reward frequent flyers with free upgrades and lounge passes.","options":["airline","overpass","underpass","highway"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: airline (航空公司) 【全文中譯】這家全球航空公司營運的客戶忠誠計劃，以免費升等和貴賓室使用券獎勵常客。 【選項解析】(A) airline 航空公司 (B) overpass (C) underpass (D) highway。global airline loyalty program。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Due to unexpected mechanical trouble on engine number two, the long-distance ______ made an emergency landing.","options":["underpass","overpass","highway","flight"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: flight (長途航班) 【全文中譯】由於二號發動機發生意外機械故障，該長途航班進行了緊急降落。 【選項解析】(A) underpass (B) overpass (C) highway (D) flight 航班。long-distance flight（長途航班）。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The young boy looked out the bedroom window with excitement, pointing up at a silver ______ soaring in the blue sky.","options":["subway","plane","underpass","overpass"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: plane (飛機) 【全文中譯】小男孩興奮地望向臥室窗外，用手指著天空中一架翱翔在藍天裡的銀色飛機。 【選項解析】(A) subway (B) plane 飛機 (C) underpass (D) overpass。soaring in the sky 表 plane 飛機。"},{"number":25,"stem":"During wildfire operations, a heavy water-dropping ______ refilled its tank from a nearby mountain reservoir.","options":["highway","underpass","helicopter","MRT"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: helicopter (滅火直升機) 【全文中譯】在森林野火撲滅作業中，一架重型灑水直升機從附近的山區水庫補充了水箱水槽。 【選項解析】(A) highway (B) underpass (C) helicopter 直升機 (D) MRT。water-dropping helicopter（灑水滅火直升機）。"}]},{"unit":28,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 28 (028.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Rail Transit, Travel Motion & Visual Signals | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"jeep","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a sturdy motor vehicle with four-wheel drive, used over rough terrain","chinese":"吉普車","sentence":"The wildlife rangers drove a rugged open-top ______ across the rocky grassland to observe migrating wild animals.","translation":"野生動物巡警駕駛著一輛耐用的敞篷吉普車穿過崎嶇的草原，觀察遷徙的野生動物。"},{"word":"railroad","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a permanent track composed of rails on which trains run; train system","chinese":"鐵路；鐵路系統","sentence":"Workers constructed the famous historic mountain ______ over a century ago to transport timber from deep alpine forests.","translation":"一個多世紀前，工人們修建了這條著名的歷史登山鐵路，將木材從高山深林中運送出來。"},{"word":"platform","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a raised level surface on which people stand at a train station or stage","chinese":"月台；講台；平台","sentence":"Dozens of eager commuters stood behind the yellow safety line on the railway ______ waiting for the morning express train.","translation":"數十名熱切的通勤者站在鐵路月台上的黃色安全線後方，等待著早班特快列車。"},{"word":"passenger","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a traveler on a public or private conveyance other than the driver or crew","chinese":"乘客；旅客","sentence":"The flight attendant gently reminded each seated ______ to keep their seatbelts fastened during turbulent weather conditions.","translation":"空服人員溫柔地提醒每一位就座的乘客，在不穩定的氣流天氣條件下務必繫好安全帶。"},{"word":"path","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a way or track laid down for walking or made by continual treading","chinese":"小徑；路線；道路","sentence":"A quiet stone ______ wound through the green bamboo grove, leading visitors toward an ancient wooden Buddhist monastery.","translation":"一條幽靜的石砌小徑穿過翠綠的竹林，引導遊客走向一座古老的木造佛寺。"},{"word":"tunnel","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"an artificial underground passage, especially one built through a hill","chinese":"隧道；地道；挖地道","sentence":"The high-speed bullet train turned on its bright headlights before speeding through the long mountain ______.","translation":"高速高鐵列車在急速駛過長長的山區隧道之前，打開了明亮的前照燈。"},{"word":"sign","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a notice bearing information or instructions; to write one's name","chinese":"標誌；指示牌；簽署","sentence":"The yellow highway warning ______ alerted motorists to watch out for falling rocks during heavy rainy weather.","translation":"黃色公路警示標誌提醒駕駛人，在大雨滂沱的天氣中要小心落石。"},{"word":"movement","pos":"(n.)","definition":"an act of changing physical location or position; a group trend","chinese":"動作；移動；運動","sentence":"The dance instructor watched the student's graceful arm ______ carefully and offered tips on keeping perfect balance.","translation":"舞蹈教練仔細觀察學生優雅的手臂動作，並提供了保持完美平衡的訣竅。"},{"word":"motion","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the action or process of moving or being moved; gesture","chinese":"移動；動作；提議","sentence":"The sensor lights in the dark hallway are activated by physical ______, so they turn on whenever someone walks past.","translation":"黑暗走廊裡的感應燈是由人體移動感應觸發的，因此每當有人走過時它們就會亮起。"},{"word":"effect","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a change which is a result or consequence of an action or other cause","chinese":"影響；效果；結果","sentence":"Scientific studies demonstrate that regular physical exercise has a beneficial long-term ______ on cardiovascular health.","translation":"科學研究顯示，規律的體能鍛鍊對心血管健康具有持久且有益的良好影響。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"The safari guide drove a four-wheel-drive ______ across the bumpy muddy road so tourists could photograph zebras.","options":["path","jeep","tunnel","effect"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: jeep (吉普車) 【全文中譯】荒野遊獵嚮導駕駛四輪驅動吉普車穿過崎嶇泥濘的道路，以便遊客拍攝斑馬。 【選項解析】(A) path 小徑 (B) jeep 吉普車 (C) tunnel 隧道 (D) effect 效果。四輪驅動穿越崎嶇道路者為 4WD jeep。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The high-speed transcontinental ______ connected remote coastal fishing towns to thriving industrial trade hubs.","options":["passenger","railroad","motion","movement"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: railroad (鐵路) 【全文中譯】這條跨洲高速鐵路將偏遠的沿海漁鎮與繁榮的工業貿易樞紐連接起來。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 乘客 (B) railroad 鐵路 (C) motion 動作 (D) movement 移動。transcontinental railroad（橫貫大陸鐵路）。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Hundreds of passengers waited patiently on the cold station ______ as the morning commuter train approached.","options":["sign","effect","platform","jeep"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: platform (月台) 【全文中譯】數百名乘客在早班通勤火車進站時，在寒冷的車站月台上耐心等待。 【選項解析】(A) sign 標誌 (B) effect (C) platform 月台 (D) jeep。station platform 表車站月台。"},{"number":4,"stem":"Every international airline ______ must present a valid passport and boarding pass before entering the departure gate.","options":["passenger","movement","tunnel","railroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: passenger (乘客；旅客) 【全文中譯】每位國際航班旅客在進入登機門之前，都必須出示有效護照和登機證。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 乘客 (B) movement (C) tunnel (D) railroad。搭乘航班之旅客為 flight passenger。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Follow the winding gravel ______ through the flower garden, and you will find a peaceful marble fountain at the end.","options":["motion","effect","sign","path"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: path (小徑；道路) 【全文中譯】沿著穿過花園的蜿蜒碎石小徑漫步，你將在盡頭發現一座寧靜的大理石噴泉。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) effect (C) sign (D) path 小徑。gravel path 指碎石小路。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Vehicles entering the dark undersea ______ are strictly required to turn on headlights and obey the lower speed limit.","options":["tunnel","jeep","passenger","platform"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tunnel (隧道；海底地道) 【全文中譯】進入黑暗海底隧道的車輛被嚴格要求開啟前大燈並遵守較低的速限規定。 【選項解析】(A) tunnel 隧道 (B) jeep (C) passenger (D) platform。undersea tunnel（海底隧道）。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The metal road ______ showed a sharp right turn ahead, prompting the attentive driver to slow down immediately.","options":["effect","sign","motion","movement"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: sign (標誌；指示牌) 【全文中譯】金屬道路標誌顯示前方急向右轉，促使警覺的司機立即減速。 【選項解析】(A) effect (B) sign 道路標誌 (C) motion (D) movement。road sign 指道路交通標誌。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The wildlife camera captured the stealthy ______ of a leopard stalking a deer through the tall savannah grass.","options":["movement","platform","railroad","passenger"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: movement (動作；移動姿態) 【全文中譯】野生動物相機捕捉到一隻花豹穿過大草原高草潛伏靠近鹿群的悄悄動作。 【選項解析】(A) movement 移動/動作 (B) platform (C) railroad (D) passenger。stealthy movement 指潛行動作。"},{"number":9,"stem":"The automated camera caught the subtle hand ______ of the magician as he replaced the playing card unseen.","options":["tunnel","path","motion","jeep"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: motion (動作；移動) 【全文中譯】自動攝影機捕捉到了魔術師在無人注意下掉換撲克牌時的微妙手部動作。 【選項解析】(A) tunnel (B) path (C) motion 動作 (D) jeep。hand motion 指手部細微動作。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Lack of sleep had a negative ______ on David's academic concentration, causing his exam scores to drop.","options":["effect","sign","platform","railroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: effect (影響；效果) 【全文中譯】睡眠不足對大衛的學術專注力產生了負面影響，導致他的考試成績下滑。 【選項解析】(A) effect 影響 (B) sign (C) platform (D) railroad。negative effect on... 指對……產生負面影響。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Soldiers used an armored military ______ to navigate rugged mountain trails where regular cars could not travel.","options":["passenger","effect","path","jeep"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: jeep (軍用吉普車) 【全文中譯】士兵們使用裝甲軍用吉普車穿梭於普通汽車無法通行的崎嶇山徑。 【選項解析】(A) passenger (B) effect (C) path (D) jeep 吉普車。military jeep 指軍用吉普車。"},{"number":12,"stem":"In the 19th century, expansion of the transcontinental ______ stimulated trade and settlement across North America.","options":["railroad","movement","tunnel","sign"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: railroad (鐵路) 【全文中譯】在 19 世紀，橫貫大陸鐵路的擴張促進了整個北美的貿易和定居拓荒。 【選項解析】(A) railroad 鐵路 (B) movement (C) tunnel (D) sign。expansion of railroad（鐵路拓建）。"},{"number":13,"stem":"The station announcer warned travelers not to lean over the edge of the subway ______ while waiting for trains.","options":["motion","platform","effect","jeep"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: platform (月台) 【全文中譯】車站廣播提醒旅客在等車時，切勿探身越過地鐵月台邊緣。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) platform 月台 (C) effect (D) jeep。edge of subway platform（地鐵月台邊緣）。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The elderly bus ______ was offered a courtesy seat by a polite student who noticed she was carrying heavy groceries.","options":["passenger","path","sign","railroad"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: passenger (公車乘客) 【全文中譯】一位有禮貌的學生看到這位老婦人提著沉重的雜貨，便主動給這位年邁的公車乘客讓座。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 乘客 (B) path (C) sign (D) railroad。bus passenger 指公車乘客。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Hikers enjoyed walking along the scenic coastal ______, which offered breathtaking panoramic views of the blue ocean.","options":["movement","effect","path","tunnel"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: path (景觀步道；步道) 【全文中譯】徒步旅行者享受漫步於風景優美的海岸步道，該小徑提供蔚藍海洋令人驚嘆的全景。 【選項解析】(A) movement (B) effect (C) path 步道 (D) tunnel。scenic coastal path（濱海觀景步道）。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Construction teams drilled through solid granite for five years to build the twenty-kilometer railway ______.","options":["tunnel","passenger","jeep","platform"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: tunnel (鐵路隧道) 【全文中譯】施工團隊耗時五年鑽穿堅硬的花崗岩，修建完成了這條長達二十公里的鐵路隧道。 【選項解析】(A) tunnel 隧道 (B) passenger (C) jeep (D) platform。railway tunnel 指鐵路隧道。"},{"number":17,"stem":"A red octagonal stop ______ was erected at the dangerous street corner to prevent further vehicular collisions.","options":["motion","effect","sign","path"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: sign (停標誌；標牌) 【全文中譯】危險的街角樹立了一個紅色的八角形停車標誌，以防止再次發生車輛碰撞事故。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) effect (C) sign 交通標誌 (D) path。stop sign 指八角形停字標誌。"},{"number":18,"stem":"The doctor checked the range of joint ______ in the athlete's shoulder following his reconstructive surgery.","options":["railroad","movement","platform","tunnel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: movement (關節活動度；動作範圍) 【全文中譯】在運動員進行韌帶重建手術後，醫生檢查了他肩部的關節活動幅度。 【選項解析】(A) railroad (B) movement 活動度/活動範圍 (C) platform (D) tunnel。range of joint movement 指關節活動度。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Modern automatic doors operate using infrared ______ sensors that detect approaching people and open smoothly.","options":["motion","jeep","passenger","effect"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: motion (動態；運動感知) 【全文中譯】現代自動門使用紅外線動態感應器運作，該感應器探測到接近的人員並平穩打開門。 【選項解析】(A) motion 動態 (B) jeep (C) passenger (D) effect。motion sensor 指動態感應器。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The unexpected positive ______ of planting urban trees was a noticeable reduction in neighborhood summer heat.","options":["sign","path","platform","effect"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: effect (效應；效果) 【全文中譯】種植城市樹木帶來的意料之外積極效應，是鄰里夏季高溫顯著降低。 【選項解析】(A) sign (B) path (C) platform (D) effect 效應/效果。positive effect（正向效應）。"},{"number":21,"stem":"The tour guide parked the sturdy ______ beside the canyon viewpoint so passengers could take memorable landscape photos.","options":["jeep","railroad","movement","motion"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: jeep (吉普車) 【全文中譯】導遊將堅固的吉普車停在峽谷觀景點旁，以便乘客拍攝難忘的風景照。 【選項解析】(A) jeep 吉普車 (B) railroad (C) movement (D) motion。parked the sturdy jeep。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Steam locomotives operated along this historical mountain ______ for decades before modern diesel trains were introduced.","options":["effect","passenger","railroad","sign"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: railroad (高山鐵路) 【全文中譯】在現代柴油火車問世之前，蒸汽機車在這條歷史高山鐵路上行駛了數十年。 【選項解析】(A) effect (B) passenger (C) railroad 鐵路 (D) sign。mountain railroad 指高山登山鐵路。"},{"number":23,"stem":"The crowded railway ______ was cleared quickly as passengers boarded the ten arriving passenger carriages.","options":["path","platform","motion","tunnel"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: platform (月台) 【全文中譯】當旅客登上進站的十節客運車廂時，擁擠的鐵路月台迅速被清空疏散。 【選項解析】(A) path (B) platform 月台 (C) motion (D) tunnel。railway platform 指火車月台。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The train captain apologized over the intercom to every delayed ______ for the unexpected signal breakdown.","options":["passenger","jeep","effect","movement"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: passenger (旅客) 【全文中譯】列車長透過廣播對講機向每一位因意外號誌故障而行程受阻的延誤旅客致歉。 【選項解析】(A) passenger 旅客 (B) jeep (C) effect (D) movement。delayed passenger 指被延誤之乘客。"},{"number":25,"stem":"A narrow dirt ______ led through the quiet orchard directly to the farmer's welcoming wooden cottage.","options":["motion","tunnel","path","sign"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: path (泥土小路；小徑) 【全文中譯】一條狹窄的泥土小徑穿過寧靜的果園，直接通向農夫熱情好客的木造小屋。 【選項解析】(A) motion (B) tunnel (C) path 小徑 (D) sign。narrow dirt path 指泥土小徑。"}]},{"unit":29,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 29 (029.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Weather, Atmospheric Conditions & Cosmos | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"climate","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the weather conditions prevailing in an area over a long period","chinese":"氣候","sentence":"The Mediterranean region is famous for its mild winter ______, which attracts millions of northern European holidaymakers each year.","translation":"地中海地區以其溫和的冬季氣候聞名，每年吸引數百萬北歐度假者前來。"},{"word":"temperature","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the degree of heat or cold measured by a thermometer","chinese":"溫度；氣溫；體溫","sentence":"When the winter cold front arrived from Siberia, the nighttime ______ dropped rapidly below five degrees Celsius in the mountains.","translation":"當來自西伯利亞的冬季冷鋒抵達時，山區的夜間氣溫迅速降至攝氏五度以下。"},{"word":"fog","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a thick cloud of tiny water droplets suspended in the atmosphere near earth","chinese":"霧；濃霧","sentence":"Heavy morning ______ settled over the harbor, forcing ship captains to blow loud foghorns to avoid collisions with other vessels.","translation":"清晨的濃霧籠罩著港口，迫使船長們鳴響響亮的霧號以避免與其他船隻相撞。"},{"word":"thunder","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a loud rumbling or crashing noise heard after a lightning flash","chinese":"雷聲；雷鳴；打雷","sentence":"A sudden roll of loud ______ shook the window glass, and the frightened family rushed inside before the heavy rainfall started.","translation":"一陣突如其來的滾滾雷聲震動了窗戶玻璃，受驚的全家人在暴雨降臨前匆忙躲進屋內。"},{"word":"lightning","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the natural electrical discharge of very short duration between clouds","chinese":"閃電","sentence":"A blinding flash of sharp ______ illuminated the dark midnight sky, striking a tall pine tree on the hill a second later.","translation":"一道耀眼的銳利閃電照亮了漆黑的午夜天空，一秒鐘後擊中了山丘上的一棵高大松樹。"},{"word":"storm","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a violent disturbance of the atmosphere with strong winds, rain, or snow","chinese":"暴風雨；風暴","sentence":"The tropical ______ brought ferocious gale-force winds and heavy rain, uprooting trees and causing temporary power outages in town.","translation":"熱帶風暴帶來了兇猛的狂風和暴雨，連根拔起了樹木並導致鎮上暫時停電。"},{"word":"stormy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"characterized by violent weather with strong winds, rain, or thunder","chinese":"暴風雨的；波濤洶湧的","sentence":"The brave fishermen decided to stay safely inside the sheltered harbor because ______ seas made sailing extremely hazardous.","translation":"勇敢的漁民決定安全地留在遮蔽的避風港內，因為暴風雨的洶湧大海使出航極其危險。"},{"word":"snowy","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"covered with snow, or characterized by snowfall","chinese":"下雪的；積雪的；多雪的","sentence":"Children dressed in warm wool jackets ran out into the ______ yard, joyfully building a round snowman with their neighborhood friends.","translation":"穿著保暖羊毛夾克的孩子們跑進積雪的院子裡，歡天喜地與鄰居朋友一起堆起圓圓的雪人。"},{"word":"humid","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"marked by a relatively high level of water vapor in the atmosphere","chinese":"潮濕的；濕潤的","sentence":"Summer afternoons in Taipei are intensely hot and ______, so most people carry small towels and stay inside air-conditioned shops.","translation":"台北夏日的午後非常炎熱潮濕，所以大多數人都隨身攜帶小毛巾並待在有冷氣的店鋪裡。"},{"word":"universe","pos":"(n.)","definition":"all existing matter, energy, and space considered as a whole; cosmos","chinese":"宇宙；全人類","sentence":"Astronomers use giant space telescopes orbiting Earth to study distant galaxies and discover the mysterious secrets of the vast ______.","translation":"天文學家使用環繞地球運行的巨型太空望遠鏡研究遙遠的星系，發現浩瀚宇宙的神祕秘密。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Tropical islands usually have a warm and sunny ______ throughout the year, making them popular holiday destinations.","options":["fog","climate","lightning","thunder"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: climate (氣候) 【全文中譯】熱帶島嶼通常全年氣候溫暖晴朗，使其成為受歡迎的度假勝地。 【選項解析】(A) fog 霧 (B) climate 氣候 (C) lightning 閃電 (D) thunder 雷聲。warm and sunny climate 指氣候。"},{"number":2,"stem":"The nurse used a digital ear thermometer to check the sick toddler's body ______ before administering medicine.","options":["temperature","universe","storm","climate"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: temperature (體溫；溫度) 【全文中譯】護士在給藥前，使用數位耳溫槍檢查生病幼兒的體溫。 【選項解析】(A) temperature 體溫 (B) universe 宇宙 (C) storm 暴風雨 (D) climate。body temperature 指體溫。"},{"number":3,"stem":"Dense gray ______ enveloped the mountain highway, reducing visibility to less than ten meters ahead of the windshield.","options":["thunder","fog","climate","universe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fog (濃霧) 【全文中譯】濃密的灰色晨霧籠罩了高山公路，使擋風玻璃前的能見度降低到不足十公尺。 【選項解析】(A) thunder (B) fog 霧 (C) climate (D) universe。dense fog 指濃霧造成視線不佳。"},{"number":4,"stem":"We saw the bright flash in the sky, and five seconds later a terrifying boom of ______ echoed through the valley.","options":["temperature","climate","thunder","fog"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thunder (雷聲) 【全文中譯】我們看到天空中閃過一道亮光，五秒鐘後一聲可怕的雷鳴在山谷中迴盪。 【選項解析】(A) temperature (B) climate (C) thunder 雷聲 (D) fog。先見閃電後聞雷聲 boom of thunder。"},{"number":5,"stem":"You should never stand under a tall solitary tree in an open meadow during a thunderstorm to avoid being struck by ______.","options":["lightning","climate","universe","temperature"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lightning (閃電) 【全文中譯】雷雨期間切勿站在空曠草地上的孤立高樹下，以避免遭到雷擊閃電襲擊。 【選項解析】(A) lightning 閃電 (B) climate (C) universe (D) temperature。struck by lightning 指遭雷擊。"},{"number":6,"stem":"The maritime bureau issued a severe weather alert warning that a powerful winter ______ would reach the northern coast by dawn.","options":["climate","temperature","fog","storm"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: storm (暴風雨；風暴) 【全文中譯】海事局發布惡劣天氣警報，警告一場強大的冬季暴風雨將在黎明前襲擊北部海岸。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) temperature (C) fog (D) storm 風暴。winter storm 指冬季暴風雨。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The cargo ship rocked violently from side to side in the ______ waters, forcing the crew to secure all loose containers.","options":["stormy","snowy","humid","mild"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stormy (暴風雨的；波濤洶湧的) 【全文中譯】貨輪在暴風雨肆虐的波濤洶湧海水中劇烈左右搖晃，迫使船員固定所有鬆動的貨櫃。 【選項解析】(A) stormy 暴風雨的 (B) snowy 下雪的 (C) humid 潮濕的 (D) mild。stormy waters 指波濤洶湧的海水。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The ski resort opened earlier than expected this year because heavy ______ conditions covered the slopes with deep powder.","options":["humid","stormy","snowy","dry"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: snowy (下雪的；積雪的) 【全文中譯】該滑雪度假勝地今年比預期更早開放，因為大雪覆蓋了滑雪坡道呈現厚厚粉雪。 【選項解析】(A) humid (B) stormy (C) snowy 積雪的 (D) dry。snowy conditions 指降雪積雪狀況。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Because the subtropical rainforest climate is extremely warm and ______, exotic ferns and colorful orchids thrive on tree trunks.","options":["snowy","stormy","humid","cold"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: humid (潮濕的) 【全文中譯】由於亞熱帶雨林氣候極其溫暖潮濕，奇異的蕨類植物和色彩鮮豔的蘭花在樹幹上蓬勃生長。 【選項解析】(A) snowy (B) stormy (C) humid 潮濕的 (D) cold。warm and humid 指溫暖潮濕。"},{"number":10,"stem":"Modern cosmologists estimate that our observable ______ contains billions of galaxies, each holding hundreds of billions of stars.","options":["storm","universe","temperature","climate"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: universe (宇宙) 【全文中譯】現代宇宙學家估計我們可觀測的宇宙包含數十億個星系，每個星系擁有數千億顆恆星。 【選項解析】(A) storm (B) universe 宇宙 (C) temperature (D) climate。observable universe 指可觀測宇宙。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Global warming is causing profound disruptions to Earth's seasonal ______, resulting in prolonged droughts and severe floods.","options":["fog","thunder","lightning","climate"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: climate (氣候系統) 【全文中譯】全球暖化對地球的季節性氣候造成深刻破壞，導致長期乾旱和嚴重洪水。 【選項解析】(A) fog (B) thunder (C) lightning (D) climate 氣候。Earth's seasonal climate。"},{"number":12,"stem":"During the heatwave in July, the afternoon ______ climbed above thirty-eight degrees Celsius in central urban districts.","options":["temperature","storm","universe","fog"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: temperature (氣溫) 【全文中譯】在七月的熱浪中，中部市區午後氣溫攀升至攝氏三十八度以上。 【選項解析】(A) temperature 氣溫 (B) storm (C) universe (D) fog。temperature climbed above 38 degrees。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Flights departing from the international airport were grounded for two hours until the thick morning ______ dissipated.","options":["climate","fog","lightning","universe"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: fog (晨霧) 【全文中譯】從國際機場起飛的航班停飛了兩個小時，直到濃厚的晨霧散去。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) fog 霧 (C) lightning (D) universe。thick morning fog 指濃郁晨霧。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The frightened puppy hid under the sofa because the deafening roar of ______ made the whole living room vibrate.","options":["temperature","climate","thunder","fog"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: thunder (雷聲) 【全文中譯】受驚嚇的小狗躲在沙發底下，因為震耳欲聾的打雷轟鳴聲讓整個客廳都在震動。 【選項解析】(A) temperature (B) climate (C) thunder 雷聲 (D) fog。roar of thunder 指打雷轟鳴。"},{"number":15,"stem":"An electrical bolt of ______ hit the metal TV antenna on the roof, instantly disabling electrical appliances throughout the house.","options":["lightning","climate","temperature","universe"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lightning (閃電雷擊) 【全文中譯】一道閃電擊中了屋頂的金屬電視天線，瞬間損壞了全屋的電器設備。 【選項解析】(A) lightning 閃電 (B) climate (C) temperature (D) universe。bolt of lightning 指一道閃電。"},{"number":16,"stem":"Fierce gale winds from the tropical ______ tore roof tiles off houses and knocked down power lines across the coastal county.","options":["climate","temperature","storm","fog"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: storm (熱帶風暴；暴風雨) 【全文中譯】熱帶風暴帶來的猛烈狂風掀掉了房屋的屋瓦，並吹倒了沿海縣市的電線。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) temperature (C) storm 風暴 (D) fog。tropical storm 指熱帶風暴。"},{"number":17,"stem":"The small fishing boat could not cross the ______ sea, so the captain returned to the safety of the rocky cove.","options":["snowy","stormy","humid","clear"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: stormy (暴風雨肆虐的) 【全文中譯】小型漁船無法穿越暴風雨肆虐的大海，因此船長返回了多岩石海灣的安全水域。 【選項解析】(A) snowy (B) stormy 暴風雨的 (C) humid (D) clear。stormy sea 指暴風雨之大海。"},{"number":18,"stem":"In December, tourists love visiting the ______ peaks of Hokkaido to enjoy hot springs and ski on pristine white trails.","options":["humid","stormy","snowy","hot"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: snowy (積雪的；白雪皚皚的) 【全文中譯】在十二月，遊客喜歡造訪北海道白雪皚皚的山峰，享受溫泉並在潔白的純淨雪道上滑雪。 【選項解析】(A) humid (B) stormy (C) snowy 積雪的 (D) hot。snowy peaks 指積雪山峰。"},{"number":19,"stem":"When the weather is excessively hot and ______, moisture in the air prevents sweat from evaporating, making people feel uncomfortable.","options":["snowy","stormy","humid","windy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: humid (潮濕悶熱的) 【全文中譯】當天氣過度炎熱潮濕時，空氣中的水分阻止汗水蒸發，使人感到非常不舒服。 【選項解析】(A) snowy (B) stormy (C) humid 潮濕的 (D) windy。hot and humid 指濕熱。"},{"number":20,"stem":"Space probes explore the outer boundaries of our solar system, sending back extraordinary pictures from across the known ______.","options":["storm","temperature","climate","universe"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: universe (宇宙) 【全文中譯】太空探測器探索我們太陽系的外邊界，從已知宇宙的各個角落傳回非凡的照片。 【選項解析】(A) storm (B) temperature (C) climate (D) universe 宇宙。known universe 指已知宇宙。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Planting olive and citrus trees requires a warm Mediterranean ______, where winters are mild and summers are dry.","options":["climate","fog","lightning","thunder"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: climate (地中海型氣候) 【全文中譯】種植橄欖和柑橘樹需要溫暖的地中海型氣候，那裡冬季溫和，夏季乾燥。 【選項解析】(A) climate 氣候 (B) fog (C) lightning (D) thunder。Mediterranean climate（地中海氣候）。"},{"number":22,"stem":"To bake the chocolate cake perfectly, set the electronic kitchen oven ______ to one hundred and eighty degrees Celsius.","options":["climate","temperature","universe","storm"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: temperature (烤箱溫度) 【全文中譯】為了完美烘烤巧克力蛋糕，請將廚房電子烤箱溫度設定為攝氏一百八十度。 【選項解析】(A) climate (B) temperature 溫度 (C) universe (D) storm。oven temperature 指烤箱溫度。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Early morning motorists turned on yellow ______ lights and maintained double following distance along the foggy highway.","options":["lightning","thunder","fog","climate"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: fog (霧燈) 【全文中譯】清晨的駕駛人開啟黃色霧燈，並在多霧的高速公路上保持兩倍的跟車距離。 【選項解析】(A) lightning (B) thunder (C) fog 霧 (D) climate。fog lights 指車輛霧燈。"},{"number":24,"stem":"The sudden flash was followed immediately by sharp rattling ______, signaling that the storm center was directly overhead.","options":["temperature","universe","climate","thunder"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: thunder (雷鳴) 【全文中譯】突如其來的閃光之後緊接著是一陣劇烈的連環雷鳴，顯示風暴中心就在正上方。 【選項解析】(A) temperature (B) universe (C) climate (D) thunder 雷聲。rattling thunder 指轟鳴雷聲。"},{"number":25,"stem":"Protective copper rods are installed on tall skyscrapers to channel hazardous strikes of ______ harmlessly deep into the ground.","options":["lightning","fog","climate","temperature"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: lightning (閃電；避雷針引雷) 【全文中譯】摩天大樓上安裝了保護性的銅避雷針，將危險的閃電襲擊安全導入地底深處。 【選項解析】(A) lightning 閃電 (B) fog (C) climate (D) temperature。strikes of lightning 指閃電雷擊。"}]},{"unit":30,"title":"GEPT Basic Vocabulary — Lesson 30 (030.mp3)","topic":"Topic Focus: Natural Landscapes, Bodies of Water & Coastal Geography | Target Level: CEFR A1–A2","vocab":[{"word":"nature","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the physical world including plants, animals, and landscapes","chinese":"大自然；自然界；天性","sentence":"Spending a quiet weekend camping in the national park allows city residents to reconnect with the peace of ______.","translation":"在國家公園度過安靜的露營週末，使城市居民能夠重新連結大自然的寧靜。"},{"word":"natural","pos":"(adj.)","definition":"existing in or caused by nature; not made or caused by humankind","chinese":"自然的；天然的；天生的","sentence":"The remote tropical island is completely surrounded by pristine ______ coral reefs teeming with colorful exotic fish.","translation":"這座偏遠的熱帶島嶼完全被未受破壞的天然珊瑚礁環繞，裡面充滿了色彩斑斕的奇異魚類。"},{"word":"ocean","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a very large expanse of sea, in particular each of the main areas","chinese":"海洋；大洋","sentence":"A great white shark swam gracefully beneath the surface of the Pacific ______, hunting for seals near the coastal islands.","translation":"一隻大白鯊在太平洋海面下優雅地游動，在沿海島嶼附近獵食海豹。"},{"word":"shore","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the land along the edge of a sea, lake, or other large body of water","chinese":"岸；濱；海岸","sentence":"Children took off their sandals and walked along the sandy lake ______, collecting smooth pebbles and shiny seashells in buckets.","translation":"孩子們脫下涼鞋，沿著沙質湖岸漫步，把光滑的鵝卵石和閃亮的貝殼收集在水桶裡。"},{"word":"coast","pos":"(n.)","definition":"the part of the land near the sea; the edge of the land","chinese":"海岸；沿岸地區","sentence":"The eastern ______ of Taiwan features dramatic rocky cliffs rising steeply from the sparkling deep blue waters.","translation":"台灣東部海岸以從閃爍深藍海水中陡峭拔起的壯麗岩石峭壁為特色。"},{"word":"stream","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a small, narrow river of water; continuous flow of liquid","chinese":"小溪；溪流；流動","sentence":"Hikers filled their reusable aluminum bottles with cold fresh water running down from the clean alpine mountain ______.","translation":"登山客用乾淨的高山小溪流淌而下的冰涼清泉，裝滿了他們的可重複使用鋁製水壺。"},{"word":"waterfall","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a cascade of water falling from a height, formed when a river falls steeply","chinese":"瀑布","sentence":"Tourists took pictures of the breathtaking mountain ______, whose thundering white spray formed a vibrant rainbow in the sun.","translation":"遊客拍攝了令人驚嘆的高山瀑布，其轟鳴的白色水花在陽光下形成了一道生動的彩虹。"},{"word":"pool","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small body of still water; an artificial swimming pool","chinese":"水池；游泳池","sentence":"After swimming ten laps in the outdoor Olympic ______, Mark rested on a lounge chair beside the cool blue water.","translation":"在室外奧林匹克游泳池游了十趟之後，馬克在冰涼碧藍池水旁的休閒椅上休息。"},{"word":"pond","pos":"(n.)","definition":"a small body of still water formed naturally or hollowing out","chinese":"池塘","sentence":"Green frogs croaked loudly among the blooming water lilies floating on the surface of the quiet farm ______.","translation":"在靜謐農場池塘水面上漂浮的盛開睡蓮叢中，綠色的青蛙大聲地鳴叫著。"},{"word":"wave","pos":"(n.) / (v.)","definition":"a ridge of water moving on the surface of water; to move the hand","chinese":"海浪；波浪；揮手","sentence":"Surfers paddled their boards into the sea, waiting patiently for a massive ocean ______ to carry them back to the beach.","translation":"衝浪客將衝浪板划向海中，耐心等待一股巨大的海浪將他們載回海灘。"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"stem":"Photographers love to hike into deep mountain reserves to document the untouched beauty of raw ______.","options":["pool","nature","pond","wave"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: nature (大自然) 【全文中譯】攝影師喜歡徒步深入高山保護區，記錄原始大自然未受破壞的壯麗景色。 【選項解析】(A) pool (B) nature 大自然 (C) pond (D) wave。untouched beauty of raw nature。"},{"number":2,"stem":"Eating fresh organic fruit without artificial preservatives is considered a healthy ______ dietary habit.","options":["stormy","natural","humid","snowy"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: natural (天然的；自然的) 【全文中譯】食用無人工防腐劑的新鮮有機水果，被認為是一種健康的天然飲食習慣。 【選項解析】(A) stormy (B) natural 天然的 (C) humid (D) snowy。healthy natural dietary habit。"},{"number":3,"stem":"The Atlantic ______ separates the Americas from Europe and Africa, serving as a vital commercial shipping lane.","options":["pond","stream","ocean","pool"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ocean (大洋；大西洋) 【全文中譯】大西洋將美洲與歐洲和非洲分開，是一條至關重要的商業海上航道。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) stream (C) ocean 大洋 (D) pool。Atlantic Ocean（大西洋）。"},{"number":4,"stem":"We stood on the sandy lake ______ at twilight, watching the golden orange sunset reflect across the quiet water.","options":["shore","wave","waterfall","stream"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: shore (湖岸；岸邊) 【全文中譯】黃昏時分我們站在沙質湖岸上，看著金橘色的日落倒映在平靜的水面上。 【選項解析】(A) shore 岸邊 (B) wave (C) waterfall (D) stream。sandy lake shore 指沙質湖岸。"},{"number":5,"stem":"Driving along the scenic highway following the Pacific ______, travelers admired rugged cliffs rising above the sea.","options":["pond","pool","coast","waterfall"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: coast (海岸；海岸線) 【全文中譯】沿著沿太平洋海岸行駛的景觀公路開車，旅客讚歎著拔起於海面上的崎嶇峭壁。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) coast 海岸 (D) waterfall。Pacific coast（太平洋海岸）。"},{"number":6,"stem":"Cold mountain water flowed swiftly along the rocky ______, providing a home for rare native freshwater trout.","options":["stream","ocean","shore","wave"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: stream (小溪；溪流) 【全文中譯】高山冷冽的溪水沿著多石的小溪急速流淌，為罕見的本土淡水鱒魚提供了棲息地。 【選項解析】(A) stream 溪流 (B) ocean (C) shore (D) wave。rocky stream 指多石的小溪。"},{"number":7,"stem":"The Shifen ______ in Pingxi is often praised as the Little Niagara of Taiwan due to its broad curtain of falling water.","options":["pool","waterfall","pond","shore"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: waterfall (瀑布) 【全文中譯】平溪的十分瀑布因其寬闊的水簾而經常被譽為台灣的小尼加拉瓜瀑布。 【選項解析】(A) pool (B) waterfall 瀑布 (C) pond (D) shore。Shifen Waterfall（十分瀑布）。"},{"number":8,"stem":"The luxury hotel features a heated indoor swimming ______ where guests can exercise comfortably during the winter.","options":["stream","coast","pool","ocean"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pool (游泳池) 【全文中譯】這家豪華飯店設有溫水室內游泳池，客人可以在冬季舒適地進行鍛鍊。 【選項解析】(A) stream (B) coast (C) pool 游泳池 (D) ocean。indoor swimming pool 指室內游泳池。"},{"number":9,"stem":"Yellow ducklings swam in a neat line behind their mother across the tranquil surface of the village ______.","options":["ocean","waterfall","shore","pond"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: pond (池塘) 【全文中譯】黃色的小鴨子排成整齊的隊伍跟在鴨媽媽身後，游過鄉村池塘平靜的水面。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) waterfall (C) shore (D) pond 池塘。village pond 指鄉村池塘。"},{"number":10,"stem":"A towering ocean ______ crashed against the sea wall, sending white sea foam flying high into the windy air.","options":["pond","pool","wave","stream"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: wave (海浪；波浪) 【全文中譯】高聳的海浪撞擊在防波堤上，將白色的海浪泡沫高高拋入起風的空中。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) wave 海浪 (D) stream。ocean wave 指海浪。"},{"number":11,"stem":"Ecotourism encourages travelers to respect wild ______ by not littering or disturbing endangered plant habitats.","options":["nature","pool","pond","wave"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: nature (大自然) 【全文中譯】生態旅遊鼓勵旅行者不亂扔垃圾或不打擾瀕危植物棲息地，以此尊重野生大自然。 【選項解析】(A) nature 大自然 (B) pool (C) pond (D) wave。respect wild nature。"},{"number":12,"stem":"Honey produced by wild bees in mountain forests is a delicious ______ sweetener containing beneficial nutrients.","options":["stormy","humid","natural","snowy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: natural (天然的) 【全文中譯】高山森林野蜂釀造的蜂蜜是一種美味的天然甜味劑，含有有益人體的營養素。 【選項解析】(A) stormy (B) humid (C) natural 天然的 (D) snowy。natural sweetener 指天然甜味劑。"},{"number":13,"stem":"Marine biologists dive deep into the blue ______ to record the migration patterns of humpback whales.","options":["pond","pool","stream","ocean"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: ocean (海洋；大洋) 【全文中譯】海洋生物學家潛入蔚藍大洋深處，記錄座頭鯨的遷徙路線模式。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) stream (D) ocean 海洋。deep into the blue ocean。"},{"number":14,"stem":"The shipwrecked sailors safely reached the rocky island ______ and collapsed onto the dry sand in relief.","options":["waterfall","shore","stream","wave"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: shore (岸邊；海岸) 【全文中譯】遇難的水手安全到達了多岩石的島嶼岸邊，如釋重負地倒在乾燥的沙灘上。 【選項解析】(A) waterfall (B) shore 岸邊 (C) stream (D) wave。rocky island shore 指島嶼岸邊。"},{"number":15,"stem":"Many lighthouses were constructed along the rocky ______ to guide incoming cargo vessels away from hidden reefs.","options":["coast","pond","pool","waterfall"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: coast (海岸；沿海地區) 【全文中譯】岩石海岸沿線修建了許多燈塔，以引導進港貨輪避開暗礁。 【選項解析】(A) coast 海岸 (B) pond (C) pool (D) waterfall。rocky coast 指多岩海岸。"},{"number":16,"stem":"The little girl knelt beside the clear mountain ______ and dipped her hands into the refreshing icy water.","options":["ocean","shore","stream","wave"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: stream (小溪) 【全文中譯】小女孩跪在清澈的高山小溪旁，將雙手浸入清涼冰冽的水中。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) shore (C) stream 小溪 (D) wave。clear mountain stream 指清澈高山小溪。"},{"number":17,"stem":"After a long hike up the mountain trail, visitors heard the thundering roar of the spectacular eighty-meter ______.","options":["pool","waterfall","coast","pond"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: waterfall (瀑布) 【全文中譯】沿著山徑長途跋涉後，遊客聽到了壯觀的八十公尺大瀑布轟鳴的咆哮聲。 【選項解析】(A) pool (B) waterfall 瀑布 (C) coast (D) pond。spectacular waterfall（壯觀的瀑布）。"},{"number":18,"stem":"Community centers often host water aerobics classes in the heated public ______ for senior citizens.","options":["ocean","pool","stream","shore"],"answer":"B","explanation":"目標字: pool (泳池) 【全文中譯】社區中心經常在公共溫水游泳池為年長者舉辦水中健美操課程。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) pool 游泳池 (C) stream (D) shore。heated public pool 指公共溫水泳池。"},{"number":19,"stem":"Grandfather sits on a wooden bench beside the backyard koi ______, feeding colorful fish every sunny morning.","options":["ocean","waterfall","pond","coast"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: pond (錦鯉池；水塘) 【全文中譯】祖父坐在後院錦鯉池旁的木椅上，每個陽光明媚的早晨都會餵食色彩繽紛的魚兒。 【選項解析】(A) ocean (B) waterfall (C) pond 池塘 (D) coast。backyard koi pond 指錦鯉池。"},{"number":20,"stem":"The skillful surfer rode inside the barrel of the powerful rolling ______ all the way to the sandy beach.","options":["pond","pool","stream","wave"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: wave (海浪；浪管) 【全文中譯】技術精湛的衝浪好手在強勁翻滾的海浪浪管內滑行，一路滑到了沙灘上。 【選項解析】(A) pond (B) pool (C) stream (D) wave 浪潮/海浪。barrel of the rolling wave。"},{"number":21,"stem":"Living in harmony with Mother ______ is an essential principle taught by many traditional indigenous cultures.","options":["Nature","Wave","Pool","Pond"],"answer":"A","explanation":"目標字: Nature (大自然；大地之母) 【全文中譯】與大自然母親和諧相處是許多傳統原住民文化所傳授的重要基本原則。 【選項解析】(A) Nature 大自然 (B) Wave (C) Pool (D) Pond。Mother Nature 指大自然母親。"},{"number":22,"stem":"Marble is a durable ______ stone created from limestone under immense heat and pressure deep within Earth's crust.","options":["humid","stormy","natural","snowy"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: natural (天然的) 【全文中譯】大理石是由石灰岩在地殼深處巨大的高溫高壓下形成的耐用天然石材。 【選項解析】(A) humid (B) stormy (C) natural 天然的 (D) snowy。durable natural stone。"},{"number":23,"stem":"Container vessels take roughly two weeks to navigate across the vast Pacific ______ from Asia to North America.","options":["stream","pool","ocean","pond"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: ocean (大洋；太平洋) 【全文中譯】貨櫃船大約需要兩週時間才能橫渡遼闊的太平洋從亞洲駛向北美。 【選項解析】(A) stream (B) pool (C) ocean 大洋 (D) pond。vast Pacific Ocean。"},{"number":24,"stem":"Flocks of white seagulls landed along the ocean ______, pecking at tiny crabs left behind by the receding tide.","options":["waterfall","stream","shore","wave"],"answer":"C","explanation":"目標字: shore (海岸；水邊) 【全文中譯】成群的白海鷗降落在海岸邊，啄食退潮後留下的微小螃蟹。 【選項解析】(A) waterfall (B) stream (C) shore 海岸/岸邊 (D) wave。along the ocean shore。"},{"number":25,"stem":"High tide produced rolling white ______ that swept away the elaborate sandcastles children had built on the beach.","options":["ponds","pools","streams","waves"],"answer":"D","explanation":"目標字: waves (海浪；波浪) 【全文中譯】漲潮時翻滾的白浪沖走了孩子們在海灘上建造的精美沙堡。 【選項解析】(A) ponds (B) pools (C) streams (D) waves 海浪。rolling white waves 指滾滾白浪。"}]}];
